2026-10-13 03:58:04,723 - voice_bot.livekit - INFO - Search packages by name response: [{'id': 'PKG011591', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG011591', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Marvellous Singapore', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG011591_0_20260907152058', 'price': 106756, 'packageSummary': "The 'Marvellous Singapore' package is a 7-day tour covering the spectacular city-state of Singapore. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the futuristic Gardens by the Bay, Marina Bay Sands, Merlion Park, and the cultural enclaves of Chinatown and Little India. Participants will enjoy a thrilling day at Universal Studios, a scenic cable car ride to Sentosa Island, and an exciting night safari adventure.", 'images': ['SingaporeSkyline.jpg', 'Singapore-City.jpg', 'SingaporeUniversalStudio.jpg', 'Sentosa_Island_753.jpg', 'Bird-Paradise.jpg', 'Adventure-Cove-Waterpark.jpg', 'dan-freeman-399577-unsplash.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 106756, 'thumbnailImage': 'Singapore26798.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Couple Special', 'Honeymoon', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG011591 is named 'Marvellous Singapore' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Singapore Welcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Museum of Ice Cream and Snow City (1 HR. Play Time) on PVT basis Dive into a sweet spread of UNLIMITED ice cream that spans global tastes, textures, and toppings! whether you’re into creamy, crunchy, dairy-free or fruity, Museum of Ice Cream is serving up the chillest treats for every tastebud with fantastically familiar flavors and un-cone-ventional bites. Later visit go in for the ultimate cooldown in Snow City Singapore. Try snow tubing and making snow angels in the tropics! Enjoy loads of winter fun in the center of the tropical city: play snowballs, see ice sculptures, visit an igloo and more. Open to visitors aged 14 years old and above, experience a fun and exhilarating experience in a closed sub-zero environment or have a close quarter battle with your families and friends., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: VISIT UNIVERSAL STUDIOS AND OCEANARIUM – NON-PEAK (SIC BASIS) (CLOSED ON TUESDAY) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit the Oceanarium Located at Resorts World Sentosa, Singapore Oceanarium aims to spark knowledge, love, and action for the ocean and aquatic life. Be amazed by a massive panoramic viewing panel showcasing reef manta rays, zebra sharks, and schools of fish. Explore live marine habitats, ocean stories, and hands-on digital exhibits that make learning exciting. Discover marine science through interactive exhibits and eco-friendly innovation in a fully solar-powered building. Later, visit the Universal Studios Start your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Sentosa Island on SIC Basis (One Way Cable Car, Luge and Skyride – 2 Rides, MT 4 in 1, 4D Adventure land - any 2 rides, Wings of Time) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail. Enjoy the Sentosa Island One Way Cable Car, Luge and Skyride – 2 Rides, MT 4 in 1, 4D Adventure land - any 2 rides, Wings of Time) Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bird Paradise + Night Safari on SIC basis Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. A peek into Paradise. Immerse yourself in the symphony of colors across 8 walk-through aviaries that will take you to different biomes and landscapes of the world. Bird Paradise is home to over 3,500 birds from over 400 avian species. Explore the Night Safari for an off-hour wildlife adventure to observe the Zoo’s nocturnal fauna., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Adventure Cove Waterpark on SIC Basis Come experience the exhilaration and adrenaline rush of zipping down water slides at Southeast Asia’s only integrated aquatic and marine life park! You can take high-speed water slides, laze the day away drifting on a lazy river, or snorkel with 20,000 tropical fish over a colorful Rainbow Reef. For the thrill seekers, challenge your friend on the Dueling Racer - a dueling high-speed competitive plunge to the finish line or head for the Pipeline Plunge to experience dropping through an elevated chute. Blast off in the Riptide Rocket - Southeast Asia’s first hydro-magnetic coaster (think rollercoaster on water!). For great family fun, cruise down the Adventure River, enhanced with mini tipping buckets, splash buckets as well as water shooters. Float through 14 stunning scenes including a lush jungle garden, a mysterious grotto and an underwater tunnel with a sea of marine life swimming above and around you., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Trael Validity: 1 Oct 2026 till 24th Mar 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PAKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX 03 star IBIS Novena / Chancellor or similar 1281 1259 1249 1250 04 star Village hotel Bugis / Village hotel albert court 1356 1334 1324 1325, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 106756.0. Hotels envisaged include: \nIBIS\xa0Novena / Chancellor (Standard Room) or similar\n, \nFurama Riverfront (Value)\xa0or Similar in Singapore\n, \nHotel Grand Copthorne Waterfront\xa0(Premium) or similar in Singapore\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 06 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore. Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on SIC basis. MUSEUM OF ICE CREAM AND SNOW CITY (1 HR. PLAY TIME) (PVT BASIS) VISIT UNIVERSAL STUDIOS AND OCEANARIUM – NON-PEAK (SIC BASIS) (CLOSED ON TUESDAY) SENTOSA ISLAND ON SIC BASIS (ONE WAY CABLE CAR, LUGE AND SKYRIDE, MT 4 IN 1, 4D ADVENTURE LAND - ANY 2 RIDES, WINGS OF TIME) BIRD PARADISE + NIGHT SAFARI (SIC BASIS) ADVENTURE COVE WATERPARK (SIC BASIS) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Departure PCR test, if app