ATERPARK (SIC BASIS)\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': "\nTCS & GST\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nVisa Services\nHigh & Peak Season Surcharge\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around SGD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nAirport Taxes (Domestic & International)\nEnglish Speaking Guide\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc )\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nAll transfers are made only on point-to-point basis only\xa0\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\n\nBlackout dates:\n\n\nSingapore Formula 1 :- 01st Oct – 11th Oct 2026\xa0\n\n\nCHIRSTMAS & NEW YEAR - 15 DEC' 26 -10 JAN 2027\n\nCHINESE NEW YEAR - 01 - 09 FEB'27\n", 'termsAndConditions': 'TERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/Singapore26798.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/SingaporeSkyline.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/Singapore-City.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/SingaporeUniversalStudio.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/Sentosa_Island_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/Bird-Paradise.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/Adventure-Cove-Waterpark.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011591/itinerary/dan-freeman-399577-unsplash.jpg']}, 'score': 13.073993, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014458', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014458', 'availableMonths': ['april_2027', 'november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Singapore Extravaganza', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ["An Air Inclusive Premium Tour with Tour Manager's assistance throughout the tour. Visa & Insurance 4 Star Plus Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Lunches & Dinners Whats More Like - Tea, Coffee, Ice Cream, at certain sightseeing’s Singapore: Guided City Tour of Singapore | Visit Sentosa Island with 4 in 1 Madame Tussauds |Visit Gardens by the Bay - Entrance to Cloud Forest with Jurassic World Exhibition & Flower Dome I Visit Mandai Bird Paradise I Visit Singapore Flyer I Visit Universal Studios I Visit Singapore Oceanarium"], 'pdfName': 'PKG002219_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 124066, 'packageSummary': "The 'Singapore Extravaganza' package is a 5-day premium air-inclusive tour covering the vibrant city of Singapore, complete with the assistance of a dedicated tour manager throughout the journey. Guests will enjoy comfortable stays in 4-star plus hotels on a bed and breakfast basis, along with visa and insurance coverage, specially curated Indian Jain, vegetarian, and non-vegetarian lunches and dinners, and delightful treats like tea, coffee, and ice cream at select locations. The exciting itinerary features a guided city tour of Singapore, a ride on the Singapore Flyer, and a visit to Sentosa Island including the 4-in-1 Madame Tussauds experience. Additionally, travelers will explore the stunning Gardens by the Bay—including the Flower Dome and the Cloud Forest with its Jurassic World Exhibition—as well as the Mandai Bird Paradise, Universal Studios, and the Singapore Oceanarium.", 'images': ['Singapore7536.jpg', 'SingaporeFlyer.jpg', 'UniversalStudio753.jpg', 'Singapore7532.jpg', 'SingaporeCity753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 124066, 'thumbnailImage': 'Singapore26745.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014458 is named 'Singapore Extravaganza' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrive In Singapore - Guided City Tour Of Singapore - Visit Gardens By The Bay Welcome To Singapore. Upon Arrival, Proceed To The Hotel & Check In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs). Later This Afternoon Proceed For A Guided City Tour Of Singapore - Drive Pass Suntek City, Business District, China Town, Orchard, Buddha Tooth Relic Temple & Merlion Park. Later This Evening Visit Gardens By The Bay - Visit The Cloud Forest Dome With Jurassic World Exhibition & Flower Dome Followed By Light & Sound Show (Weather Permitting). Note : Joining Direct Passengers / Nri Passengers Can Check-In On Your Own At The Hotel. The Standard Check-In Time Is 1500 Hrs. All Our Guests Are Advised To Activate International Calling/Data & International Credit Card. Kindly Take A Note Of Prohibited Items That Are Not To Be Carried In Singapore. At Singapore Immigration All Bags Will Be Scanned And Checked Before Customs And Immigration. No Trolleys Or Porters Are Available At This Point & Every Guest Needs To Hand Carry Luggage Through Singapore Customs.(Https:// Www.Customs.Gov.Sg/Individuals/Going-Throughcustoms/Arrival/Prohibited-And- Controlled- Goods) All Guests Have To Fill Up Singapore Landing Card On Sg Arrival App., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Visit Mandai Bird Park – Visit Singapore Flyer - Visit Sentosa Island By One Way Cable Car This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Mandai Bird Paradise, Home To Over 5,000 Birds Across 400 Species, Making It One Of The Largest Bird Parks In The World. Proceed To Take A Ride On The Singapore Flyer, One Of The World’s Largest Observation Wheels. Later, Proceed To Sentosa Island By A One-Way Cable Car Ride. On Arrival At Sentosa Island - Visit Madame Tussauds With Bollywood Avenue, Spirit Of Singapore, Images Of Singapore, Boat Ride. Later This Evening Enjoy The Spectacular Wings Of Time Show -A Dazzling Display Of Water, Laser, And Fire Effects., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner, Description: Visit Singapore Oceanarium - Visit Universal Studio This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Singapore Oceanarium & Universal Studios. Enjoy The Rest Of The Day At Universal Studios., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Day At Leisure This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Day Is At Leisure. Spend Rest Of The Day Exploring Singapore On Your Own Or “ Plan Your Day” From The Various Optional Tours Available On Attractive Offers., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: End Of Tour - Fly Back This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour. CHILD POLICY Infant Child No Bed Child With Bed 0 - 1.99 yrs 2 - 6.99 yrs 7 - 11.99 yrs, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 124066.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n04 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore\n, Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nDaily breakfast. (Except Day 1)\n02 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non vegetarian Lunches (includes 01 Lunch Coupons)\n04 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non vegetarian Dinners\xa0\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner). Inclusions: Return economy class airfare as per the itinerary. Accommodation at the hotels specified above or similar. Visa & Airport taxes (Any further increase in the same must be borne by the guest). Services of a professional & multilingual Tour Manager or Local representative. (Tour Manager subject to minimum 20 customers) If the group size is less than 15 customers, then the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis. Cost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 1st December 2025 Medical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges. Meals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary. Visa Requirements Cost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 1st December 2025. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers. Single - entry Singapore visa. It is compulsory to hold a hard copy of Visa Paper (In case of E visa) Passport should be valid for 6 months from the date of departure. Exclusions: The cost of deviation, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. City Tax or Tourism tax (If applicable) Visa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable) Cruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays) Cost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. The tour cost does not include POE charges, porterage and passport charges. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 10,000. Govt Taxes & Service taxes as applicable. The cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 1st December 2025. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers. The company will not be held responsible for the same. Any increase in the rate of exchange leading to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure. The tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure. Any expenses of personal nature such as laundry, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menus provided by us. Tips to guides, hotel waiters, drivers etc. (If applicable) Meals other than what is mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers other than those included in your itinerary. Product Terms and Conditions: N/A. Highlights of the package: An Air Inclusive Premium Tour with Tour Manager's assistance throughout the tour. Visa & Insurance 4 Star Plus Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Lunches & Dinners Whats More Like - Tea, Coffee, Ice Cream, at certain sightseeing’s Singapore: Guided City Tour of Singapore | Visit Sentosa Island with 4 in 1 Madame Tussauds |Visit Gardens by the Bay - Entrance to Cloud Forest with Jurassic World Exhibition & Flower Dome I Visit Mandai Bird Paradise I Visit Singapore Flyer I Visit Universal Studios I Visit Singapore Oceanarium.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZSE550', 'holidayLtPri