engers Can Check-In On Your Own At The Hotel. The Standard Check-In Time Is 1500 Hrs.\xa0\nAll Our Guests Are Advised To Activate International Calling/Data & International Credit Card.\nKindly Take A Note Of Prohibited Items That Are Not To Be Carried In Singapore. At\nSingapore Immigration All Bags Will Be Scanned And Checked Before Customs And Immigration. No Trolleys Or Porters Are Available At This Point & Every Guest Needs To Hand Carry Luggage Through Singapore Customs.(Https:// Www.Customs.Gov.Sg/Individuals/Going-Throughcustoms/Arrival/Prohibited-And- Controlled- Goods)\nAll Guests Have To Fill Up Singapore Landing Card On Sg Arrival App.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Mandai Bird Park – Visit Singapore Flyer - Visit Sentosa Island By One Way Cable Car\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Mandai Bird Paradise, Home To Over 5,000 Birds Across 400 Species, Making It One Of The Largest Bird Parks In The World. Proceed To Take A Ride On The Singapore Flyer, One Of The World’s Largest Observation Wheels. Later, Proceed To Sentosa Island By A One-Way Cable Car Ride. On Arrival At Sentosa Island - Visit Madame Tussauds With Bollywood Avenue, Spirit Of Singapore, Images Of Singapore, Boat Ride. Later This Evening Enjoy The Spectacular Wings Of Time Show -A Dazzling Display Of Water, Laser, And Fire Effects.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast,\xa0Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Singapore Oceanarium - Visit Universal Studio \nThis Morning \xa0After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Singapore Oceanarium & Universal Studios. Enjoy The Rest Of The Day At Universal Studios.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay At Leisure\nThis Morning \xa0After Buffet Breakfast, Day Is At Leisure. Spend Rest Of The Day Exploring Singapore On Your Own Or “ Plan Your Day” From The Various Optional Tours Available On Attractive Offers.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\nEnd Of Tour - Fly Back\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour.\n\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCHILD POLICY\n\n\n\n\nInfant\n\n\nChild No Bed\n\n\nChild With Bed\n\n\n\n\n0 - 1.99 yrs\n\n\n2 - 6.99 yrs\n\n\n7 - 11.99 yrs\n\n\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n04 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore\n', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': '\n04 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore\n', '1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'SG', 'countryName': 'Singapore', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Premium', 'price': 124100.0, 'hotels': ['\n04 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Furama Riverfront/Hotel Orchard Rendezvous\xa0or Similar in Singapore\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', '\nDaily breakfast. (Except Day 1)\n02 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non vegetarian Lunches (includes 01 Lunch Coupons)\n04 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non vegetarian Dinners\xa0\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary', '\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 1st December 2025. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\xa0\nSingle - entry Singapore visa.\nIt is compulsory to hold a hard copy of Visa Paper (In case of E visa)\nPassport should be valid for 6 months from the date of departure\n'], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Singapore:\n\nGuided city tour of Singapore\xa0\nVisit Gardens by the Bay\xa0 - Entrance to Cloud Forest with Jurassic World Exhibition & Flower Dome\nVisit Mandai Bird Paradise\xa0\nVisit Singapore Flyer\xa0\nVisit Sentosa Island by One way Cable car ride\nVisit Madame Tussauds with Bollywood Avenue, Spirit of Singapore, Images of Singapore, Boat Ride\xa0\nEntrance to Wings of Time Show\nVisit Universal Studios\nVisit Singapore Oceanarium\xa0\n', 'Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '<p>Provision of a Tour Manager is subject to the final operating group size. An accompanying Tour Manager will be provided for groups of 15 or more confirmed passengers. For groups with fewer than 15 passengers, the tour will operate on a Seat in Coach (SIC) / Free independent Tour (FIT) basis, and a Virtual Tour Manager or local representative/assistance will be provided to assist remotely with coordination, guidance, daily briefings, reconfirmations, and on tour support. The Virtual Tour Manager does not accompany the group in person. The company reserves the right to operate the tour without a physical Tour Manager should the final group size be less than 15 passengers. Confirmation of Tour Manager arrangement will be communicated 10-15 days prior to the departure.</p>', 'flightDescription': '<ul>\n<li>Return economy class airfare as per the itinerary.</li>\n</ul>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn economy class airfare as per the itinerary.\nAccommodation at the hotels specified above or similar.\nVisa & Airport taxes (Any further increase in the same must be borne by the guest).\nServices of a professional & multilingual Tour Manager or Local representative.\n(Tour Manager subject to minimum 20 customers)\nIf the group size is less than 15 customers, then the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis.\nCost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 1st December 2025\nMedical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges.\nMeals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary.\n\n\xa0\nVisa Requirements\n\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 1st December 2025. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\xa0\nSingle - entry Singapore visa.\nIt is compulsory to hold a hard copy of Visa Paper (In case of E visa)\nPassport should be valid for 6 months from the date of departure\n', 'exclusions': '\nThe cost of deviation, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure.\nCity Tax or Tourism tax (If applicable)\nVisa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable)\nCruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays)\nCost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure.\nThe tour cost does not include POE charges, porterage and passport charges.\nCost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 10,000.\nGovt Taxes & Service taxes as applicable.\nThe cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 1st December 2025. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers. The company will not be held responsible for the same.\nAny increase in the rate of exchange leading to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure.\nThe tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure.\nAny expenses of personal nature such as laundry, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menus provided by us.\nTips to guides, hotel waiters, drivers etc. (If applicable)\nMeals other than what is mentioned in the itinerary.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers other than those included in your itinerary\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014458/Singapore26745.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014458/itinerary/Singapore7536.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014458/itinerary/SingaporeFlyer.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014458/itinerary/UniversalStudio753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014458/itinerary/Singapore7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014458/itinerary/SingaporeCity753.jpg']}, 'score': 13.073993, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG011623', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG011623', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Classic Singapore 4N', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG011623_0_20261012153704.pdf', 'price': 73285, 'packageSummary': "The 'Classic Singapore 4N' package is an exciting 5-day tour dedicated entirely to exploring the vibrant city-state of Singapore. The itinerary is packed with memorable experiences, including a comprehensive city tour featuring the iconic Merlion Park, Chinatown, and Little India. Participants will enjoy key activities such as a thrilling night safari, a visit to the futuristic Gardens by the Bay, a day of adventure at Universal Studios, and a scenic cable car ride to Sentosa Island to watch the spectacular Wings of Time show.", 'images': ['Nightsafari.jpg', 'GardensBythebayNEW_753.jpg', 'SingaporeSentosa.jpg', 'Universal-Studio.jpg', 'dan-freeman-399577-unsplash.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 73285, 'thumbnailImage': 'Singapore34.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Durga Puja Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG011623 is named 'Classic Singapore 4N' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Singapore, Night Safari (SIC Basis) Welcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.) Later, explore the Night Safari for an off-hour wildlife adventure to observe the Zoo's nocturnal fauna., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour (SIC basis), Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore. We drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.! Visit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay. Cloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways Flower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts Jurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail. Enjoy the cable car ride and experience 4D Adventure Land. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show. Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit the Oceanarium Located at Resorts World Sentosa, Singapore Oceanarium aims to spark knowledge, love, and action for the ocean and aquatic life. Be amazed by a massive panoramic viewing panel showcasing reef manta rays, zebra sharks, and schools of fish. Explore live marine habitats, ocean stories, and hands-on digital exhibits that make learning exciting. Discover marine science through interactive exhibits and eco-friendly innovation in a fully solar-powered building. Later, visit the Universal Studios Start your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The itinerary is tentative and subject to change without prior notice. Travel Validity – 01 October 2026 – 25 March 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PAKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX 03 star IBIS Novena / Chancellor or similar 893 885 880 888 04 star Village hotel Bugis / Village hotel albert court 943 935 930 938, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 73285.0. Hotels envisaged include: \nHotel\xa0Furama Riverfront (Value) or similar in Singapore\n, \nHotel Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium) or similar in Singapore\n, \nIBIS Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard or similar\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore. Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on PVT basis Night Safari (SIC Basis) Half Day City Tour (SIC basis), Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis) Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Visit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Visa Services High & Peak Season Surcharge Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around SGD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Airport Taxes (Domestic & International) English Speaking Guide Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge All transfers are made only on point-to-point basis only The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Blackout dates: SINGAPORE FORMULA 1 - 01ST OCT'26 - 11TH OCT'26 CHIRSTMAS & NEW YEAR - 15 DEC' 26 - 10 JAN 2027 CHINESE NEW YEAR - 01- 09 FEB'27. Product Terms and Conditions: TERMS AND CONDITIONS: The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 