0 hrs.)\nLater, explore the Night Safari for an off-hour wildlife adventure to observe the Zoo's nocturnal fauna.\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Novena / Chancellor (Standard) / Hotel Furama Riverfront (Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour (SIC basis), Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\xa0\nProceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore.\n\xa0\nWe drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.!\nVisit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay.\xa0\n\xa0\nCloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways\nFlower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts\n\xa0\nJurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences.\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Novena / Chancellor (Standard) / Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\xa0\nToday enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail.\nEnjoy the cable car ride and experience 4D Adventure Land. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show.\n\xa0\nNote: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Novena / Chancellor (Standard) / Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nVisit the Oceanarium\nLocated at Resorts World Sentosa, Singapore Oceanarium aims to spark knowledge, love, and action for the ocean and aquatic life. Be amazed by a massive panoramic viewing panel showcasing reef manta rays, zebra sharks, and schools of fish. Explore live marine habitats, ocean stories, and hands-on digital exhibits that make learning exciting. Discover marine science through interactive exhibits and eco-friendly innovation in a fully solar-powered building.\n\xa0\nLater, visit the Universal Studios\nStart your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Novena / Chancellor (Standard) / Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subject 