ing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011623/Singapore34.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011623/itinerary/Nightsafari.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011623/itinerary/GardensBythebayNEW_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011623/itinerary/SingaporeSentosa.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011623/itinerary/Universal-Studio.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011623/itinerary/dan-freeman-399577-unsplash.jpg']}, 'score': 12.560211, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014053', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014053', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Classic Singapore 5N', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014053_0_20261012154640.pdf', 'price': 85449, 'packageSummary': "The 'Classic Singapore 5N' package is an exciting 6-day tour dedicated entirely to exploring the vibrant city-state of Singapore. Throughout this immersive journey, travelers will experience the very best of the city, with key activities including a panoramic city tour, a visit to the futuristic Gardens by the Bay, and an action-packed day at Universal Studios. Participants will also enjoy a thrilling night safari, a scenic cable car ride to Sentosa Island to explore its various attractions, and stunning panoramic views from the iconic Marina Bay Sands observation deck.", 'images': ['4596_Gardens_By_the_bay753.jpg', 'SingaporeMerlionpark2.jpg', 'UniversalStudiosSingapore.jpg', 'Sentosa_Island_753.jpg', 'birdpark_singapore_753.png', 'SingaporeMerlionpark1.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 85449, 'thumbnailImage': 'gardensbythebay.bmp', 'packageTheme': ['Durga Puja Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014053 is named 'Classic Singapore 5N' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Singapore - Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis) Welcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.). Visit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay. Cloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways Flower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts Jurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences. Overnight in Singapore., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Singapore City Tour (SIC Basis) Proceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore. We drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town, and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park! Meals: Breakfast at the hotel. Overnight stay in Singapore, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit the Oceanarium Located at Resorts World Sentosa, Singapore Oceanarium aims to spark knowledge, love, and action for the ocean and aquatic life. Be amazed by a massive panoramic viewing panel showcasing reef manta rays, zebra sharks, and schools of fish. Explore live marine habitats, ocean stories, and hands-on digital exhibits that make learning exciting. Discover marine science through interactive exhibits and eco-friendly innovation in a fully solar-powered building. Later, visit the Universal Studios Start your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more. Meals: Breakfast at the hotel Overnight stay in Singapore, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail. Enjoy the cable car ride and experience 4D Adventure Land. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show. Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025. Meals: Breakfast at the hotel Overnight stay in Singapore., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. A peek into Paradise. Immerse yourself in the symphony of colors across 8 walk-through aviaries that will take you to different biomes and landscapes of the world. Bird Paradise is home to over 3,500 birds from over 400 avian species. Explore the Night Safari for an off-hour wildlife adventure to observe the Zoo’s nocturnal fauna. Meals: Breakfast at the hotel Overnight stay in Singapore, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India Meals: Breakfast at the hotel * The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. PACKAGE ENVISAGED Travel Validity – 01 OCT’26 – 25 MAR’27 CATEGORY HOTELS PAKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX 03 star IBIS Novena / Chancellor or similar 1050 1041 1038 1045 04 star Village hotel Bugis / Village hotel albert court 1113 1104 1100 1108, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 85449.0. Hotels envisaged include: Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0or similar in Singapore, \nHotel Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium) or similar in Singapore\n, \nIBIS Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard or similar\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 05 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore. Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on PVT Basis Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis) Singapore City Tour (SIC Basis) Visit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday) Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025. Bird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC Basis) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Visa Services High & Peak Season Surcharge Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around SGD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Airport Taxes (Domestic & International) English Speaking Guide Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Ho