itats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts\nJurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Singapore.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis\xa0Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) / Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium)\xa0or similar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nSingapore City Tour (SIC Basis)\xa0\n\xa0\nProceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore.\nWe drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town, and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park!\nMeals: Breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nOvernight stay in Singapore', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis\xa0Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) / Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium)\xa0or similar'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nVisit the Oceanarium\nLocated at Resorts World Sentosa, Singapore Oceanarium aims to spark knowledge, love, and action for the ocean and aquatic life. Be amazed by a massive panoramic viewing panel showcasing reef manta rays, zebra sharks, and schools of fish. Explore live marine habitats, ocean stories, and hands-on digital exhibits that make learning exciting. Discover marine science through interactive exhibits and eco-friendly innovation in a fully solar-powered building.\n\xa0\nLater, visit the Universal Studios\nStart your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more.\nMeals: Breakfast at the hotel\xa0\nOvernight stay in Singapore", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis\xa0Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) / Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium)\xa0or similar'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\xa0\nToday enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail.\nEnjoy the cable car ride and experience 4D Adventure Land. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show.\n\xa0\nNote: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025.\n\xa0\nMeals: Breakfast at the hotel\nOvernight stay in Singapore.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis\xa0Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) / Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium)\xa0or similar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0Bird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nA peek into Paradise. Immerse yourself in the symphony of colors across 8 walk-through aviaries that will take you to different biomes and landscapes of the world. Bird Paradise is home to over 3,500 birds from over 400 avian species. Explore the Night Safari for an off-hour wildlife adventure to observe the Zoo’s nocturnal fauna.\n\xa0\nMeals: Breakfast at the hotel\xa0\nOvernight stay in Singapore', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis\xa0Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) / Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium)\xa0or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\xa0\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India\xa0\nMeals: Breakfast at the hotel\xa0\n\xa0\n* The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0PACKAGE ENVISAGED\nTravel Validity – 01 OCT’26 – 25 MAR’27\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY \n\n\nHOTELS\n\n\nPAKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD\n\n\n\n\n4-5 PAX\n\n\n6-7 PAX\n\n\n8-9 PAX\n\n\n10 PAX\n\n\n\n\n03 star \n\n\nIBIS Novena / Chancellor or similar\n\n\n1050\n\n\n1041\n\n\n1038\n\n\n1045\n\n\n\n\n04 star \n\n\nVillage hotel Bugis / Village hotel albert court\n\n\n1113\n\n\n1104\n\n\n1100\n\n\n1108\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0or similar in Singapore', '\nHotel Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium) or similar in Singapore\n', '\nIBIS Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard or similar\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\nIBIS Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard or similar\n', '2': '\nHotel Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium) or similar in Singapore\n', '1': 'Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0or similar in Singapore'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'SG', 'countryName': 'Singapore', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 85400.0, 'hotels': ['\nIBIS Bencoolen / Chancellor @ Orchard or similar\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 90300.0, 'hotels': ['Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0or similar in Singapore']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 144500.0, 'hotels': ['\nHotel Grand Copthorne Waterfront (Premium) or similar in Singapore\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\xa0\n\nVisit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis)\nSingapore City Tour (SIC Basis)\xa0\nVisit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday)\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis)\nBird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC Basis)\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\xa0\n\n05 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore.\nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\nAirport / hotel / airport transfers on PVT Basis\nVisit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC basis)\nSingapore City Tour (SIC Basis)\xa0\nVisit Universal Studios and Oceanarium – Non-Peak (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday)\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis)\xa0Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025.\nBird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC Basis)\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': "\nTCS & GST\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nVisa Services\nHigh & Peak Season Surcharge\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around SGD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nAirport Taxes (Domestic & International)\nEnglish Speaking Guide\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nAll transfers are made only on point-to-point basis only\xa0\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\n\nBlackout dates:\xa0\n\nGENERAL BALCKOUTS (FOR ALL)\nCHIRSTMAS & NEW YEAR - 15 DEC' 25 - 05 JAN 2026 \nSingapore Air Show - 27 Jan – 08 Feb\nRAMADAN EID - 10 Mar - 20 MAR'26\nGOOD FRIDAY - 31 MAR - 03 APR'26\nEID AL ADHA - 20 May - 27 MAY'26\nNATIONAL DAY - 5 Aug - 10 AUG'26\n", 'termsAndConditions': 'TERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/gardensbythebay.bmp', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/itinerary/4596_Gardens_By_the_bay753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/itinerary/SingaporeMerlionpark2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/itinerary/UniversalStudiosSingapore.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/itinerary/Sentosa_Island_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/itinerary/birdpark_singapore_753.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014053/itinerary/SingaporeMerlionpark1.jpg']}, 'score': 12.560211, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014774', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014774', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Genting Dream Cruise (Singapore - Penang - Port Klang - Singapore)', 'days': 4, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Genting Dream Cruise', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Genting Dream Cruise', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Genting Dream Cruise', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['3 Nights Cruise in inside cabin on Genting Dream Cruise. All Meals included on board the ship. International shows onboard the ship. Live Music at Bars and Lounges. Genting Dream: The art of experiencing the sea DREAM CRUISE LINE first ship, Genting Dream is a vessel for your dreams—it features all the comfort of authentic Asian hospitality, combined with the finest experiences from around the world. Welcome onboard Genting Dream, the flagship of Dream Cruises. We’ve been a pioneer and a trendsetter in hospitality for 50 years and we know luxury cruising like no other. We’ll be bringing you fresh, novel experiences and an array of cuisine, entertainment and themes from across the globe for a cruise that’s limited only by your imagination. Enjoy your dinner at Pavilion Restaurant, or Palace Restaurant. Enjoy the set sail from pool deck bar or the discotheque.'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014774_0_20260507162851.pdf', 'price': 38038, 'packageSummary': "The 'Genting Dream Cruise (Singapore - Penang - Port Klang - Singapore)' package is a 4-day voyage starting and ending in Singapore, offering a luxurious maritime journey aboard the flagship Genting Dream vessel. This package features a 3-night stay in an inside cabin with all meals included on board, allowing guests to dine at premium venues like the Pavilion Restaurant or the Palace Restaurant. Throughout the cruise, participants will enjoy world-class international shows, live music at various bars and lounges, and vibrant nightlife at the pool deck bar or the discotheque. Combining authentic Asian hospitality with global entertainment and dining, this itinerary is designed to deliver a premium, imaginative luxury cruising experience on the open sea.", 'images': ['GentingDreamCruise753.jpg', 'Penang7533.jpg', 'GentingDreamCruise753.jpg', 'Singaporecity.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 38038, 'thumbnailImage': 'GentingDream267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Cruise'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014774 is named 'Genting Dream Cruise (Singapore - Penang - Port Klang - Singapore)' and spans 4 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Genting Dream Cruise, Meals: Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Fri - Boarding on the Cruise SINGAPORE The guests will be informed prior to sailing at what time they can board the cruise. The guests can enjoy the sail away from the Aperol Spritz Bar enjoying their drink at the Pool Bar For dinner choices the guests will be spoilt for life with inclusive dining at the main dining room or the specialty restaurants on board. Enjoy the night at the disco. The ship sails at 13:00 hrs. Singapore time. So, ensure all guests are on board 3-4 hours prior to departure time., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Genting Dream Cruise, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Sat - Penang After breakfast the guests can get off the ship and enjoy the recommended shore excursions or can walk around the town or simply walk around the exotic beaches of Penang. The guests can get off the ship around 09:00 am. If the guests choose to stay on board and enjoy the amenities such as swimming pool, Jacuzzi, gaming zone, watch a movie the guests can choose to come back to the ship for lunch. You can also visit Vibrant Chinatown, ancient temples and streets of colonial villas. Our guests have all evening to spend their time at shore or come back on the ship for dinner or enjoying the shows. The guests can enjoy our casino or our disco for the night or just choose to relax in their staterooms., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Genting Dream Cruise, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Sun - Port Klang (Kuala Lumpur) In the morning and after our breakfast buffet the guests are free to get off the ship and explore the city of Kuala Lumpur. The guests can get off the ship as early as 08:00am. There are recommended shore excursions organized by the cruise liner that our guests can purchase on board or can choose to travel on their own. The guests can discover a bustling metropolis that uniquely blends the traditional and modern. Visitors will be entertained by exceptional shopping and dining opportunities. Kuala Lumpur is also home to the tallest twin towers in the world - the Petronas Twin Towers. The guests who have already visited the city earlier can choose to enjoy the amenities on board the ship. There is a Asian spa which has variety of massages and spa treatments to choose from. All spend all day at the pool or whirl pools. The guests who have been out to explore the city will be back on board around 7:00pm. Post embarking, all the evening activities and entertainment start on board. The guests can enjoy the live band at Tributes or enjoy dinner at one of our specialty Italian style cuisine at Bistro By Mark Best. Dream Dining Room is always available if our guests choose to dine with the rest of the friends they get introduced to on board. Post the evening show the bar and lounges are open for variety of music and drinks. Late night disco Zouk is grooving with top chart busters and music that one cant resist but dance., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mon - Singapore Breakfast the guests can disembark and continue their onward journey. The ship docks in Singapore around 14:00 hrs. So, guests can enjoy late breakfast as well. Important Note: The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Note: Costing given is subject to change and availability. Mid Season : - June 16 Travel Dates - 2026 Roomcategory Price ApplicablePer Person(1st & 2ndAdult) Price Applicable 3rd Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax Price Applicable 4th Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax June 16 Inside Cabin - 72 72 Ocean View Cabin CHECKAVAILABILITY CHECK AVAILABILITY CHECK AVAILABILITY Balcony Cabin 635 72 72 Low Season : April: 21 | May: 19 | July: 14 | September: 1 | October: 20 | November: 17 Travel Dates - 2026 Roomcategory Price ApplicablePer Person(1st & 2ndAdult) Price Applicable 3rd Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax Price Applicable 4th Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax April: 21May: 19July: 14September: 1October: 20November: 17 Inside Cabin - 72 72 Ocean View Cabin CHECKAVAILABILITY CHECK AVAILABILITY CHECK AVAILABILITY Balcony Cabin 509 72 72, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 38038.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n3 Nights in\xa0Balcony Cabin\xa0on\xa0Genting Dream Cruise\n, \n3 Nights in Inside Cabin\xa0on Genting Dream Cruise\n, \n2 Nights in\xa0Balcony Cabin\xa0on\xa0Genting Dream Cruise\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nAll meals onboard the Cruise\n03 Breakfasts\n03 lunches as mentioned in the itinerary\n03 dinners as mentioned in the itinerary\nDay & Late-Night Snacks available\n. Inclusions: Cabin Fare + Port Taxes Accommodation: 3 Nights Cruise in inside cabin on Genting Dream Cruise. Meals: All meals onboard the Cruise 03 Breakfasts 03 lunches as mentioned in the itinerary 03 dinners as mentioned in the itinerary Day & Late-Night Snacks available. Exclusions: Airfare Visa Fees and Travel Insurance Any expenses of personal nature Meals other than that are mentioned in your itinerary. Any services not mentioned in the inclusions list Drinks including Water during meals or sightseeing tours are not included Surcharges as applicable due to peak season, surcharge dates, trade fair dates, Christmas, New Year week. Sight Seeing Onboard Gratuities Shore Excursions Transfers to and fro the ship terminal A fuel surcharge of SGD 15 per guest, per night (applicable to guests aged 2 years and above) will apply. The total fuel surcharge will be automatically added to the guest’s onboard account for settlement prior to disembarkation.. Product Terms and Conditions: Terms and Conditions: All prices are based on current ROE (Rate of Exchange) of the cruise liner. Please confirm with us at the date of booking of prevailing ROE. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. Meals on land tour are not included. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. Thomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.. Highlights of the package: 3 Nights Cruise in inside cabin on Genting Dream Cruise. All Meals included on board the ship. International shows onboard the ship. Live Music at Bars and Lounges. Genting Dream: The art of experiencing the sea DREAM CRUISE LINE first ship, Genting Dream is a vessel for your dreams—it features all the comfort of authentic Asian hospitality, combined with the finest experiences from around the world. Welcome onboard Genting Dream, the flagship of Dream Cruises. We’ve been a pioneer and a trendsetter in hospitality for 50 years and we know luxury cruising like no other. We’ll be bringing you fresh, novel experiences and an array of cuisine, entertainment and themes from across the globe for a cruise that’s limited only by your imagination. Enjoy your dinner at Pavilion Restaurant, or Palace Restaurant. Enjoy the set sail from pool deck bar or the discotheque..", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPr