the discotheque. Combining authentic Asian hospitality with global entertainment and dining, this itinerary is designed to deliver a premium, imaginative luxury cruising experience on the open sea.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nFri - Boarding on the Cruise SINGAPORE\nThe guests will be informed prior to sailing at what time they can board the cruise. The guests can enjoy the sail away from the Aperol Spritz Bar enjoying their drink at the Pool Bar For dinner choices the guests will be spoilt for life with inclusive dining at the main dining room or the specialty restaurants on board. Enjoy the night at the disco. The ship sails at 13:00 hrs. Singapore time. So, ensure all guests are on board 3-4 hours prior to departure time.\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the Genting Dream Cruise'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nSat - Penang\nAfter breakfast the guests can get off the ship and enjoy the recommended shore excursions or can walk around the town or simply walk around the exotic beaches of Penang. The guests can get off the ship around 09:00 am. If the guests choose to stay on board and enjoy the amenities such as swimming pool, Jacuzzi, gaming zone, watch a movie the guests can choose to come back to the ship for lunch. You can also visit Vibrant Chinatown, ancient temples and streets of colonial villas. Our guests have all evening to spend their time at shore or come back on the ship for dinner or enjoying the shows. The guests can enjoy our casino or our disco for the night or just choose to relax in their staterooms.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the Genting Dream Cruise'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nSun -\xa0Port Klang (Kuala Lumpur)\nIn the morning and after our breakfast buffet the guests are free to get off the ship and explore the city of Kuala Lumpur.\xa0 The guests can get off the ship as early as 08:00am. There are recommended shore excursions organized by the cruise liner that our guests can purchase on board or can choose to travel on their own. The guests can discover a bustling metropolis that uniquely blends the traditional and modern. Visitors will be entertained by exceptional shopping and dining opportunities. Kuala Lumpur is also home to the tallest twin towers in the world - the Petronas Twin Towers. The guests who have already visited the city earlier can choose to enjoy the amenities on board the ship. There is a Asian spa which has variety of massages and spa treatments to choose from. All spend all day at the pool or whirl pools. The guests who have been out to explore the city will be back on board around 7:00pm. Post embarking, all the evening activities and entertainment start on board. The guests can enjoy the live band at Tributes or enjoy dinner at one of our specialty Italian style cuisine at Bistro By Mark Best. Dream Dining Room is always available if our guests choose to dine with the rest of the friends they get introduced to on board. Post the evening show the bar and lounges are open for variety of music and drinks. Late night disco Zouk is grooving with top chart busters and music that one cant resist but dance.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the Genting Dream Cruise'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nMon - Singapore\n\xa0\nBreakfast the guests can disembark and continue their onward journey. The ship docks in Singapore around 14:00 hrs.\xa0 So, guests can enjoy late breakfast as well.\n\xa0\nImportant Note:\xa0The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\nNote:\xa0Costing given is subject to change and availability.\nMid Season : -\xa0June 16\n\n\n\nTravel Dates - 2026\nRoomcategory\nPrice ApplicablePer Person(1st & 2ndAdult)\nPrice Applicable 3rd\xa0Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax\nPrice Applicable 4th Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax\n\n\nJune 16\nInside Cabin\n-\n72\n72\n\n\nOcean View Cabin\nCHECKAVAILABILITY\nCHECK AVAILABILITY\nCHECK AVAILABILITY\n\n\nBalcony Cabin\n635\n72\n72\n\n\n\nLow Season :\xa0April: 21 | May: 19 | July: 14 | September: 1 | October: 20 | November: 17\n\n\n\nTravel Dates - 2026\nRoomcategory\nPrice ApplicablePer Person(1st & 2ndAdult)\nPrice Applicable 3rd\xa0Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax\nPrice Applicable 4th Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax\n\n\nApril: 21May: 19July: 14September: 1October: 20November: 17\nInside Cabin\n-\n72\n72\n\n\nOcean View Cabin\nCHECKAVAILABILITY\nCHECK AVAILABILITY\nCHECK AVAILABILITY\n\n\nBalcony Cabin\n509\n72\n72\n\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n3 Nights in\xa0Balcony Cabin\xa0on\xa0Genting Dream Cruise\n', '\n3 Nights in Inside Cabin\xa0on Genting Dream Cruise\n', '\n2 Nights in\xa0Balcony Cabin\xa0on\xa0Genting Dream Cruise\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n3 Nights in\xa0Balcony Cabin\xa0on\xa0Genting Dream Cruise\n', '0': '\n3 Nights in Inside Cabin\xa0on Genting Dream Cruise\n', '1': '\n2 Nights in\xa0Balcony Cabin\xa0on\xa0Genting Dream Cruise\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'SG', 'countryName': 'Singapore', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 38000.0, 'hotels': ['\n3 Nights in Inside Cabin\xa0on Genting Dream Cruise\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', '\nAll meals onboard the Cruise\n03 Breakfasts\n03 lunches as mentioned in the itinerary\n03 dinners as mentioned in the itinerary\nDay & Late-Night Snacks available\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': [], 'sightseeing': [], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\nCabin Fare + Port Taxes\xa0\n\nAccommodation:\xa03 Nights Cruise in inside cabin on Genting Dream Cruise.\nMeals:\n\nAll meals onboard the Cruise\n03 Breakfasts\n03 lunches as mentioned in the itinerary\n03 dinners as mentioned in the itinerary\nDay & Late-Night Snacks available\n', 'exclusions': '\nAirfare\nVisa Fees and Travel Insurance\nAny expenses of personal nature\nMeals other than that are mentioned in your itinerary.\nAny services not mentioned in the inclusions list\nDrinks including Water during meals or sightseeing tours are not included\nSurcharges as applicable due to peak season, surcharge dates, trade fair dates, Christmas, New Year week.\nSight Seeing\nOnboard Gratuities\nShore Excursions\nTransfers to and fro the ship terminal\n\n\xa0\nA fuel surcharge of SGD 15 per guest, per night (applicable to guests aged 2 years and above) will apply. The total fuel surcharge will be automatically added to the guest’s onboard account for settlement prior to disembarkation.', 'termsAndConditions': 'Terms and Conditions:\n\nAll prices are based on current ROE (Rate of Exchange) of the cruise liner. Please confirm with us at the date of booking of prevailing ROE.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nMeals on land tour are not included.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nThomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014774/GentingDream267.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014774/itinerary/GentingDreamCruise753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014774/itinerary/Penang7533.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014774/itinerary/GentingDreamCruise753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014774/itinerary/Singaporecity.jpg']}, 'score': 12.465438, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG011760', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG011760', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Classic Malaysia And Singapore', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuala Lumpur', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuala Lumpur', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuala Lumpur', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG011760_0_20260826174619', 'price': 89934, 'packageSummary': "The 'Classic Malaysia And Singapore' package is an 8-day tour covering the vibrant destinations of Singapore and Kuala Lumpur. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Petronas Twin Towers, the historic Batu Caves, Gardens by the Bay, and Sentosa Island. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, thrilling experiences at Universal Studios, scenic cable car rides, and ample opportunities to explore bustling local night markets and shopping districts.", 'images': ['Putrajaya1.jpg', '8316_Malaysia753.jpg', 'BatuCaves1.jpg', 'singapore1.jpg', 'UniversalStudiosSingapore.jpg', 'GardensBythebayNEW_753.jpg', 'BirdParadise_753.jpeg', 'Singapore_lastday.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 89934, 'thumbnailImage': 'Malaysia26745.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG011760 is named 'Classic Malaysia And Singapore' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kuala Lumpur, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Kuala Lumpur – Enroute Putrajaya 15 mins Photo stop – (Private Basis) Selamat Datang! Welcome to Malaysia's capital city - Kuala Lumpur! Upon arrival at Kuala Lumpur, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.) Highlights : 15 min photo-stop in Putrajaya: Pinkish Putra Mosque, Dataran Putra overlooking the Putrajaya Lake, Putra Bridge. Check in Hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kuala Lumpur, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour (Private Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed for city tour. Experience the unique blend of modern, historic, secular, and religious sights found in Kuala Lumpur during this half-day sightseeing tour. Visit prominent sights such as the sky-high Petronas Towers (photo stop), the country's National Mosque, stunning buildings such as the King's Palace and various other places. These places will leave you awestruck. You can also get yourself some memorable gifts from the local shops, which will remind you of your good days in Kuala Lumpur., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Kuala Lumpur, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Genting Highlands Day Trip En-Route Batu Caves (15 Mins Photo-Stop Only) & 2 Ways Cable Car – (Private Basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Post breakfast, set out to explore Genting Highlands. It is an hour’s drive from Kuala Lumpur. With the landscape beautifully dotted with mountain peaks, Genting Highlands is also known as RWG (Resorts World Genting). It is fashioned on Las Vegas- Asian style. The highlands include luxury hotels, casinos, and exciting shopping malls. It has a theme park in Pahang which is at a staggering height of 1800 meters on the peak of Gunung Ulu Kali. There is a lot more than the highlands offer. BATU CAVES: Batu Caves, one of Kuala Lumpur’s most frequented tourist attractions, is a limestone hill comprising three major caves and a number of smaller ones. Located approximately 11 kilometers to the north of Kuala Lumpur, this 100-year-old temple features idols and statues erected inside the main caves and around it. Incorporated with interior limestone formations said to be around 400 million years old, the temple is considered an important religious landmark by Hindus. Cathedral Cave – the largest and most popular cavern in Batu Caves – houses several Hindu shrines beneath its 100-metre-high arched ceiling. At the foot of Batu Hill are two other cave temples – the Art Gallery Cave and Museum Cave – which houses numerous Hindu statues and paintings., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Depart Kuala Lumpur – Arrive Singapore by Coach Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to Singapore Upon arrival at the Singapore, transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Universal Studios (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Later, visit the Universal Studios Start your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome – Impression of Monet Expression + Cloud Forest) (SIC basis) + Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land Any 2, & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay. We then visit Gardens by the Bay – Flower Dome and Super Tree Observation Deck. Enter the flower Dome, the largest glass greenhouse in the world. It replicates a mild, dry climate and features plants found in the Mediterranean and other semi-arid tropical regions. Home to one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and a lush mountain clad with plants from around the world, Cloud Forest rewards the curious and adventurous. Go on a fascinating journey of discovery and get up close with some of the world’s most exotic plant species as you stroll along its unique aerial walkways. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail. Enjoy the cable car ride and experience 4D adventure land any 2 options. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show. Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. A peek into Paradise. Immerse yourself in the symphony of colors across 8 walk-through aviaries that will take you to different biomes and landscapes of the world. Bird Paradise is home to over 3,500 birds from over 400 avian species. Explore the Night Safari for an off-hour wildlife adventure to observe the Zoo’s nocturnal fauna, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice PACKAGE ENVISAGED: Travel Validity: 01 July 2025 – 25 SEP 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD 4 – 5 PAX 6 – 7 PAX 8 -9 PAX 03 Star Metro Bukit Bintang or similar in Kuala Lumpur 180 160 155 04 Star Royal KL or similar in Kuala Lumpur 210 195 190 05 Star Berjaya Times Square or similar in Kuala Lumpur 265 250 245 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD 4 – 5 PAX 6 – 7 PAX 8 -9 PAX 03 Star Chancellor @ Albert Court / Ibis Style Albert or similar in Singapore 845 840 825 04 Star Mercure Tyrwitt or Similar in Singapore 885 880 865 05 Star One Farer Hotel or Similar in Singapore 1145 1140 1125 EXTENSION NIGHT KUALA LUMPUR Travel Validity: 01 July 2025 – 25 SEP 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD SINGLE TWIN / DOUBLE TRIPLE CHILD WITH BED CHILD NO BED 03 star Metro Bukit Bintang or similar in Kuala Lumpur 50 30 30 27 20 04 star Royal KL or similar in Kuala Lumpur 75 40 40 50 20 05 star Berjaya Times Square or similar in Kuala Lumpur 100 55 55 53 20 EXTENSION NIGHT SINGAPORE Travel Validity: 01 July 2025 – 25 SEP 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD SINGLE TWIN / DOUBLE TRIPLE CHILD WITH BED CHILD NO BED 03 star Chancellor @ Albert Court / Ibis Style Albert or similar in Singapore 200 100 100 95 15 04 star Mercure Tyrwitt or Similar in Singapore 219 110 110 106 20 05 star One Farer Hotel or Similar in Singapore 350 175 175 150 25, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 89934.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nKuala Lumpur\nRoyal KL or similar in Kuala Lumpur\xa0\n\n\nSingapore\nMercure Tyrwitt or Similar in Singapore\xa0\n\n\n, \n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nKuala Lumpur\nMetro Bukit Bintang or similar in Kuala Lumpur\n\n\nSingapore\nChancellor @ Albert Court / Ibis Style Albert or similar in Singapore\xa0\n\n\n, \n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nKuala Lumpur\nBerjaya Times Square or similar in Kuala Lumpur\xa0\n\n\nSingapore\nOne Farer Hotel or Similar in Singapore\xa0\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Kuala Lumpur 04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on Private basis Enroute Putrajaya 15 Min Photo Stop on Private Basis Half Day Kuala Lumpur City Tour on Private basis Genting Highlands Day Trip En-Route Batu Caves (15 Mins Photo-Stop Only) & 2 Ways Cable Car on Private Basis Kuala Lumpur to Singapore in Coach (SIC Basis) Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest) (SIC basis) Visit Universal Studios (SIC basis) Bird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC basis) Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land (Any 2) & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025. Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: Return Airfare TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc ) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adults travelling. Blackout dates: Singapore & Malaysia 04 Oct 2026 – 11 Oct 2026 (Formula One) 15 Dec 2026 – 10 Jan 2027 (Christmas & New Year) 28 Jan 2027 – 03 Feb 2027 (Singapore Air Show) 04 Feb 2027 – 09 Feb 2027 (Chinese New Year). Product Terms and Conditions: Terms & Conditions: The upgraded hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgraded hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the hotels envisaged. The upgraded hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel. The rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adults travelling together. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers will be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-board/connecting flights. The rates are subject to the availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offers, if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'ho