itinerary'], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', '\nAirport / hotel / airport transfers on Private basis\n'], 'sightseeing': ['\nEnroute Putrajaya 15 Min Photo Stop on Private Basis\xa0\nHalf Day Kuala Lumpur City Tour on Private basis\nGenting Highlands Day Trip En-Route Batu Caves (15 Mins Photo-Stop Only) & 2 Ways Cable Car on Private Basis\nKuala Lumpur to Singapore in Coach (SIC Basis)\nVisit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest) (SIC basis)\nVisit Universal Studios (SIC basis)\nBird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC basis)\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land (Any 2) & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis)\xa0Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025.\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\n03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Kuala Lumpur\n04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore\nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\nAirport / hotel / airport transfers on Private basis\nEnroute Putrajaya 15 Min Photo Stop on Private Basis\xa0\nHalf Day Kuala Lumpur City Tour on Private basis\nGenting Highlands Day Trip En-Route Batu Caves (15 Mins Photo-Stop Only) & 2 Ways Cable Car on Private Basis\nKuala Lumpur to Singapore in Coach (SIC Basis)\nVisit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens by the Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest) (SIC basis)\nVisit Universal Studios (SIC basis)\nBird Paradise + Night Safari (SIC basis)\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, 4D Adventure Land (Any 2) & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis)\xa0Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025.\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': '\nReturn Airfare\xa0\nTCS & GST\nVisa charges\xa0\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc )\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adults travelling.\n\nBlackout dates: Singapore & Malaysia\n\n04 Oct 2026 – 11 Oct 2026 (Formula One)\n15 Dec 2026 – 10 Jan 2027 (Christmas & New Year)\n28 Jan 2027 – 03 Feb 2027 (Singapore Air Show)\xa0\n04 Feb 2027 – 09 Feb 2027 (Chinese New Year)\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Terms & Conditions:\n\nThe upgraded hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgraded hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the hotels envisaged.\xa0\nThe upgraded hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adults travelling together.\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers will be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-board/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to the availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffers, if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/Malaysia26745.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/Putrajaya1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/8316_Malaysia753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/BatuCaves1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/singapore1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/UniversalStudiosSingapore.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/GardensBythebayNEW_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/BirdParadise_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011760/itinerary/Singapore_lastday.jpg']}, 'score': 12.141141, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG012840', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG012840', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Simply Singapore Fully Loaded', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Sentosa Sensoryscape Tour'], 'pdfName': 'PKG012840_0_20260826133651', 'price': 76013, 'packageSummary': "The 'Simply Singapore Fully Loaded' package is a 5-day tour covering Singapore. The itinerary features the Sentosa Sensoryscape Tour as its key highlight, where participants will enjoy an immersive, multi-sensory journey through stunning architectural and natural displays. Throughout the trip, travelers will experience the very best of the city-state's vibrant culture, modern attractions, and scenic sights.", 'images': ['Singapore.jpg', 'Gardensbythebay753.jpg', 'SentosaIsland.jpg', 'UniversalStudio753.jpg', 'Singapore7532.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 76013, 'thumbnailImage': 'Singapore26709.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Durga Puja Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG012840 is named 'Simply Singapore Fully Loaded' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Singapore Welcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour (Sic Basis), Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (Sic Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore. We drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.! Visit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay. Cloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways Flower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts Jurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, Madame Tussauds 4 in 1, Sentosa SensoryScape & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail. Enjoy the cable car ride and experience Madame Tussauds 4 in 1. Enter Sentosa Sensoryscape, a realm where every scent, sound, and dazzling light display is the beginning of an extraordinary journey of your senses. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show. Note: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Universal Studios (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Later, visit the Universal Studios Start your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice* Package Price: Package Cost - Travel Validity: 01 October 2026 – 26 March 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PAKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN SGD 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX 03 star IBIS Novena / Chancellor or similar 769 761 756 764 04 star Village hotel Bugis / Village hotel albert court 819 811 806 814 The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 76013.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n04 Nights Hotel\xa0Furama Riverfront or similar in Singapore\n, \n04 Nights Hotel IBIS Novena / Chancellor or similar in Singapore\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 4 Nights’ Accommodation At The Lowest Room Category With Daily Breakfast (Except On Day 1) Return Airport Transfer (Airport - Hotel -Airport) Half Day City Tour (Sic Basis), Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (Sic Basis) Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, Madame Tussauds 4 In 1, Sentosa Sensoryscape & Wings Of Time) (Sic Basis) Visit Universal Studios (Sic Basis) Travel Insurance (Valid For The Age Group Till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Visa Services High & Peak Season Surcharge Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Airport Taxes (Domestic & International) English Speaking Guide Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc ) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Blackout Dates: Rates won’t be valid if the stay falls on or between the mentioned dates. SINGAPORE FORMULA 1 - 01st OCT'26 - 11th OCT'26 CHIRSTMAS & NEW YEAR - 15 DEC'26 - 05 JAN 2027 CHINESE NEW YEAR - 10 FEB'27 – 03 MAR’27 Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge All transfers are made only on point-to-point basis only The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.. Product Terms and Conditions: The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period whi