': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Simply Singapore Fully Loaded' package is a 5-day tour covering Singapore. The itinerary features the Sentosa Sensoryscape Tour as its key highlight, where participants will enjoy an immersive, multi-sensory journey through stunning architectural and natural displays. Throughout the trip, travelers will experience the very best of the city-state's vibrant culture, modern attractions, and scenic sights.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive at Singapore\nWelcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)!\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.).', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel IBIS Novena / Chancellor (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront (Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour (Sic Basis), Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (Sic Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nProceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore.\nWe drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.!\nVisit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay.\nCloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways\nFlower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts\nJurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel IBIS Novena / Chancellor (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, Madame Tussauds 4 in 1, Sentosa SensoryScape & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) \n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nToday enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail.\nEnjoy the cable car ride and experience Madame Tussauds 4 in 1. Enter Sentosa Sensoryscape, a realm where every scent, sound, and dazzling light display is the beginning of an extraordinary journey of your senses. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show.\n\xa0\nNote: Wings of Time Fireworks Symphony shall be temporarily closed from 3 Nov - 16 Nov 2025.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel IBIS Novena / Chancellor (Standard) /\xa0Furama Riverfront\xa0(Value) or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Universal Studios (SIC basis) (closed on Tuesday)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nLater, visit the Universal Studios\nStart your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more.", 'mealDescription':