yName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG011271_0_20240405160515.pdf', 'price': 68405, 'packageSummary': "The 'Singapore - Christmas and New Year Special' package is a 5-day tour covering the vibrant city-state of Singapore. The festive itinerary includes marveling at the spectacular holiday light-up along Orchard Road, exploring the futuristic Gardens by the Bay, and visiting the famous Sentosa Island. Participants will enjoy thrilling rides at Universal Studios Singapore, a scenic cable car ride, and the breathtaking New Year's Eve countdown fireworks over the iconic Marina Bay.", 'images': ['singapore1.jpg', 'MerlionParkNew_753.jpg', 'GardensBythebayNEW_753.jpg', 'Singapore_City.jpg', 'Singapore_lastday.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 68405, 'thumbnailImage': 'SINGAPORE-14.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Xmas & New Year Departures', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015322 is named 'Singapore - Christmas and New Year Special' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Singapore Welcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour (Sic Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore. We drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.!, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay. Cloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways Flower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts Jurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Universal Studios (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit the Universal Studios Start your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice*, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 68405.0. Hotels envisaged include: \nHotel\xa0Double Tree By Hilton M Square\xa0(Premium For Apr - Sept Departures) or similar in Dubai\nHotel\xa0Canvas Mgallery By Sofitel\xa0(Premium For Oct - Mar Departures) or similar in Dubai\n, Overnight stay at the Hotels, \nHotel Novotel Bur\xa0or similar in Dubai\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Singapore Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on SIC basis Gardens by the Bay Cloud Forest & Flower Dome – SIC Basis Marina Bay Sands – SIC Basis Universal Studios – SIC Basis Singapore City Tour – SIC Basis Sentosa Island (Cable Car | Madame Tussauds 4 In 1| Wings of Time) – SIC Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: International Return Airfare TCS & GST. Visa Charges The rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling. Pre- and post-tour services & costs. Hotel rates are not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges - Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (mini-bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list. Visa - Visa Required Single Entry at additional cost. Product Terms and Conditions: Note : The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Note :The above prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer TERMS AND CONDITIONS: The package price is valid until 25th September 2024 The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT 