': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Singapore - Christmas and New Year Special' package is a 5-day tour covering the vibrant city-state of Singapore. The festive itinerary includes marveling at the spectacular holiday light-up along Orchard Road, exploring the futuristic Gardens by the Bay, and visiting the famous Sentosa Island. Participants will enjoy thrilling rides at Universal Studios Singapore, a scenic cable car ride, and the breathtaking New Year's Eve countdown fireworks over the iconic Marina Bay.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive at Singapore\nWelcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)!\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.).', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama River Front\xa0or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour (Sic Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\xa0\nProceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore.\nWe drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.!', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama River Front\xa0or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Marina Bay Sands Sky Park & Gardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Cloud Forest & Jurassic World) (SIC Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nVisit the Marina Bay Sands hotel to enjoy panoramic views of the city from MBS Sky Park. Take a walk from MBS to Gardens by the Bay.\xa0\nCloud Forest: Visit one of the world’s tallest indoor waterfalls and explore a lush mountain with exotic plants as you stroll along aerial walkways\nFlower Dome: Get up-close with unusual plants native to a range of unique habitats – from the Mediterranean region, to South African savannahs and arid deserts\nJurassic World: The Experience: Step into a prehistoric adventure at Cloud Forest, with life-sized dinosaurs and immersive experiences.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama River Front\xa0or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit Universal Studios (SIC Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nVisit the Universal Studios\nStart your journey to Hollywood movie theme park - Universal Studios™ forms part of Resorts World™ Sentosa. Among the park's many rides and exciting attractions are Battlestar Galactica™, the world's tallest pair of dueling roller coasters and Far Far Away Castle™, the first castle from the world of Shrek where you can experience the amazing Shrek 4-D™ attraction. One of the biggest spectacles in live entertainment is based on the movie Waterworld™. The action comes gushing to life in a tidal wave of death-defying stunts, explosions, and thrilling action. Enjoy Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure™, Madagascar: A Crate Adventure™ and Revenge of the Mummy™, TRANSFORMERS The Ride and many more.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Furama River Front\xa0or similar in Singapore'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\n* The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice*', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\nHotel\xa0Double Tree By Hilton M Square\xa0(Premium For Apr - Sept Departures) or similar in Dubai\nHotel\xa0Canvas Mgallery By Sofitel\xa0(Premium For Oct - Mar Departures) or similar in Dubai\n', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\nHotel Novotel Bur\xa0or similar in Dubai\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\nHotel\xa0Double Tree By Hilton M Square\xa0(Premium For Apr - Sept Departures) or similar in Dubai\nHotel\xa0Canvas Mgallery By Sofitel\xa0(Premium For Oct - Mar Departures) or similar in Dubai\n', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': '\nHotel Novotel