ers only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015322/SINGAPORE-14.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015322/itinerary/singapore1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015322/itinerary/MerlionParkNew_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015322/itinerary/GardensBythebayNEW_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015322/itinerary/Singapore_City.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015322/itinerary/Singapore_lastday.jpg']}, 'score': 11.498684, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014129', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014129', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Singapore - Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Singapore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['*Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE! Return Airport Transfer (Airport - Hotel -Airport) – (SIC Basis) Singapore City Tour – (SIC Basis) Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car, & Wings of Time) – (SIC Basis) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014129_0_20260905120321', 'price': 78401, 'packageSummary': "The 'Singapore - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' package is a 5-day tour covering the vibrant city of Singapore. This special package features an incredible Buy One Get One Free offer where one adult companion travels completely free with a paying adult. Throughout the trip, participants will enjoy convenient seat-in-coach return airport transfers, a comprehensive Singapore city tour, and an exciting excursion to Sentosa Island, which includes a scenic one-way cable car ride and the mesmerizing Wings of Time show. Additionally, the package provides travel insurance for participants up to 60 years of age, ensuring a hassle-free and memorable tropical getaway.", 'images': ['SingaporeCity753.jpg', 'SingaporeMerlionpark2.jpg', 'SingaporeSentosa.jpg', 'SingaporeFlyer.jpg', 'Singapore7532.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 78401, 'thumbnailImage': 'Singapore780.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Durga Puja Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014129 is named 'Singapore - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Singapore, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Singapore Welcome to Singapore – also known as the Lion City (Singapura)! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Singapore City tour (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed for Half Day City Tour of Singapore. We drive past the Suntec city, Parliament House, Supreme Court, City Hall, China Town and Little India. Visit Singapore’s Iconic statue - one of the most famous depictions at Merlion Park.! Rest day for leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Sentosa Island (One Way Cable Car & Wings of Time) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today enjoy full day at the Sentosa Island. Sentosa is an island resort off Singapore’s southern coast, connected to the city by road, cable car, pedestrian boardwalk, and monorail. Finish your day on Sentosa Island on a spectacular note with the award-winning Wings of Time show., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Singapore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Day is for Leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Singapore, Mea