You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014554/Disney_Adventure_Cruise_267.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014554/itinerary/Disney_Adventure_Cruise_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014554/itinerary/Let_Sail_Party_Disney_Adventure_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014554/itinerary/Oceaners_Club_Marvel_Lab_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014554/itinerary/OneBedroom_Oaceanview_Suite_DisneyAdventure_753.jpg']}, 'score': 6.864795, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014556', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014556', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'december_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Disney Adventure Cruise - Singapore Sailings - 4 Nights', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Disney Adventure', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Disney Adventure', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Disney Adventure', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Disney Adventure', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Disney Adventure', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['4 Nights Cruise on Disney Adventure All Meals included on board the ship. International Shows onboard the ship. All Kids Activities Meet and greet with Disney Characters Experience fun filled adventure at Marvel Landing Enjoy live shows like Moana – Call of the Sea'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014556_0_20260507160511.pdf', 'price': 73408, 'packageSummary': "The 'Disney Adventure Cruise - Singapore Sailings - 4 Nights' package is a magical 5-day voyage where guests spend their entire journey aboard the spectacular Disney Adventure cruise ship. This immersive itinerary features four nights of onboard accommodation with all meals included, alongside a spectacular lineup of international shows and dedicated kids' activities. Throughout the sailing, guests will enjoy meet-and-greet opportunities with beloved Disney characters, experience high-energy fun at Marvel Landing, and take in captivating live performances such as the 'Moana – Call of the Sea' show.", 'images': ['Disney_Adventure_Cruise_753.jpg', 'Let_Sail_Party_Disney_Adventure_753.jpg', 'Oceaners_Club_Marvel_Lab_753.jpg', 'OneBedroom_Oaceanview_Suite_DisneyAdventure_753.jpg', 'Oceaners_Club_VDI_Lab_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 73408, 'thumbnailImage': 'Disney_Adventure_Cruise_267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Cruise'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014556 is named 'Disney Adventure Cruise - Singapore Sailings - 4 Nights' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Disney Adventure, Meals: Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Boarding on the Cruise – Singapore – – Boarding starts from 12 noon till 3:00pm. Ship sails 4:00pm The guests will be informed prior to the sailing what time they can board the cruise. The guests can enjoy the sail away. Sail away on a magical adventure as you explore 7 imaginatively themed areas across the ship—each bursting with immersive experiences that bring the tales from Disney, Marvel and Pixar to life on a grand scale. Some suggestive activities for today are Celebrating the Disney Princesses from Tangled, Cinderella, Frozen, The Princess and the Frog and more, this fantastical area offers lavishly themed dining, quaint cafes and lounges, imaginative salons and stunning shops. As the ship’s premier indoor entertainment hub, Town Square is also home to the iconic Walt Disney Theatre, where enchanting Broadway-style shows spring to life—and Spellbound, the shadowylounge inspired by the Evil Queen from the Disney animated film Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Disney Adventure, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Snacks (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Day at Sea - Disney Imagination Garden, Photo Shoot with Disney Princesses After breakfast the guests can indulge in watching a broadways style musical and splash it at one of the Sparkling pool. Savour in upscale, restaurants, buffets, pool side snacks and room service. Find one-of-a-kindfun in unique venues designed for kids, teens, tweens and adults. Enjoy the Disney Imagination Garden – At the heart of the ship, amid a charming courtyard and majestic stage, lies a special gathering place brimming with the magic of 100 years of Disney storytelling. Because every story begins with a spark of imagination, your holiday at sea begins here, with a high-energy Let’s Set Sail dance party. Throughout your voyage, you can also catch captivating stage performances like Avengers Assemble! spot favorite Disney Characters, and enjoy delicious Indian and Pacific cuisines at Gramma Tala’s Kitchen and Mowgli’s Eatery., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Disney Adventure, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Day at Sea Today’s suggestive activities: Marvel Landing, Toy Story Place Calling all Avengers! A fun-filled adventure zone on the high seas awaits you at Marvel Landing. Located on the ship’s upper deck, this mighty area is a celebration of all things Marvel, where new recruits and seasoned Superheroes alike can avenge their need for adventure with 3 brand-new, supercharged attractions—Groot Galaxy Spin, Pym Quantum Racers and Ironcycle Test Run, the first-ever roller coaster aboard a Disney Cruise Line ship. It is also the longest roller coaster at sea—spanning over 820 feet (250 meters)! Dive into aquatic family fun as the whimsical world of the Toy Story films spring to life in surprising and imaginative ways. This lively area, spanning the center of the upper decks, takes the joy of play to infinity and beyond, with the Sunnyside Family Pool, Woody and Jessie’s Wild Slides, the Flying Saucer Splash Zone, the Toy Story Splash Pad and several whirlpool spas. The family can also enjoy watching Disney films on 2 jumbo screens. And when it’s time to refuel, enjoy a quick bite from Pizza Planet or a soft-serve ice cream from Wheezy’s Freezies., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Disney Adventure, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise), Description: Day at Sea Today’s suggestive activities: Dining With Characters and WayFinder Bay Savor everything from elegant culinary journeys to made-to-order casual fare at magically themed restaurants throughout the ship. Plus, you’ll have 3 distinctly Disney dining experiences during your voyage, with a preset schedule included with your booking. Hollywood Spotlight Club: Immerse yourself in the glitz and glam of Hollywood’s Golden Age at this star-studded dinner club. While dining on exquisite regional and international cuisines, be dazzled by live appearances and interactions with the most famous Disney VIPs of all—Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Donald Duck and Daisy Duck—each dressed to the nines and ready for an unforgettable evening of celebration that puts the spotlight on family, friends and sensational fun. Animator’s Palate: Enjoy an innovative dinner show celebrating the filmmaking legacy of Disney and Pixar Animation Studios. While dining amid film strips, clapboards, director’s chairs and display cases housing animation boards and mechanical props from favorite movies such as The Little Mermaid, Encanto and Toy Story, indulge in an artfully prepared regional and international cuisine. And watch in amazement as your own drawings magically spring to vibrant life right before your very eyes. Navigator’s Club: Return to the Golden Age of cruising as you set sail on the prestigious maritime tradition of dining at the “Captain’s Table.” Located near Town Square, this elegant restaurant conjures up the bygone era of grand ocean liners with vintage maps, charts, photos and artwork amid refined art deco touches. While savoring delicious regional and international dishes, enjoy a front-row seat to musical appearances and interactions with Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Donald Duck and Daisy Duck as these illustrious world travelers share lively songs and tales of adventure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Disney Adventure, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Singapore - Disembarkation Ship Docks in Singapore Cruise terminal at 7:00am. Guest can disembark post breakfast post 9 – 9:30am Important Note: The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Price Starting From: Travel Dates – 2026 Room category Price Applicable Per Person (1st & 2nd Adult) Price Applicable 3rd Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax Price Applicable 4th Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax March: 19, 26 April: 2, 9, 16, 23, 30 May: 7, 14, 21, 28 June: 4, 11, 18, 25 July: 9, 16, 23, 30 August: 6, 13, 20, 27 September: 3, 10, 17, 24 October: 1, 8, 15, 22, 29 November: 5, 12, 19, 26 December: 3, 10, 17, 24, 31 Inside Cabin USD 743 USD 490 USD 490 Ocean View USD 1025 USD 570 USD 570 Balcony Cabin USD 1115 USD 620 USD 620, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 73408.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n4 Nights in\xa0Balcony\xa0Cabin (Premium)\xa0on\xa0Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\n, \n4 Nights in Inside Cabin (Standard)\xa0on\xa0Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\n, \n4 Nights in\xa0Ocean View (Value)\xa0on\xa0Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation Meals Unlimited Coffee, Tea & Soda Broadway-Quality Shows Character Experiences Movie Screenings Pools Waterslides, Splash Zones & Wading Pools Kids Clubs Disney's Oceaneer Club (3 to 10 years old) Disney's Oceaneer Lab (3 to 10 years old) Edge (11 to 14 years old) Vibe (14 to 17 years old) Adult-Exclusive Activities Nightclubs, Lounges & Live Music Adults-Only Pool & Whirlpool Spa Fitness Center. Exclusions: TCS Gratuities WiFi Bottled Water, Alcoholic Beverages, Specialty Coffees, Teas & Drinks Spa & Salon Ground Transfers Air Travel Pre and Post-Cruise Hotel Stays More Family Fun Royal Court Royal Tea, a tea party with Disney Characters for kids ages 3 to 12 Bibbidi Bobbidi Boutique and The Pirate’s League, offering magical makeovers for children Adult-Exclusive Dining Palo. Product Terms and Conditions: Terms and Conditions: All prices are based on current ROE (Rate of Exchange) of the cruise liner. Please confirm with us at the date of booking of prevailing ROE. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. Meals on land tour are not included. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. Thomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. Highlights of the package: 4 Nights Cruise on Disney Adventure All Meals included on board the ship. International Shows onboard the ship. All Kids Activities Meet and greet with Disney Characters Experience fun filled adventure at Marvel Landing Enjoy live shows like Moana – Call of the Sea.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Disney Adventure Cruise - Singapore Sailings - 4 Nights' package is a magical 5-day voyage where guests spend their entire journey aboard the spectacular Disney Adventure cruise ship. This immersive itinerary features four nights of onboard accommodation with all meals included, alongside a spectacular lineup of international shows and dedicated kids' activities. Throughout the sailing, guests will enjoy meet-and-greet opportunities with beloved Disney characters, experience high-energy fun at Marvel Landing, and take in captivating live performances such as the 'Moana – Call of the Sea' show.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nBoarding on the Cruise – Singapore – – Boarding starts from 12 noon till 3:00pm. Ship sails 4:00pm\nThe guests will be informed prior to the sailing what time they can board the cruise. The guests can enjoy the sail away. Sail away on a magical adventure as you explore 7\xa0imaginatively themed areas across the ship—each bursting with immersive experiences that bring the\xa0tales from Disney, Marvel and Pixar to life on a grand scale. Some suggestive activities for today\xa0are Celebrating the Disney Princesses from Tangled, Cinderella, Frozen,\xa0The Princess and the Frog and more, this fantastical area offers lavishly themed dining,\xa0quaint cafes and lounges, imaginative salons and stunning shops. As the ship’s premier\xa0indoor entertainment hub, Town Square is also home to the iconic Walt Disney Theatre,\xa0where enchanting Broadway-style shows spring to life—and Spellbound, the shadowylounge inspired by the Evil Queen from the Disney animated film Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs.', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\xa0(Over Night on the ship)'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Sea - Disney Imagination Garden, Photo Shoot with Disney Princesses\nAfter breakfast the guests can indulge in watching a broadways style musical and splash it at one of the\xa0Sparkling pool. Savour in upscale, restaurants, buffets, pool side snacks and room service. Find one-of-a-kindfun in unique venues designed for kids, teens, tweens and adults. Enjoy the Disney Imagination Garden –\xa0At the heart of the ship, amid a charming courtyard and majestic stage, lies a special gathering place brimming with the magic of 100 years of Disney storytelling. Because every story begins with a spark of imagination, your holiday at sea begins here, with a high-energy\xa0Let’s Set Sail\xa0dance party. Throughout your voyage, you can also catch captivating stage performances like\xa0Avengers Assemble! spot favorite Disney Characters, and enjoy delicious Indian and Pacific cuisines at\xa0Gramma Tala’s Kitchen\xa0and\xa0Mowgli’s Eatery.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Snacks (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the\xa0Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\xa0(Over Night on the ship)'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Sea\nToday’s suggestive activities: Marvel Landing, Toy Story Place Calling all Avengers! A fun-filled adventure zone on the high seas awaits you at Marvel Landing.\xa0Located on the ship’s upper deck, this mighty area is a celebration of all things Marvel, where new\xa0recruits and seasoned Superheroes alike can avenge their need for adventure with 3 brand-new,\xa0supercharged attractions—Groot Galaxy Spin, Pym Quantum Racers and Ironcycle Test Run,\xa0the first-ever roller coaster aboard a Disney Cruise Line ship. It is also the longest roller coaster at sea—spanning over 820 feet (250 meters)!\n\xa0\nDive into aquatic family fun as the whimsical world of the Toy Story films spring to life in surprising and imaginative ways. This lively area, spanning the center of the upper decks, takes the joy of play to infinity\xa0and beyond, with the Sunnyside Family Pool, Woody and Jessie’s Wild Slides, the Flying Saucer Splash Zone, the Toy Story Splash Pad and several whirlpool spas. The family can also enjoy watching Disney films on 2 jumbo screens. And when it’s time to refuel, enjoy a quick bite from Pizza Planet or a soft-serve\xa0ice cream from Wheezy’s Freezies.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the\xa0Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\xa0(Over Night on the ship)'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Sea\nToday’s suggestive activities: Dining With Characters and WayFinder Bay Savor everything from elegant culinary journeys to made-to-order casual fare at magically themed\xa0restaurants throughout the ship. Plus, you’ll have 3 distinctly Disney dining experiences during your voyage, with a preset schedule included with your booking.\xa0\nHollywood Spotlight Club: Immerse yourself in the glitz and glam of Hollywood’s Golden Age at this star-studded dinner club. While dining on exquisite regional and international cuisines, be dazzled by live appearances and interactions with the most famous Disney VIPs of all—Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Donald Duck and Daisy Duck—each dressed to the nines and ready for an unforgettable evening of celebration that puts the spotlight on family, friends and sensational fun.\nAnimator’s Palate: Enjoy an innovative dinner show celebrating the filmmaking legacy of Disney and Pixar Animation Studios. While dining amid film strips, clapboards, director’s chairs and display cases housing animation boards and mechanical props from favorite movies such as The Little Mermaid, Encanto and Toy Story, indulge in an artfully prepared regional and international cuisine. And watch in amazement as your own drawings magically spring to vibrant life right before your very eyes.\nNavigator’s Club: Return to the Golden Age of cruising as you set sail on the prestigious maritime tradition of dining at the “Captain’s Table.” Located near Town Square, this elegant restaurant conjures up the bygone\xa0era of grand ocean liners with vintage maps, charts, photos and artwork amid refined art deco touches.\xa0\nWhile savoring delicious regional and international dishes, enjoy a front-row seat to musical appearances and interactions with Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Donald Duck and Daisy Duck as these illustrious world travelers share lively songs and tales of adventure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner (One of the restaurants on the Cruise)', 'overnightStay': 'Onboard the\xa0Disney Adventure\xa0Cruise\xa0(Over Night on the ship)'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nSingapore - Disembarkation\nShip Docks in Singapore Cruise terminal at 7:00am. Guest can disembark post breakfast post 9 – 9:30am\n\xa0\nImportant Note: The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\nPrice Starting From:\xa0\n\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\nTravel Dates – 2026\n\n\nRoom category\n\n\nPrice Applicable Per Person (1st & 2nd Adult)\n\n\nPrice Applicable 3rd Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax\n\n\nPrice Applicable 4th Adult after paying full price on 1st and 2nd pax\n\n\n\n\nMarch: 19, 26\nApril: 2, 9, 16, 23, 30\nMay: 7, 14, 21, 28\nJune: 4, 11, 18, 25\nJuly: 9, 16, 23, 30\nAugust: 6, 13, 20, 27\nSeptember: 3, 10, 17, 24\nOctober: 1, 8, 15, 22, 29\nNovember: 5, 12, 19, 26\nDecember: 3, 10, 17, 24, 31  \n\n\nInside Cabin\n\n\n\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 USD 743\n\n\nUSD 490\n\n\nUSD 490\n\n\n\n\nOcean View\n\n\n\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0\xa0USD\xa01025\n\n\nUSD 570\n\n\nUSD 570\n\n\n\n\nBalcony Cabin\n\n\n\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0\xa0USD\xa01115\n\n\nUSD 620\n\n\nUSD 620\n\n\n\n\n\