/images/holidays/PKG014556/itinerary/OneBedroom_Oaceanview_Suite_DisneyAdventure_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014556/itinerary/Oceaners_Club_VDI_Lab_753.jpg']}, 'score': 6.864795, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015557', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015557', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Super Deal Bali on Singapore Airlines – Multiple Hubs', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['SIGHTSEEINGS: Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Boat, Parasailing) Uluwatu temple Tour Ubud Tour ( Coffee Plantation, Celuk Mass Village) Swing by My Swing Bedugul Tour (Ulun Danu Temple) Tanah Lot Sunset'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 87700, 'packageSummary': "The 'Super Deal Bali on Singapore Airlines – Multiple Hubs' package is a 7-day tour covering the popular Balinese destinations of Ubud and Kuta. The itinerary features thrilling water sports like jet skiing, banana boat rides, and parasailing, as well as cultural highlights including the Uluwatu Temple tour and the Bedugul tour to see the Ulun Danu Temple. Travelers will also enjoy an Ubud tour with visits to a local coffee plantation and Celuk Mass Village, experience the famous Swing by My Swing, and witness a spectacular sunset at the iconic Tanah Lot temple.", 'images': ['Balicity.jpg', 'BaliAdventure.jpg', 'Uluwatu_Temple_753.jpg', 'Bali_1.jpg', 'Bali22.jpg', '47777_Ubud_Green_Rice_Bali753.jpg', 'Bali_Sunset_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 87700, 'thumbnailImage': 'BaliSRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': 