d': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/Phuket3.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/MayaBAY_PHIPHI_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/Krabi_7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/PhraNangBeach_Krabi_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/753_Chalong_temple_Phuket.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/Phuket_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/Phuketfantasea_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012732/itinerary/Phuketfantasea_753.jpg']}, 'score': 9.849279, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014145', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014145', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Fun -Tastic Thailand', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014145_0_20260914131836', 'price': 49874, 'packageSummary': "The 'Fun -Tastic Thailand' package is a 6-day tour covering the exciting destinations of Pattaya and Bangkok. The itinerary includes a thrilling speedboat ride to Coral Island, a visit to the spectacular Alcazar Show, and guided city tours of Bangkok's famous temples, including Wat Traimit and Wat Pho. Participants will also enjoy a fun-filled day at Safari World and Marine Park, alongside ample opportunities for shopping and exploring the vibrant local culture.", 'images': ['Pattaya1.jpg', 'Fun-tastic-thai.jpg', 'Sanctury-of-Truth.jpg', 'Bangkok-gall.jpg', 'Bangkok-iti-11.jpg', 'Thailand_bangkok.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 49874, 'thumbnailImage': 'Fun-tastic-thai.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014145 is named 'Fun -Tastic Thailand' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Bangkok, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Bangkok. Transfer to Pattaya (PVT Basis) Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel in Pattaya. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.) Rest of the Day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Pattaya, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Columbia Pictures Aquaverse Waterpark (PVT Basis)Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. The largest water play structure in Southeast Asia is teeming with monsters from Hotel Transylvania ready to greet their human guest. The Ghostbusters Proton Stream is where guests can go on an exhilarating journey in the world’s first water dome attraction. As Columbia Pictures Aquaverse begins to expand beyond water-driven attractions, the park will debut a Bad Boys Race Club complete with customized go-karts and an Emoji Movie Mini Golf zone., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Pattaya, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Sanctury of Truth (PVT Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Built by the late Thai millionaire Lek Viriyaphan in 1981, the temple/castle is still under construction. Much of its design is inspired by the grandeur of the Ayutthaya temples, but what makes it unique is that it’s solely constructed with intricately carved wood - you’ll find that not even metal nails were used in its foundations. Though the complete structure is still not set to be finished until 2025, the sanctuary is already open, serving as a museum, workshop, and art gallery for visitors., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Pattaya – Bangkok – En-route Mahanakhon Sky Walk (PVT Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Experience Thailand’s tallest observatory deck when you visit the Mahanakhon SkyWalk. Hop on a multimedia-themed elevator and head to the King Power Mahanakhon’s 74th floor for a sweeping view of the city. Stop by the building’s rooftop on the 78th floor and enjoy an exhilarating walk across the world’s largest glass floors, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jurassic World Bangkok– The Experience (PVT Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. What makes the Jurassic World: The Experience – Bangkok ticket truly unique is its combination of cinematic immersion, cutting-edge technology, and exclusive firsts-all within a fully interactive, walk-through adventure unlike anything else in Thailand or Southeast Asia. The experience spans over 6,000 sqm at Asiatique and recreates Isla Nublar with life-sized animatronic dinosaurs, lush jungle settings, and iconic scenes from the movies-including the towering Brachiosaurus, the Velociraptor paddock, and the T. rex enclosure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India Note: The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice PACKAGE ENVISAGED Travel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027 CATEGORY 4-5 PAX 6-8 PAX 9-10 PAX INF STANDARD 428 421 414 0 VALUE 553 539 526 0 PREMIUM 625 618 605 0, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 49874.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Brighton Grand & Convention Pattaya (Premium)