'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Fun -Tastic Thailand' package is a 6-day tour covering the exciting destinations of Pattaya and Bangkok. The itinerary includes a thrilling speedboat ride to Coral Island, a visit to the spectacular Alcazar Show, and guided city tours of Bangkok's famous temples, including Wat Traimit and Wat Pho. Participants will also enjoy a fun-filled day at Safari World and Marine Park, alongside ample opportunities for shopping and exploring the vibrant local culture.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive at Bangkok. Transfer to Pattaya (PVT Basis)\nWelcome to Thailand!\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel in Pattaya. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)\xa0\nRest of the Day at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden Beach Pattaya (Standard) / Pattaya Discovery (Value) / Brighton Grand & Convention Pattaya (Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nColumbia Pictures Aquaverse Waterpark (PVT Basis)Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nThe largest water play structure in Southeast Asia is teeming with monsters from Hotel Transylvania ready to greet their human guest. The Ghostbusters Proton Stream is where guests can go on an exhilarating journey in the world’s first water dome attraction. As Columbia Pictures Aquaverse begins to expand beyond water-driven attractions, the park will debut a Bad Boys Race Club complete with customized go-karts and an Emoji Movie Mini Golf zone.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden Beach Pattaya (Standard) / Pattaya Discovery (Value) / Brighton Grand & Convention Pattaya (Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nSanctury of Truth (PVT Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nBuilt by the late Thai millionaire Lek Viriyaphan in 1981, the temple/castle is still under construction. Much of its design is inspired by the grandeur of the Ayutthaya temples, but what makes it unique is that it’s solely constructed with intricately carved wood - you’ll find that not even metal nails were used in its foundations. Though the complete structure is still not set to be finished until 2025, the sanctuary is already open, serving as a museum, workshop, and art gallery for visitors.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden Beach Pattaya (Standard) / Pattaya Discovery (Value) / Brighton Grand & Convention Pattaya (Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nPattaya – Bangkok – En-route Mahanakhon Sky Walk (PVT Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nExperience Thailand’s tallest observatory deck when you visit the Mahanakhon SkyWalk. Hop on a multimedia-themed elevator and head to the King Power Mahanakhon’s 74th floor for a sweeping view of the city. Stop by the building’s rooftop on the 78th floor and enjoy an exhilarating walk across the world’s largest glass floors', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ecotel (Standard) / Palace (Value) /\xa0 The Berkely BKK (Premium) or similar in\xa0Bangkok'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nJurassic World Bangkok– The Experience (PVT Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nWhat makes the Jurassic World: The Experience – Bangkok ticket truly unique is its combination of cinematic immersion, cutting-edge technology, and exclusive firsts-all within a fully interactive, walk-through adventure unlike anything else in Thailand or Southeast Asia.\n\xa0\nThe experience spans over 6,000 sqm at Asiatique and recreates Isla Nublar with life-sized animatronic dinosaurs, lush jungle settings, and iconic scenes from the movies-including the towering Brachiosaurus, the Velociraptor paddock, and the T. rex enclosure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ecotel (Standard) / Palace (Value) /\xa0 The Berkely BKK (Premium) or similar in\xa0Bangkok'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India\xa0\n\xa0\nNote: The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice\nPACKAGE ENVISAGED\n\xa0\nTravel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\n4-5 PAX\n\n\n6-8 PAX\n\n\n9-10 PAX\n\n\nINF\n\n\n\n\nSTANDARD\n\n\n428\n\n\n421\n\n\n414\n\n\n0\n\n\n\n\nVALUE\n\n\n553\n\n\n539\n\n\n526\n\n\n0\n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM\n\n\n625\n\n\n618\n\n\n605\n\n\n0\n\n\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Brighton Grand & Convention Pattaya (Premium) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nBangkok\nHotel The Berkely BKK (Premium) or similar in\xa0Bangkok\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Pattaya Discovery (Value) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nBangkok\xa0\nHotel Palace (Value) or similar in Bangkok\xa0\n\n\n', '\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Golden Beach Pattaya (Standard) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nBangkok\nHotel Ecotel Bangkok (Standard) or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Pattaya Discovery (Value) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nBangkok\xa0\nHotel Palace (Value) or similar in Bangkok\xa0\n\n\n', '2': '\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Brighton Grand & Convention Pattaya (Premium) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nBangkok\nHotel The Berkely BKK (Premium) or similar in\xa0Bangkok\n\n\n', '0': '\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nPattaya\nHotel Golden Beach Pattaya (Standard) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nBangkok\nHotel Ecotel Bangkok (Standard) or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'TH', 'countryName': 'Thailand', 'continen