xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nBlackout Dates if any will be applicable\xa0\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc )\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\xa0\nSURCHARGE of USD 15 per person for Pick Up & Drop At DMK Airport.\xa0\n\n\xa0\nBlack Out/Surcharges Dates\n\nYi Peng Lantern Festival (24-26 NOV'26, tentative)\nLoy Krathong Festival (25 NOV'26)\nPattaya International Fireworks Festival - 27-29 Nov 26\nChristmas & New Year - 15 Dec 26 - 08 Jan 27\xa0\nChinese New Year - 05 Feb 27 - 12 Feb 27\n", 'termsAndConditions': 'Terms and Conditions:\n\nThe package price is valid until Sep 2026\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/Fun-tastic-thai.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/itinerary/Pattaya1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/itinerary/Fun-tastic-thai.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/itinerary/Sanctury-of-Truth.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/itinerary/Bangkok-gall.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/itinerary/Bangkok-iti-11.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014145/itinerary/Thailand_bangkok.jpg']}, 'score': 9.212089, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG012429', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG012429', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Blissful Thailand - Honeymoon Special', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012429_0_20260829190507', 'price': 69854, 'packageSummary': "The 'Blissful Thailand - Honeymoon Special' package is an 8-day tour covering the scenic tropical destinations of Koh Samui, Krabi, and Phuket. The itinerary includes romantic experiences such as private candlelit beach dinners, rejuvenating couples' spa treatments, and scenic sunset cruises. Participants will also enjoy exciting island-hopping excursions to pristine beaches, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and exploring vibrant local markets and nightlife.", 'images': ['Phuket753456.jpg', '248228_James_Bond_Island_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', '75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '526460_Phra_Nang_Cave_Krabi_Thailand_753.jpg', '00996_Tao_island_Kon_Samui_Thailand_753.jpg', '12349_Angthong_Island_Koh_Samui_Thailand_753.jpg', 'Safari-World.jpg', '4448_Koh_Samui_Island_Thailand_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 69854, 'thumbnailImage': 'THailand26709.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG012429 is named 'Blissful Thailand - Honeymoon Special' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Phuket, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Phuket. Visit Phuket Fantasea show with dinner (SIC basis) - operate on Tue, Fri & Sun Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs). In the evening, we visit Phuket Fantasea show. Inspired by Thailand's rich and exotic heritage, Phuket Fantasea not only showcases the charm and beauty of Thailand but also enriches ancient Thai traditions with the wonder of cutting-edge technology and special effects. The result is a stunning 140-acre themed complex packed with a multitude of activities and entertainments: a carnival village with games, handicrafts, and shopping, a 4,000-seat themed restaurant offering a grand buffet of Thai and international cuisines, a breathtaking Las Vegas-style theatrical show, displaying Thailand's myths, mysteries, grace and beauty, not to mention the troupe of elephants, fire-eaters, graceful dancers, and even a tiger!, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit James Bond Island by speedboat with lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Live out your inner 007 with this tour that takes you straight to the iconic James Bond Island from the movie, 'The Man with the Golden Gun', and get to explore the rest of the beautiful Phang Nga Bay while you're at it!, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Krabi, Meals: N/A, Description: Phuket - Krabi Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Krabi, famous for its scenic view and breathtaking Beaches and Islands. Its coral reef vistas are also one of the world's most beautiful, which makes the City a great spot for coral diving. Rest of the day is at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Four Island Tour with lunch by speedboat (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy exciting Island-hopping to the tropical hot spots in the Krabi Sea: Phra Nang Cave, Tub Island, Chicken Island and Poda Island. Swimming, snorkeling, sunbathing, exploring the islands are the main activities to enjoy. Expect a great day out, a rich variety of corals and fish, crystal clear water and white powdery beaches, lined with coconut palms. (Entrance to National Park fee is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Krabi - Koh Samui Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we transfer you to Krabi airport for your flight to Samui. Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Angthong Island by join Big Boat (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we enjoy a full day trip northwest from Koh Samui to Angthong Marine National Park which covers some 250 square kilometers. Major park islands largely towering, verdant rock masses encircled by clear seas, include Mae Koh which has a beautiful beach and an emerald saltwater lake called Thale Nai. Lunch is included at Koh Paluay, which is away from any noise and modern development. After lunch, enjoy swimming, sunbathing, canoeing or just relaxing on the pristine white sandy beach. (Entrance to National Park fee is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jungle Safari (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy the jungle safari jeep tour on Koh Samui will take you to some of the most famous attractions on the island. With a 4x4 off-road ride through the largely untouched jungle, you will also discover the hidden outback. Meanwhile, you can refresh yourself under a waterfall, get impressed by nature. Rest of the day is at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th EXTENSION NIGHT Travel Validity – 01 NOV’2025 – 25 Sep 2026 CATEGORY DBL STANDARD 172 VALUE 203 PREMIUM 261 Travel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027 CATEGORY DBL STANDARD 181 VALUE 214 PREMIUM 275, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 69854.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n03 Star\n\nHotel Bel Aire Patong Phuket (Standard)\n\n\n\n\nHotel Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi (Standard)\xa0\n\n\n\nHotel Samui First (Standard)\xa0\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n04 Star\nBest Western Patong Phuket (Value)\n\n\nDeevana Plaza Krabi (Value)\xa0\n\n\nChaba Cabana (Value) Koh Samui\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n05 Star\xa0\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Premium)\xa0\n\n\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan Krabi (Premium)\n\n\nNora Beach (Premium) Koh Samui\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\n, \nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\xa0\n. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Krabi 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Koh Samui Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on PVT basis Visit Fantasea Show Ticket with Dinner (SIC basis) Visit James Bond Island tour by Longtail boat with lunch (National Park Excluded) - (SIC basis) Visit Krabi 04 Island by Speedboat with lunch (National Park Excluded) – (SIC basis). Jungle Safari Tour (SIC Basis) Travel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge SURCHARGE of USD 15 per person for Pick Up & Drop At DMK Airport. Black Out/Surcharges Dates (Exclusion Section) Yi Peng Lantern Festival (24-26 NOV'26, tentative) Loy Krathong Festival (25 NOV'26) Pattaya International Fireworks Festival - 27-29 Nov 26 Christmas & New Year - 15 Dec 26 - 08 Jan 27 Chinese New Year - 05 Feb 27 - 12 Feb 27 Songkran - 10 Apr 27 - 17 Apr 27 Ubon Ratchathani Candle Festival (17-22 JUL'27). Product Terms and Conditions: Terms And Conditions: The package price is valid until MAR 2026 The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the tim