d at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Blissful Thailand - Honeymoon Special' package is an 8-day tour covering the scenic tropical destinations of Koh Samui, Krabi, and Phuket. The itinerary includes romantic experiences such as private candlelit beach dinners, rejuvenating couples' spa treatments, and scenic sunset cruises. Participants will also enjoy exciting island-hopping excursions to pristine beaches, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and exploring vibrant local markets and nightlife.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': "\xa0\nArrive at Phuket. Visit Phuket Fantasea show with dinner (SIC basis) - operate on Tue, Fri & Sun\nWelcome to Thailand!\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs).\nIn the evening, we visit Phuket Fantasea show. Inspired by Thailand's rich and exotic heritage, Phuket Fantasea not only showcases the charm and beauty of Thailand but also enriches ancient Thai traditions with the wonder of cutting-edge technology and special effects. The result is a stunning 140-acre themed complex packed with a multitude of activities and entertainments: a carnival village with games, handicrafts, and shopping, a 4,000-seat themed restaurant offering a grand buffet of Thai and international cuisines, a breathtaking Las Vegas-style theatrical show, displaying Thailand's myths, mysteries, grace and beauty, not to mention the troupe of elephants, fire-eaters, graceful dancers, and even a tiger!", 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Bel\xa0Aire\xa0Patong\xa0Phuket (Standard)\xa0/\xa0Best\xa0Western\xa0Patong\xa0Phuket (Value)\xa0/\xa0The\xa0Nature\xa0Phuket\xa0Resort (Premium) or similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit James Bond Island by speedboat with lunch (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nLive out your inner 007 with this tour that takes you straight to the iconic James Bond Island from the movie, 'The Man with the Golden Gun', and get to explore the rest of the beautiful Phang Nga Bay while you're at it!", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and\xa0Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Bel\xa0Aire\xa0Patong\xa0Phuket (Standard)\xa0/\xa0Best\xa0Western\xa0Patong\xa0Phuket (Value)\xa0/\xa0The\xa0Nature\xa0Phuket\xa0Resort (Premium) or similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nPhuket - Krabi\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nKrabi, famous for its scenic view and breathtaking Beaches and Islands. Its coral reef vistas are also one of the world's most beautiful, which makes the City a great spot for coral diving.\n\xa0\nRest of the day is at leisure.", 'mealDescription': 'N/A\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ramada\xa0by\xa0Wyndham Ao\xa0Nang\xa0Krabi (Standard)\xa0/\xa0Deevana\xa0Plaza\xa0Krabi (Value)\xa0/\xa0Ao\xa0Nang\xa0Phu\xa0Pimaan\xa0Krabi (Premium)\xa0or similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nFour Island Tour with lunch by speedboat (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nEnjoy exciting Island-hopping to the tropical hot spots in the Krabi Sea: Phra Nang Cave, Tub Island, Chicken Island and Poda Island. Swimming, snorkeling, sunbathing, exploring the islands are the main activities to enjoy. Expect a great day out, a rich variety of corals and fish, crystal clear water and white powdery beaches, lined with coconut palms.\n(Entrance to National Park fee is not included)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ramada\xa0by\xa0Wyndham Ao\xa0Nang\xa0Krabi (Standard)\xa0/\xa0Deevana\xa0Plaza\xa0Krabi (Value)\xa0/\xa0Ao\xa0Nang\xa0Phu\xa0Pimaan\xa0Krabi (Premium)\xa0or similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nKrabi - Koh Samui\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nToday we transfer you to Krabi airport for your flight to Samui.\n\xa0\n\xa0Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs).', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Samui\xa0First\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Chaba\xa0Cabana (Value) Koh\xa0Samui\xa0 /\xa0Nora\xa0Beach (Premium)\xa0Koh\xa0Samui\xa0or similar in\xa0Koh Samui'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit\xa0Angthong\xa0Island\xa0by\xa0join\xa0Big\xa0Boat\xa0(SIC\xa0basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nToday we enjoy a full day trip northwest from Koh Samui to Angthong Marine National Park which covers some 250 square kilometers. Major park islands largely towering, verdant rock masses encircled by clear seas, include Mae Koh which has a beautiful beach and an emerald saltwater lake called Thale Nai. Lunch is included at Koh Paluay, which is away from any noise and modern development. After lunch, enjoy swimming, sunbathing, canoeing or just relaxing on the pristine white sandy beach.\n\xa0\n(Entrance to National Park fee is not included)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Samui\xa0First\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Chaba\xa0Cabana (Value) Koh\xa0Samui\xa0 /\xa0Nora\xa0Beach (Premium)\xa0Koh\xa0Samui\xa0or similar in\xa0Koh Samui'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nJungle Safari (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nEnjoy the jungle safari jeep tour on Koh Samui will take you to some of the most famous attractions on the island. With a 4x4 off-road ride through the largely untouched jungle, you will also discover the hidden outback. Meanwhile, you can refresh yourself under a waterfall, get impressed by nature.\n\xa0\nRest of the day is at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Samui\xa0First\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Chaba\xa0Cabana (Value) Koh\xa0Samui\xa0 /\xa0Nora\xa0Beach (Premium)\xa0Koh\xa0Samui\xa0or similar in\xa0Koh Samui\xa0'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th\n\xa0\nEXTENSION NIGHT\xa0\nTravel Validity – 01 NOV’2025 – 25 Sep 2026\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\nDBL\n\n\n\n\nSTANDARD\n\n\n172\n\n\n\n\nVALUE\n\n\n203\n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM\n\n\n261\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\nDBL\n\n\n\n\nSTANDARD\n\n\n181\n\n\n\n\nVALUE\n\n\n214\n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM\n\n\n275\n\n\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n03 Star\n\nHotel Bel Aire Patong Phuket (Standard)\n\n\n\n\nHotel Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi (Standard)\xa0\n\n\n\nHotel Samui First (Standard)\xa0\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n04 Star\nBest Western Patong Phuket (Value)\n\n\nDeevana Plaza Krabi (Value)\xa0\n\n\nChaba Cabana (Value) Koh Samui\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n05 Star\xa0\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Premium)\xa0\n\n\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan Krabi (Premium)\n\n\nNora Beach (Premium) Koh Samui\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n05 Star\xa0\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Premium)\xa0\n\n\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan Krabi (Premium)\n\n\nNora Beach (Premium) Koh Samui\n\n\n', '0': '\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n03 Star\n\nHotel Bel Aire Patong Phuket (Standard)\n\n\n\n\nHotel Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi (Standard)\xa0\n\n\n\nHotel Samui First (Standard)\xa0\n\n\n', '1': '\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n04 Star\nBest Western Patong Phuket (Value)\n\n\nDeevana Plaza Krabi (Value)\xa0\n\n\nChaba Cabana (Value) Koh Samui\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'TH', 'countryName': 'Thailand', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'pric