ngkok transfer enroute Bangkok City & Temple Tour with Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha & Gems Gallery - Pvt basis Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Enroute Bangkok City & Temple Tour with Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha Explore Bangkok’s cultural highlights en route on your way from Pattaya to Bangkok with visits to the iconic Golden Buddha and serene Marble Buddha temples. Enjoy this city tour showcasing vibrant local sights along the way. Gems Gallery Gems Gallery Bangkok offers an interactive look at Thailand’s gemstone craftsmanship, showcasing mining, cutting, and jewelry making, with exhibits and shopping. It’s a popular stop for visitors seeking quality gems and unique experiences. Overnight in Bangkok., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bangkok: Day at Leisure Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Rest of the day is free for you to relax or explore on your own. Overnight in Bangkok., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Bangkok: This morning after breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Final Itinerary will be handed over on the day of arrival. Travel Validity: 01 Apr 2026 – 27 Oct 2026 Pattaya Extension Night : CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Golden Sea Pattaya/ Mike Garden Pattaya or similar 50 Value Aiyara Grand Hotel Pattaya or similar 56 Bangkok Extension Night: CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Anya Nana Bangkok or Seasons Siam Bangkok or similar 56 Value Citrus Sukhumvit 11 Bangkok or similar 75 Travel Validity: 01 NOV 2026 - 27 MAR 2027 Pattaya Extension Night : CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Golden Sea Pattaya/ Mike Garden Pattaya or similar 53 Value Aiyara Grand Hotel Pattaya or similar 59 Bangkok Extension Night: CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard 