– Pattaya\nWelcome to the capital of Thailand - Bangkok! Collect your luggage and transfer towards the resort city of Pattaya.\nArrive at your hotel in Pattaya. Standard check in time is between 1400-1500 hrs.\nPattaya is one of the Thailand’s largest resort cities. As a beach resort with city status, Pattaya has something for everyone. Most beach resorts rely on their natural surroundings; Pattaya makes an all-out attempt to provide the best of everything- recreation, entertainment, sightseeing and fun.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Golden Sea / Mike Garden Resort (Standard) /\xa0Aiyara Grand Hotel Pattaya (Value)\xa0or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nCoral Island with Lunch by Speed Boat - SIC basis & Later Art in Paradise\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nCoral Island tour with Indian lunch by speedboat\nEnjoy a relaxing Coral Island tour by speedboat, taking in scenic views and free time on the beach. Enjoy a delicious lunch, with optional watersports like snorkeling, sea walking, parasailing, jet-skiing, etc. at your own cost.\n\xa0\nArt In Paradise\nStep into a world of illusion at Art in Paradise Pattaya, Thailand's most vibrant 3D art museum Capture fun photos, explore interactive exhibits, and create unforgettable memories in this unique, immersive experience.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Pattaya.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and\xa0Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Golden Sea / Mike Garden Resort (Standard) /\xa0Aiyara Grand Hotel Pattaya (Value)\xa0or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nPattaya to Bangkok transfer enroute Bangkok City & Temple Tour with Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha & Gems Gallery - Pvt basis\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nEnroute Bangkok City & Temple Tour with Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha\xa0\nExplore Bangkok’s cultural highlights en route on your way from Pattaya to Bangkok with visits to the iconic Golden Buddha and serene Marble Buddha temples. Enjoy this city tour showcasing vibrant local sights along the way.\n\xa0\nGems Gallery\xa0\nGems Gallery Bangkok offers an interactive look at Thailand’s gemstone craftsmanship, showcasing mining, cutting, and jewelry making, with exhibits and shopping. It’s a popular stop for visitors seeking quality gems and unique experiences.\nOvernight in Bangkok.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Anya Nana Sukhumvit\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Citrus Sukhumvit 11 Bangkok (Value)\xa0or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nBangkok: Day at Leisure\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel. Rest of the day is free for you to relax or explore on your own.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Bangkok.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Anya Nana Sukhumvit\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Citrus Sukhumvit 11 Bangkok (Value)\xa0or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Bangkok:\nThis morning after breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Final Itinerary will be handed over on the day of arrival.\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 Apr 2026 – 27 Oct 2026\nPattaya Extension Night :\n\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\xa0\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0\n\n\nPER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\xa0\n\n\n\n\nStandard\n\n\nGolden Sea Pattaya/ Mike Garden Pattaya or similar\n\n\n50\n\n\n\n\nValue\n\n\nAiyara Grand Hotel Pattaya or similar\n\n\n56\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\nBangkok Extension Night:\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\xa0\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0\n\n\nPER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\xa0\n\n\n\n\nStandard\n\n\nAnya Nana Bangkok or Seasons Siam Bangkok or similar\n\n\n56\n\n\n\n\nValue\n\n\nCitrus Sukhumvit 11 Bangkok or similar\n\n\n75\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 NOV 2026 - 27 MAR 2027\nPattaya Extension Night :\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\xa0\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0\n\n\nPER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\xa0\n\n\n\n\nStandard\n\n\nGolden Sea Pattaya/ Mike Garden Pattaya or similar\n\n\n53\n\n\n\n\nValue\n\n\nAiyara Grand Hotel Pattaya or similar\n\n\n59\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\nBangkok Extension Night:\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\xa0\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0\n\n\nPER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\xa0\n\n\n\n\nStandard\n\n\nAnya Nana Bangkok or Seasons Siam Bangkok or similar\n\n\n59\n\n\n\n\nValue\n\n\nCitrus Sukhumvit 11 Bangkok or similar\n\n\n79\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\xa0\n*Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE!\n\xa0\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Aiyara Grand\xa0or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel Citrus Sukhumvit 11 or Similar in Bangkok\n', '\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Golden Sea / Mike Garden Pattaya or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Anya Nana Sukhumvit / Seasoms Siam or Similar in Bangkok\n', '\n2 Nights Hotel Dusit or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel Amari or Similar in Bangkok\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Aiyara Grand\xa0or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel Citrus Sukhumvit 11 or Similar in Bangkok\n', '0': '\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Golden Sea / Mike Garden Pattaya or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Anya Nana Sukhumvit / Seasoms Siam or Similar in Bangkok\n', '2': '\n2 Nights Hotel Dusit or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel Amari or Similar in Bangkok\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'TH', 'countryName': 'Thailand', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 46800.0, 'hotels': ['\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Golden Sea / Mike Garden Pattaya or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Anya Nana Sukhumvit / Seasoms Siam or Similar in Bangkok\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 52700.0, 'hotels': ['\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Aiyara Grand\xa0or Similar in Pattaya\xa0\n2 Nights Hotel Citrus Sukhumvit 11 or Similar in Bangkok\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nAirport / hotel / airport transfers on Private basis\nSuvarnabhumi Airport / Hotel / Suvarnabhumi Airport on Private Basis\n', 'As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\nArt in Paradise (Ticket Only)\n01 Hr Traditiona Thai Massage Head, Back & Shoulder (Coupon Only)\nCoral Island tour with Indian Lunch by speedboat on sharing basis\nPattaya to Bangkok transfers on Private Basis.\nEnroute Bangkok City & Temple\xa0tour\xa0with Gems Gallery visit on Private\xa0Basis\n', '\nPattaya Coral Island Tour and 1 hour Thai Massage\nEntry Ticket for Art in Paradise (Transfers on own)\nBangkok City tour with Golden and Marble Buddha temple on seat in coach basis (Gems Gallery is not visited)\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\n02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Pattaya\n02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Bangkok\nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\nReturn airport transfers on Private basis\nArt in Paradise (Ticket Only) \n01 Hr Traditiona Thai Massage Head, Back & Shoulder (Coupon Only)\nCoral Island tour with Indian Lunch by speedboat on sharing basis\nPattaya to Bangkok transfers on Private Basis.\nEnroute Bangkok City & Temple\xa0tour\xa0with Gems Gallery visit on Private\xa0Basis\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n\n\xa0', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adult travelling together\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights service\xa0\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary.\nTips for guide & Driver\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions.\nPorterage Facility\nVisa Charges for NRI Passangers (if applicable)\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc)\nAll drink and beverages\nCost of Optional excursions.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary.\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nBlack Out Dates Surcharge will be applicable if any\n\n\xa0', 'termsAndConditions': 'Child Policy :\n\nInfant: 0-1.99 yrs\nChild No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs\nChild With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs\n\nA person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult.\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration:\xa0https://tdac.immigration.go.th\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nThe package price is valid until 27 March 2027.\nRates are valid for a minimum of 02 adult travelling together.\nA surcharge of USD 20 per person applies for pick up and drop off at DMK Airport.\nHotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nHotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels.\nHotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking.\nIf the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category.\nThe rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods.\xa0\nAny applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly.\nSurcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking.\nGuests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking.\nAll rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking.\nWe reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\xa0\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\xa0\nInternational Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\nWherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges.\nNo refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services.\nAll sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice.\nRates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends.\nAny promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice.\nOnce bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time.\nOrganization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control.\n\nA refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG009254/Thailand9.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG009254/itinerary/Pattaya1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG009254/itinerary/coralisland1Thailand.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG009254/itinerary/Bangkok753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG009254/itinerary/Bangkok1City.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG009254/itinerary/Thailand2.jpg']}, 'score': 7.077457, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG011674', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG011674', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'CLASSIC PHUKET PATTAYA BANGKOK', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG011674_0_20261008193750.pdf', 'price': 54837, 'packageSummary': "The 'CLASSIC PHUKET PATTAYA BANGKOK' package is an 8-day tour covering the popular Thai destinations of Phuket, Pattaya, and Bangkok. The itinerary includes visits to stunning tropical beaches, sacred Buddhist temples, and vibrant local markets. Participants will enjoy exciting activities such as a speedboat excursion to Coral Island, guided city and temple tours in Bangkok, exploring the lively nightlife of Pattaya, and ample opportunities for shopping and tasting local street food.", 'images': ['Thailand_Phuket21.jpg', '8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', 'Phuket12.jpg', 'AlcazarshowPattayaThailandshutterstock_45747421.jpg', 'coralisland1.jpg', 'Bangkok6.jpg', 'Safariworld_753.png', 'Bangkok1City.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 54837, 'thumbnailImage': 'Thailand_SRP_new.png', 'packageTheme': ['Couple Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG011674 is named \'CLASSIC PHUKET PATTAYA BANGKOK\' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Phuket, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Phuket Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Phi Phi Island with lunch by Big boat (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Explore the picturesque and pristine beaches of Thailand’s Phi Phi Islands on this exciting day tour from Phuket. Get a chance to meet the mischievous creatures of Monkey Island, swim the clear waters of Maya Bay, and more. Discover the fascinating marine life and underwater world of Thailand during fun snorkeling sessions on Phi Phi Island. (National Park Entrance fee isn’t included in the package), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: James Bond Island by join speed boat with local lunch & national park fee (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today, we visit James Bond Island by joined speedboat. Enjoy sightseeing at Panak Island, Bat Cave & Hoytib Walk around I -tim Cave and Diamond Cave. Canoeing 30 minutes in Hong Island, cave-like "room". Have a great lunch at Koh Panyee sea gypsy village. Visit ancient drawings at Khao Khian. Visit Koh Tapu, known as James Bond Island, famous after the filming of the "The Man with Golden Gun" movie for some greats photos. Arrive Naka Island for swimming and relaxing on the beach., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Pattaya, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Phuket –Pattaya. Alcazar Show (SIC Basis) (Airfare Not Included) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we check out and transfer to Phuket airport for a flight to Bangkok. Arrive Suvarnabhumi Bangkok Airport and private transfer to Pattaya Hotel. Check-in at Pattaya hotel. Later, Visit Alcazar Show., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Pattaya, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit Coral Island by joined speedboat with lunch – (Water sports not included) – Art in Paradise (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Discover Pattaya\'s rich underwater world, fly with a parachute, go on a sea walker dive, and more on a secluded beach. This Coral Island activity combines 5 fun water things to do in Pattaya, and you are sure to find something you\'ve always wanted to try. Select from snorkeling, sea walker diving, parasailing, jet-skiing, and banana boating! Later, visit Art in Paradise The first 3D arts museum in Thailand and the largest in the world We would like to present you an interactive 3D arts in a new way That you will be stunned and amazed of. Come and capture your beautiful memories with friends, families, or lovers here., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Pattaya – Bangkok. City Tour of Bangkok Temples (Golden Buddha Temple & Marble Temple) (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit Thailand’s famous attractions today as you drive past the city. Visit Bangkok City & Temples (Golden Buddha Temple & Marble Temple)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit Safari World & Marine Park with lunch (SIC basis) (closed on Monday) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Visit one of Thailand\'s top open zoos, the Safari World in Bangkok. The park is divided into the Safari Park and Marine Park, each of which is home to a distinct collection of species. Visit the Safari park to get up close and personal with animals like tigers and giraffes. Be enthralled by the Marine Park\'s beautiful aquatic wildlife. Don\'t forget to attend the various performances the park hosts for guests. So, come along with your loved ones and enjoy your day., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th PACKAGE ENVISAGED: Travel Validity: Oct 2025 - Sept 2026 - RATES IN USD PER PERSON CATEGORY 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX INF STANDARD 538 513 538 525 0 VALUE 675 650 675 681 0 PREMIUM 750 731 750 738 0 Travel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027 CATEGORY 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX INF STANDARD 566 539 566 553 0 VALUE 711 684 711 717 0 PREMIUM 789 770 789 776 0 Extension Night Cost: RATES IN USD PER PERSON Travel Validity: Oct 2025 - Sept 2026 CATEGORY SR OTHERS DBL TRPL 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX CWB CNB INF STANDARD 208 145 145 134 128 134 131 109 94 0 VALUE 278 181 181 169 163 169 170 136 118 0 PREMIUM 319 202 202 188 183 188 184 151 131 0 Travel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027 CATEGORY SR OTHERS DBL TRPL 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX CWB CNB INF STANDARD 219 153 153 141 135 141 138 115 99 0 VALUE 293 191 191 178 171 178 179 143 124 0 PREMIUM 336 212 212 197 192 197 194 159 138 0, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 54837.0. Hotels envisaged include: Valid from November 2025 to September 2026\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n03 star\xa0\nBel Aire Patong Phuket (Superior)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\nGolden Beach Pattaya (Superior) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nAnya Nana Sukhumvit (Superior) or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n, \xa0Valid from November 2025 to September 2026\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n04 star\xa0\nBest Western Patong\xa0(Superior) or similar in Phuket\n\n\nSunbeam Pattaya (Superior) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nRamada D Ma (Superior) or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n, Valid till\xa0September\xa02025\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n05 star\xa0\nGrand Mercure Phuket Patong (Superior) or similar in Phuket\n\n\nGrand Palazzo Hotel (Grand Room) or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nThe Berkeley Hotel Pratunam (Luxury) or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValid from November 2025 to September 2026\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n05 star\xa0\nNature Phuket (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\nSiam Bay Shore (Tropical Dlx Pool)\xa0or similar in Pattaya\n\n\nThe Berkeley (Luxury) or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Pattaya 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Bangkok Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on PVT basis Phi Phi Island with lunch by Big boat (SIC basis) James Bond Island by join speed boat with local lunch & national park fee (SIC basis) Alcazar Show (SIC Basis) Visit Coral Island by joined speedboat with lunch – (Water sports not included) – Art in Paradise (SIC basis) City Tour of Bangkok Temples (Golden Buddha Temple & Marble Temple) (SIC Basis) Visit Safari World & Marine Park with lunch (SIC basis) (closed on Monday) Travel Insurance (Valid for the Age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge SURCHARGE of USD 15 per person for Pick Up & Drop At DMK Airport. National Park fees are required and must be settled at the attractions upon arrival. Black Out/Surcharges Dates (Exclusion Section) Yi Peng Lantern Festival (24-26 NOV\'26, tentative) Loy Krathong Festival (25 NOV\'26) Pattaya International Fireworks Festival - 27-29 Nov 26 Christmas & New Year - 15 Dec 26 - 08 Jan 27 Chinese New Year - 05 Feb 27 - 12 Feb 27 Songkran - 10 Apr 27 - 17 Apr 27 Ubon Ratchathani Candle Festival (17-22 JUL\'27). Product Terms and Conditions: All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th Terms And Conditions: The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ranchi', 'cityCode': 'IXR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'CLASSIC PHUKET PATTAYA BANGKOK' package is an 8-day tour covering the popular Thai destinations of Phuket, Pattaya, and Bangkok. The itinerary includes visits to stunning tropical beaches, sacred Buddhist temples, and vibrant local markets. Participants will enjoy exciting activities such as a speedboat excursion to Coral Island, guided city and temple tours in Bangkok, exploring the lively nightlife of Pattaya, and ample opportunities for shopping and tasting local street food.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive at Phuket\nWelcome to Thailand!\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Bel Aire Patong\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Patong\xa0(Value)\xa0/\xa0Nature Phuket\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in Phuket\xa0'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nPhi Phi Island with lunch by Big boat (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nExplore the picturesque and pristine beaches of Thailand’s Phi Phi Islands on this exciting day tour from Phuket. Get a chance to meet the mischievous creatures of Monkey Island, swim the clear waters of Maya Bay, and more. Discover the fascinating marine life and underwater world of Thailand during fun snorkeling sessions on Phi Phi Island.\n(National Park Entrance fee isn’t included in the package)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Bel Aire Patong\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Patong\xa0(Value)\xa0/\xa0Nature Phuket\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in Phuket\xa0'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nJames Bond Island by join speed boat with local lunch & national park fee (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nToday, we visit James Bond Island by joined speedboat.\nEnjoy sightseeing at Panak Island, Bat Cave & Hoytib Walk around I -tim Cave and Diamond Cave. Canoeing 30 minutes in Hong Island, cave-like "room".\nHave a great lunch at Koh Panyee sea gypsy village. Visit ancient drawings at Khao Khian. Visit Koh Tapu, known as James Bond Island, famous after the filming of the "The Man with Golden Gun" movie for some greats photos. Arrive Naka Island for swimming and relaxing on the beach.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Bel Aire Patong\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Patong\xa0(Value)\xa0/\xa0Nature Phuket\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nPhuket –Pattaya. Alcazar Show (SIC Basis) (Airfare Not Included)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nToday we check out and transfer to Phuket airport for a flight to Bangkok. Arrive Suvarnabhumi Bangkok Airport and private transfer to Pattaya Hotel. Check-in at Pattaya hotel.\nLater, Visit Alcazar Show.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden Beach Pattaya\xa0(Standard) / Sunbeam Pattaya (Value) /\xa0Siam Bay Shore\xa0(Premium) or similar in Pattaya\xa0'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit Coral Island by joined speedboat with lunch – (Water sports not included) – Art in Paradise (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nDiscover Pattaya's rich underwater world, fly with a parachute, go on a sea walker dive, and more on a secluded beach. This Coral Island activity combines 5 fun water things to do in Pattaya, and you are sure to find something you've always wanted to try. Select from snorkeling, sea walker diving, parasailing, jet-skiing, and banana boating!\nLater, visit Art in Paradise The first 3D arts museum in Thailand and the largest in the world We would like to present you an interactive 3D arts in a new way That you will be stunned and amazed of. Come and capture your beautiful memories with friends, families, or lovers here.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden Beach Pattaya\xa0(Standard) / Sunbeam Pattaya (Value) /\xa0Siam Bay Shore\xa0(Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nPattaya – Bangkok. City Tour of Bangkok Temples (Golden Buddha Temple & Marble Temple) (SIC Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nVisit Thailand’s famous attractions today as you drive past the city. Visit Bangkok City & Temples (Golden Buddha Temple & Marble Temple).', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Anya Nana Sukhumvit\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Ramada D’Ma (Value) / The Berkeley (Premium) or similar in Bangkok\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit Safari World & Marine Park with lunch (SIC basis) (closed on Monday)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nVisit one of Thailand's top open zoos, the Safari World in Bangkok. The park is divided into the Safari Park and Marine Park, each of which is home to a distinct collection of species. Visit the Safari park to get up close and personal with animals like tigers and giraffes. Be enthralled by the Marine Park's beautiful aquatic wildlife. Don't forget to attend the various performances the park hosts for guests. So, come along with your loved ones and enjoy your day.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Anya Nana Sukhumvit\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Ramada D’Ma (Value) / The Berkeley (Premium) or similar in Bangkok\xa0'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the ai