hout this five-day stay, guests will enjoy the exclusive key highlight of a complimentary upgrade to a stylish Sunkissed Room at the vibrant M Social Phuket, ensuring a comfortable and chic base from which to explore the island's stunning beaches, local culture, and lively nightlife.", 'images': ['8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', '43654_Karon_View_Point_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', '161992_Promthep_Cape_View_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 39994, 'thumbnailImage': 'PhuketKrabi26790.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015014 is named 'Phuket - Special Offer' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Phuket, Meals: None, Description: Arrival in Phuket Transfers: Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Phuket on a Pvt basis. (Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs). Rest of the day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Phi Phi Island with Local Lunch by shared Big Boat - SIC basis (National Park fee excluded) Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Phi Phi Island with Local Lunch by shared Big Boat Cruise to the stunning Phi Phi Islands on a big boat and enjoy clear waters, scenic beaches, and views of Maya Bay. Visit Monkey Island, swim in vibrant marine life of Maya Bay, relax and enjoy a tasty local lunch., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Phuket city tour - SIC basis Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Half day Phuket city tour Discover the charm of Phuket on a guided city tour by shared transfers. Explore iconic temples, vibrant markets, and scenic viewpoints while learning about local culture and history for an unforgettable experience., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day at Leisure Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. The rest of the day is free for you to explore the city on your own or relax at the hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure After breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your return flight. CHILD POLICY Infant: 0-1.99 yrs Child No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs Child With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs A person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult. KRABI & PHUKET EXTENSION NIGHT Category Hotels Per Person in USD (Twin/Double) Premium M Social Phuket or similar 70, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 39994.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket.\n, \n2 Nights Hotel Ramada By Wyndham Aonang\xa0or Similar in Krabi\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Best Westen Patong or Similar in\xa0Phuket\n, \n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Days Inn by Wyndham Aonang\xa0or Similar in Krabi\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong / Kata Sea Phuket or Similar in Phuket\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\n01 Local Lunch\n. Inclusions: 04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on private basis Half Day Phuket city tour – SIC basis Phi Phi Island with Local Lunch by shared Big Boat – SIC basis (National Park fee excluded) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adult travelling together. All flight services. Pre- and post - tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges - Songkran - 07 Apr - 16 Apr 2026 Pattaya Fireworks Festival, Loy Krathong Festival, Yi Peng Lantern Festival (Chiang Mai) - 20 Nov - 28 Nov 2026. Christmas & New Year - 15 Dec 2026 - 05 Jan 2027 Chinese New Year - (ON REQUEST) - 01 Feb - 22 Feb 2027 Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.. Product Terms and Conditions: All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th Black Out/Surcharges Dates: The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer Terms and Conditions: The package price is valid until 26 March 2027. Rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adult travelling together. Hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. Hotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels. Hotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking. If the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category. The rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods. Any applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly. Surcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking. Guests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking. All rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Wherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges. No refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services. All sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice. Rates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends. Any promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice. Once bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time. Organization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control. A refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.. Highlights of the package: Complimentary Upgrade to Stylish Sunkissed Room in M Social Phuket.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPri