lability and cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\nWherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges.\nNo refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services.\nAll sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice.\nRates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends.\nAny promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice.\nOnce bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time.\nOrganization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control.\nA refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015014/PhuketKrabi26790.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015014/itinerary/8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015014/itinerary/43654_Karon_View_Point_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015014/itinerary/161992_Promthep_Cape_View_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014890', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014890', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'CLASSIC PATTAYA BANGKOK', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pattaya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014890_0_20261008202642.pdf', 'price': 36740, 'packageSummary': "The 'CLASSIC PATTAYA BANGKOK' package is a 6-day tour covering the vibrant Thai destinations of Pattaya and Bangkok. The itinerary features exciting activities such as a scenic speedboat excursion to the beautiful Coral Island, attending the world-famous Alcazar Show, and taking a guided city tour of Bangkok to visit historic temples like Wat Traimit and Wat Pho. Throughout the trip, travelers will also have ample opportunities to indulge in local shopping, savor authentic Thai cuisine, and experience the bustling street life and cultural landmarks of both cities.", 'images': ['Pattaya1.jpg', 'coralisland1.jpg', 'Columbia_Picture_Aquaverse.jpg', 'Chaophray.jpg', 'safariworld_new.png', 'Thailand_bangkok.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 36740, 'thumbnailImage': 'Thailand9.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Budget Friendly', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014890 is named 'CLASSIC PATTAYA BANGKOK' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Pattaya, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive in Bangkok and transfer to Pattaya. Evening visit Alcazar Show (SIC basis) Transfers: Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Pattaya. (Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.) Alcazar Show: Enjoy the spectacular Alcazar Show, one of Thailand’s most famous performances, featuring world-class dancers, dazzling costumes, vibrant lighting, and cutting edge stage technology for an unforgettable experience. Overnight in Pattaya., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Pattaya, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Coral Island Tour with Tea, Samosa & Indian Lunch (SIC basis) (Watersports not included) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Travel by shared speedboat to Coral Island. Enjoy tea and samosa, relax on a beautiful beach, and savor an Indian lunch. Optional water sports like snorkeling, parasailing, jet skiing, banana boat rides, and sea walker diving are available at extra cost. Overnight in Pattaya., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Pattaya, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Columbia Aquaverse Pattaya with Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Spend an action packed day at Columbia Aquaverse Pattaya on a shared basis with lunch included. Enjoy Hollywood themed water rides, thrilling slides, wave pools, lazy rivers, and fun attractions for all ages. Overnight in Pattaya., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Pattaya to Bangkok enroute Guided Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha Tour with Gems Gallery Followed by Evening Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Transfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Pattaya and transferred to the Bangkok Hotel. Enjoy the Guided Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha tour with Gems gallery on the way. Pattaya to Bangkok enroute Guided Golden Buddha & Marble Buddha Tour with Gems Gallery: Travel from Pattaya to Bangkok with a guided visit to the Golden Buddha and Marble Buddha temples, showcasing Thailand’s spiritual heritage, followed by a stop at the renowned Gems Gallery. Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise (Indian): Enjoy an Indian dinner cruise on the Chao Phraya River, sailing past illuminated landmarks of Bangkok while indulging in delicious cuisine, live entertainment, and stunning night views of the city. Overnight in Bangkok., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Safari World and Marine Park Visit Bangkok’s famous Safari World and Marine Park on a shared basis with lunch included. Explore open safari zones with animals like tigers and giraffes, discover marine life, and enjoy entertaining live animal shows (closed Mondays). Overnight in Bangkok., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight. The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 36740.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nPattaya (2N)\nPattaya - Samsara Pattaya or similar\n\n\nBangkok\xa0(2N)\nBangkok - Grand Mercure Atrium or similar\n\n\n, \xa0\n\xa0\n\nHotel Golden Beach (Standard) or similar in Pattaya\nHotel Anya Nana Sukhumvit (Standard)\xa0or similar in Bangkok\n\n\xa0, \n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nPattaya (3N)\nPattaya - Beverly Hotel or similar\n\n\nBangkok (2N)\nBangkok - Ramada DMA / BangkokPalace or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast (Except