rrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th Terms And Conditions: Rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling. Hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. Hotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels. Hotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking. If the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category. The rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods. Any applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly. Surcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking. Guests are requested to confirm their onward /connecting flights with the sales team before booking. All rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Wherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges. No refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services. All sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice. Rates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends. Any promotional offer, if applicable