 World & Marine Park with Lunch (SIC basis)\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling.\nAll flight services.\nPre and post tour services & costs.\nHotel rates are not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales.\nMidnight surcharge.\nMeals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary.\nTips for guide & driver.\nCity tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable).\nExpenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.)\nCamera fee.\nPorterage facility\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable.\nVisa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable).\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary.\xa0\nCost of optional excursions.\nAnything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.\n\nBlackout date surcharges:\n\nSongkran - 06 Apr - 16 Apr 2026\nPattaya Fireworks Festival, Loy Krathong Festival, Yi Peng Lantern Festival (Chiang Mai) - 20 Nov - 28 Nov 2026.\nChristmas & New Year - 14 Dec 2026 - 05 Jan 2027\nChinese New Year - (ON REQUEST) - 01 Feb - 22 Feb 2027\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration:\xa0https://tdac.immigration.go.th\nTerms And Conditions:\n\nRates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling.\nHotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nHotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels.\nHotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking.\nIf the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category.\nThe rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods.\xa0\nAny applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly.\nSurcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking.\nGuests are requested to confirm their onward\xa0 /connecting flights with the sales team before booking.\nAll rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking.\nWe reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\xa0\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\xa0\nInternational Check in time is\xa01400/1500 hours\xa0& Check out time is\xa01100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\nWherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges.\nNo refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services.\nAll sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice.\nRates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends.\nAny promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice.\nOnce bookings are confirmed,\xa0cancellation charges\xa0will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time.\nOrganization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control.\nA refundable security deposit is required at check-in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check-out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini-bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/Thailand9.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/itinerary/Pattaya1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/itinerary/coralisland1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/itinerary/Columbia_Picture_Aquaverse.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/itinerary/Chaophray.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/itinerary/safariworld_new.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014890/itinerary/Thailand_bangkok.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014729', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014729', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Super Deal Phuket Krabi (4N/5D)', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['One Complimentary Dinner on Arrival'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 57455, 'packageSummary': "The 'Super Deal Phuket Krabi (4N/5D)' package is a 5-day tour covering the beautiful tropical destinations of Phuket and Krabi. The itinerary offers a relaxing getaway where participants can explore stunning beaches and vibrant local sights, with the special highlight of a complimentary dinner on arrival to welcome guests. This exciting package provides the perfect opportunity to experience the best of Thailand's coastal beauty and warm hospitality.", 'images': ['Phuket123.jpg', 'ThailandPhuket.jpg', 'Krabi_753.jpg', 'PhraNangBeach_Krabi_753.jpeg', 'Krabi1.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 57455, 'thumbnailImage': 'Phuket2.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014729 is named 'Super Deal Phuket Krabi (4N/5D)' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Phuket, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrive at Phuket Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx.1400 hrs.) Overnight in Phuket., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Phi Phi Island with Thai lunch by shared big boat (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Explore the picturesque and pristine beaches of Thailands Phi Phi Islands on this exciting day tour from Phuket. Get a chance to meet the mischievous creatures of Monkey Island, swim the clear waters of Maya Bay, and more. Discover the fascinating marine life and underwater world of Thailand during fun snorkeling sessions on Phi Phi Island., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Phuket - Krabi (SIC Basis) Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Depart Phuket and enjoy a scenic journey to Krabi, passing through beautiful coastal landscapes and lush tropical countryside. Upon arrival, check in to your hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure exploring Krabi., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Picnic Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy exciting Island-hopping to the tropical hot spots in the Krabi Sea: Phra Nang Cave, Tub Island, Chicken Island and Poda Island. Swimming, snorkeling, sunbathing, exploring the islands are the main activities to enjoy. Expect a great day out, a rich variety of corals and fish, crystal clear water and white powdery beaches, lined with coconut palms. (Entrance to National Park fee is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 57455.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: \nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\nMeals as specified in the itinerary\n. Inclusions: Non-Stop Direct Akasa Air Flights (Ex Mumbai – Return) 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Krabi Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on SIC basis Visit Phi Phi Island by Big Boat with Thai Lunch Excluding NP Fee (SIC Basis) Visit Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed boat with Picnic lunch Excluding NP Fee (SIC basis) Travel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling. All flight services. Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.. Product Terms and Conditions: The package price is valid. Rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling. Hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. Hotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels. Hotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking. If the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category. The rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods. Any applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly. Surcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking. Guests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking. All rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Wherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges. No refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services. All sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service provi