our control.\nA refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014729/Phuket2.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014729/itinerary/Phuket123.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014729/itinerary/ThailandPhuket.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014729/itinerary/Krabi_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014729/itinerary/PhraNangBeach_Krabi_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014729/itinerary/Krabi1.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015173', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015173', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'december_2026'], 'packageName': 'Magical Phuket Krabi', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014739_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 87882, 'packageSummary': "The 'Magical Phuket Krabi' package is a 6-day tour covering the scenic tropical destinations of Phuket and Krabi. The itinerary includes visits to pristine beaches, the famous Phi Phi Island, and the stunning limestone cliffs of Krabi. Participants will enjoy exciting island-hopping excursions, speed boat tours, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and exploring vibrant local markets and cultural landmarks.", 'images': ['75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', 'PhraNangBeach_Krabi_753.jpeg', '753_Chalong_temple_Phuket.jpg', 'MayaBAY_PHIPHI_753.jpeg', 'Dubai_Dolphin.jpg', 'Phuket1.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 87882, 'thumbnailImage': 'Thailand_Phuket.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015173 is named 'Magical Phuket Krabi' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Krabi, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrive in Phuket and transfer to Krabi Hotel Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Krabi. (Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.) Rest of the Day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast, Local Lunch and Dinner, Description: Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Explore Krabi’s stunning islands by speedboat—Phra Nang, Tub, Poda, and Chicken Island. Swim, snorkel, stroll scenic beaches, admire limestone cliffs, and relax in crystal-clear waters on this unforgettable island-hopping adventure. (*National Park Fees Included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Krabi to Phuket transfer Enroute Half day Phuket City Tour Today after breakfast at the hotel. Check out and drive to Phuket hotel Travel to Phuket and enjoy a guided city tour along the island’s southern coast, covering Patong, Karon, Kata, and Rawai beaches. Stop at Karon Viewpoint for panoramic views and visit the sacred Wat Chalong temple. (Big Buddha is not included). Rest of the day is at leisure, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Local lunch and Dinner, Description: Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later take speed boats to the stunning Phi Phi Islands, enjoying panoramic views of turquoise waters and limestone cliffs. Explore scenic bays, swim, and relax on pristine beaches while soaking in beauty at a comfortable pace. (*National Park Fees Included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Dolphin show Today after breakfast at the hotel. Enjoy Dolphin show catch the 45-minute dolphin and fur seal performance at Dolphins Bay Phuket, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure transfer to Phuket airport Today after an American breakfast at your hotel, proceed to the airport as this fantastic tour comes to an end. Return home with wonderful memories of your tour CHILD POLICY Infant: 0-1.99 yrs Child No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs Child With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs A person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 87882.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n02 nights accommodation Phuket at Deevana plaza Phuket-Patong 4* or similar\n02 nights accommodation Krabi at ibis Styles Krabi Ao Nang 4* or similar\n02 nights accommodation Bangkok at Grand Howard Hotel 4* or similar\n, \n02 nights accommodation Krabi at\xa0Avasee Krabi / Ramada Aonang\xa0or similar\n03 nights accommodation Phuket at\xa0Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites\xa0or similar\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast\n02 Local Lunches\n02 Indian Lunch\xa0\n05 Indian Dinner\n, \nDaily breakfast. (Except on the day of arrival)\xa0\n02 Local Lunch at Indian Restaurant\n06 Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian Dinners at Indian Restaurant\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner). Inclusions: Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary. Accommodations at the hotels specified above or similar. All local taxes including services taxes as of 1st July, 2026. Cost of Travel Insurance for the duration of the tour. Sightseeing, accommodation & services as per the above-mentioned itinerary. All transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. Professional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 12 customers) or a local Representative. If groups size is less than 11 customers than the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis.. Exclusions: TCS & GST. Gala dinner supplement for Christmas and New Year. Hotel rates are not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.. Product Terms and Conditions: CHILD POLICY Infant Child No Bed Child With Bed 0 - 1.99 yrs 2 - 6.99 yrs 7 - 11.99 yrs. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPK551', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPK551', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPK551', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Magical Phuket Krabi' package is a 6-day tour covering the scenic tropical destinations of Phuket and Krabi. The itinerary includes visits to pristine beaches, the famous Phi Phi Island, and the stunning limestone cliffs of Krabi. Participants will enjoy exciting island-hopping excursions, speed boat tours, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and exploring vibrant local markets and cultural landmarks.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive in Phuket and transfer to Krabi Hotel\nUpon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Krabi.\n(Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.)\nRest of the Day at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Avasee Krabi / Ramada Aonang Or Similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nKrabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\nExplore Krabi’s stunning islands by speedboat—Phra Nang, Tub, Poda, and Chicken Island. Swim, snorkel, stroll scenic beaches, admire limestone cliffs, and relax in crystal-clear waters on this unforgettable island-hopping adventure.\n(*National Park Fees Included)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Local Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Avasee Krabi / Ramada Aonang Or Similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nKrabi to Phuket transfer Enroute Half day Phuket City Tour\nToday after breakfast at the hotel. Check out and drive to Phuket hotel\nTravel to Phuket and enjoy a guided city tour along the island’s southern coast, covering Patong, Karon, Kata, and Rawai beaches. Stop at Karon Viewpoint for panoramic views and visit the sacred Wat Chalong temple. (Big Buddha is not included).\nRest of the day is at leisure', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites Or Similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nPhi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later take speed boats to the stunning Phi Phi Islands, enjoying panoramic views of turquoise waters and limestone cliffs. Explore scenic bays, swim, and relax on pristine beaches while soaking in beauty at a comfortable pace.\n(*National Park Fees Included)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Local lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites Or Similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDolphin show\nToday after breakfast at the hotel. Enjoy Dolphin show catch the 45-minute dolphin and fur seal performance at Dolphins Bay Phuket', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites Or Similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture transfer to Phuket airport\nToday after an American breakfast at your hotel, proceed to the airport as this fantastic tour comes to an end. Return home with wonderful memories of your tour\nCHILD POLICY\nInfant: 0-1.99 yrs\nChild No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs\nChild With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs\nA person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n02 nights accommodation Phuket at Deevana plaza Phuket-Patong 4* or similar\n02 nights accommodation Krabi at ibis Styles Krabi Ao Nang 4* or similar\n02 nights accommodation Bangkok at Grand Howard Hotel 4* or similar\n', '\n02 nights accommodation Krabi at\xa0Avasee Krabi / Ramada Aonang\xa0or similar\n03 nights accommodation Phuket at\xa0Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites\xa0or similar\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\n02 nights accommodation Phuket at Deevana plaza Phuket-Patong 4* or similar\n02 nights accommodation Krabi at ibis Styles Krabi Ao Nang 4* or similar\n02 nights accommodation Bangkok at Grand Howard Hotel 4* or similar\n', '1': '\n02 nights accommodation Krabi at\xa0Avasee Krabi / Ramada Aonang\xa0or similar\n03 nights accommodation Phuket at\xa0Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites\xa0or similar\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'TH', 'countryName': 'Thailand', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 87900.0, 'hotels': ['\n02 nights accommodation Krabi at\xa0Avasee Krabi / Ramada Aonang\xa0or similar\n03 nights accommodation Phuket at\xa0Mercure Journey Hub/ Elite Suites\xa0or similar\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast\n02 Local Lunches\n02 Indian Lunch\xa0\n05 Indian Dinner\n', '\nDaily breakfast. (Except on the day of arrival)\xa0\n02 Local Lunch at Indian Restaurant\n06 Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian Dinners at Indian Restaurant\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nAs per itinerary\n', '\nTransfers as mentioned in the itinerary.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Krabi\n\nKrabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch with National Park Fees\n\n\xa0\nPhuket\n\nPhuket City Tour\nPhi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch with National Park Fees\nDolphin show\n', '\nPhuket Fantasea Show – Phuket\xa0\nGuided City tour - Phuket\xa0\nDolphin Show -\xa0 Phuket\nGuided city tour of Ao Nang – Krabi\xa0\n4 Island tour with a local lunch – Krabi\xa0\nGuided city tour of Bangkok\xa0\nVisit Marble Buddha & Golden Buddha\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': "<p>Rest assured, Thomas Cook's experienced &amp; knowledgeable tour manager will be with the group at every step of the journey. Be it transportation, accommodation &amp; everything in between, ensuring a seamless &amp; stress-free travel experience from start to finish. Whether it's a question or a challenge, our tour manager is always readily available to offer support, assistance &amp; ensure that your trip becomes a most cherished memory. (Presence of the Tour Manager is subject to a minimum of 12 customers, depending on package/destination booked)</p>", 'flightDescription': '<ul>\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.</li>\n<li>Airfare not included for joining direct passengers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>FLIGHT DETAILS:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>EX MUMBAI</strong></p>\n<p>QP618 BOM HKT 0620 AM 1240 PM</p>\n<p>QP619 HKT BOM 1350 PM 1720 PM</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>EX BANGALORE</strong></p>\n<p>QP623 BLR HKT 0955 AM 1505 PM</p>\n<p>QP624 HKT BLR 1610 PM 1815 PM</p>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.\nAccommodations at the hotels specified above or similar.\nAll local taxes including services taxes as of 1st July, 2026.\nCost of Travel Insurance for the duration of the tour.\nSightseeing, accommodation & services as per the above-mentioned itinerary.\nAll transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\nProfessional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 12 customers) or a local Representative. If groups size is less than 11 customers than the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis.\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST.\nGala dinner supplement for Christmas and New Year.\nHotel rates are not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales.\nBlackout date surcharges\nMidnight surcharge.\nMeals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary.\nTips for guide & driver.\nCity tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable).\nExpenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.)\nCamera fee.\nPorterage facility\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable.\nVisa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable).\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary.\xa0\nCost of optional excursions.\nAnything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCHILD POLICY\n\n\n\n\nInfant\n\n\nChild No Bed\n\n\nChild With Bed\n\n\n\n\n0 - 1.99 yrs\n\n\n2 - 6.99 yrs\n\n\n7 - 11.99 yrs\n\n\n\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/Thailand_Phuket.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/itinerary/75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/itinerary/PhraNangBeach_Krabi_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/itinerary/753_Chalong_temple_Phuket.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/itinerary/MayaBAY_PHIPHI_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/itinerary/Dubai_Dolphin.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015173/itinerary/Phuket1.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG010800', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG010800', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'CLASSIC  KRABI KOH SAMUI', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Koh Samui', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG010800_0_20261008194959.pdf', 'price': 51060, 'packageSummary': "The 'CLASSIC KRABI KOH SAMUI' package is a 7-day tour covering the stunning tropical destinations of Koh Samui and Krabi. The itinerary includes visits to pristine white-sand beaches, vibrant local markets, and iconic cultural landmarks such as the Big Buddha temple and the sacred Tiger Cave Temple. Participants will enjoy a variety of exciting activities, including scenic island-hopping boat tours, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, exploring the famous Four Islands, and relaxing amidst the breathtaking coastal landscapes of southern Thailand.", 'images': ['Krabi2itinerary.jpg', 'kkrabi.jpg', 'speedboatkrabi.jpg', 'Samui_Koh_753.jpg', 'speedboatsamuithailand.jpg', 'samuiitinerarythailand.jpg', 'samuiiithaailanditinerry.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 51060, 'thumbnailImage': 'krabithailandsrp.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Couple Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG010800 is named 'CLASSIC  KRABI KOH SAMUI' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Krabi, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive at Krabi. Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs). Krabi, famous for its scenic view and breathtaking Beaches and Islands. Its coral reef vistas are also one of the world's most beautiful, which makes the City a great spot for coral diving. Rest of the day is at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast at hotel and Lunch, Description: Krabi Rainforest Tour with lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we start with Hot Springs & Emerald Pool – In the South of Krabi in the province of Klong Thom District are nature’s own hot tub jazuzzi known as naam tok rawn in Thai. The water here comes from thermal springs originating deep underground in volcanic chambers. The other “must-see” site in the reserve is the brightly colored ‘Blue Pool’, located some 600m further upstream from the Emerald Pool. Tiger Cave Temple is a Buddhist temple northeast of Krabi, Thailand. It is well known for the tiger paw prints in the cave and a tall Buddha statues which sits at the summit with spectacular views across Krabi Town, mountains and the tropical rain forests., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast at hotel and Lunch, Description: Four Island Tour with lunch by speedboat (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy exciting Island-hopping to the tropical hot spots in the Krabi Sea: Phra Nang Cave, Tub Island, Chicken Island and Poda Island. Swimming, snorkeling, sunbathing, exploring the islands are the main activities to enjoy. Expect a great day out, a rich variety of corals and fish, crystal clear water and white powdery beaches, lined with coconut palms., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast at hotel, Description: Krabi - Koh Samui Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we transfer you to Krabi airport for your flight to Samui. Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast at hotel and Lunch, Description: Visit Angthong Island by join speedboat with lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we enjoy a full day trip northwest from Koh Samui to Angthong Marine National Park which covers some 250 square kilometers. Major park islands largely towering, verdant rock masses encircled by clear seas, include Mae Koh which has a beautiful beach and an emerald saltwater lake called Thale Nai. Lunch is included at Koh Paluay, which is away from any noise and modern development. After lunch, enjoy swimming, sunbathing, canoeing or just relaxing on the pristine white sandy beach. (Entrance to National Park fee is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast at hotel, Description: Half Day Tour of Koh Samui Island (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Explore the coastal beauty, lush countryside and local highlights on this half day around the island. Visit three famous ornate temples, an amazing nature rocks (Hin Tar, Hin Yai). Enjoy Lad Koh Viewpoint, this is probably one of theeasiest-to-reach breathtaking viewpoints on the island, relax at Namuang Waterfall, before return hotel stroll around Natorn pier town., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Koh Samui, Meals: Breakfast at the hotel, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th PACKAGE ENVISAGED RATES IN USD PER PERSON Travel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027 CATEGORY 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX INF STANDARD 559 553 559 553 0 VALUE 730 724 730 724 0 PREMIUM 862 849 862 855 0 PACKAGE ENVISAGED EXTENSION NIGHT Travel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027 CATEGORY 4-5 PAX 6-7 PAX 8-9 PAX 10 PAX INF STANDARD 140 138 140 138 0 VALUE 183 181 183 181 0 PREMIUM 215 212 215 214 0, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 51060.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n05 Star\nDusit Thani Krabi (Deluxe) or similar in Krabi\n\n\nNora Buri Resort & Spa (Deluxe Hillside) or similar in Koh Samui\n\n\n\n\xa0, \n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n04 Star\nPeace Laguna Resort and Spa (Standard) or similar in Krabi\n\n\nChaba Cabana Samui (Deluxe Building) or similar in Koh Samui\n\n\n\n\xa0, \n\n\nCATEGORY\xa0\nHOTELS\n\n\n03 Star\nRamada by Wyndham Krabi (Deluxe) or similar in Krabi\n\n\nChaweng Noi Pool Villa (Deluxe Pool View) or similar in Koh Samui\n\n\n\n\xa0. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Krabi 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Koh Samui Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Airport / hotel / airport transfers on PVT basis Krabi Rainforest Tour with lunch (SIC basis) Four Island Tour with lunch by speedboat (SIC basis) Visit Angthong Island by join speedboat with lunch (SIC basis) Half Day Tour of Koh Samui Island (SIC basis) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. SURCHARGE of USD 15 per person for Pick Up & Drop At DMK Airport. National Park fees are required and must be settled at the attractions upon arrival. GENERAL BLACKOUTS Yi Peng Lantern Festival (24-26 NOV'26, tentative) Loy Krathong Festival (25 NOV'26) Pattaya International Fireworks Festival - 27-29 Nov 26 Christmas & New Year - 15 Dec 26 - 08 Jan 27 Chinese New Year - 05 Feb 27 - 12 Feb 27. Product Terms and Conditions: All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th Terms And Conditions: The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any