ingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'CLASSIC KRABI KOH SAMUI' package is a 7-day tour covering the stunning tropical destinations of Koh Samui and Krabi. The itinerary includes visits to pristine white-sand beaches, vibrant local markets, and iconic cultural landmarks such as the Big Buddha temple and the sacred Tiger Cave Temple. Participants will enjoy a variety of exciting activities, including scenic island-hopping boat tours, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, exploring the famous Four Islands, and relaxing amidst the breathtaking coastal landscapes of southern Thailand.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': "\xa0\nArrive\xa0at\xa0Krabi.\n\xa0\nWelcome\xa0to\xa0Thailand!\n\xa0\nUpon\xa0arrival\xa0at\xa0the\xa0airport,\xa0pick\xa0up\xa0from\xa0airport\xa0and\xa0transfer\xa0to\xa0your\xa0hotel.\xa0Check\xa0in\xa0at\xa0hotel\xa0(standard\xa0time\xa0approx\xa01400\xa0hrs).\xa0\n\xa0\nKrabi,\xa0famous\xa0for\xa0its\xa0scenic\xa0view\xa0and\xa0breathtaking\xa0Beaches\xa0and\xa0Islands.\xa0Its\xa0coral\xa0reef\xa0vistas\xa0are\xa0also\xa0one\xa0of\xa0the\xa0world's\xa0most\xa0beautiful,\xa0which\xa0makes\xa0the\xa0City\xa0a\xa0great\xa0spot\xa0for\xa0coral\xa0diving.\n\xa0\nRest\xa0of\xa0the\xa0day\xa0is\xa0at\xa0leisure.", 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Ramada by Wyndham Krabi\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Peace Laguna Resort and Spa\xa0(Value) /\xa0Dusit\xa0Thani\xa0Krabi (Premium) or Similar in Krabi\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nKrabi\xa0Rainforest\xa0Tour\xa0with\xa0lunch\xa0(SIC\xa0basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy\xa0Breakfast\xa0in\xa0Hotel.\n\xa0\nToday we start with Hot Springs & Emerald Pool – In the South of Krabi in the province of Klong Thom District are nature’s own hot tub jazuzzi known as naam tok rawn in Thai. The water here comes from thermal springs originating deep underground in volcanic chambers. The other “must-see” site in the reserve is the brightly colored ‘Blue Pool’, located some 600m further upstream from the Emerald Pool.\xa0\n\xa0\nTiger Cave Temple is a Buddhist temple northeast of Krabi, Thailand. It is well known for the tiger paw prints in the cave and a tall Buddha statues which sits at the summit with spectacular views across Krabi Town, mountains and the tropical rain forests.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast at hotel and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Ramada by Wyndham Krabi\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Peace Laguna Resort and Spa\xa0(Value) /\xa0Dusit\xa0Thani\xa0Krabi (Premium) or Similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nFour Island Tour with lunch by speedboat (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nEnjoy exciting Island-hopping to the tropical hot spots in the Krabi Sea: Phra Nang Cave, Tub Island, Chicken Island and Poda Island. Swimming, snorkeling, sunbathing, exploring the islands are the main activities to enjoy. Expect a great day out, a rich variety of corals and fish, crystal clear water and white powdery beaches, lined with coconut palms.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast at hotel and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Ramada by Wyndham Krabi\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Peace Laguna Resort and Spa\xa0(Value) /\xa0Dusit\xa0Thani\xa0Krabi (Premium) or Similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nKrabi - Koh Samui\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nToday we transfer you to Krabi airport for your flight to Samui.\n\xa0\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs).', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast at hotel', 'overnightStay': 'Chaweng Noi Pool Villa\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Chaba Cabana Samui\xa0(Value) /\xa0Nora Buri Resort & Spa\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Koh Samui\n\xa0'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Angthong Island by join speedboat with lunch (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nToday we enjoy a full day trip northwest from Koh Samui to Angthong Marine National Park which covers some 250 square kilometers. Major park islands largely towering, verdant rock masses encircled by clear seas, include Mae Koh which has a beautiful beach and an emerald saltwater lake called Thale Nai. Lunch is included at Koh Paluay, which is away from any noise and modern development. After lunch, enjoy swimming, sunbathing, canoeing or just relaxing on the pristine white sandy beach.\xa0(Entrance to National Park fee is not included)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast at hotel and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Chaweng Noi Pool Villa\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Chaba Cabana Samui\xa0(Value) /\xa0Nora Buri Resort & Spa\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Koh Samui'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf\xa0Day\xa0Tour\xa0of Koh Samui\xa0Island\xa0(SIC\xa0basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy\xa0Breakfast\xa0in\xa0Hotel.\nExplore\xa0the\xa0coastal\xa0beauty,\xa0lush\xa0countryside\xa0and\xa0local\xa0highlights\xa0on\xa0this\xa0half\xa0day\xa0around\xa0the\xa0island.\xa0Visit\xa0three\xa0famous\xa0ornate\xa0temples,\xa0an\xa0amazing\xa0nature\xa0rocks\xa0(Hin\xa0Tar,\xa0Hin\xa0Yai).\xa0Enjoy\xa0Lad\xa0Koh\xa0Viewpoint,\xa0this\xa0is\xa0probably\xa0one\xa0of\xa0theeasiest-to-reach\xa0breathtaking\xa0viewpoints\xa0on\xa0the\xa0island,\xa0relax\xa0at\xa0Namuang\xa0Waterfall,\xa0before\xa0return\xa0hotel\xa0stroll\xa0around\xa0Natorn\xa0pier\xa0town.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast at hotel', 'overnightStay': 'Chaweng Noi Pool Villa\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Chaba Cabana Samui\xa0(Value) /\xa0Nora Buri Resort & Spa\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Koh Samui'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0Morning\xa0after\xa0breakfast;\xa0you\xa0will\xa0be\xa0transferred\xa0to\xa0the\xa0airport\xa0for\xa0your\xa0flight\xa0back\xa0home\xa0to\xa0India.\xa0\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will b