ckage is a 5-day tour covering the popular destinations of Phuket and Bangkok. The itinerary includes exploring the scenic beaches of Phuket, taking guided city tours, and visiting famous cultural landmarks such as historic temples. Participants will enjoy a perfect mix of tropical relaxation and exciting city sightseeing, with ample opportunities for shopping in vibrant local markets and experiencing the rich culture and cuisine of Thailand.", 'images': ['Phuket753.jpg', 'Phuket12.jpg', 'Sealife.png', 'safariworld_new.png', 'Thailand2.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 45824, 'thumbnailImage': 'Phuket_SRP.png', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Couple Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG011655 is named \'CLASSIC PHUKET BANGKOK\' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Phuket, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Phuket. Phuket City Tour with Simon Cabaret Show (SIC basis) Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.) Later we proceed to Phuket City tour covering Phuket Old Town, Phuket Viewpoint and Gems Gallery. We then visit the Simon Cabaret show.- Watch spectacular performers, impressive costumes and amazing set design., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit James Bond Island by joined speedboat with local Lunch and National Park fee (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today, we visit James Bond Island by joined speedboat. Enjoy sightseeing at Panak Island, Bat Cave & Hoytib Walk around I -tim Cave and Diamond Cave. Canoeing 30 minutes in Hong Island, cave-like "room". Have a great lunch at Koh Panyee sea gypsy village. Visit ancient drawings at Khao Khian. Visit Koh Tapu, known as James Bond Island, famous after the filming of the "The Man with Golden Gun" movie for some greats photos. Arrive Naka Island for swimming and relaxing on the beach., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Valid till Sep 2025 Phuket - Bangkok. Sea Life Ocean World & Madame Tussauds Wax Museum on SIC basis. Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we check out and transfer to Phuket airport for a flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.) Later, Have an encounter with over 400 marine species and 30,000 sea creatures during your visit to the ocean park. Explore different attractions, including the Ocean Tunnel, which is home to many sharks, eagle rays, and other sea creatures. Finish your SEA LIFE visit by dropping by the Penguin Ice Adventure and saying hi to Gentoo Penguins. Later, visit one of the most famous museums in the world - Madame Tussauds in Bangkok. Explore the museum\'s different zones: Red Carpet, Music, History, Film, Leaders, Art & Science, TV, and Sports. Enjoy the interactive features at every exhibition and discover how the wax figures are made. With hundreds of wax figures, enjoy endless photo ops and feel free to get creative with your poses! Valid from Oct 2025 till Sep 2026 Phuket – Bangkok. Sea Life Ocean World & Madame Tussauds Wax Museum (SIC basis) (Intercity airfare is not included) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Today we check out and transfer to Phuket airport for a flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.) Later, Have an encounter with over 400 marine species and 30,000 sea creatures during your visit to the ocean park. Explore different attractions, including the Ocean Tunnel, which is home to many sharks, eagle rays, and other sea creatures. Finish your SEA LIFE visit by dropping by the Penguin Ice Adventure and saying hi to Gentoo Penguins. Later, visit one of the most famous museums in the world — Madame Tussauds in Bangkok. Explore the museum\'s different zones: Red Carpet, 