id until Sep 2026\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011655/Phuket_SRP.png', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011655/itinerary/Phuket753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011655/itinerary/Phuket12.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011655/itinerary/Sealife.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011655/itinerary/safariworld_new.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011655/itinerary/Thailand2.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013128', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013128', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'CLASSIC KRABI PHUKET', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG013128_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 43261, 'packageSummary': "The 'CLASSIC KRABI PHUKET' package is a 6-day tour covering the scenic coastal destinations of Krabi and Phuket. The itinerary includes exciting highlights such as a speedboat excursion to the famous Phi Phi Islands, a four-island tour in Krabi, and a sightseeing tour of Phuket's cultural landmarks, including the Big Buddha and historic Old Town. Participants will also have ample time to relax on pristine beaches, explore vibrant local night markets, and enjoy various water sports along the Andaman Sea.", 'images': ['75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '91271_Railay_beach_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '99396_Wat_Chalong_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', '8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', '248228_James_Bond_Island_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', 'AdobeStock_105110190__PatongBeach,_Phuket.avif'], 'minimumPrice': 43261, 'thumbnailImage': '55170_Wat_Tham_Temple_Krabi_Thailand_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Budget Friendly', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013128 is named 'CLASSIC KRABI PHUKET' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Krabi, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive in Phuket and transfer to Krabi (SIC basis) Transfers: Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Krabi. (Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.) Rest of the Day at leisure. Overnight in Krabi, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Enjoy Krabi’s most popular island-hopping tour by speedboat with lunch included. Visit Phra Nang Beach, Tub Island, Poda Island, and Chicken Island for swimming, snorkeling, scenic walks, limestone cliffs, and relaxing beach time (NPF extra). Overnight in Krabi., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Krabi to Phuket enroute Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Transfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Krabi and transferred to the Phuket Hotel. Enjoy the Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show on the way. Krabi to Phuket enroute Phuket City Tour Travel to Phuket and enjoy a guided city tour along the island’s southern coast, covering Patong, Karon, Kata, and Rawai beaches. Stop at Karon Viewpoint for panoramic views and visit the sacred Wat Chalong temple. Phuket Dolphin Show Experience Phuket’s only dolphinarium at Dolphins Bay, featuring an entertaining dolphin and seal show with impressive tricks and interactions. A fun, family friendly attraction with multiple daily shows (closed Mondays). Overnight in Phuket., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch Set out by speedboat to the stunning Phi Phi Islands with lunch included. Discover crystal clear waters, dramatic limestone cliffs, and beautiful bays, with time for swimming, snorkeling, sightseeing, and relaxing on pristine tropical beaches. Overnight in Phuket, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Tiger Kingdom (Medium Tiger) followed by Phuket Fantasea Show with Dinner (SIC basis) Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Tiger Kingdom (Medium Tiger) Visit Tiger Kingdom on a shared basis and experience a thrilling close encounter with medium sized tigers. Capture memorable photos and observe these majestic animals in a well maintained, controlled environment. Phuket Fantasea Show with Dinner Enjoy the spectacular Phuket Fantasea cultural show on a shared basis, featuring grand stage performances, acrobatics, and special effects, followed by a delicious dinner for a magical evening experience. Overnight in Phuket., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure After breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your return flight., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 43261.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nRamada by Wyndham Ao Nang (Superior)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nBel Aire Patong Phuket (Superior)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n, \xa0\nValid till Sep 2025\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nRamada by Wyndham Aonang Krabi or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nJourneyhub Phuket Patong (Superior City View) or similar in Phuket\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValid from Oct 2025 till Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nDeevana Plaza Krabi (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nBest Western Patong (Superior)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n, \n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast (Except day-1)\n02 Local Lunches\n01 Dinner\n, Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Krabi 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on SIC basis Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch (NPF Extra) (SIC basis) Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show (Enroute Krabi to Phuket) (SIC basis) Phuket Fantasea show with Dinner (SIC basis) Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch (SIC basis) Tiger Kingdom (Medium Tiger) (SIC basis) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling. All flight services. Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates are not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list. Blackout date surcharges: Songkran - 06 Apr - 16 Apr 2026 Pattaya Fireworks Festival, Loy Krathong Festival, Yi Peng Lantern Festival (Chiang Mai) - 20 Nov - 28 Nov 2026. Christmas & New Year - 14 Dec 2026 - 05 Jan 2027 Chinese New Year - (ON REQUEST) - 01 Feb - 22 Feb 2027. Product Terms and Conditions: Terms And Conditions: Rates are valid for a minimum of 01 adult travelling. Hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. Hotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels. Hotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking. If the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category. The rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods. Any applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly. Surcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking. Guests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking. All rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Wherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges. No refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services. All sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice. Rates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends. Any promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice. Once bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time. Organization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control. A refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'lt