.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Hotel Specific freebies Days Inn by Wyndham Ao nang Krabi (Complimentary Welcome Drink) Ramada by Wyndham Ao nang Krabi (Complimentary Welcome Drink) Best Western Patong Phuket (Complimentary Welcome 02 Cup Cake)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG010526_0_20261005102233', 'price': 66526, 'packageSummary': "The 'Simply Krabi And Phuket' package is a 6-day tour covering the beautiful tropical destinations of Krabi and Phuket. Throughout this island getaway, travelers will enjoy exclusive hotel-specific freebies designed to enhance their stay. Highlights of the package include complimentary welcome drinks at both the Days Inn by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi and the Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi, as well as two complimentary welcome cupcakes at the Best Western Patong Phuket.", 'images': ['Krabi2.jpg', 'Krabi1.jpg', 'Phuket12.jpg', 'PhiPhiIsland753.jpg', 'Phuket13.jpg', 'Phuket753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 66526, 'thumbnailImage': 'Krabi2671.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Honeymoon', 'Couple Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG010526 is named 'Simply Krabi And Phuket' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Krabi, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Phuket - Krabi Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx.1400 hrs.). Krabi, famous for its scenic view and breathtaking Beaches and Islands. Its coral reef vistas are also one of the world's most beautiful, which makes the city a great spot for coral diving., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Visit Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Local Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy exciting Island-hopping to the tropical hot spots in the Krabi Sea: Phra Nang Cave, Tub Island, Chicken Island and Poda Island. Swimming, snorkeling, sunbathing, exploring the islands are the main activities to enjoy. Expect a great day out, a rich variety of corals and fish, crystal clear water and white powdery beaches, lined with coconut palms. (Entrance to National Park fee is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Krabi – Phuket (PVT Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Later proceed to Phuket, the largest Island city of Thailand, Known as Thailand’s oldest city and one of Asia’s most popular honeymoon spots. With a stunning beach view, palm trees, and soothing ocean breezes, this is the perfect place to relax and unwind during the day., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Phuket City tour (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Discover the best of paradise tour of Phuket Island! Wind along Phuket’s southern shoreline, marvelling at white sands, lush tropical flora and the unique vibe of Patong, Karon, Kata and Rawai beaches. You’ll have plenty of photo opportunities from the seat of your comfortable coach or at each stop. Snap gorgeous shots from Karon Viewpoint and witness the sacred beauty of Wat Chalong temple. Later day free to explore Phuket City., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Phi Phi Island with Thai lunch by shared big boat (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Explore the picturesque and pristine beaches of Thailand’s Phi Phi Islands on this exciting day tour from Phuket. Get a chance to meet the mischievous creatures of Monkey Island, swim the clear waters of Maya Bay, and more. Discover the fascinating marine life and underwater world of Thailand during fun snorkeling sessions on Phi Phi Island. (National Park fees is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th KRABI EXTENSION NIGHT : 01 Apr 2026 – 26 Oct 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Days Inn by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi or Similar 56 Value Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi or Similar 69 PHUKET EXTENSION NIGHT : 01 Apr 2026 – 26 Oct 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Sunshine Patong Phuket or Similar 50 Value Best Westen Patong Phuket or Similar 75 KRABI EXTENSION NIGHT : 01 NOV 2026 - 26 MAR 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Days Inn by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi or Similar 59 Value Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi or Similar 72 PHUKET EXTENSION NIGHT : 01 NOV 2026 - 26 MAR 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Sunshine Patong Phuket or Similar 53 Value Best Westen Patong Phuket or Similar 79, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 66526.0. Hotels envisaged include: \nHotel Anong / Dusit Thani Beach Resort (Premium) or Similar in Krabi\xa0\nHotel\xa0Grand Mercure Patong (Premium) or similar in Phuket\n, \n02 Nights Hotel\xa0Ramada by Wyndham Aonang\xa0or Similar in Krabi\n03 Nights Hotel\xa0Best Westen Patong Phuket or similar in Phuket\n, \n02 Nights Hotel\xa0Days Inn by Wyndham Aonang or Similar in Krabi\n03 Nights Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong or similar in Phuket\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Krabi 03 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on PVT basis Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed boat with Local lunch Excluding National Park Fee (SIC basis) Phuket City tour (SIC basis) Phi Phi Island by Big Boat with Local Lunch Excluding National Park Fee (SIC Basis) Travel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights service Meals not mentioned in the itinerary. Any tips for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions. Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge Black Out Dates Surcharge will be applicable if any The rates are valid for minimum 01 adult travelling Blackouts: Christmas & New Year - 14 Dec 2026 – 10 Jan 2027 Chinese New Year – 20 Jan 2027 – 31 Jan 2027 Songkran – 04th April – 15th April 2027. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: Be present at the hotel lobby at least 15 minutes prior to the tour departure time. Maximum 03 passengers allowed in a room. Rooming allowed will be 3A or 2A+ 1CWB or 2A +1CNB ¹ Read the Travel Insurance Policy documents for exact wordings, details of the coverage and limitations. Terms and Conditions: All rates are valid on departure dates mentioned. Thomas Cook reserves the right to change departure dates given the airline seat availability changes. Any seat preference requested will be chargeable. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. A Single room booking can be processed if accompanied with another Single room booking and/or a Twin room booking. Some flights depart from India on a previous date and arrive at the destination the next day of departure and likewise for the return flight to India. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their onwards/connecting flights. The Foreign Exchange rate is volatile / dynamic and the same may fluctuate at the time of final payment. As per RBI guidelines, the Foreign exchange component of your tour towards your land portion can only be processed 120 days prior to your travel. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. While Thomas Cook takes extreme care to ensure all your sightseeing and excursions are not on holidays / closed dates but due to the itinerary / sudden changes it sometimes becomes unavoidable. Thomas Cook will make every possible attempt to arrange for alternate sightseeing and excursions on such days. However no refund will be provided as such events are beyond our control Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. Services of Tour Manager are not included in this package. Thomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. Thomas Cook would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: Hotel Specific freebies Days Inn by Wyndham Ao nang Krabi (Complimentary Welcome Drink) Ramada by Wyndham Ao nang Krabi (Complimentary Welcome Drink) Best Western Patong Phuket (Complimentary Welcome 02 Cup Cake).", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltIt