n Hotel.   Later proceed to Phuket, the largest Island city of Thailand, Known as Thailand’s oldest city and one of Asia’s most popular honeymoon spots. With a stunning beach view, palm trees, and soothing ocean breezes, this is the perfect place to relax and unwind during the day.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Westen Patong Phuket (Value) or Similar in\xa0Phuket'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nPhuket City tour (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nDiscover the best of paradise tour of Phuket Island! Wind along Phuket’s southern shoreline, marvelling at white sands, lush tropical flora and the unique vibe of Patong, Karon, Kata and Rawai beaches. You’ll have plenty of photo opportunities from the seat of your comfortable coach or at each stop. Snap gorgeous shots from Karon Viewpoint and witness the sacred beauty of Wat Chalong temple.\nLater day free to explore Phuket City.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Westen Patong Phuket (Value) or Similar in\xa0Phuket'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nPhi Phi Island with Thai lunch by shared big boat (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nExplore the picturesque and pristine beaches of Thailand’s Phi Phi Islands on this exciting day tour from Phuket. Get a chance to meet the mischievous creatures of Monkey Island, swim the clear waters of Maya Bay, and more. Discover the fascinating marine life and underwater world of Thailand during fun snorkeling sessions on Phi Phi Island.\n(National Park fees is not included)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Westen Patong Phuket (Value) or Similar in\xa0Phuket'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India\xa0\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is ten