he age of 60 yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights service\xa0\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary.\nAny tips for guide & Driver\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions.\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nBlack Out Dates Surcharge will be applicable if any\xa0\nThe rates are valid for minimum 01 adult travelling\n\nBlackouts:\n\nChristmas & New Year - 14 Dec 2026 – 10 Jan 2027\nChinese New Year – 20 Jan 2027 – 31 Jan 2027\xa0\n\xa0Songkran – 04th April – 15th April 2027\xa0\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Important Notes:\n\nBe present at the hotel lobby at least 15 minutes prior to the tour departure time.\nMaximum 03 passengers allowed in a room. Rooming allowed will be 3A or 2A+ 1CWB or 2A +1CNB\n¹ Read the Travel Insurance Policy documents for exact wordings, details of the coverage and limitations.\n\n\xa0\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nAll rates are valid on departure dates mentioned. Thomas Cook reserves the right to change departure dates given the airline seat availability changes.\nAny seat preference requested will be chargeable.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. A Single room booking can be processed if accompanied with another Single room booking and/or a Twin room booking.\nSome flights depart from India on a previous date and arrive at the destination the next day of departure and likewise for the return flight to India. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their onwards/connecting flights.\nThe Foreign Exchange rate is volatile / dynamic and the same may fluctuate at the time of final payment. As per RBI guidelines, the Foreign exchange component of your tour towards your land portion can only be processed 120 days prior to your travel.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. While Thomas Cook takes extreme care to ensure all your sightseeing and excursions are not on holidays / closed dates but due to the itinerary / sudden changes it sometimes becomes unavoidable. Thomas Cook will make every possible attempt to arrange for alternate sightseeing and excursions on such days. However no refund will be provided as such events are beyond our control\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nServices of Tour Manager are not included in this package.\nThomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. Thomas Cook would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 1, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/Krabi2671.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/itinerary/Krabi2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/itinerary/Krabi1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/itinerary/Phuket12.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/itinerary/PhiPhiIsland753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/itinerary/Phuket13.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG010526/itinerary/Phuket753.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014889', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014889', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'CLASSIC KRABI PHUKET  BANGKOK', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Krabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bangkok', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014889_0_20261010193735', 'price': 48596, 'packageSummary': "The 'CLASSIC KRABI PHUKET  BANGKOK' package is a 7-day tour covering the beautiful destinations of Bangkok, Phuket, and Krabi. The itinerary includes exciting activities such as exploring the stunning Phi Phi Islands by speedboat, embarking on a scenic Four Island tour in Krabi, and visiting iconic temples in Bangkok like Wat Pho and Wat Traimit. Participants will also enjoy relaxing on pristine beaches, experiencing local Thai culture, and shopping at bustling city markets.", 'images': ['75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '91271_Railay_beach_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '99396_Wat_Chalong_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', '8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', 'Chaophray.jpg', 'safariworld_new.png', 'Thailand_bangkok.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 48596, 'thumbnailImage': 'Krabi_267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Durga Puja Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Budget Friendly', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014889 is named 'CLASSIC KRABI PHUKET  BANGKOK' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Krabi, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive in Phuket and transfer to Krabi (SIC basis) Transfers: Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Krabi. (Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.) Rest of the Day at leisure. Overnight in Krabi, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Enjoy Krabi’s most popular island-hopping tour by speedboat with lunch included. Visit Phra Nang Beach, Tub Island, Poda Island, and Chicken Island for swimming, snorkeling, scenic walks, limestone cliffs, and relaxing beach time (NPF extra). Overnight in Krabi., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Krabi to Phuket enroute Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Transfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Krabi and transferred to the Phuket Hotel. Enjoy the Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show on the way. Krabi to Phuket enroute Phuket City Tour Travel to Phuket and enjoy a guided city tour along the island’s southern coast, covering Patong, Karon, Kata, and Rawai beaches. Stop at Karon Viewpoint for panoramic views and visit the sacred Wat Chalong temple. Phuket Dolphin Show Experience Phuket’s only dolphinarium at Dolphins Bay, featuring an entertaining dolphin and seal show with impressive tricks and interactions. A fun, family friendly attraction with multiple daily shows (closed Mondays). Overnight in Phuket., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Packed Dinner, Description: 5 Island Tour by Speed CATAMARAN with All Meals & NPF Included Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. 5 Island Tour by Speed CATAMARAN with All Meals & NPF Included Sail in style on a luxury speed catamaran for an exciting 5 island tour. Enjoy crystal clear waters, snorkeling, swimming stops, and relaxing beach time, with all meals included and National Park Fees covered for a seamless island hopping experience. Overnight in Phuket, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Phuket to Bangkok (Flight not Included) followed by evening Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Transfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Phuket and transferred to the phuket airport for your onwards flight to Bangkok. Upon Arrival in Bangkok, you will be picked from the Airport and transferred to the Bangkok Hotel. Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise (Indian): Enjoy an Indian dinner cruise on the Chao Phraya River, sailing past illuminated landmarks of Bangkok while indulging in delicious cuisine, live entertainment, and stunning night views of the city. Overnight in Bangkok., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast amd Local Lunch, Description: Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Safari World and Marine Park Visit Bangkok’s famous Safari World and Marine Park on a shared basis with lunch included. Explore open safari zones with animals like tigers and giraffes, discover marine life, and enjoy entertaining live animal shows (closed Mondays). Overnight in Bangkok., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Bangkok, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure After breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your return flight., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 48596.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\nValid till Sep 2025\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nRamada by Wyndham Aonang Krabi or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nJourneyhub Phuket Patong (Superior City View) or similar in Phuket\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValid from Oct 2025 till Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nDeevana Plaza Krabi (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nBest Western Patong (Superior)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n, \n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n, \n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi (2N)\nAva Sea\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket (2N)\nPatong Bay Residence\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\nBangkok (2N)\nAnya Nana or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast (Except day-1)\n02 Local Lunches\n01 Dinner\n, \nDaily Breakfast (Except Day 1)\n03 Local Lunches\n02 Dinners\n. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in 