T  BANGKOK' package is a 7-day tour covering the beautiful destinations of Bangkok, Phuket, and Krabi. The itinerary includes exciting activities such as exploring the stunning Phi Phi Islands by speedboat, embarking on a scenic Four Island tour in Krabi, and visiting iconic temples in Bangkok like Wat Pho and Wat Traimit. Participants will also enjoy relaxing on pristine beaches, experiencing local Thai culture, and shopping at bustling city markets.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive in Phuket and transfer to Krabi (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Krabi.\xa0\n(Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.)\n\xa0\nRest of the Day at leisure.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Krabi', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ava Sea (Standrad) / Apple A Day (Value) /\xa0Centara Ao Nang Resort\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nKrabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Krabi’s most popular island-hopping tour by speedboat with lunch included. Visit Phra Nang Beach, Tub Island, Poda Island, and Chicken Island for swimming, snorkeling, scenic walks, limestone cliffs, and relaxing beach time (NPF extra).\n\xa0\nOvernight in Krabi.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ava Sea (Standrad) / Apple A Day (Value) / Centara Ao Nang Resort (Premium) or similar in Krabi'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nKrabi to Phuket enroute Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show (SIC basis)\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Krabi and transferred to the Phuket Hotel. Enjoy the Phuket City Tour with Dolphin Show on the way.\n\xa0\nKrabi to Phuket enroute Phuket City Tour\nTravel to Phuket and enjoy a guided city tour along the island’s southern coast, covering Patong, Karon, Kata, and Rawai beaches. Stop at Karon Viewpoint for panoramic views and visit the sacred Wat Chalong temple.\n\xa0\nPhuket Dolphin Show\nExperience Phuket’s only dolphinarium at Dolphins Bay, featuring an entertaining dolphin and seal show with impressive tricks and interactions. A fun, family friendly attraction with multiple daily shows (closed Mondays).\n\xa0\nOvernight in Phuket.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Patong Bay Residence (Standard) / Best Western Patong\xa0(Value) /\xa0The Nature Phuket Resort\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\n5 Island Tour by Speed CATAMARAN with All Meals & NPF Included\n\xa0\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\n5 Island Tour by Speed CATAMARAN with All Meals & NPF Included\nSail in style on a luxury speed catamaran for an exciting 5 island tour. Enjoy crystal clear waters, snorkeling, swimming stops, and relaxing beach time, with all meals included and National Park Fees covered for a seamless island hopping experience.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Phuket', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Packed Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Patong Bay Residence (Standard) / Best Western Patong (Value) / The Nature Phuket Resort (Premium) or similar in Phuket'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\nPhuket to Bangkok (Flight not Included) followed by evening Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Phuket and transferred to the phuket airport for your onwards flight to Bangkok. Upon Arrival in Bangkok, you will be picked from the Airport and transferred to the Bangkok Hotel.\n\xa0\nChao Phraya Dinner Cruise (Indian):\nEnjoy an Indian dinner cruise on the Chao Phraya River, sailing past illuminated landmarks of Bangkok while indulging in delicious cuisine, live entertainment, and stunning night views of the city.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Bangkok.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Petite Salil 8 (Standard) / Ramada DMA\xa0(Value) / Grand Mercure Atrium (Premium) or similar in\xa0Bangkok'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nSafari World & Marine Park with Lunch (SIC basis)\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nSafari World and Marine Park\nVisit Bangkok’s famous Safari World and Marine Park on a shared basis with lunch included. Explore open safari zones with animals like tigers and giraffes, discover marine life, and enjoy entertaining live animal shows (closed Mondays).\n\xa0\nOvernight in Bangkok.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast amd Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Petite Salil 8\xa0(Standard) / Ramada DMA (Value) / Grand Mercure Atrium (Premium) or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0\nAfter breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your return flight.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\nValid till Sep 2025\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nRamada by Wyndham Aonang Krabi or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nJourneyhub Phuket Patong (Superior City View) or similar in Phuket\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValid from Oct 2025 till Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nDeevana Plaza Krabi (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nBest Western Patong (Superior)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n', '\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n', '\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi (2N)\nAva Sea\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket (2N)\nPatong Bay Residence\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\nBangkok (2N)\nAnya Nana or similar in Bangkok\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n\n\nCity\nHotels or similar\n\n\nKrabi\nAo Nang Phu Pimaan (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Krabi\n\n\nPhuket\nThe Nature Phuket Resort (Deluxe)\xa0or similar in Phuket\n\n\n', '1': 