neswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'PARTY TRAIL PATTAYA BANGKOK' package is an exciting 5-day tour covering the vibrant destinations of Pattaya and Bangkok. The itinerary includes visits to the stunning Coral Island, the famous Alcazar Cabaret Show, and iconic cultural landmarks like the Temple of the Golden Buddha. Participants will enjoy thrilling speedboat rides, guided city sightseeing tours, shopping at bustling local markets, and experiencing the legendary nightlife that makes this trail a favorite for party-goers and travelers alike.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive in Bangkok and transfer to Pattaya. Evening visit Russian Cabaret Show\xa0(SIC basis)\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon arriving at the airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Pattaya.\xa0\n(Standard Check in time after 14:00 Hrs.)\n\xa0\nRussian Cabaret Show:\xa0\nEnjoy an entertaining evening at the famous Russian Cabaret Show, featuring spectacular dance performances, colorful costumes, and high energy stage acts for a fun and lively experience.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Pattaya.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden\xa0Sea (Standard) /\xa0Beverly (Value) /\xa0Samsara Pattaya (Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFull Day Ultimate Yacht Party Experience (3 Island Tour) (SIC basis)\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy a luxurious full day yacht party from Pattaya, sailing across three beautiful nearby islands. Relax on deck, swim in crystal clear waters, enjoy music, entertainment, and a lively party atmosphere for an unforgettable sea experience.\nOvernight in Pattaya.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden\xa0Sea (Standard) /\xa0Beverly\xa0(Value) /\xa0Samsara Pattaya\xa0(Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nHalf Day Sundowner Yacht Party (2 Hours Free Flow Drinks with Snacks) (SIC basis)\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel\n\xa0\nHalf Day Sundowner Yacht Party\nUnwind on a stylish sundowner yacht cruise with a relaxed party vibe. Enjoy a scenic coastal sail with 2 hours free flow of drinks, light snacks, music, and beautiful sunset views for a perfect evening at sea.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Pattaya.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Golden Sea Pattaya (Standard) /\xa0Beverly\xa0(Value) /\xa0Samsara Pattaya\xa0(Premium) or similar in Pattaya'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nPattaya Hotel to Bangkok Hotel Followed by Bollywood Dance Show at Dhoom (SIC basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: You will be picked up from your hotel in Pattaya and transferred to the Bangkok Hotel.\n\xa0\nBollywood Dance Show at Dhoom\nExperience a high energy Hollywood dance show at Dhoom, featuring dynamic performances, dazzling choreography, upbeat music, and a vibrant stage atmosphere for a fun filled evening of live entertainment.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Bangkok.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Petite Salil 8\xa0(Standard) / Ramada D Ma Bangkok or Bangkok Palace (Value) / Grand Mercure Atrium (Premium) or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDeparture\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight.\n\xa0\nThe itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\xa0\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 