Pho, the historic Bridge over the River Kwai, and the Allied War Cemetery. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing, a scenic train ride along the infamous Death Railway, a boat ride through local floating markets, and a chance to explore the stunning multi-tiered waterfalls of Erawan National Park.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive at Bangkok. Visit Mahanakhon Sky Walk (incl.soft drink only) (SIC basis)\nWelcome to Thailand!\n\xa0\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs).\xa0\n\xa0\nToday we visit Mahanakhon Skywalk, Thailand’s highest observation deck at 314 meters offers 360 degree panoramic views from an indoor and outdoor viewing area, and is a must-see attraction to add to your Bangkok bucket list.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'The Ecotel Bangkok\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Ramada\xa0by\xa0Wyndham\xa0D’Ma (Value) /\xa0The Berkeley Pratunam\xa0(Premium) or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Damnoen Saduak Floating Market (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nDamnoen Saduak is one of the most popular floating markets around Bangkok. It has a lot of amazing things to look forward to, from shopping to dining and strolling around.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'The Ecotel Bangkok\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Ramada\xa0by\xa0Wyndham\xa0D’Ma (Value) /\xa0The Berkeley Pratunam\xa0(Premium) or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nBangkok – Kanchanaburi (PVT basis). Kanchanaburi City Tour (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nToday we check out and transfer to Kanchanaburi.\n\xa0\nStart your tour with a visit to war cemeteries, JEATH War Museum, and last but not least, the Bridge over the River Kwai - the prominent places that always remind you of the WWII history and Kao Poon Cave & Temple.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Pung-Waan Resort Kwai Noi\xa0(Standard) /\xa0River Kwai Village\xa0(Value) /\xa0Home Phu-Toey\xa0(Premium) or similar in Kanchanaburi'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nAdventure and Nature Explore Tour (SIC basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\n\xa0\nPick up from hotel to join Adventure and Nature Explore in Kanchanaburi. Depart the hotel for Erawan Waterfall National Park. Upon arrival, start to trek along its nature trail to the splendid waterfalls inside. Then enjoy relaxing and swimming in the emerald-coloured pools. After Lunch, continue a journey to enjoy elephant riding and rafting. Enjoy the train excursion from Wang Poh to Tha Kilaen stations along the Death Railway. We then head back to the hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Pung-Waan Resort Kwai Noi\xa0(Standard) /\xa0River Kwai Village\xa0(Value) /\xa0Home Phu-Toey\xa0(Premium) or similar in Kanchanaburi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nKanchanaburi\xa0–\xa0Bangkok\xa0(PVT\xa0basis)\nEnjoy\xa0Breakfast\xa0in\xa0Hotel.\nToday\xa0we\xa0check\xa0out\xa0and\xa0transfer\xa0to\xa0Bangkok.\xa0Rest\xa0of\xa0the\xa0day\xa0is\xa0at\xa0leisure\xa0to\xa0explore\xa0on\xa0your\xa0own.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'The Ecotel Bangkok\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Ramada\xa0by\xa0Wyndham\xa0D’Ma (Value) /\xa0The Berkeley Pratunam\xa0(Premium) or similar in Bangkok'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0\nMorning\xa0after\xa0breakfast;\xa0you\xa0will\xa0be\xa0transferred\xa0to\xa0the\xa0airport\xa0for\xa0your\xa0flight\xa0back\xa0home\xa0to\xa0India.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nAll travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration:\xa0https://tdac.immigration.go.th\xa0\nPACKAGE ENVISAGED\n\xa0\nTravel Validity – 01 Oct 2026 – 25 MAR 2027\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\n4-5 PAX\n\n\n6-7 PAX\n\n\n8-9 PAX\n\n\n10 