 Cup Cake)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013924_0_20261001181452', 'price': 68540, 'packageSummary': "The 'Phuket And Krabi - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' package is a 5-day getaway covering the beautiful tropical destinations of Krabi and Phuket. This special package features an incredible Buy One Get One Free offer for two adults, allowing a companion to travel completely free when one adult pays. Along with exploring these scenic coastal cities, travelers will enjoy exclusive hotel-specific perks such as complimentary welcome drinks at both the Days Inn by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi and the Ramada by Wyndham Ao Nang Krabi, as well as delicious complimentary welcome cupcakes at the Best Western Patong Phuket.", 'images': ['75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '91271_Railay_beach_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', '8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', '43654_Karon_View_Point_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', '161992_Promthep_Cape_View_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 68540, 'thumbnailImage': 'PhuketKrabi26790.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Couple Special', 'Durga Puja Special', 'Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013924 is named 'Phuket And Krabi - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Krabi, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Phuket - Krabi Welcome to Thailand! Upon arrival at the airport, pick up from airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at hotel (standard time approx 1400 hrs). Later on we proceed to Krabi. Krabi, famous for its scenic view and breathtaking Beaches and Islands. Its coral reef vistas are also one of the world's most beautiful, which makes the City a great spot for coral diving., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Krabi, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit Krabi 4 Islands Tour by Speedboat with Lunch (Sic basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Take a most Popular trip with no exhaustion by Speedboat. Visit Secluded Phra Nang Beach , inaccessible by road, your free time for swimming ,sun bathing ,making ,exploring or relaxing .At an exotic tropical Tub island ,enjoy snorkeling and while extreme low tide you can have a pleasant walk along sandy linkage to neighboring islands. Having picnic lunch on Poda Island explore its stunning lowland Poda Island its Stunning lowland , Picturesque bamboo plantation and majestic limestone cliffs bordered by stretching long beautiful beach. Visit the landmark Chicken Island named After it's shape , unique limestone jutting out to the sea , enjoy snorkeling in warm , Inviting water among numerous coral lives. A lovely brief tour ,not FAR but FUN. (Entrance to National Park fee is not included), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Krabi – Phuket (PVT Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Later proceed to Phuket, the largest Island city of Thailand, Known as Thailand’s oldest city and one of Asia’s most popular honeymoon spots. With a stunning beach view, palm trees, and soothing ocean breezes, this is the perfect place to relax and unwind during the day., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Visit Phi Phi Island on Big Boat with lunch (SIC basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Phi-Phi Island is Thailand’s island superstar. It’s been in the movies. It’s the topic of conversation for travellers all over Thailand. For some, it’s the only reason to touchdown in Phuket. Even with all the hype, it doesn’t disappoint. Phi Phi’s beauty is a large chunk of the allure. The islands, when approached by boat, rise from the sea like a fortress. Sheer cliffs tower overhead and then give way to the beach-fronted jungle. Places to visit Phi-Phi Don + Phi-Phi Ley Ton Sai Bay Monkey Beach (Swimming) May-Oct (Low Season) After buffet lunch served in a restaurant on Phi Phi Don enjoy swimming or relaxing the depart Phi Phi Don, Stop at Koh Khai Nok and relaxing time for snorkeling swimming and return to Phuket. (Entrance to National Park 