eing and on such days. However no refund will be provided as such events are beyond our control Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Services of Tour Manager are not included in this package. Thomas Cook is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. Thomas Cook would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: *Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE Hotel specific freebies: Days Inn by Wyndham Ao nang Krabi (Complimentary Welcome Drink) Ramada by Wyndham Ao nang Krabi (Complimentary Welcome Drink) Best Western Patong Phuket (Complimentary Welcome 02 Cup Cake).", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cit