ny change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. Thomas Cook would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013924/PhuketKrabi26790.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013924/itinerary/75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013924/itinerary/91271_Railay_beach_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013924/itinerary/8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013924/itinerary/43654_Karon_View_Point_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013924/itinerary/161992_Promthep_Cape_View_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG009665', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG009665', 'availableMonths': ['june_2027', 'april_2027', 'july_2027', 'august_2027', 'november_2026', 'september_2027', 'may_2027', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Phuket - Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Phuket', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['*Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE Hotel specific freebies Best Western Phuket (Complimentary Welcome 02 Cup Cake)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG009665_0_20261005102254', 'price': 55696, 'packageSummary': "The 'Phuket - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' package is a 5-day tour covering the scenic destination of Phuket. The highlight of this package is a special Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer valid for two adults, where you pay for one traveler and your adult companion travels for free. In addition to exploring Phuket, participants will enjoy exclusive hotel-specific freebies, such as two complimentary welcome cupcakes during their stay at the Best Western Phuket.", 'images': ['85745_paradise_beach_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', '8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', '753_Chalong_temple_Phuket.jpg', '43654_Karon_View_Point_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', '161992_Promthep_Cape_View_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 55696, 'thumbnailImage': 'Phuket_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Couple Special', 'Family', 'Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG009665 is named 'Phuket - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Phuket, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Thailand – Phuket Arrive in Phuket, Phuket’s great advantage is that there's always something to do on and off the island whether it's raining or shining. From the sublime to the seemingly profane, the range of activities and places to visit is remarkable for a destination of this size., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast and Local Lunch, Description: Phuket: Phi Phi Island Tour with local lunch by Shared Big Boat on seat in coach basis Today post breakfast, get ready for an exciting day ahead. Phi Phi islands is famous from the movie ‘The Beach” (2000) starring Leonardo DiCaprio. Witness the stunning mountainous scenery surrounding paradise lagoon and coves. Get lost a little bit in a lush green patch of the tropical trees. Imagine yourself being cast-away there, wandering about some foreign paradise, eating bugs right off the tree, tripping your day in the water and creating lots of memories. Proceed for local lunch. Post this tour return to the hotel. Remaining time will be at leisure to enjoy on your own. **Phuket Phi Phi Island Tour excludes National Park fees (Approx. THB 400-450 per Adult; THB 200-250 per Child) which is on direct payment basis locally, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Phuket: Half Day City Tour (SIC basis) Today post breakfast. set out to learn more about Phuket as you proceed for the city tour. Start your tour with a drive to Phuket Town for the local sightseeing, especially to see the Sino-Portuguese architecture. Most of the people in Phuket built their houses by mixing the styles of Chinese and Portuguese architecture. Here you will get to see the beautiful and spectacular architecture of their houses. Later proceed to visit the Chalong Temple (Wat – Chalong), a very famous temple amongst the monks since olden times. These local people have their old life style and unique characteristic, which is different from people who live in town in Phuket., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Phuket : Day Free Post breakfast at hotel, rest of the day is free for you to explore the city on your own or relax at the hotel. You can avail one of the recommended optional tours., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Phuket: This morning after breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your onward flight home. Note: * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Final Itinerary will be handed over on the day of arrival. Phuket Extension Night: Travel Validity: 01 Apr 2026 – 26 Oct 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Sunshine Patong Phuket or Kata Sea Phuket or similar 47 Value Best Westen Patong Phuket or Similar 71 Travel Validity: 01 NOV 2026 - 26 MAR 2027 PHUKET EXTENSION NIGHT CATEGORY HOTELS PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Standard Sunshine Patong Phuket or Kata Sea Phuket or similar 50 Value Best Westen Patong Phuket or Similar 74 *Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE! All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 55696.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong or Similar in Phuket\n, \n04 Night's Hotel\xa0Movenpick Mytt or Similar in Phuket\n, \n4 Nights Hotel Best Western Patong or Similar in Phuket\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on Private basis Half day Phuket City tour on SIC Basis Phi Phi Island with Local Lunch by shared big boat - SIC basis (National Park Fee Excluded) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adult travelling together. All flight services. Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges Christmas & New Year - 14 Dec 2026 – 10 Jan 2027 Chinese New Year – 20 Jan 2027 – 31 Jan 2027 Songkran – 04th April – 15th April 2027 Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (mini bar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.. Product Terms and Conditions: All travelers entering Thailand (by air, land, or sea) will be required to complete the Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) process online before arriving. Register within 3 days before your arrival. Please click on the link given here for Thailand Digital Arrival Card (TDAC) registration: https://tdac.immigration.go.th CHILD POLICY Infant: 0-1.99 yrs Child No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs Child With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs A person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult. Terms and Conditions: The package price is valid until 27 March 2027. Rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together. Hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. Hotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels. Hotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking. If the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide alternate options for a similar category. The rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade Fair periods. Any applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly. Surcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking. Guests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking. All rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Wherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges. No refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services. All sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice. Rates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends. Any promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice. Once bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time. Organization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control. A refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for suc