fe of Maya Bay, relax and enjoy a tasty local lunch., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Phuket, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure After breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport for your return flight. CHILD POLICY Infant: 0-1.99 yrs Child No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs Child With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs A person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult. KRABI & PHUKET EXTENSION NIGHT Category Hotels Per Person in USD (Twin/Double) Premium Holiday Ao Nang Beach Resort Krabi or similar 65 Premium M Social Phuket or similar 70, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 46120.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n2N in\xa0Holiday Ao Nang Beach Resort Krabi or similar.\n2N in\xa0M Social Phuket or similar.\n, \n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Days Inn by Wyndham Aonang\xa0or Similar in Krabi\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Sunshine Patong / Kata Sea Phuket or Similar in Phuket\n, \n2 Nights Hotel Ramada By Wyndham Aonang\xa0or Similar in Krabi\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Best Westen Patong or Similar in\xa0Phuket\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\n02 Local Lunches\n. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Krabi 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Phuket Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on private basis 4 Island tour with Local Lunch by shared Speedboat - SIC basis (National Park fee excluded) Phi Phi Island with Local Lunch by shared Big Boat - SIC basis (National Park fee excluded) Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: VISAS : Visa on Arrival - free for Indians Nationals TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adult travelling together. All flight services. Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & 