ons, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015009/PhuketKrabi26790.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015009/itinerary/75464_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015009/itinerary/91271_Railay_beach_Krabi_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015009/itinerary/8097_Long_Tail_Boat_Phuket_Thailand753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015009/itinerary/43654_Karon_View_Point_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015009/itinerary/161992_Promthep_Cape_View_Phuket_Thailand_753.jpg']}, 'score': 3.5732946, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}]
