e', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Kashmir - Pahalgam Gulmarg Sonmarg Special' is a 7-day tour covering Sonamarg, Pahalgam, Srinagar, and Gulmarg. This package offers a variety of curated experiences, including daily breakfast, five complimentary dinners, a riverside lunch, a traditional Kashmiri dinner, and a lakeside Hi-Tea with Kashmiri Kahwa and vegetable pakoras. Key activities feature a scenic Shikara ride on Dal Lake with a photography session in traditional Kashmiri attire, alongside visits to Shalimar Bagh, Nishat Bagh, and ABC Valley with entry tickets included. Throughout the journey, travelers will enjoy private chauffeur-driven transfers and sightseeing, with travel insurance also provided for participants under the age of 69.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive in Srinagar\n\xa0\nWelcome onboard a wonderful tour to one of the most happening destinations - Kashmir! On arrival at the Srinagar Airport, you will be welcomed & received by our representative/driver.\n\xa0\nTransfer from the airport to the hotel and check in. You can relax for a while. Later in the evening, proceed for a visit.\n\xa0\nVisit Shalimar Bagh\nVisit Nishant Bagh\nEnjoy shikara ride in Dal lake.\n\xa0\n(Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)\nOvernight Srinagar at the Houseboat.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nNa', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nStandard - The Olive Hotel/ Hotel Sapphire or similar in Srinagar\nValue - Hotel Dewan BY Royal Naqash / Hotel Ramada or similar in Srinagar\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Srinagar /\xa0 Hotel Orchard Retreat & Spa or similar in Srinagar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar to Pahalgam (90 Kms / approx 03 hrs).\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed Pahalgam - Pahalgam is famous for its scenic beauty and is the jewel of the picturesque Liddar valley in the high Himalayas. It provides an ideal setting for hiking, trekking, and fishing. It is also the starting point of the annual pilgrimage to the holy cave of Amarnath.\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay at the hotel in Pahalgam', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nStandard - Royale Comfort/Himalayn Hill/River View or similar in Pahalgam\nValue - Hotel The Kudrat / Hotel Walnut Creek or similar in Pahalgam\nPremium- Hotel ITC Fortune or similar in Pahalgam'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nPahalgam\xa0\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for ABC Valley Tour.\n\xa0\nBetaab Valley (Known for its picturesque beauty, made famous by the Bollywood movie "Betaab")\n\xa0\nEnjoy leisure time, shopping at the local Pahalgam market – on your own.\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay at the hotel in Pahalgam\n\xa0\nNote: Day excursion to Betaab, and Chandanwari is conducted by local taxis (Tavera/Sumo/Eeco) operating on a fixed schedule set by the Pahalgam Taxi Union.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nStandard - Royale Comfort/Himalayn Hill/River View or similar in Pahalgam\nValue - Hotel The Kudrat / Hotel Walnut Creek or similar in Pahalgam\nPremium- Hotel ITC Fortune or similar in Pahalgam'}, {'day': 4, 'description': 'Pahalgam to Gulmarg (139 kms / 4 hours)\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Gulmarg - "Meadow of Flowers",\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive Gulmarg Enjoy Asia\'s Highest Cable Car Project Gulmarg Gondola - The Gondola offers all tourists, scenic views of\xa0 Pir Panjal Mountains and Valley as you head towards Phase 1: KHILANMARG. You may enjoy an Sledge ride or Snow Mobile ride on the snow covered slopes (on direct payment basis)\xa0\n\xa0\nDinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.\xa0\n\xa0\nNote: - In case of heavy snow fall and Gulmarg is not operational, we will take clients to Yusmarg.\n\xa0\nImportant Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking\n\xa0\nGulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\n\xa0\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri.\n\xa0\nGondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging.\n\xa0\nGuests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nStandard - Hotel Zahgeer or smilar in Gulmarg\nValue - Hotel Pine Spring / Hotel Rosewood or smilar in Gulmarg\nPremium - Hotel Hilltop / Hotel The Vintage or smilar in Gulmarg'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nGulmarg to Sonmarg (125 Kms / approx 04 hrs).\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for\xa0 Sonmarg - Golden Meadow.\xa0Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. \n\xa0\nSonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy riding on a pony up to Thajiwas Glacier (on direct payment basis & subject to Operation) or Sledge Riding on snow (on direct payment). \n\xa0\nDinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg. ', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nStandard - Glacier Heights/ Hotel Divine Inn or similar in Sonmarg\nValue - Hotel Village walk or similar in Sonmarg\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Sonmarg'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nSonmarg to Srinagar (80 Kms / approx 02 hrs).\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Srinagar - Evening is free for shopping. \n\xa0\nDinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar. ', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nStandard - The Olive Hotel/ Hotel Sapphire or similar in Srinagar\nValue - Hotel Dewan BY Royal Naqash / Hotel Ramada or similar in Srinagar\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Srinagar /\xa0 Hotel Orchard Retreat & Spa or similar in Srinagar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar - Fly Back Home\n\xa0\nDeparture from Srinagar:\n\xa0\nToday after breakfast, transfer to Srinagar airport to board the return flight with Happy Memories!!!\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Hotels in any Seasonal hill Station / weekend destination in Srinagar) follow dynamic pricing method – the price may vary from month to month, day to day, depending on the festivals, functions, events, long weekends, occasions and market demand. The above mentioned rates are for your reference – however, the same may change at the time of booking. Request you to re-check the availability and the prevailing rates at the time of actual booking. ', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Na'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'IN', 'countryName': 'India', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 30700.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 41400.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}, {'category'