eraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Simply Bali Split Stay - 4N Hotel and 2N Villa' package is a 7-day tour covering the tropical paradise of Bali. This relaxing itinerary features a split stay consisting of four nights in a hotel and two nights in a villa, allowing travelers to experience different styles of island accommodation. As a key highlight of the trip, participants will enjoy a complimentary floating breakfast in their villa, along with ample time to experience the island's vibrant culture, stunning beaches, and scenic landscapes.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive at Bali (PVT basis)\nWelcome to Bali – Arrival at the Ngurah Rai, Bali International Airport, meet & greet by our local guide who led you to the parking area to board on vehicle for your transfer to your hotel. It takes about 20 minutes’ drive from airport to your hotel or more depending on the traffic.\nUpon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso (Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nFull Day Kintamani Hot Spring & Ubud village Tour –With Tanah Lot Sunset Tour (PVT Basis)\nPick up for Celuk Silver Art Village\nCeluk Village is a traditional village which famous for the incredible gold and silver handicrafts are available around this area for very low prices. As you enter the neighborhood, you're going to feel as if you were in a jewelry exhibition. On either side of the road are established many art shops showcasing their finest works inside a glass display case. We will visit one of the best gold and silver art works in celuk village. You can take a closer look at them to appreciate it and buy some if you really like it or you can made custom jewelry based on your design.\nVisit Mas Wooden Carved Art Village\nMas Village is one of traditional villages in Bali fundamentally as an artistic countryside by focusing the art of wood carving. This village is famous in the island as Bali Wood Carving Center located in Ubud sub district and Gianyar Regency. It owns the typical style of wood carving art by placing forward the distinguish synergy of the humanism and naturalism\nVisit Kintamani Hot Spring\nKintamani Hot Spring features eight natural hot spring pools and one warm olympic sized pool. Heated deep within the earth, minerals from the colorless and odorless hot spring brings healing and curative powers. Enjoy a relaxing dip with the majestic panorama!\n*Inclusions: Natural Hot Spring Pools, Toya Water Slide with Tubes, Towel & Locker, Change & Shower Room, Facility\nContinue to visit Tanah Lot for Sunset Tour\nTanah Lot Temple is one of the most popular Bali Places of Interest and its an ancient Hindu shrine perched on top of an outcrop amidst constantly crashing waves the temple is simply among Bali not to be missed icons. The onshore site is dotted with smaller shrines alongside visitor’s leisure facilities that comprise restaurants, shops and cultural park presenting regular dance performances. The temple is located in the Beraban village of the Tabanan regency, an approximate 20 Km northwest of Kuta and is included on most of the Bali western and central regions.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso (Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nWater Sports at Tanjung Benoa Beach (PVT Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.   Salty Air! Sandy Hair! Feel the tropical breeze and get closer to Indian Ocean with our selected Water Sports Activity. Pick up for Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa Beach (Incl. 1 x Jet Ski – Banana Boat Ride) and Complimentary 1 x Parasailing or Flying Fish\n\xa0\nNote:- Children below 10 years of age are not permitted to participate in water sports, rafting, swing, spa, or ATV activities. For this age group, only entrance tickets are included; participation in activities is not applicable.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso (Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Leisure\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nToday Day is at leisure to explore Bali or shopping at the local market.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso (Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or Similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nKuta – Villa (PVT Basis)   Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel.  Pick up for Inter Hotel Transfers to Villa', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak or Similar in Seminyak'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Leisure\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nToday Day is at leisure to explore Bali or shopping at the local market.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak or Similar\xa0in Seminyak'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart from Kuta\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subject to change without prior notice.\xa0\n\xa0\nExtension Nights :\xa0Travel Validity: 01 Oct 2026 – 24 Mar 2027\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY \n\n\nHOTELS\n\n\nPACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nSINGLE\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\n\n\nTRIPLE\n\n\nCHILD WITH BED\n\n\nCHILD NO BED\n\n\n\n\nSTANDARD\n\n\nThe Legian Paradiso or similar \n\n\nUSD 50\n\n\nUSD 45\n\n\nUSD 45\n\n\nUSD 20\n\n\nUSD 20\n\n\n\n\nVALUE\n\n\nSwiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak Or Similar\n\n\nUSD 86\n\n\nUSD 75\n\n\nUSD 75\n\n\nUSD 30\n\n\nUSD 30\n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM\n\n\nBintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar\n\n\nUSD 135\n\n\nUSD 120\n\n\nUSD 120\n\n\nUSD 50\n\n\nUSD 50\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\nHOTELS\n\n\nPACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nSINGLE\n\n\nTWIN /DOUBLE\n\n\nTRIPLE\n\n\nCHILDWITH BED\n\n\nCHILDNO BED\n\n\n\n\nVilla\n\n\nGrand Kesambi Villas Seminyak or similar\n\n\nUSD 135\n\n\nUSD 70\n\n\nUSD 70\n\n\nUSD 60\n\n\nUSD 60\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0The Legian Paradiso or similar in Kuta, Bali\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n', '\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Sense Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n', '\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0The Legian Paradiso or similar in Kuta, Bali\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n', '1': '\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Sense Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n', '2': '\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'ID', 'countryName': 'Indonesia', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 64800.0, 'hotels': ['\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0The Legian Paradiso or similar in Kuta, Bali\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 69300.0, 'hotels': ['\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Sense Swiss Belcourt Seminyak / Fairfield Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 78700.0, 'hotels': ['\n4 Nights Hotel\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Grand Kesambi Villas Seminyak\xa0or Similar in Villa\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\nFull Day Kintamani Hot Spring with Ubud Village Tour\nTanah Lot Sunset Tour\nHalf Day Water Sports (1 x Jet Ski & 1xBanana Boat) at Tanjung Benoa\nComplimentary 01 Floating Breakfast on the 2nd day of stay at the villa\nComplimentary 1xParasailing during the water sports activities.\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'in