ookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTC is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TC would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 1, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/bali5.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali_Scenic_7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Tanah_Lot_Temple_New_Bali_&53.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/BALI_BananaBoat.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Batur.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali9.jpg']}, 'score': 16.236786, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014042', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014042', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Bali Split Stay - Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Seminyak', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seminyak', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seminyak', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['*Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE!'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014042_0_20261001143918', 'price': 37714, 'packageSummary': "The 'Bali Split Stay - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' package is a 6-day tour covering the vibrant coastal town of Seminyak and the cultural heart of Ubud. This unique itinerary offers travelers a split-stay experience to enjoy the best of Bali's beaches and lush landscapes. The major highlight of this package is the exclusive Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer valid for two adults, allowing you to pay for one traveler while your adult companion travels completely free.", 'images': ['Seminyak753.jpg', 'TanahLotTemple75345.jpg', 'Bali_Scenic_7531.jpg', 'Ubud.jpg', 'Bali_Sunset_753.jpg', 'bali_shutterstock_224711452.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 37714, 'thumbnailImage': 'BaliWaterSport267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Couple Special', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014042 is named 'Bali Split Stay - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Seminyak, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive at Bali (PVT basis) Welcome to Bali – Arrival at the Ngurah Rai, Bali International Airport, meet & greet by our local guide who led you to the parking area to board on vehicle for your transfer to your hotel. It takes about 20 minutes’ drive from airport to your hotel or more depending on the traffic. Upon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Seminyak, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat followed by Half Day Sunset Tanah Lot Temple on private basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel An ideal Bali holiday is incomplete without water sports & what better than the famous Tanjung Benoa beach. This beach, best known for its aquatic adventure, is located in the Benoa peninsula far away from the hustle & bustle. Please check with our representatives for all the water sports information. Many shacks & restaurants lined up along the beach make sure that your tummy is full & you enjoy yourself the most. Watch the sunset from one of the top spots on Bali during this tour to Tanah Lot Temple, which boasts a location right on the island’s rocky coast. Note:- Children below 10 years of age are not permitted to participate in water sports, rafting, swing, spa, or ATV activities. For this age group, only entrance tickets are included; participation in activities is not applicable., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Seminyak, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day free for Leisure Morning Breakfast at the Hotel. Rest Day Free for Leisure to explore the Bali., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Seminyak – Ubud Full Day Kintamani Hot Spring & Ubud Market (PVT Basis) A visit to Kintamani Volcano is a rare opportunity to experience one of Bali’s last remaining active volcanos up close. This is one of the most popular and best day trip in Bali. Later visit to the Ubud market, which was originally a traditional market, has slowly become an art market that sells various kinds of artistic goods for tourists., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day free for Leisure Morning Breakfast at the Hotel. Rest Day Free for Leisure to explore the Bali., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Ubud, Meals: Brea