 Kuta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Full Day Ubud & Kintamani Tour on Private Basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Proceed for a scenic full-day tour covering the cultural and natural highlights of Bali including: Visit to Celuk Village, famous for traditional silver and gold craftsmanship Experience authentic Balinese Coffee Plantation with local coffee tasting Enjoy panoramic views of Mount Batur and Kintamani Highlands Explore the artistic and cultural charm of Ubud region Overnight stay at Kuta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Leisure & Shopping Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Free day for shopping and exploring local markets, cafes, and beach areas. Overnight stay at Kuta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Bali, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free for Leisure Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Free day for leisure or opt from any optional activities. Overnight stay at Kuta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight. * The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. EXTENSION NIGHTS Travel Validity: 01 - 24 JUN 2026 & 01 SEP - 15 DEC 2026 & 10 JAN - 24 MAR 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST:PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Value Grand Mega Resort / Harris Riverview Kuta or similar 14 Travel Validity: 01 July 2026 - 24 August 2026 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST:PER PERSON IN USD TWIN / DOUBLE Value Grand Mega Resort / Harris Riverview Kuta or similar 25, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 23669.0. Hotels envisaged include: Travel Validity: 10 JAN – 25 MAR 2026\n\n3 Night's Hotel\xa0Swissbell Inn\xa0Or Similar in\xa0Seminyak, Bali\n2 Night's Hotel\xa0Bali Spirit\xa0Ubud\xa0Or Similar in\xa0Ubud, Bali\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 APR – 25 JUN 2026,\xa001 JULY – 25