 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Magical Vietnam With Ho Chi Minh And Bali (Winter)' package is a 12-day tour covering Da Nang, Bali, Ho Chi Minh City, Hanoi, and Ha Long Bay. This comprehensive, air-inclusive tour with tour manager assistance features 4-star accommodations and a rich itinerary of activities, including thrilling water sports, the Bali Swing, and visits to Tanah Lot and Uluwatu Temple in Bali. In Vietnam, participants will experience a cyclo ride through Hanoi's Old Quarter, an overnight cruise on Ha Long Bay with Tai Chi and kayaking, a basket boat ride at Cam Thanh Village, and a lantern-releasing boat ride in Hoi An. The adventure also includes a cable car ride to Ba Na Hills to see the Golden Bridge, a guided tour of Ho Chi Minh City featuring the Cu Chi Tunnels and a local water bus ride, and a scenic excursion to the Mekong Delta.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrival in Bali - Check In\nWelcome to Bali, Indonesia, one of the most famous destinations in the world for holidays and packages. Upon arrival at the Denpasar airport, you will be met by our representative/ Tour Manager who will assist you for your transfer to the hotel.\nOn arrival in Bali, you will be greeted by your friendly Tour Manager / local representative outside the baggage hall area at the airport. Transfer to the hotel & check-in. (Standard Check in time after 1500Hrs). Rest of the day is at leisure.\n\xa0\nNote:\n\nAll our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card\nJoining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nExperience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunset Tour\nPost breakfast, proceed for an exciting swing, the most famous Bali Swing.\nLater arrive at Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset – An ancient Hindu shrine.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Leisure Or Optional Tour of Nusa Penida\nThis morning after buffet breakfast, day is at leisure.\xa0\nSpend rest of the day exploring Bali on your own OR you can explore Nusa Penida Island\nOPTIONAL EXCURSION: Full Day Nusa Penida Tour inclusive of Angel Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Beach with Lunch (Set Menu) at USD 45 per person (Minimum 2 Pax Required)\nJoin Day Tour of Nusa Penida, where you’ll visit iconic spots like the stunning Broken Beach, the awe-inspiring Kelingking Secret Point, the natural pool of Angel's Billabong.\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nWater Sports At Tanjung Benoa – Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance\nAfter breakfast, proceed to the Tanjung Benoa near Nusa Dua Bali. Here you will enjoy the water sport activities included in your tour like - Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski.\n(**Parasailing subjected to weather conditions)\nLater proceed for Uluwatu Temple Tour; located at 70-meter-high cliff. Later this evening enjoy the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFly to Hanoi – Day at Leisure\nThis morning after breakfast proceed to Denpasar airport for the flight to Hanoi. Later we proceed to the hotel and check in. (Standard check in time 1500 hrs).\nRest of the day at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\nHotel Sen Grand / Army / Grand View or similar in Hanoi'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0Hanoi – Ha Long Bay – Overnight on Cruise - Visit Pearl Farm Enroute Ha Long Bay\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to Ha Long. Enroute visit Pearl Farm. Upon arrival in Ha Long, check in at the overnight cruise. As we sail on the Ha Long bay we visit Surprise Caves & Ti Top Island - enjoy free time at the beach or walk up the hill to enjoy a view of Ha Long Bay.\nLater enjoy sunset view from sundeck.\nOR\nHanoi – Lan Ha Bay – Overnight on Cruise\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to Lan Ha Bay. Upon Arrival in Lan Ha Bay, check in at the Overnight Cruise.\xa0 As we sail on the Lan Ha Bay, we visit Dark & Bright Cave (Hang Sang & Toi) - Enjoy free time at the beach or enjoy a view of Lan Ha Bay.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Local Lunch and Local Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nSail on Ha Long Bay – Drive to Hanoi - Guided City Tour of Hanoi - Enjoy Cyclo Tour\nThis morning after breakfast, we visit Luon Cave by boat - enjoy kayaking or wooden boat ride through the cave. Enjoy brunch on board the Cruise\nReturn to Halong Wharf and transfer back to Hanoi.\n(Note: The cruise itinerary can be changed according to weather conditions.)\nUpon arrival, we proceed on the city tour - See Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum from outside. Visit One Pillar Pagoda followed by a cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi. Later enjoy photostop at Hoan Kiem Lake.\nOR\nSail On Lan Ha Bay – Drive to Hanoi - Guided City Tour of Hanoi - Enjoy Cyclo Tour\nThis Morning After Breakfast, Enjoy sunrise photograph and brunch on board the cruise\nReturn to Tuan Chau Harbor and transfer back to Hanoi.\n(Note: The cruise itinerary can be changed according to the cruise / weather conditions.)\nUpon arrival, we proceed on the city tour - See Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum from outside. Visit One Pillar Pagoda followed by a cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi. Later enjoy photostop at Hoan Kiem Lake.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Brunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Sen Grand / Army / Grand View or similar in Hanoi'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFly to Da Nang - Visit Cam Thanh Village – Enjoy Basket Boat Ride at Cam Thanh Village - Visit Hoi An Ancient Town - Experience Boat Ride with Lantern Releasing\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to the airport for our flight to Da Nang.\nUpon arrival, transfer from the airport to the hotel for check in. (Standard check in time 1500 hrs).\nLater visit Cam Thanh Village. Enjoy a basket boat ride through the coconut jungle forest. Visit Hoi An ancient town - see the tile-roofed Japanese Bridge, Chinese Assembly halls and ancient houses followed by a boat ride with lantern releasing on the river.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay Excursion to Ba Na Hills - Visit Golden Bridge - Photo Stop at Dragon Bridge\nThis morning after breakfast, we proceed to Ba Na hills. On arrival take a Cable Car to Ba Na hills station. Visit Golden Bridge followed by visit the Old Villas, French Stable, and Tinh Tam Garden. See the Linh Ung Pagoda. Visit Loc Uyen Garden and Quan Am Pavilion. Our next stop will be the Fantasy Park, an amusement park.\nLater this evening proceed for a photo stop at Dragon Bridge.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, International Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFly to Ho Chi Minh – Visit Cu Chi Tunnels - Ride on Water Bus\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to the airport for our flight to Ho Chi Minh City.\xa0\nLater visit Cu Chi tunnels – the network of over 200 km tunnels which became legendary when they played a vital role in the War. Later proceed a local water bus ride.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City'}, {'day': 11, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Mekong Delta, Free time at Ben Thanh Market\nThis morning after breakfast, we visit My Tho Village - the homeland of coconut and Unicorn Island. On the way we visit Vinh Trang pagoda, one of the biggest pagodas in the region.\nEnjoy Coconut Water during Boat Ride. Later we visit Ben Thanh Market.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City'}, {'day': 12, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nGuided City Tour of Ho Chi Minh - Visit War Remnants Museum - End of Tour - Fly Back\nThis morning after breakfast, check out and proceed on a guided city tour of Ho Chi Minh - Saigon Central Post Office and Reunification Palace see from outside. Visit War Remnants Museum.\nLater proceed to the Airport. Return home with wonderful memories of your tour.\nNote: Joining Direct / NRI Passengers requested to book flights after 5pm as we need to cover sightseeing on this day. In case of early flight, the sightseeing on this day will be missed.\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Final Itinerary will be handed over on the day of arrival.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n', '\n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': '\n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n', '2': '\n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'VN', 'countryName': 'Vietnam', 'continentName': 'Asia'}, {'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'ID', 'countryName': 'Indonesia', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 228200.0, 'hotels': ['\n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily buffet / packed breakfast (Except Day 1)\n04 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Lunches\n01 International buffet Lunch\n10 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners\xa0\n1 Lunch, 1 Dinner and 1 Brunch onboard Cruise\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch/ IL/D - International Lunch/Dinner / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)\n**Depending on Flight timings Packed Meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) will be provided instead of Sitting Meals at Indian / Local Restaurant.\n\xa0\n**Lunches are not included in Bali Portion', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary', '\nVietnam E-visa included in the package.\nIndonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival)\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\nAll foreign nationals and overseas Vietnamese entering with a visa must complete the digital arrival card prior to immigration clearance.\nTravelers can fill out the form by scanning a QR code upon arrival at international airports or, preferably, by completing it in advance online at https://prearrival.immigration.gov.vn/ to save time.\n'], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', '\nAll transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Bali\n\nExperience Bali Swing\nVisit Tanah Lot Floating Temple For Sunset\nEnjoy Water Sports At Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject To Weather Conditions)\xa0\nVisit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance\n\nHanoi\n\nGuided City Tour Of Hanoi\xa0\nPhoto Stop At Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum\nPhoto Stop At One Pillar Pagoda\nExperience Cyclo Tour Ride\nVisit Hoan Kiem Lake\n\n\xa0\nHalong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n\nOvernight Stay On Ha Long Bay / Lan Ha Bay\nOn Cruise Activities Tai Chi Training, Cooking Classes, Kayaking (Subject To Availability, Cruise Type & Weather Conditions)\n\nDa Nang\n\nVisit Cam Thanh Coconut Village\nEnjoy Basket Boat Ride At Cam Thanh Village\nVisit Hoi An Ancient Town\nEnjoy Boat Ride With Lantern Releasing\nDay Excursion To Bana Hills By Cable Car\nVisit Golden Bridge\nVisit French Gardens\nVisit French Quarters\nVisit St. Denis Church\nVisit Indoor Fantasy Park (Wax Museum Not Included)\nPhoto Stop At Dragon Bridge\n\nHo Chi Minh\n\nGuided City Tour Of Ho Chi Minh\xa0\nPhoto Stop Saigon Central Post Office\nVisit War Remnants Museum\nPhoto Stop At Reunification Palace\nVisit Cu Chi Tunnels\nEnjoy Water Bus Ride (A Local Transport Ride)\nVisit Mekong Delta\n', 'Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '<p>Provision of a Tour Manager is subject to the final operating group size. An accompanying Tour Manager will be provided for groups of 15 or more confirmed passengers. For groups with fewer than 15 passengers, the tour will operate on a Seat in Coach (SIC) / Free independent Tour (FIT) basis, and a Virtual Tour Manager or local representative/assistance will be provided to assist remotely with coordination, guidance, daily briefings, reconfirmations, and on tour support. The Virtual Tour Manager does not accompany the group in person. The company reserves the right to operate the tour without a physical Tour Manager should the final group size be less than 15 passengers. Confirmation of Tour Manager arrangement will be communicated 10-15 days prior to the departure.</p>', 'flightDescription': '<ul>\n<li>Return economy class airfare as per the itinerary.</li>\n<li>Internal airfare for Bali &ndash; Hanoi, Hanoi-Da Nang, Da Nang &ndash; Ho Chi Minh is included for Joining Direct &amp; NRI passengers</li>\n</ul>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn economy class airfare as per the itinerary.\nInternal airfare for Bali – Hanoi, Hanoi- Da Nang, Da Nang – Ho Chi Minh is included for Joining Direct & NRI passengers\xa0\nAccommodation at the hotels specified above or similar.\nVietnam Visa & Airport taxes (Any further increase in the same must be borne by the guest).\nCost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 30 April 2026\nMedical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges.\nMeals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary\nAirport transfers from all airports.\nAll transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\nProfessional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative.\xa0\nIf groups size is less than 15 customers than the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis.\n\n\xa0\nVisa Requirements:\n\nVietnam E-visa included in the package.\nIndonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival)\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\nAll foreign nationals and overseas Vietnamese entering with a visa must complete the digital arrival card prior to immigration clearance.\nTravelers can fill out the form by scanning a QR code upon arrival at international airports or, preferably, by completing it in advance online at https://prearrival.immigration.gov.vn/ to save time.\n', 'exclusions': '\nCompulsory tips for tour guide and driver: USD 5 per person per day\nIndonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival)\nThe cost of deviation, if you want to deviate from the group departure dates will be at an additional cost.\nCity Tax or Tourism Tax\nVisa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable)\nCruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays)\nCost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure.\nCost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 2,50,000.\nApplicable Government Taxes and other service charges.\nThe cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same\nAny increase in the rate of exchange leading to increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure.\nThe tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure.\nThe tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.\nPorterage Facility\nAny other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package.\nAdditional Meals which is not specifically included in the above itinerary.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary.\nCost of Optional Excursions.\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'General Information:\nAll travelers while returning to India should submit a self-declaration form (mandatory) on the online Air Suvidha portal\xa0(www.newdelhiairport.in)\xa0before the scheduled travel, including the last 14 days of travel details. Each passenger shall also submit a declaration with respect to the authenticity of the report and will be liable for criminal prosecution if found otherwise.\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/Bali26789.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/Bali_Swing_Ubud_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/Tanah_Lot_Temple_New_Bali_&53.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/Nusa_Penida_New_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/KeckDanace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HoChiMinh753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HalongBayCruise753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/AdobeStock_296902787_One_Pillar_pagoda_in_Hanoi.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HoiAn753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/GoldenbridgeDanang753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/CuChiTunnels753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/MekongDelta753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HoChiMinhCity753.jpg']}, 'score': 8.488001, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014805', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014805', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Ljubljana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ljubljana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zagreb', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zadar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zadar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Split', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014805_0_20261007161333.pdf', 'price': 186161, 'packageSummary': "The 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia' package is a 9-day tour covering Dubrovnik, Zadar, Split, Zagreb, and Ljubljana. The itinerary includes visits to the ancient city walls of Dubrovnik, the unique Sea Organ in Zadar, the historic Diocletian's Palace in Split, and the picturesque Ljubljana Castle. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours of historic old towns, scenic coastal drives along the Adriatic, and opportunities to explore charming local markets and cultural landmarks.", 'images': ['Ljubljana.jpg', 'Lake_Bled.jpg', 'Zagerb (1).jpg', 'ZADAR-c.jpg', 'croatia-Split.jpg', 'Diocletians.jpg', 'Dubrovnik-1.jpg', 'DUBROVNIK-para.jpg', 'Croatia-Dubrovnik.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 186161, 'thumbnailImage': 'Zagreb_SRP.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014805 is named 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Ljubljana, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Ljubljana Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Ljubljana airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis. Walking Tour of Ljubljana with Funicular Ride (Optional): Enjoy an evening walking tour of Ljubljana from Town Hall Square. Explore major sights and the historic center, then ride the funicular to Ljubljana Castle for stunning city views (castle entry not included). Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Ljubljana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ljubljana - Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama Ljubljana - Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama - Ljubljana: Visit Lake Bled, sail to Bled Island by traditional Pletna boat, and enjoy stunning views. Explore Bled Castle, then continue to Postojna Cave for a scenic train ride through its vast halls. End at Predjama Castle, dramatically set in a cliff. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Zagreb, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ljubljana - Zagreb | Zagreb Walking Tour Transfers: Today you will travel from Ljubljana to Zagreb by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagrebs highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatias vibrant capital. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Zadar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zagreb - Zadar | Enroute Plitvice National Park | Transfers: 1. This morning travel to Zadar, enroute visit Plitvice National Park. 2. Later continue your journey to Zadar Plitvice National Park: Plitvice National Park dazzles with waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Your ticket includes full access to trails and boardwalks, a panoramic train ride, shuttle buses between lakes, and an electric boat cruise on Kozjak Lake., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Zadar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Walking Tour Of Zadar Walking Tour of Zadar: Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadars Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only. 2. You can opt for a Romantic Sunset Cruise at a supplement cost, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Split, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zadar - Split | Walking Tour Of Split Transfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Split: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletians Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Split - Dubrovnik| Walking Tour Of Dubrovnik Transfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Towns history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Trip To Bosnia & Herzegovina Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottomanera mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most - one of the modern worlds most remarkable bridges. Special Note: 1. Guest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa. 2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 186161.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nSTANDARD\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLjubljana\n\n\nHotel\xa0Park\xa0Ljubljana,\xa0Ibis\xa0styles\xa0Ljubljana\xa0centre,\xa0Hotel\xa0Center\xa0Ljubljana\xa0or\xa0Similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Laguna,\xa0Hotel\xa0Central\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nA'mare\xa0Hotel\xa0Zadar,\xa0Hotel\xa0Mediteran,\xa0Hotel\xa0Sky\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel\xa0Jadrran,\xa0hotel\xa0AS\xa0Hotel\xa0Batuda\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nhotel\xa0Vis,\xa0Hotel\xa0Komodor,\xa0Hotel\xa0Dubrovnik\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nPREMIUM\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLjubljana\n\n\nGrand\xa0Plaza\xa0Hotel\xa0;\xa0InterContinental\xa0-\xa0Ljubljana,\xa0an\xa0IHG\xa0Hotel\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Sheraton,\xa0Hotel\xa0Esplanade\xa0Zagreb,\xa0Hotel\xa0Westin\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nMiramare\xa0Hotel,\xa0Teatro\xa0Verdi\xa0Boutique\xa0Hotel\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\n\xa0Radisson\xa0Blu\xa0Resort\xa0&\xa0Spa,\xa0Hotel\xa0Ambasador\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel\xa0President,\xa0hotel\xa0Sun\xa0Gardens,\xa0Hotel\xa0Hilton\xa0Imperial\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nVALUE\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLjubljana\n\n\nOccidental\xa0Ljubljana,\xa0Best\xa0Western\xa0Premier,\xa0Radisson\xa0Hotel\xa0Plaza\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0AS,\xa0Hotel\xa0Dubrovnik,\xa0Canopy\xa0by\xa0Hilton\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nFalkensteiner\xa0Club\xa0Funimation\xa0Borik,\xa0Hotel\xa0Kolovare\xa0or\xa0Similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel\xa0Fanat,\xa0Hotel\xa0Globo,\xa0Hotel\xa0Cora\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel\xa0Lero,\xa0Hotel\xa0Valamar\xa0Lacroma,\xa0Hotel\xa0Lapad\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights accommodation in Ljubljana based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Nights accommodation in Zagreb based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights accommodation in Zadar based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Nights accommodation in Split based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights accommodation in Dubrovnik based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Transfer from Ljubljana Airport to Ljubljana Hotel Private transfer from Zagreb Hotel to Zadar Hotel enroute visit Plitvice National Park Private Transfer from Dubrovnik Hotel to Dubrovnik Airport Bus Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Bus ticket from Ljubljana to Zagreb (Subject to availability until ticketed) Bus ticket from Zadar to Split (Subject to availability until ticketed) Bus Ticket from Split to Dubrovnik (Subject to availability until ticketed) Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Full Day tour to Lake Bled, Predjama Castle, and Postojna Cave - Small Group Tour Walking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group Walking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point Walking tour of Split in group Walking tour of Dubrovnik in group Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary INCLUSIONS head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Note: Prices are Starting from Rates (please recheck costs with exact dates) IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia' package is a 9-day tour covering Dubrovnik, Zadar, Split, Zagreb, and Ljubljana. The itinerary includes visits to the ancient city walls of Dubrovnik, the unique Sea Organ in Zadar, the historic Diocletian's Palace in Split, and the picturesque Ljubljana Castle. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours of historic old towns, scenic coastal drives along the Adriatic, and opportunities to explore charming local markets and cultural landmarks.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Ljubljana\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Ljubljana airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nWalking Tour of Ljubljana with Funicular Ride (Optional): Enjoy an evening walking tour of Ljubljana from Town Hall Square. Explore major sights and the historic center, then ride the funicular to Ljubljana Castle for stunning city views (castle entry not included).\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Park Ljubljana\xa0(Standard) // Occidental Ljubljana\xa0(Value) // Grand Plaza Hotel\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Ljubljana\xa0'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\nLjubljana -\xa0 Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama\xa0\nLjubljana - Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama - Ljubljana: Visit Lake Bled, sail to Bled Island by traditional Pletna boat, and enjoy stunning views. Explore Bled Castle, then continue to Postojna Cave for a scenic train ride through its vast halls. End at Predjama Castle, dramatically set in a cliff.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Park Ljubljana\xa0(Standard)//\xa0Occidental Ljubljana\xa0(Value)//\xa0Grand Plaza Hotel\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Ljubljana\xa0'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLjubljana - Zagreb | Zagreb Walking Tour\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Ljubljana to Zagreb by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagrebs highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatias vibrant capital.\nSpecial Note:\xa01. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard)//\xa0Hotel AS (Value)//Hotel Sheraton (Premuim) in Zagreb'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nZagreb - Zadar | Enroute Plitvice National Park |\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. This morning travel to Zadar, enroute visit Plitvice National Park.\n2. Later continue your journey to Zadar\n\xa0\nPlitvice National Park: Plitvice National Park dazzles with waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Your ticket includes full access to trails and boardwalks, a panoramic train ride, shuttle buses between lakes, and an electric boat cruise on Kozjak Lake.\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': "Hotel\xa0A'mare Zadar (Standard)//\xa0Falkensteiner Club Funimation Borik (Value)//Miramare Hotel (Premium)or similar in Zadar"}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nWalking Tour Of Zadar\xa0\xa0\nWalking Tour of Zadar:\xa0 Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadars Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n2. You can opt for a Romantic Sunset Cruise at a supplement cost\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': "Hotel\xa0A'mare Zadar (Standard)//\xa0Falkensteiner Club Funimation Borik (Value)//Miramare Hotel (Premium)or similar in Zadar"}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nZadar - Split | Walking Tour Of Split\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Split:\xa0 Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletians Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Jadrran (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Globo (Value)//\xa0Hotel Atrium (Premium)\xa0or similar in Split'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSplit - Dubrovnik| Walking Tour Of Dubrovnik\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Towns history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Lero (Value)//Hotel President (Premium) or\xa0similar in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nTrip To Bosnia & Herzegovina\xa0\xa0\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottomanera mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most - one of the modern worlds most remarkable bridges.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Guest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa.\n2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Lero (Value)//Hotel President (Premium) or\xa0similar in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ["\n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nSTANDARD\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLjubljana\n\n\nHotel\xa0Park\xa0Ljubljana,\xa0Ibis\xa0styles\xa0Ljubljana\xa0centre,\xa0Hotel\xa0Center\xa0Ljubljana\xa0or\xa0Similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Laguna,\xa0Hotel\xa0Central\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nA'mare\xa0Hotel\xa0Zadar,\xa0Hotel\xa0Mediteran,\xa0Hotel\xa0Sky\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel\xa0Jadrran,\xa0