rs (Pick Up and Drop Off) to Inter-city Bus Terminal\nInter-city travel by SCHEDULED Air-Conditioned shared coach service.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nFull Day tour to Lake Bled, Predjama Castle, and Postojna Cave - Small Group Tour\xa0\nWalking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group\nWalking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point\nWalking tour of Split in group\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\xa0\n', 'Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nFull Day tour to Lake Bled, Predjama Castle, and Postojna Cave - Small Group Tour\xa0\nWalking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group\nWalking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point\nWalking tour of Split in group\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\xa0\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights accommodation in Ljubljana based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Nights accommodation in Zagreb based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights accommodation in Zadar based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Nights accommodation in Split based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights accommodation in Dubrovnik based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nPrivate Transfer from Ljubljana Airport to Ljubljana Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Zagreb Hotel to Zadar Hotel enroute visit Plitvice National Park\nPrivate Transfer from Dubrovnik Hotel to Dubrovnik Airport\n\n\xa0\nBus Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nBus ticket from Ljubljana to Zagreb (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus ticket from Zadar to Split (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus Ticket from Split to Dubrovnik (Subject to availability until ticketed)\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nFull Day tour to Lake Bled, Predjama Castle, and Postojna Cave - Small Group Tour\xa0\nWalking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group\nWalking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point\nWalking tour of Split in group\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary INCLUSIONS head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Note: Prices are Starting from Rates (please recheck costs with exact dates)\n\xa0\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost.\n\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/Zagreb_SRP.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/Ljubljana.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/Lake_Bled.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/Zagerb_(1).jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/ZADAR-c.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/croatia-Split.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/Diocletians.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/Dubrovnik-1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/DUBROVNIK-para.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014805/itinerary/Croatia-Dubrovnik.jpg']}, 'score': 7.7708406, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014763', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014763', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Pure Croatia', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Zagreb', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zagreb', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zadar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Split', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Split', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014763_0_20260518115709.pdf', 'price': 169543, 'packageSummary': "The 'Pure Croatia' package is an 8-day tour covering the historic and scenic cities of Dubrovnik, Zadar, Zagreb, and Split. Throughout this captivating journey, participants will immerse themselves in Croatia's rich heritage and stunning coastal beauty through guided city tours of ancient Roman ruins, walks along medieval city walls, and visits to vibrant local markets. Travelers will also enjoy scenic coastal drives along the Adriatic Sea, explore historic cathedrals, and experience the unique blend of cultural charm and modern life that defines these iconic Croatian destinations.", 'images': ['Zagerb.jpg', 'ZAGRAB-CROATIA (1).jpg', 'Plitvice-Lakes-National-Park-1 (1).jpg', 'split.jpg', 'croatia-Split_2.jpg', 'dubrovnik_2.jpg', 'Elaphiti_Islands.jpg', 'Dubrovnik.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 169543, 'thumbnailImage': 'Split_SRP.png', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014763 is named 'Pure Croatia' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Zagreb, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Zagreb Transfers: Upon your arrival at Zagreb airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis. Walking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagreb’s highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatia’s vibrant capital. Special Note: Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Zagreb, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free At Leisure Optional Day Trip To Slovenia on SIC Basis: Enjoy a free day or take an optional trip to Slovenia. Visit the charming capital Ljubljana, then escape into nature at Lake Bled, famous for its scenic lake and hilltop castle—an unforgettable getaway from Zagreb. Special Note: You need to be in possession of a multiple entry Schengen visa to visit Slovenia. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Zadar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zagreb - Zadar | Enroute Plitvice National Park | Transfers: This morning travel to Zadar, enroute visit Plitvice National Park. Later continue your journey to Zadar Plitvice National Park: Plitvice National Park dazzles with waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Your ticket includes full access to trails and boardwalks, a panoramic train ride, shuttle buses between lakes, and an electric boat cruise on Kozjak Lake., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Split, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Walking Tour of Zadar | Zadar - Split Transfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Zadar: Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadar’s Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset. Special Note: Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Split, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Blue Lagoon 3 Island Tour | Walking Tour of Split Blue Lagoon – 3 Island Tour: Enjoy a relaxing Blue Lagoon 3 Island Tour, visiting UNESCO listed Trogir, the Blue Lagoon, and Šolta’s Stomorska village for swimming and exploring. You can also take a Blue Cave 5 Island Tour to Biševo, Vis, Pakleni, Hvar and Brac for stunning views and swims. Walking Tour of Split: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletian’s Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade. Special Note: You have an opportunity to upgrade your Blue Lagoon and Guided walking tour of Split to a full-day Blue Cave Tour at an additional cost. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Split – Dubrovnik | Walking Tour of Dubrovnik | Transfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Town’s history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below. Special Note: Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only. You can opt for a Sunset Dinner Cruise (Dalmatian Cuisine) at a supplement cost, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Trip To Bosnia & Herzegovina Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottoman era mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most—one of the modern world’s most remarkable bridges. Special Note: Guest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 169543.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nCity\n\nHotels\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Sheraton, Hotel Esplanade Zagreb, Hotel Westin or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nMiramare Hotel, Teatro Verdi Boutique Hotel, Hotel Bastion or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nCornaro Hotel, Radisson Blu Resort & Spa, Hotel Ambasador or Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel President, Hotel Sun Gardens, Hotel Hilton Imperial or Similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0\n\n\nHotels\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Canopy By Hilton, Hotel AS, Hotel Dubrovnik or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nFalkensteiner Club Funimation Borik, Hotel Kolovare, Almayer Art And Heritage Hotel or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel Fanat, Hotel Globo, Hotel Cora or Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel Lero, Hotel Valamar Lacroma, Hotel Lapad or Similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nHotels\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Laguna, Best Western Hotel Stella, Garden Hotel or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nA'mare Hotel Zadar, Hotel Mediteran, Hotel Delfin or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nArt Hotel Depadansa, Hotel AS, Hotel Jadran or Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel Vis, Hotel Komodor, Hotel Dubrovnik or Similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Zagreb based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Zadar based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Split based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Dubrovnik based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Transfer from Zagreb Airport to Zagreb Hotel Private transfer from Zagreb Hotel to Zadar Hotel enroute visit Plitvice National Park Private Transfer from Dubrovnik Hotel to Dubrovnik Airport Bus Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Bus ticket from Zadar to Split (Subject to availability until ticketed) Bus Ticket from Split to Dubrovnik (Subject to availability until ticketed) Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Walking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group Walking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point Blue Lagoon and 3 island group tour from Split Walking tour of Split in group Walking tour of Dubrovnik in group Dubrovnik Cable Car Roundtrip ticket Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for