{'day': 1, 'description': "\xa0\nArrive Zagreb\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Zagreb airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nWalking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagreb's highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatia's vibrant capital.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Laguna (Standard) // Canopy by Hilton (Value) // Hotel Sheraton (Premium)\xa0or similar in Zagreb'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0Day Free At Leisure\nOptional Day Trip to Slovenia on SIC Basis: Enjoy a free day or take an optional trip to Slovenia. Visit the charming capital Ljubljana, then escape into nature at Lake Bled, famous for its scenic lake and hilltop castle - an unforgettable getaway from Zagreb.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. You need to be in possession of a multiple entry Schengen visa to visit Slovenia.\n2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Laguna (Standard) // Canopy by Hilton (Value) // Hotel Sheraton (Premium)\xa0or similar in Zagreb'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0Zagreb - Plitvice | Visit Plitvice National Park\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Zagreb to Plitvice by bus on shared basis.\nVisit Plitvice National Park: Travel to Plitvice and check into your hotel. Explore Plitvice National Park, famous for its stunning waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Enjoy access to hiking trails, boardwalks, a panoramic train, shuttle buses, and a boat ride on Lake Kozjak.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Plitvice (Standard) // Ethno Houses Plitvice Lakes Hotel (Value) // Fenomen Plitvice Resort (Premium) or Similar in Plitvice'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0Plitvice - Zadar | Walking Tour Of Zadar\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Plitvice to Zadar by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Zadar:\xa0 Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadar's Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n2. You can opt for a Romantic Sunset Cruise at a supplement cost", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': "Hotel\xa0A'mare Zadar (Standard) //\xa0Falkensteiner Club Funimation Borik (Value) // Miramare Hotel (Premium)or similar in Zadar"}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0Zadar - Split | Walking Tour Of Split\xa0\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Split: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletian’s Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Jadrran (Standard) //\xa0Hotel Globo (Value) //\xa0Hotel Atrium (Premium)\xa0or similar in Split'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "Blue Lagoon - 3 Island Tour\xa0\xa0\nBlue Lagoon - 3 Island Tour:\xa0 Enjoy a relaxing Blue Lagoon 3 Island Tour, visiting UNESCO listed Trogir, the Blue Lagoon, and Solta's Stomorska village for swimming and exploring. You can also take a Blue Cave 5 Island Tour to Biševo, Vis, Pakleni, Hvar and Brac\xa0for stunning views and swims.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. You have an opportunity to upgrade your Blue Lagoon tour to a full day Blue Cave Tour at an additional cost.\n2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Jadrran (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Globo (Value)//\xa0Hotel Atrium (Premium)\xa0or similar in Split'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSplit - Dubrovnik| Walking Tour Of Dubrovnik\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Town’s history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard) //\xa0Hotel Lero (Value) //Hotel President (Premium) or\xa0similar in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 8, 'description': "\xa0Trip To Bosnia & Herzegovina\xa0\xa0\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottoman era mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most - one of the modern world's most remarkable bridges.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Guest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa.\n2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard) //\xa0Hotel Lero (Value) // Hotel President (Premium) or\xa0similar in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCity\xa0\n\n\nHotels\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Sheraton,\xa0Hotel\xa0Esplanade\xa0Zagreb,\xa0Hotel\xa0Westin\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nPlitvice\n\n\nFenomen\xa0Plitvice\xa0Resort\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nMiramare\xa0Hotel,\xa0Teatro\xa0Verdi\xa0Boutique\xa0Hotel\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nRadisson\xa0Blu\xa0Resort\xa0&\xa0Spa,\xa0Hotel\xa0Ambasador\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel\xa0President,\xa0hotel\xa0Sun\xa0Gardens,\xa0Hotel\xa0Hilton\xa0Imperial\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nVALUE\xa0\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0AS,\xa0Hotel\xa0Dubrovnik,\xa0Canopy\xa0by\xa0Hilton\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nPlitvice\n\n\nEthno\xa0Houses\xa0Plitvice\xa0Lakes\xa0Hotel,\xa0Lyra\xa0Hotel\xa0Plitvice\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nFalkensteiner\xa0Club\xa0Funimation\xa0Borik,\xa0Hotel\xa0Kolovare\xa0or\xa0Similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel\xa0Fanat,\xa0Hotel\xa0Globo,\xa0Hotel\xa0Cora\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel\xa0Lero,\xa0Hotel\xa0Valamar\xa0Lacroma,\xa0Hotel\xa0Lapad\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n', "\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nSTANDARD\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Laguna,\xa0Hotel\xa0Central\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nPlitvice\n\n\nHotel\xa0Plitvice,\xa0Hotel\xa0Jezero\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nA'mare\xa0Hotel\xa0Zadar,\xa0Hotel\xa0Mediteran,\xa0Hotel\xa0Sky\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel\xa0Jadrran,\xa0hotel\xa0AS\xa0Hotel\xa0Batuda\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel\xa0Vis,\xa0Hotel\xa0Komodor,\xa0Hotel\xa0Dubrovnik\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n"], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n\n\n\nCity\xa0\n\n\nHotels\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Sheraton,\xa0Hotel\