 group from a central meeting point\nEntrance to Plitvice National Park\nWalking tour of Split in group\nBlue Lagoon and 3 island group tour from Split\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group (Dubrovnik Cable Car Roundtrip ticket)\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights accommodation in Zagreb based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Plitvice based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Zadar based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights accommodation in Split based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights accommodation in Dubrovnik based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\nTransportation: (Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis)\n\nPrivate Transfer from Zagreb Airport to Zagreb Hotel\nPrivate Transfer from Dubrovnik Hotel to Dubrovnik Airport\nBus Tickets: (Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed)\nBus ticket from Zagreb to Plitvice National park (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus Ticket from Plitvice to Zadar (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus ticket from Zadar to Split (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus Ticket from Split to Dubrovnik (Subject to availability until ticketed)\n\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nWalking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group\nWalking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point\nEntrance to Plitvice National Park\nWalking tour of Split in group\nBlue Lagoon and 3 island group tour from Split\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group (Dubrovnik Cable Car Roundtrip ticket)\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\n\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': "\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional\xa0excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary 'INCLUSIONS' head.\n\n\xa0", 'termsAndConditions': 'Note: Prices are Starting from Rates (please recheck costs with exact dates)\n\xa0\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost.\n\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nTravel Validity: 01 April 2025 – 31 October 2025\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/Zagreb_SRP.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Zagerb.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/ZAGRAB-CROATIA.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Plitvice-Lakes-National-Park-1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/ZADAR-c.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/croatia-Split.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Diocletians.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Dubrovnik_(1).jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/DUBROVNIK-para.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Croatia-Dubrovnik.jpg']}, 'score': 7.7708406, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015079', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015079', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Finnish Lapland', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Saariselka', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Igloo Stay', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012446_0_20240410184106.pdf', 'price': 360206, 'packageSummary': "The 'Finnish Lapland' package is a 5-day tour covering Rovaniemi and Saariselka, including a unique Igloo Stay. The itinerary includes visits to the famous Santa Claus Village, thrilling husky and reindeer safaris, and exciting excursions to witness the magical Northern Lights. Participants will enjoy guided Arctic wilderness tours, traditional Lappish dining, and the unforgettable experience of sleeping under the stars in a glass igloo.", 'images': ['Saariselka00.jpg', 'IGLOOSATY09887.jpg', 'Rovaniemi098.jpg', 'Rovaniemi.avif', 'Rovaniemi453.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 360206, 'thumbnailImage': 'Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015079 is named 'Finnish Lapland' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Saariselka, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Ivalo Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Ivalo Airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the Saariselka hotel in a private vehicle. Saariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour: Experience a magical Northern Lights chase in Lapland. Ride a reindeer sleigh through quiet, snowy forests as you search for the auroras. Enjoy the peaceful night safari and the beauty of the Arctic wilderness. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Igloo Stay, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Snowmobiling & Overnight In Glass Igloo Snowmobiling Experience: Ride a snowmobile through Lapland’s Forest trails and enjoy stunning winter scenery. Stop along the way to admire snowy landscapes while the expert guide provides safety tips and driving instructions for a safe, fun adventure. Overnight in Glass Igloo: Later you will be transferred to an amazing experience of sleeping in a glass igloo. Sleep under the stars in the accommodation of your dreams. Indulge in the cozy warmth while enjoying the sensational views of the glass igloos., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Rovaniemi, Meals: NA, Description: Saariselka To Rovaniemi By Car Transfers: You will be transferred from Saariselka to Rovaniemi by car on private basis. Rovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour: Enjoy a Northern Lights chase by minivan with an expert local guide. Travel away from city lights into Lapland’s wilderness in search of auroras, with convenient pickup and drop off from your accommodation., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Santa Village Visit Santa village: Enjoy a small group visit with Santa Claus! Meet Santa, share your wishes, and visit his Post Office where elves work year round. Send postcards, cross the Arctic Circle, and capture memorable photos and videos. Special Note: Husky Safari (Optional) @ EUR 210., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will be transferred from Rovaniemi hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 360206.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0, Overnight stay at the Hotels, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0. Meals include: \n1 dinner included at Northern Lights Village Saariselka Resort\n5 lunches included (days 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 of the program)\n, \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 1 Nights’ accommodation in Saariselka based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night’ accommodation in Igloo Stay based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Rovaniemi based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Dinner as a part of Igloo Stay Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis] Arrival Transfers from Ivalo Airport to the Saariselka Hotel Private transfer from Saariselka to Rovaniemi by car Departure transfers from Rovaniemi hotel to the Airport Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Saariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour Snowmobiling Experience Rovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour Visit Santa village Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Special Note: The itinerary and sightseeing may vary based on availability and seasonality Please note that should the Covid-19 pandemic necessitate further protocols as mandated by the Government and/or the individual properties in the future which results in an increase in our standard tour operator rates, then Thomas Cook India reserves the right to adjust the above quoted rates accordingly. This may lead to an increase in prices quoted. Certain Activities are subject to weather conditions and protocols. Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions: Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs , conventions , and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Allahabad', 'cityCode': 'IXD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Finnish Lapland' package is a 5-day tour covering Rovaniemi and Saariselka, including a unique Igloo Stay. The itinerary includes visits to the famous Santa Claus Village, thrilling husky and reindeer safaris, and exciting excursions to witness the magical Northern Lights. Participants will enjoy guided Arctic wilderness tours, traditional Lappish dining, and the unforgettable experience of sleeping under the stars in a glass igloo.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Ivalo\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Ivalo Airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the Saariselka hotel in a private vehicle.\nSaariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour: Experience a magical Northern Lights chase in Lapland. Ride a reindeer sleigh through quiet, snowy forests as you search for the auroras. Enjoy the peaceful night safari and the beauty of the Arctic wilderness.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Star Arctic or similar in Saariselka'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nSnowmobiling & Overnight In Glass Igloo\nSnowmobiling Experience: Ride a snowmobile through Lapland’s Forest trails and enjoy stunning winter scenery. Stop along the way to admire snowy landscapes while the expert guide provides safety tips and driving instructions for a safe, fun adventure.\nOvernight in Glass Igloo: Later you will be transferred to an amazing experience of sleeping in a glass igloo. Sleep under the stars in the accommodation of your dreams. Indulge in the cozy warmth while enjoying the sensational views of the glass igloos.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Kakslauttanen resort /small glass igloo or similar in Igloo Stay'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nSaariselka To Rovaniemi By Car\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Saariselka to Rovaniemi by car on private basis.\nRovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour: Enjoy a Northern Lights chase by minivan with an expert local guide. Travel away from city lights into Lapland’s wilderness in search of auroras, with convenient pickup and drop off from your accommodation.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic Pohjanhovi or similar in Rovaniemi'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Santa Village\nVisit Santa village: Enjoy a small group visit with Santa Claus! Meet Santa, share your wishes, and visit his Post Office where elves work year round. Send postcards, cross the Arctic Circle, and capture memorable photos and videos.\nSpecial Note: Husky Safari (Optional) @ EUR 210.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic Pohjanhovi or similar in Rovaniemi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Rovaniemi hotel to the Airport on private transfer.\xa0\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email\xa0 as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0'], 'hotels_list': {'2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '0': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '1': '\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 