a to Rovaniemi by car\nDeparture transfers from Rovaniemi hotel to the Airport\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nSaariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour\nSnowmobiling Experience\xa0\nRovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour\xa0\nVisit Santa village\xa0\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\n\xa0Special Note:\n\nThe itinerary and sightseeing may vary based on availability and seasonality\nPlease note that should the Covid-19 pandemic necessitate further protocols as mandated by the Government and/or the individual properties in the future which results in an increase in our standard tour operator rates, then Thomas Cook India reserves the right to adjust the above quoted rates accordingly. This may lead to an increase in prices quoted. Certain Activities are subject to weather conditions and protocols.\n\n\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc.