t to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015079/Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015079/itinerary/Saariselka00.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015079/itinerary/IGLOOSATY09887.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015079/itinerary/Rovaniemi098.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015079/itinerary/Rovaniemi.avif', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015079/itinerary/Rovaniemi453.jpg']}, 'score': 6.750083, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013788', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013788', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Explore Bali', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Nusa Penida', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Nusa Penida', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG009597_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 33861, 'packageSummary': "The 'Explore Bali' package is a 7-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Ubud, Kuta, and Nusa Penida. Throughout this tropical journey, travelers will enjoy key activities such as exploring the lush Tegallalang Rice Terraces and sacred monkey forests in Ubud, relaxing on the vibrant, sun-kissed beaches of Kuta, and taking a scenic boat ride to Nusa Penida to marvel at the iconic Kelingking Beach. The itinerary also features cultural temple visits, traditional Balinese dance performances, and opportunities to experience local markets and authentic cuisine.", 'images': ['Bali1.jpg', 'BannanaBoat.jpg', 'NusaPenida753.jpg', 'Nusa_Penida_753.jpg', 'Bali12.jpg', 'Bali7531.jpg', 'bali_shutterstock_521467954.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 33861, 'thumbnailImage': 'ExploreBali267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Durga Puja Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013788 is named 'Explore Bali' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kuta, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrival at the Ngurah Rai, Bali International Airport, meet & greet by our local guide who lead you to the parking area to board on vehicle for your transfer to your hotel. It takes about 20 minutes’ drive from airport to your hotel or more depending on the traffic. Upon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel An ideal Bali holiday is incomplete without water sports & what better than the famous Tanjung Benoa beach. This beach best known for its aquatic adventure is located in the Benoa peninsula far away from the hustle & bustle. Please check with our representatives for all the water sports information. Many shacks & restaurants lined up along the beach make sure that your tummy is full & you enjoy the most. Note:- Children below 10 years of age are not permitted to participate in water sports, rafting, swing, spa, or ATV activities. For this age group, only entrance tickets are included; participation in activities is not applicable., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Nusa Penida, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfer from Kuta to Nusa Penida. Full Day West Penida Tour with Local Lunch on Private Basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel A Full day tour to Nusa Penida West Island Tour will give you an experience you will never forget. This is a relatively undeveloped island southeast of the mainland of Bali. Nusa means Island and Penida means priests in Balinese. You won’t find the snazzy beach clubs, organic cafes or trendy restaurants here, but Nusa Penida is still worthy of a visit. It houses some of the most photogenic sights in Bali. In Nusa Penida West Island Tour, we visit 04 Points - Klingking bay, Angel billabong, Broken beach and Crystal Bay., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Nusa Penida, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Nusa Penida Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Day Free to explore the island., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfer from Nusa Penida to Ubud, Followed by Full Day Ubud Kintamani Tour & Sunset Tanah Lot Temple on Private Basis. Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Enroute visit to Kintamani Volcano is a rare opportunity to experience one of Bali’s last remaining active volcanos up close. This is one of the most popular and best day trip in Bali. The tour begins with the sights of a vibrant art village. Here you can meet with the people who keep the techniques of the regions handicrafts alive with a stop at Tohpati village, widely known as the centre of handmade Balinese Batik weaving. Next stop is Celuk village famous for producing high-grade gold and silver handicrafts. Continue trip to Mas Village, one of the many artists villages surrounding Ubud, is the best place on the island to find high-quality Balinese woodcarvings, considered some of the best woodcarvings in the world. Evening enjoy Tanah Lot Temple, locally known as Pura Tanah Lot is probably the most popular and photographed temple on the island, located on the coastal side of Beraban countryside, Kediri sub district and Tabanan Regency. Tanah Lot Temple stands for Earth (Tanah) and Sea (Lot), quite appropriate considering its spectacular setting on top of an impressive rock overlooking the Indian Ocean. This cultural icon is among the seven sea temples located in the coast of Bali and has been contained in Balinese mythology for centuries., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ubud Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Day Free to explore the island., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. EXTENSION NIGHT: PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD Travel Validity: 01 September'2026 – 24 September'2026 2026 / 01 Oct – 25 Mar 2027 Hotels SINGLE TWIN / DOUBLE TRIPLE CHILD WITH BED CHILD NO BED Free Upgrade to 4 Star Atanaya Resort Kuta or Similar NA 18 18 14 10 Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa NA 43 43 35 30 Arsa Santhi Nusa Penida or similar NA 26 26 20 10, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 33861.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n2 Nights\xa0Atanaya\xa0 Resort\xa0or Similar in Kuta\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in Nusa Penida\xa0\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa\xa0in Ubud\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, Daily Breakfast except on Day 01. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Kuta 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Nusa Penida 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Ubud Meet & Greet assistance at the Airport Return Airport & Inter Hotel Transfer on Private basis Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private Basis Full Day Kintamani Volcano Tour with Ubud Village on Private Basis Full Day Nusa Penida tour with Local Lunch on Private Basis Sunset Tanah Lot Temple on Private Basis Sunset Uluwatu Temple tour on private Basis Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Meals as mentioned in the itinerary. Travel Insurance (Valid Till the age of 60 yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person. Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Entrance fees Blackout Dates: Christmas & New year - 15th Dec'2026 to 10th Jan'2027 & 01 Mar 2027 – 11 Mar 2027 Nyepi Day Meals not mentioned in the itinerary. Any tips - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions. Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc.) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer.. Product Terms and Conditions: The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer. Terms and Conditions: The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same. Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TC is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TC would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCod