tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice.\nRates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends.\nAny promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice.\nOnce bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time.\nOrganization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control.\nA refundable security deposit is required at check in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at check out. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as mini bar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/Bali_New_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/itinerary/Kuta.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/itinerary/Bananaboat.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/itinerary/Baliswing_new_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/itinerary/Bali75309.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/itinerary/Gatetheaven7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015697/itinerary/Seminyak753.jpg']}, 'score': 4.546687, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG011485', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG011485', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Exotic Kashmir With Gulmarg Stay', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pahalgam', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pahalgam', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Gulmarg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Stay in Houseboat on Dal Lake Enjoy Shikara ride on Dal Lake till Char Chinar The Gondola Ride (Phase -1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG011485_0_20260922114141.pdf', 'price': 44300, 'packageSummary': "The 'Exotic Kashmir With Gulmarg Stay' package is a 7-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Pahalgam, Srinagar, and Gulmarg. The itinerary offers a memorable experience featuring a unique stay in a traditional houseboat on Dal Lake and a relaxing Shikara ride to Char Chinar. Additionally, travelers will get to enjoy the famous Phase-1 Gondola ride in Gulmarg, subject to ticket availability, ensuring a perfect blend of relaxation and adventure in the beautiful valley.", 'images': ['Dallake.jpg', 'AdobeStock_296897404.jpeg', 'AdobeStock_1062426595.jpeg', '7162146702_b896312393_h.jpg', 'gondola.jpg', '49943812578_6f76e97314_k.jpg', 'kashmir8.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 44300, 'thumbnailImage': 'AdobeStock_362192710.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Winter GIT', 'Summer GIT', 'Family', 'Domestic Diwali Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG011485 is named \'Exotic Kashmir With Gulmarg Stay\' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Srinagar, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrival in Srinagar Welcome to Srinagar and transfer to the houseboat. Check in to the houseboat and freshen up. Enjoy a romantic Shikara ride on the enchanting Char Chinar Dal lake (Kashmir\'s iconic jewel, a serene houseboat haven) Dinner and overnight stay in Srinagar at the houseboat Note: Room heating facilities in houseboats are available depending on weather conditions., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Pahalgam, Meals: Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner, Description: Srinagar to Pahalgam (90 Km / ~03 hours drive) Morning breakfast at the houseboat and check out. Srinagar sightseeing Shankaracharya Temple (Dedicated to Lord Shiva) Nishat Bagh (Mughal Gardens) Pari Mahal (Palace of Fairies) Drive to Pahalgam (A picturesque valley surrounded by snow-capped mountains, offering stunning natural beauty and adventure opportunities) En route visit Pampore for saffron demonstration and shopping Avantipur Ruins (ancient temple complex) Enjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute. Check in at the hotel and relax. Dinner and overnight stay in Pahalgam at the hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Pahalgam, Meals: Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner, Description: Pahalgam Morning breakfast at the hotel. Full Day city tour, visiting the below attractions Betaab Valley (Known for its picturesque beauty, made famous by the Bollywood movie "Betaab") Enjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute. Enjoy leisure time, shopping at the local Pahalgam market – on your own. Dinner and overnight stay at the hotel in Pahalgam Note: Day excursion to Betaab is conducted by local taxis (Tavera/Sumo/Eeco) operating on a fixed schedule set by the Pahalgam Taxi Union., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Gulmarg, Meals: Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner, Description: Pahalgam to Gulmarg (140Km / ~ 04 hours drive) Morning breakfast at the hotel and check out. Drive to Gulmarg (Meadow of flowers) En route visit, Martand Sun Temple (ancient ruins) Kashmiri Cricket Bat Factory (Witness the craftsmanship of world-renowned cricket bats made from Kashmir willow) Enjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute. Check in at the hotel and relax. Dinner and overnight stay in Gulmarg at the hotel. Note : In case of heavy rainfall/ Gulmarg is not operational due to any sort of Weather conditions, we will take clients to Doodhpathri. Gulmarg Gondola Ticket up to Phase 1 is part of the package and subject to availability as per the booking dates. Please be noted, that Gulmarg date can change since itinerary is subject to shuffling. In Gulmarg - The Tour Vehicle only provides drop to the Gulmarg hotel. For local movement guest has to either hire the pony or local vehicle on direct payment basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner, Description: Gulmarg to Srinagar (83 Km / ~ 02 hours drive) Morning breakfast at the hotel and check out. Experience the Gulmarg Gondola (Asia\'s highest cable car project) Enjoy panoramic views of the Pir Panjal Mountains and Valley. Experience sledge riding on snow – on direct payment basis Enjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute. Enroute visit Handloom Emporium on the way back to Srinagar. Drive to Srinagar Check in to the hotel and relax Dinner and overnight stay in Srinagar at the hotel. Important Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking Gulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest. Gondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging. Guests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner, Description: Srinagar – Sonmarg – Srinagar (83 Km / ~ 2 hours drive) Morning breakfast at the hotel. Drive to Sonmarg (Golden meadow) Enjoy riding on a pony up to Thajiwas Glacier- on direct payment basis Enjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute. Optional: Sledge or snowmobile ride – on direct payment basis Dinner and overnight stay in Srinagar at the hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Morning breakfast at the hotel and check out. Proceed to the airport for your onward journey, taking with you cherished memories of your Kashmir experience. Note: As this is a group tour, the airport transfer departs from the Srinagar hotel at 10:00 AM., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 44300.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: \nBreakfasts: 06; Lunches: 06; Dinners: 06\nBreakfast & Dinners will be Buffet\nLunches will be enroute in a restaurant/hotel or packed\nExtra Toppings: Snacks with coffee, tea, or a cold drink once during the day\n\n\xa0, Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Hotels: Twin sharing basis in the listed hotels or similar Meals: Breakfasts: 06; Lunches: 05; Dinners: 06 Breakfast & Dinners will be Buffet Lunches will be enroute in a restaurant/hotel or packed Extra Toppings: Snacks with coffee, tea, or a cold drink once during the day Additional Inclusions: Round-trip economy class airfare Water: 500 ml water per person per day Insurance Standard travel insurance coverage for the entire duration of the tour. For guests aged 70 and above, or those choosing to extend their stay, additional insurance fees may apply to accommodate these specific needs.. Exclusions: Airfare not included for joining direct passengers Additional / personal use of vehicle. Any personal expenses, room service & special orders, mineral water, alcoholic & non alcoholic beverages, porterage, tips, phone calls, laundry etc. Any extra excursions or sightseeing apart from the above specified itinerary. Camera fees Any incidental and other expenses which are not specified in the inclusions. GST will be applicable as per prevailing rates. Product Terms and Conditions: The tour price printed is dynamic & is purely on first come first serve basis. The person booking tour early is likely to get the lowest price as communicated / offered by the Company, subject to availability of seats It is mandatory to carry photo ID card (except Pan Card) while you are on tour. Valid ID for Kashmir: Driving License/ Voter ID/Passport/Aadhar Card The vehicle used for transfers is not at disposal. This is an indicative itinerary and subject to change depending upon circumstances. Please consult driver / local representative for next day’s sightseeing schedule / transfers timings. At Sonmarg, Gulmarg & Pahalgam the vehicles are allowed only up to the common parking lot. Thereafter one has to walk or hire ponies/ local vehicles for local conveyance on direct payment basis. Tour-program is subject to change depending upon circumstances Please note that only post paid mobile number works in Kashmir. Highlights of the package: Stay in Houseboat on Dal Lake Enjoy Shikara ride on Dal Lake till Char Chinar The Gondola Ride (Phase -1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability).', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'JKEKGL', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Exotic Kashmir With Gulmarg Stay' package is a 7-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Pahalgam, Srinagar, and Gulmarg. The itinerary offers a memorable experience featuring a unique stay in a traditional houseboat on Dal Lake and a relaxing Shikara ride to Char Chinar. Additionally, travelers will get to enjoy the famous Phase-1 Gondola ride in Gulmarg, subject to ticket availability, ensuring a perfect blend of relaxation and adventure in the beautiful valley.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': "\xa0\nArrival in Srinagar\n\xa0\nWelcome to Srinagar and transfer to the houseboat.\n\xa0\nCheck in to the houseboat and freshen up.\n\xa0\nEnjoy a romantic Shikara ride on the enchanting Char Chinar Dal lake (Kashmir's iconic jewel, a serene houseboat haven)\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay in Srinagar at the houseboat\xa0\n\xa0\nNote:\xa0Room heating facilities in houseboats are available depending on weather conditions.", 'mealDescription': 'Dinner\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nHotel -\xa0Khyber Group of Deluxe Houseboats or similar in Srinagar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar to Pahalgam (90 Km / ~03 hours drive)\n\xa0\nMorning breakfast at the houseboat and check out.\n\xa0\nSrinagar sightseeing\n\nShankaracharya Temple (Dedicated to Lord Shiva)\nNishat Bagh (Mughal Gardens)\nPari Mahal (Palace of Fairies)\n\n\xa0\nDrive to Pahalgam (A picturesque valley surrounded by snow-capped mountains, offering stunning natural beauty and adventure opportunities)\n\xa0\nEn route visit\n\nPampore for saffron demonstration and shopping\nAvantipur Ruins (ancient temple complex)\n\n\xa0\nEnjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute.\n\xa0\nCheck in at the hotel and relax.\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay in Pahalgam at the hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nHotel - White Water Resorts or similar in Pahalgam\xa0'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nPahalgam\n\xa0\nMorning breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nFull Day city tour, visiting the below attractions\n\nBetaab Valley (Known for its picturesque beauty, made famous by the Bollywood movie "Betaab")\n\n\xa0\nEnjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute.\n\xa0\nEnjoy leisure time, shopping at the local Pahalgam market – on your own.\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay at the hotel in Pahalgam\n\xa0\nNote:\xa0Day excursion to Betaab is conducted by local taxis (Tavera/Sumo/Eeco) operating on a fixed schedule set by the Pahalgam Taxi Union.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nHotel - White Water Resorts or similar in Pahalgam\xa0'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nPahalgam to Gulmarg (140Km / ~ 04 hours drive)\n\xa0\nMorning breakfast at the hotel and check out.\n\xa0\nDrive to Gulmarg (Meadow of flowers)\n\xa0\nEn route visit,\n\nMartand Sun Temple (ancient ruins)\nKashmiri Cricket Bat Factory (Witness the craftsmanship of world-renowned cricket bats made from Kashmir willow)\n\n\xa0\nEnjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute.\n\xa0\nCheck in at the hotel and relax.\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay in Gulmarg at the hotel.\n\xa0\nNote :\n\nIn case of heavy rainfall/ Gulmarg is not operational due to any sort of Weather conditions, we\xa0 will take clients to Doodhpathri.\nGulmarg Gondola Ticket up to Phase 1 is part of the package and subject to availability as per the booking dates. Please be noted, that Gulmarg date can change since itinerary is subject to shuffling.\nIn Gulmarg - The Tour Vehicle only provides drop to the Gulmarg hotel. For local movement guest has to either hire the pony or local vehicle on direct payment basis.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Royal Park or Similar in\xa0Gulmarg\xa0'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nGulmarg to Srinagar (83 Km / ~ 02 hours drive)\n\xa0\nMorning breakfast at the hotel and check out.\n\xa0\nExperience the Gulmarg Gondola (Asia's highest cable car project)\n\xa0\nEnjoy panoramic views of the Pir Panjal Mountains and Valley.\n\xa0\nExperience sledge riding on snow – on direct payment basis\n\xa0\nEnjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute.\n\xa0\nEnroute visit\n\xa0\n\nHandloom Emporium on the way back to Srinagar.\n\n\xa0\nDrive to Srinagar\n\xa0\nCheck in to the hotel and relax\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay in Srinagar at the hotel.\n\xa0\nImportant Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking\n\xa0\n\nGulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest.\nGondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging.\nGuests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri.\n", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Paisley Palace or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar – Sonmarg – Srinagar (83 Km / ~ 2 hours drive)\n\xa0\nMorning breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nDrive to Sonmarg (Golden meadow)\n\xa0\nEnjoy riding on a pony up to Thajiwas Glacier- on direct payment basis\n\xa0\nEnjoy lunch, tea/coffee & snacks enroute.\n\xa0\nOptional: Sledge or snowmobile ride – on direct payment basis\n\xa0\nDinner and overnight stay in Srinagar at the hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast , Lunch & Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Paisley Palace or similar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\n\xa0\nMorning breakfast at the hotel and check out.\n\xa0\nProceed to the airport for your onward journey, taking with you cherished memories of your Kashmir experience.\n\xa0\nNote:\xa0As this is a group tour, the airport transfer departs from the Srinagar hotel at 10:00 AM.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'IN', 'countryName': 'India', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 44300.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}], 'meals': ['\nBreakfasts: 06; Lunches: 06; Dinners: 06\nBreakfast & Dinners will be Buffet\nLunches will be enroute in a restaurant/hotel or packed\nExtra Toppings: Snacks with coffee, tea, or a cold drink once during the day\n\n\xa0', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nVehicles as per group size on Sharing basis (6 Pax in Innova; 10 in Tempo Traveller; Vehicle Type Cannot be confirmed at the time of Booking)\nVehicle is not at disposal – means it is for transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary.\nSeats Allotment in the Vehicle is on first come first serve basis at the venue, irrespective of the booking dates.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Srinagar\n\nShikara ride on the enchanting Char Chinar Dal lake\n\nNishat Bagh (Mughal Gardens)\nPari Mahal (Palace of Fairies)\n\nPahalgam\n\nPampore\nAvantipur Ruins\nBetaab Valley\nChandanwari\nMartand Sun Temple\nKashmiri Cricket Bat Factory\xa0\n\nGulmarg\n\nGondola\nHandloom Emporium\xa0\n\n\xa0', 'As per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': "<p>Rest assured, Thomas Cook's experienced &amp; knowledgeable tour manager will be with the group at every step of the journey. Be it transportation, accommodation &amp; everything in between, ensuring a seamless &amp; stress-free travel experience from start to finish. Whether it's a question or a challenge, our tour manager is always readily available to offer support, assistance &amp; ensure that your trip becomes a most cherished memory. (Presence of the Tour Manager is subject to a minimum of 25 customers, depending on package/destination booked)</p>", 'flightDescription': '', 'inclusions': 'Hotels:\n\nTwin sharing basis in the listed hotels or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nBreakfasts: 06; Lunches: 05; Dinners: 06\nBreakfast & Dinners will be Buffet\nLunches will be enroute in a restaurant/hotel or packed\nExtra Toppings: Snacks with coffee, tea, or a cold drink once during the day\n\nAdditional Inclusions:\n\nRound-trip economy class airfare\nWater: 500 ml water per person per day\n\nInsurance\n\nStandard travel insurance coverage for the entire duration of the tour.\nFor guests aged 70 and above, or those choosing to extend their stay, additional insurance fees may apply to accommodate these specific needs.\n', 'exclusions': '\nAirfare not included for joining direct passengers\nAdditional / personal use of vehicle.\nAny personal expenses, room service & special orders, mineral water, alcoholic & non alcoholic beverages, porterage, tips, phone calls, laundry etc.\nAny extra excursions or sightseeing apart from the above specified itinerary.\nCamera fees\nAny incidental and other expenses which are not specified in the inclusions.\nGST will be applicable as per prevailing rates\n\n\xa0', 'termsAndConditions': '\nThe tour price printed is dynamic & is purely on first come first serve basis. The person booking tour early is likely to get the lowest price as communicated / offered by the Company, subject to availability of seats\nIt is mandatory to carry photo ID card (except Pan Card) while you are on tour. Valid ID for Kashmir: Driving License/ Voter ID/Passport/Aadhar Card\nThe vehicle used for transfers is not at disposal.\nThis is an indicative itinerary and subject to change depending upon circumstances. Please consult driver / local representative for next day’s sightseeing schedule / transfers timings.\nAt Sonmarg, Gulmarg & Pahalgam the vehicles are allowed only up to the common parking lot. Thereafter one has to walk or hire ponies/ local vehicles for local conveyance on direct payment basis.\nTour-program is subject to change depending upon circumstances\nPlease note that only post paid mobile number works in Kashmir\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 1, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 0, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package does not include flights. You can book flights separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/AdobeStock_362192710.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/Dallake.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/AdobeStock_296897404.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/AdobeStock_1062426595.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/7162146702_b896312393_h.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/gondola.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/49943812578_6f76e97314_k.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011485/itinerary/kashmir8.jpg']}, 'score': 4.480349, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013454', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013454', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Kashmir Special With Pahalgam Stay', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Pahalgam', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Meal Daily Breakfast 03 Complimentary Dine Experience Or Activity Shikara ride on Dal Lake 01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire Entrance Or Entry tickets Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh All transfers and sightseeing Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle Travel Insurance Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013454_0_20260916152649.pdf', 'price': 21190, 'packageSummary': "The 'Kashmir Special With Pahalgam Stay' package is a 5-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Srinagar and Pahalgam. The itinerary includes a memorable Shikara ride on Dal Lake, a special photography session in traditional Kashmiri attire, and visits to the historic Shalimar Bagh and Nishat Bagh gardens with entry tickets provided. Participants will enjoy daily breakfast, three complimentary dining experiences, and seamless transfers and sightseeing in a private chauffeur-driven vehicle, with travel insurance also included for travelers under sixty-nine years of age.", 'images': ['Dal_Lake.jpg', '25344846040_64ef8bac76_o(1).jpg', '49943812578_6f76e97314_k.jpg', '7162484002_4696c449e0_h.jpg', 'Sunset_3.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 21190, 'thumbnailImage': '7162146702_b896312393_h.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG013454 is named \'Kashmir Special With Pahalgam Stay\' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Srinagar, Meals: Na, Description: Arrive in Srinagar Welcome onboard a wonderful tour to one of the most happening destinations - Kashmir! On arrival at the Srinagar Airport, you will be welcomed & received by our representative/driver. Transfer from the airport to the hotel and check in. You can relax for a while after arrival. Later in the evening, proceed for a visit. Visit Shalimar Bagh Visit Nishant Bagh Enjoy shikara ride in Dal lake. (Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.) Overnight Srinagar at the Houseboat., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Srinagar – Excursion to Gulmarg (90 kms / 3 ½ hours one way) After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for day excursion to Gulmarg - "Meadow of Flowers", Arrive Gulmarg Enjoy Asia\'s Highest Cable Car Project Gulmarg Gondola - The Gondola offers all tourists, scenic views of Pir Panjal Mountains and Valley as you head towards Phase 1: KHILANMARG. You may enjoy an Sledge ride or Snow Mobile ride on the snow covered slopes (on direct payment basis) Later proceed to Srinagar. En-route visit Handloom Emporium. Arrive into Srinagar and Check In Houseboat. Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar. Note: - In case of heavy snow fall and Gulmarg is not operational, we will take clients to Yusmarg. In Gulmarg - The vehicle only provides drop to the Gulmarg. For local movement guest has to either hire the pony or local vehicle on direct payment basis. Important Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking Gulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest. Gondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging. Guests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Day Excursion to Sonmarg (83 Kms / approx 02 hrs). After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for day excursion to Sonmarg - Golden Meadow. Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy riding on a pony up to Thajiwas Glacier (on direct payment basis & subject to Operation) or Sledge Riding on snow (on direct payment). Return back to Srinagar by evening. Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Pahalgam, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Srinagar to Pahalgam (90 Kms / approx 03 hrs). After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Pahalgam - Pahalgam is famous for its scenic beauty and is the jewel of the picturesque Liddar valley in the high Himalayas. It provides an ideal setting for hiking, trekking, and fishing. It is also the starting point of the annual pilgrimage to the holy cave of Amarnath. Enjoy Betaab valley - on direct payment basis & subject to Operation) Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Pahalgam to Srinagar - Fly Back Home Departure from Srinagar: Today after breakfast, transfer to Srinagar airport to board the return flight with Happy Memories!!! Special Note: Hotels in any Seasonal hill Station / weekend destination in Srinagar) follow dynamic pricing method – the price may vary from month to month, day to day, depending on the festivals, functions, events, long weekends, occasions and market demand. The above mentioned rates are for your reference – however, the same may change at the time of booking. 