nd Tour by Fast Boat will give you an experience you will never forget. Fast Boat transfer is on Sharing Basis. This is a relatively undeveloped island southeast of the mainland of Bali. Nusa means Island and Penida means priests in Balinese. You won’t find the snazzy beach clubs, organic cafes or trendy restaurants here, but Nusa Penida is still worthy of a visit. It houses some of the most photogenic sights in Bali. In Nusa Penida West Island Tour, we visit - Kelingking beach, Angela™s billabong, Broken beach and Crystal Bay.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Grand Mega Resort (Standard) /\xa0Cross Paasha Atelier\xa0(Value) /\xa0Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Seminyak (Bali)'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nDeparture\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight.\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\nEXTENSION NIGHT\nTravel Validity: 01 Oct'2026 – 24 Mar 2027\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY \n\n\nHOTELS\n\n\nPACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nSINGLE\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\n\n\nTRIPLE\n\n\nCHILD WITH BED\n\n\nCHILD NO BED\n\n\n\n\nStandard\n\n\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar \n\n\nNA\n\n\n25\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n15\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nDeluxe\n\n\nAlam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n55\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nCross Paasha Atelier or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n25\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nPremium\n\xa0\n\n\nFurama Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\n NA\n\n\n80\n\n\n NA\n\n\n NA\n\n\n NA\n\n\n\n\nKuta Paradiso or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n40\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\xa0\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nAlam Puisi 