\n02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Seminyak\nReturn Airport Transfers on Private basis\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\xa0\nHalf Day ATV Quad Bike (1 Hr. Tandem Drive) On Private Basis.\xa0\nHalf Day Authentic Balinese Massage (60 Min) + Bali Swing with photo Shoot (1 Hr) on Pvt Basis.\xa0\nFull Day Nusa Penida Tour with Local Lunch And Snorkeling Equipment’s On Sic Basis\xa0\nHalf Day Water Sports (1xJet Ski & 1xBanana Boat)\xa0\xa0\n01 Time Candlelight Romantic Dinner\nComplimentary 1xParasailing or 1X Flying Fish during the water sports activities\nComplimentary welcome gift on arrival\nComplimentary 01 Floating Breakfast on the 2nd day of stay at the villa\nMeals as mentioned in the itinerary.\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': "\nTCS & GST\nVisa Charges\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nEntrance fees\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary.\nAny tips - for guide & Driver\xa0\nBlackout Dates: Christmas & New year - 15th Dec'2026 to 10th Jan'2027 & 01st Mar 2027 – 11 Mar 2027 Nyepi Day\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions.\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc.)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nVisa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person.\n", 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nDuring Peak Season: Minimum 2 Nights Stay is required\nNo Check Out period on 31 December 2025 and 01 January 2026\nNyepi Day (Silent Day) is on 19 March 2026. No outdoor activity is allowed, and Airport will be closed from 05.59 am 19 March 2026 to 06.00 am 20 March 2026\nCompulsory New Year Dinner will be Applicable according to the Resort\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same.\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/SRP_NusaPenida.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Bali75390.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Bananaboat.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Baliswing_new_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/NusaPenida753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Bali7531.jpg']}, 'score': 4.1276164, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013451', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013451', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Kashmir Special With Gulmarg And Sonmarg Stay', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Gulmarg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Sonmarg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Meal Daily Breakfast 04 Complimentary Dine Experience Or Activity Shikara ride on Dal Lake 01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire The Gondola Ride (Phase -1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability) Entrance Or Entry tickets Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh All transfers and sightseeing Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle Travel Insurance Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013451_0_20260924114803.pdf', 'price': 25890, 'packageSummary': "The 'Kashmir Special With Gulmarg And Sonmarg Stay' package is a 6-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Sonmarg, Srinagar, and Gulmarg. This curated itinerary offers travelers a range of memorable experiences, including a traditional Shikara ride on Dal Lake, a unique photography session in Kashmiri attire, and a breathtaking Phase-1 Gondola ride in Gulmarg. Guests will enjoy daily breakfast, four complimentary dining experiences or activities, and entry tickets to the historic Shalimar Bagh and Nishat Bagh. The package also ensures a hassle-free journey with all transfers and sightseeing conducted in a private chauffeur-driven vehicle, alongside included travel insurance for participants under the age of 69.", 'images': ['Dal_Lake.jpg', '25344846040_64ef8bac76_o(1).jpg', '49943812578_6f76e97314_k.jpg', 'KheerBhawaniTemple.jpg', '7162484002_4696c449e0_h.jpg', '7845531024_d0b41e9634_k.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 25890, 'thumbnailImage': '53073277540_2a766a4a52_b.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG013451 is named \'Kashmir Special With Gulmarg And Sonmarg Stay\' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Srinagar, Meals: Na, Description: Arrive in Srinagar Welcome onboard a wonderful tour to one of the most happening destinations - Kashmir! On arrival at the Srinagar Airport, you will be welcomed & received by our representative/driver. Transfer from the airport to the hotel and check in. You can relax for a while after arrival. Later in the evening, proceed for a visit. Visit Shalimar Bagh Visit Nishant Bagh Enjoy shikara ride in Dal lake. (Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.) Overnight Srinagar at the Houseboat., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Gulmarg, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Srinagar to Gulmarg (90 kms / 3 ½ hours one way) After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Gulmarg - "Meadow of Flowers", Arrive Gulmarg Enjoy Asia\'s Highest Cable Car Project Gulmarg Gondola - The Gondola offers all tourists, scenic views of Pir Panjal Mountains and Valley as you head towards Phase 1: KHILANMARG. You may enjoy an Sledge ride or Snow Mobile ride on the snow covered slopes (on direct payment basis) Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg. Note: - In case of heavy snow fall and Gulmarg is not operational, we will take clients to Yusmarg. Important Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking Gulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest. Gondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging. Guests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Sonmarg, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Gulmarg to Sonmarg (125 Kms / approx 04 hrs). After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Sonmarg - Golden Meadow. Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy riding on a pony up to Thajiwas Glacier (on direct payment basis & subject to Operation) or Sledge Riding on snow (on direct payment). Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Sonmarg to Srinagar (125 Kms / approx 04 hrs). After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Srinagar - En-route - Visit Kheer Bhawani Temple.. Evening is free for shopping. Dinner & overnight stay will be at hotel in Srinagar., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast And Dinner, Description: Srinagar to Pahalgam: (Day Trip) After Buffet Breakfast, proceed for day excursion to Pahalgam - Pahalgam is famous for its scenic beauty and is the jewel of the picturesque Liddar valley in the high Himalayas. It provides an ideal setting for hiking, trekking, and fishing. It is also the starting point of the annual pilgrimage to the holy cave of Amarnath. Enjoy Betaab valley - on direct payment basis & subject to Operation) Return back to Srinagar by evening. Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Srinagar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Srinagar - Fly Back Home Departure from Srinagar: Today after breakfast, transfer to Srinagar airport to board the return flight with Happy Memories!!! Special Note: Hotels in any Seasonal hill Station / weekend destination in Srinagar) follow dynamic pricing method – the price may vary from month to month, day to day, depending on the festivals, functions, events, long weekends, occasions and market demand. The above mentioned rates are for your reference – however, the same may change at the time of booking. Request you to re-check the availability and the prevailing rates at the time of actual booking., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 25890.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast\xa0\n04 Complimentary Dinner\n01 Hi Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora)\n01 Lunch At River Side\xa0(Subject to flight arrival time on Day 1)\n01 Kashmiri Dinner\n. Inclusions: Assistance on Arrival. Meal:- Daily Breakfast 04 Complimentary Dinner 01 Hi Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora) 01 Lunch At River Side (Subject to flight arrival time on Day 1) 01 Kashmiri Dinner Experience Or Activity Shikara ride on Dal Lake 01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire The Gondola Ride (Phase -1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability) Entrance Or Entry tickets Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.) Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills ) All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate Important Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking Gulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Gondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging. Guests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri. Insurance Standard travel insurance coverage for the entire duration of the tour. For guests aged 70 and above, or those choosing to extend their stay, additional insurance fees may apply to accommodate these specific needs. Exclusions: Any Air or Rail fare. Any other meal not mentioned in price includes. Any other destination not mentioned in itinerary. Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges. Any expenses of personal nature. GST @ Current Rate UPPLEMENT STANDARD VALUE PREMIUM Upgrade from Sedan to MUV [Per Vehicle] 9450 9450 9450. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking Gulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest. Gondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging. Guests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com] Though we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri. BASICS Price is subject to change Price is based on the “Base” Category of Hotel Room/Airlines Seats. This is Irrespective of the Package Category Chosen. Upgrade to Higher Category is available at an extra cost. All domestic Hotels/Transport rates are based on current tariff & subject to change without prior notification; the revised rates will be charged extra. HOTELS Many regions do not have star category hotels. Generally there isn’t any star categorization in this sector, however the same is demarcated as per prices and put into slabs of 2*/ 3*/ 4*or STD/ DLX/ PRM or equivalent. Packages are based on base category rooms, irrespective of the Hotel category opted. Quote based on Non-Ac Rooms on Hills. AC Rooms on Extra Charges Please be reminded that all special requests like early check-in, smoking, non-smoking, views, floors, king, twin, adjoining and/or interconnecting rooms are strictly subject to availability upon arrival and cannot be guaranteed prior. Any expenses arising out of this is to be borne by the customer. Only 01 extra bed/mattress is allowed per room. This extra bed means a Mattress / Roll over Extra mattress on floor provided where proper extra bed isn’t available. In case of guests cannot climb the higher floors, we request you to update this at the time of booking so that we may take appropriate action and try for rooms in the Ground floor. This is again subject to availability and difference if any will have to be settled directly before check out. In hills, hotels may be located in a way where the view might be of a building in the front, beside or behind it. There will not be any refund in cased any of the sightseeing is missed/uncovered during the trip. The Hotels may/may not have some of following amenities as per its policy. Tea/coffee maker/ mini fridge/ enhanced toiletry kit (with moisturizer, tooth paste, brush, shaving kit, lufa, bathroom sleepers, bath-robe) etc. For meal plans, menu will be on fixed plan/ buffet basis and not on A-la-Carte basis. MAP & AP Meal plans do not include Evening snacks & cold drinks / liquor, Soups or Deserts. For order on A-la- Carte basis, guests are requested to make direct payment for additional items. Please follow the stipulated timings for the sightseeing trips / activities as informed by our representative. It helps manage the tour in a destination low on vehicles and dependent on ferry timings. Itinerary can be shuffled but in all cases we manage to provide all the inclusions as mentioned or similar or alternate. No refund for Complimentary Activities cancelled or unutilized due to reasons beyond our control (natural/technical) TRANSPORTATION Usual vehicle used are Air Conditioned Sedan (Indigo/Etios/Dzire etc) for 2-3 pax; SUV (Innova/Xylo/Ertiga etc) for 4-6 Pax or Tempo Traveller for 7-09 pax Transfers as per itinerary only for the mentioned Sightseeing only. A/c in Vehicle will be switched off during hilly drive. Please consult driver / local representative for next day’s sightseeing schedule / Transfers timings. Due to unforeseen situations (force majeure/ traffic jams / traffic halts/ diversions/ Bandh/ curfew, Union strike, VVIP movement, etc.) the program may get delayed/shuffled. We will request you to bear with us and as soon as vehicle arrives you will have to get in ASAP. Monument will remain closed on Public holidays & Sundays. National Park is Closed Around Mid Jun -Mid Nov INCIDENTAL CHARGES DUE TO UNFORESEEN SITUATIONS All arrangements made by TCIL are in the capacity of an agent only. TCIL will not be liable for claims or expenses arising from circumstances beyond our control such as accidents, injuries, delayed or cancelled flights & acts of Force majeure/ traffic jams / traffic halts/ diversions/ bandh/ curfew, Union strike, VVIP movement, etc. – We will request you to bear with us the situations beyond our control. We will arrange for alternate sightseeing. In case of discontinued itinerary due to these reasons no refund on the hotel booking will be provided and alternate accommodations (as per availability) are managed in the place where you have to stay back. While it is our endeavor to manage the alternate arrangements during such scenarios, please note the difference may be charged for the same. OTHER ON TOUR AND PRE TOUR EXPECTATIONS Carry comfort clothing – Shorts, T Shirts, Open Footwear, Cap or Hat, Sunglasses, Sun screen lotion, Rubber soled shoes; Pullovers or Light Jackets for Hills Guests Photo ID to Shared while booking and Carried on tour: Passport/Voter ID/DL/Aadhar are valid photo ids ((except Pan Card) Please follow the stipulated timings for the sightseeing trips / activities as informed by our representative. It helps manage the tour in a destination low on vehicles and dependent on ferry timings. No refund for Complimentary Activities cancelled or unutilized due to reasons beyond our control (natural/technical) Food in Kashmir: Vegetarian, North Indian, South Indian, Continental and Chinese dishes are available at all restaurants and hotels. In hotels, buffet is provided based on occupancy. Being Responsible & a Better Guest in Someone else’s Land While some of the pointers require Self-awareness, some actually are strictly prohibited. Take a Little Consent before taking pictures of people & their materials; Respect things local including Drivers, Guides, and Staff. Pls. Do not misbehave or manhandle. Do Not Be loud during any part of the journey. If anything not up to the mark, please inform the helpline number and check with local representative A little bargaining is expected but not too much haggling; Bother to learn/understand the local language – it helps a lot. This helps differentiate ‘rude’ from ‘local tone’ and also helps your bargaining Maintain Cleanliness. Pls. use dustbins or take back the days litter to your hotel’s bin. Do not Drink or Smoke in Public Places; Do check with crew/representatives before taking away things from Flight, Hotels and Cabs. Usually, Toiletries (soap/shampoo/moisturises/comb/dental kit/ loofah/slipper) are free takeaways in Hotels if they are placed in small pouches for one person consumption. Do not enter restricted areas or off-road where you please. Pls. consult. Take Proper permits are required to take video or film; Do not dirty & damage vehicles, hotels; property; place; habitats & vegetation Leave Places Better than you found it! Most leisure holiday destinations are relaxed, remote places. They may look less on professionalism but are high on humility. Let us be respectful of locals and the ‘culture’ that we have paid to experience. Let us all be The “Great Guests” that we expect from others visiting our homes. Jai Hind!. Highlights of the package: Meal Daily Breakfast 04 Complimentary Dine Experience Or Activity Shikara ride on Dal Lake 01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire The Gondola Ride (Phase -1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability) Entrance Or Entry tickets Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh All transfers and sightseeing Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle Travel Insurance Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs).', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Allahabad', 'cityCode': 'IXD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Kashmir Special With Gulmarg And Sonmarg Stay' package is a 6-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Sonmarg, Srinagar, and Gulmarg. This curated itinerary offers travelers a range of memorable experiences, including a traditional Shikara ride on Dal Lake, a unique photography session in Kashmiri attire, and a breathtaking Phase-1 Gondola ride in Gulmarg. Guests will enjoy daily breakfast, four complimentary dining experiences or activities, and entry tickets to the historic Shalimar Bagh and Nishat Bagh. The package also ensures a hassle-free journey with all transfers and sightseeing conducted in a private chauffeur-driven vehicle, alongside included travel insurance for participants under the age of 69.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive in Srinagar\n\xa0\nWelcome onboard a wonderful tour to one of the most happening destinations - Kashmir! On arrival at the Srinagar Airport, you will be welcomed & received by our representative/driver.\n\xa0\nTransfer from the airport to the hotel and check in. You can relax for a while after arrival. Later in the evening, proceed for a visit.\n\xa0\nVisit Shalimar Bagh\nVisit Nishant Bagh\nEnjoy shikara ride in Dal lake.\n\xa0\n(Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)\nOvernight Srinagar at the Houseboat.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nNa', 'overnightStay': 'Standard - The Olive Hotel/ Hotel Sapphire or similar in Srinagar\nValue - Hotel Dewan BY Royal Naqash / Hotel Ramada or similar in Srinagar\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Srinagar /\xa0 Hotel Orchard Retreat & Spa or similar in Srinagar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar to Gulmarg (90 kms / 3 ½ hours one way)\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Gulmarg - "Meadow of Flowers", \n\xa0\nArrive Gulmarg Enjoy Asia\'s Highest Cable Car Project Gulmarg Gondola - The Gondola offers all tourists, scenic views of\xa0 Pir Panjal Mountains and Valley as you head towards Phase 1: KHILANMARG. You may enjoy an Sledge ride or Snow Mobile ride on the snow covered slopes (on direct payment basis) \n\xa0\nDinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.\xa0\n\xa0\nNote: - \nIn case of heavy snow fall and Gulmarg is not operational, we will take clients to Yusmarg.\nImportant Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking\n\xa0\n\nGulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest.\nGondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging.\nGuests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri.\n', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Standard - Hotel Zahgeer or similar in Gulmarg\nValue -Hotel Pine Spring / Hotel Rosewood or similar in Gulmarg\nPremium - Hotel Hilltop / Hotel The Vintage or similar in Gulmarg'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nGulmarg to Sonmarg (125 Kms / approx 04 hrs).\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Sonmarg - Golden Meadow.\xa0Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. \n\xa0\nSonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy riding on a pony up to Thajiwas Glacier (on direct payment basis & subject to Operation) or Sledge Riding on snow (on direct payment). \n\xa0\nDinner & Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg. ', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Standard - Glacier Heights/ Hotel Divine Inn or similar in Sonmarg\nValue - Hotel Village walk or similar in Sonmarg\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Sonmarg'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nSonmarg to Srinagar (125 Kms / approx 04 hrs).\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for Srinagar - En-route - Visit Kheer Bhawani Temple..\nEvening is free for shopping. \n\xa0\nDinner & overnight stay will be at hotel in Srinagar.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Standard - The Olive Hotel/ Hotel Sapphire or similar in Srinagar\nValue - Hotel Dewan BY Royal Naqash / Hotel Ramada or similar in Srinagar\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Srinagar /\xa0 Hotel Orchard Retreat & Spa or similar in Srinagar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar to Pahalgam: (Day Trip)\n\xa0\nAfter Buffet Breakfast, proceed for day excursion to Pahalgam - Pahalgam is famous for its scenic beauty and is the jewel of the picturesque Liddar valley in the high Himalayas. It provides an ideal setting for hiking, trekking, and fishing. It is also the starting point of the annual pilgrimage to the holy cave of Amarnath.\n\xa0\nEnjoy Betaab valley - on direct payment basis & subject to Operation)\n\xa0\n\xa0\nReturn back to Srinagar by evening. Dinner & Overnight stay at hotel.\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast And Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Standard - The Olive Hotel/ Hotel Sapphire or similar in Srinagar\nValue - Hotel Dewan BY Royal Naqash / Hotel Ramada or similar in Srinagar\nPremium - Hotel Four Points By Sheraton, Srinagar /\xa0 Hotel Orchard Retreat & Spa or similar in Srinagar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nSrinagar - Fly Back Home\n\xa0\nDeparture from Srinagar:\n\xa0\nToday after breakfast, transfer to Srinagar airport to board the return flight with Happy Memories!!!\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Hotels in any Seasonal hill Station / weekend destination in Srinagar) follow dynamic pricing method – the price may vary from month to month, day to day, depending on the festivals, functions, events, long weekends, occasions and market demand. The above mentioned rates are for your\xa0\xa0reference – however, the same may change at the time of booking. Request you to re-check the availability and the prevailing rates at the time of actual booking.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Na'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'IN', 'countryName': 'India', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 25900.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 36300.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 49100.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast\xa0\n04 Complimentary Dinner\n01 Hi Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora)\n01 Lunch At River Side\xa0(Subject to flight arrival time on Day 1)\n01 Kashmiri Dinner\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['As per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Included as per itinerary', 'inclusions': 'Assistance on Arrival.\nMeal:-\n\nDaily Breakfast \n04 Complimentary Dinner\n01 Hi Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora)\n01 Lunch At River Side\xa0(Subject to flight arrival time on Day 1)\n01 Kashmiri Dinner\n\nExperience Or Activity\n\nShikara ride on Dal Lake\n01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire\nThe Gondola Ride (Phase -1) At Gulmarg\xa0 (Tickets are subject to availability)\n\nEntrance Or Entry tickets\n\nEntry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh\nEntry Ticket for Nishant Bagh\n\nNote: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)\n\nPrivate Chauffeur Driven Vehicle\nAll transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )\nAll currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate\n\nImportant Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking\n\nGulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing\nGondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging.\nGuests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri.\n\nInsurance\n\nStandard travel insurance coverage for the entire duration of the tour.\nFor guests aged 70 and above, or those choosing to extend their stay, additional insurance fees may apply to accommodate these specific needs\n', 'exclusions': '\nAny Air or Rail fare.\nAny other meal not mentioned in price includes.\nAny other destination not mentioned in itinerary.\nAny monument entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges.\nAny expenses of personal nature.\nGST @ Current Rate\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nUPPLEMENT\nSTANDARD\nVALUE\nPREMIUM\n\n\nUpgrade from Sedan to MUV [Per Vehicle]\n9450\n9450\n9450\n\n\n\n\xa0', 'termsAndConditions': 'Important Notice: Gulmarg Gondola Ride Ticket Booking\n\nGulmarg Gondola Ticket is complimentary but not guaranteed as it is booked basis availability exclusively on the Jammu & Kashmir Cable Car Corporation’s portal [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing options Plus the refund of Gondola Ticket Price as per actual to the guest.\nGondola Ticket availability is very limited and demand is very high and more so in summer peak times. Moreover, the opening time of these slots is neither pre-decided nor fixed, making the booking process even more challenging.\nGuests can also try and book Tatkal tickets directly at the Gondola ticket windows [https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com]\nThough we endeavor to provide Gondola ride to all our guests, in the event the tickets are not available, we will arrange alternative sightseeing Buta Pathri.\n\nBASICS\n\n\nPrice is subject to change\nPrice is based on the “Base” Category of Hotel Room/Airlines\nSeats. This is Irrespective of the Package Category Chosen. Upgrade to Higher Category is available at an extra cost.\nAll domestic Hotels/Transport rates are based on current tariff & subject to change without prior notification; the revised rates will be charged extra.\n\nHOTELS\n\nMany regions do not have star category hotels. Generally there isn’t any star categorization in this sector, however the same is demarcated as per prices and put into slabs of 2*/ 3*/ 4*or STD/ DLX/ PRM or equivalent.\nPackages are based on base category rooms, irrespective of the Hotel category opted.\nQuote based on Non-Ac Rooms on Hills. AC Rooms on Extra Charges\nPlease be reminded that all special requests like early check-in, smoking, non-smoking, views, floors, king, twin, adjoining and/or interconnecting rooms are strictly subject to availability upon arrival and cannot be guaranteed prior. Any expenses arising out of this is to be borne by the customer.\nOnly 01 extra bed/mattress is allowed per room. This extra bed means a Mattress / Roll over Extra mattress on floor provided where proper extra bed isn’t available.\nIn case of guests cannot climb the higher floors, we request you to update this at the time of booking so that we may take appropriate action and try for rooms in the Ground floor. This is again subject to availability and difference if any will have to be settled directly before check out.\nIn hills, hotels may be located in a way where the view might be of a building in the front, beside or behind it. There will not be any refund in cased any of the sightseeing is missed/uncovered during the trip.\nThe Hotels may/may not have some of following amenities as per its policy. Tea/coffee maker/ mini fridge/ enhanced toiletry kit (with moisturizer, tooth paste, brush, shaving kit, lufa, bathroom sleepers, bath-robe) etc.\nFor meal plans, menu will be on fixed plan/ buffet basis and not on A-la-Carte basis. MAP & AP Meal plans do not include Evening snacks & cold drinks / liquor, Soups or Deserts. For order on A-la- Carte basis, guests are requested to make direct payment for additional items.\nPlease follow the stipulated timings for the sightseeing trips / activities as informed by our representative. It helps manage the tour in a destination low on vehicles and dependent on ferry timings.\nItinerary can be shuffled but in all cases we manage to provide all the inclusions as mentioned or similar or alternate.\nNo refund for Complimentary Activities cancelled or unutilized due to reasons beyond our control (natural/technical)\n\nTRANSPORTATION\n\nUsual vehicle used are Air Conditioned Sedan (Indigo/Etios/Dzire etc) for 2-3 pax; SUV (Innova/Xylo/Ertiga etc) for 4-6 Pax or Tempo\nTraveller for 7-09 pax\nTransfers as per itinerary only for the mentioned Sightseeing only.\nA/c in Vehicle will be switched off during hilly drive.\nPlease consult driver / local representative for next day’s sightseeing schedule / Transfers timings.\nDue to unforeseen situations (force majeure/ traffic jams / traffic halts/ diversions/ Bandh/ curfew, Union strike, VVIP movement, etc.) the program may get delayed/shuffled. We will request you to bear with us and as soon as vehicle arrives you will have to get in ASAP.\nMonument will remain closed on Public holidays & Sundays.\nNational Park is Closed Around Mid Jun -Mid Nov\n\nINCIDENTAL CHARGES DUE TO UNFORESEEN SITUATIONS\nAll arrangements made by TCIL are in the capacity of an agent only. TCIL will not be liable for claims or expenses arising from circumstances beyond our control such as accidents, injuries, delayed or cancelled flights & acts of Force majeure/ traffic jams / traffic halts/ diversions/ bandh/ curfew, Union strike, VVIP movement, etc. – We will request you to bear with us the situations beyond our control. We will arrange for alternate sightseeing. In case of discontinued itinerary due to these reasons no refund on the hotel booking will be provided and alternate accommodations (as per availability) are managed in the place where you have to stay back. While it is our endeavor to manage the alternate arrangements during such scenarios, please note the difference may be charged for the same.\nOTHER ON TOUR AND PRE TOUR EXPECTATIONS\n\nCarry comfort clothing – Shorts, T Shirts, Open Footwear, Cap or Hat, Sunglasses, Sun screen lotion, Rubber soled shoes; Pullovers or Light Jackets for Hills\nGuests Photo ID to Shared while booking and Carried on tour: Passport/Voter ID/DL/Aadhar are valid photo ids ((except Pan Card)\nPlease follow the stipulated timings for the sightseeing trips / activities as informed by our representative. It helps manage the tour in a destination low on vehicles and dependent on ferry timings.\nNo refund for Complimentary Activities cancelled or unutilized due to reasons beyond our control (natural/technical)\nFood in Kashmir: Vegetarian, North Indian, South Indian, Continental and Chinese dishes are available at all restaurants and hotels. In hotels, buffet is provided based on occupancy.\n\nBeing Responsible & a Better Guest in Someone else’s Land\nWhile some of the pointers require Self-awareness, some actually are strictly prohibited.\n\nTake a Little Consent before taking pictures of people & their materials;\nRespect things local including Drivers, Guides, and Staff. Pls. Do not misbehave or manhandle.\nDo Not Be loud during any part of the journey. If anything not up to the mark, please inform the helpline number and check with local representative\nA little bargaining is expected but not too much haggling;\nBother to learn/understand the local language – it helps a lot. This helps differentiate ‘rude’ from ‘local tone’ and also helps your bargaining\xa0\nMaintain Cleanliness. Pls. use dustbins or take back the days litter to your hotel’s bin.\nDo not Drink or Smoke in Public Places;\nDo check with crew/representatives before taking away things from Flight, Hotels and Cabs. Usually, Toiletries (soap/shampoo/moisturises/comb/dental kit/ loofah/slipper) are free takeaways in Hotels if they are placed in small pouches for one person consumption.\nDo not enter restricted areas or off-road where you please. Pls. consult.\nTake Proper permits are required to take video or film;\nDo not dirty & damage vehicles, hotels; property; place; habitats & vegetation\nLeave Places Better than you found it!\n\nMost leisure holiday destinations are relaxed, remote places. They may look less on professionalism but are high on humility. Let us be respectful of locals and the ‘culture’ that we have paid to experience. Let us all be The “Great Guests” that we expect from others visiting our homes.\nJai Hind!', 'pkgSubtypeId': 2, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 0, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/53073277540_2a766a4a52_b.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/itinerary/Dal_Lake.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/itinerary/25344846040_64ef8bac76_o(1).jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/itinerary/49943812578_6f76e97314_k.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/itinerary/KheerBhawaniTemple.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/itinerary/7162484002_4696c449e0_h.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013451/itinerary/7845531024_d0b41e9634_k.jpg']}, 'score': 3.8333416, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015271', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015271', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Jakarta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Jakarta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Jakarta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Guaranteed Departure – Minimum 2 Pax Required. Insurance 4 Star Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Dinners What’s More Like – One Souvenir per room Bali Experience Bali Swing Visit Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset Enjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject to Weather Conditions) Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance Jakarta Visit Autograph Tower City Tour Visit Merdeka Square Photostop At National Monument Visit National Museum Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to Operation) Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Free time at Kuta Dua - Jakarta’s Old Town'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 92232, 'packageSummary': "The 'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter' package is a 7-day tour covering the vibrant destinations of Kuta and Jakarta. This exciting itinerary features a Bali Swing experience, a sunset visit to the Tanah Lot Floating Temple, thrilling water sports at Tanjung Benoa including banana boat rides, parasailing, and jet skiing, and a visit to the Uluwatu Temple to watch the traditional Kecak Dance. In Jakarta, participants will enjoy a comprehensive city tour with highlights such as the Autograph Tower, Merdeka Square, the National Monument, the National Museum, the Presidential Palace, the Jakarta Aquarium Safari, and free time to explore Kota Tua. With guaranteed departures for a minimum of two guests, the package also includes 4-star hotel accommodations with breakfast, travel insurance, a complimentary souvenir per room, and specially curated Indian dinners catering to Jain, vegetarian, and non-vegetarian preferences.", 'images': ['Bali7531.jpg', 'BaliSwing.jpg', 'NusaPenida753.jpg', 'KeckDanace.jpg', 'Jakarta.jpg', 'Jakarta753.jpg', 'Bali891.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 92232, 'thumbnailImage': 'SRP BALI.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG015271 is named \'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter\' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kuta, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrival In Bali - Check In Welcome To Bali, Indonesia, One Of The Most Famous Destinations In The World For Holidays And Packages. Upon Arrival At Denpasar Airport, You Will Be Met By Our Representative/ Tour Manager Who Will Assist You For Your Transfer To The Hotel. On Arrival In Bali, You Will Be Greeted By Your Friendly Tour Manager / Local Representative Outside The Baggage Hall Area At The Airport. Transfer To The Hotel & Check-In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs). Rest Of The Day Is At Leisure. NOTE All our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card Joining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Experience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunset TourThis morning after breakfast, proceed for an exciting adventure at Bali Swing and to experience incredible views while swinging. Later proceed to Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset – an ancient Hindu shrine perched on top of an outcrop amidst constantly crashing waves, the temple is simply among Bali not to be missed icons. Overnight in Bali, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Visit Nusa Penida Island This morning after breakfast, Visit Nusa Penida Tour where you’ll visit iconic spots like the stunning Broken Beach - stunning cove features a dramatic archway in the rocky cliffs, creating a picturesque "broken" effect that opens up to the sparkling turquoise ocean below, the awe-inspiring Kelingking Secret Point - with its iconic T-rex shaped cliff, the beach offers stunning panoramic views of turquoise waters crashing against dramatic limestone formations., the natural pool of Angel\'s Billabong - is a stunning natural pool located on the western coast of Nusa Penida. This picturesque spot features crystal-clear turquoise waters that are surrounded by dramatic rocky cliffs. Overnight in Bali., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Enjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa – Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance This morning after breakfast, proceed to the Tanjung Benoa near Nusa Dua Bali. Here you will enjoy the water sport activities included in your tour like - Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski. (**Sports Activities subjected to weather conditions) Later proceed for Uluwatu Temple Tour explores Bali\'s iconic 11th-century sea temple perched 70 meters on a sheer cliff. Later this evening enjoy the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’ a stunning Balinese cultural performance set against the backdrop of a dramatic sunset by the Indian Ocean. Overnight in Bali, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Jakarta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Proceed to Jakarta - Check In – Evening visit Autograph Tower This morning after breakfast reach Denpasar Airport for Flight to Jakarta, you will be greeted by your friendly Tour Manager / local representative outside the baggage hall area at the Jakarta airport. On arrival in Jakarta, Transfer to the hotel & check-in. (Standard Check in time after 1500Hrs). Later in the evening visit Autograph Tower Jakarta- to enjoy unforgettable 360-degree views of Jakarta from Indonesia’s Tallest Observatory Deck. More than just a view, visit the Sky Garden a multi-level, semi-outdoor experience where visitors can explore immersive spaces and enjoy thrilling sky-high attractions (Glass Floors, UPswing, UPside, UP High) Overnight in Jakarta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Jakarta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: City Tour of Jakarta - Merdeka Square, National Museum, Presidential Palace – Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari – Free time at Kuta Tua - Jakarta’s Old Town This morning after breakfast we will explore the Merdeka Square (Independence Square), Photostop at National Monument, Visit National Museum, Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to operation). Later we visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Indonesia\'s largest indoor living planet - where the mysteries of the ocean meet the excitement of a safari adventure. Later in the evening enjoy your free time at Kuta Tua - Jakarta’s Old Town the area is filled with historic buildings, museums, and open spaces that still preserve the atmosphere of old Jakarta. Overnight in Jakarta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Jakarta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: End Of Tour - Fly Back This Morning After Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour. Note : The Given Itinerary is a tentative itinerary. Itinerary and activities can be rescheduled or substituted based on weather, operational requirements, or unforeseen circumstances, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 92232.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n, \n04 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Bali\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Santika Premiere Hayam Wuruk / Aston Pluit & Residence or similar in Jakarta\n\n\xa0\nNote : Under unavoidable circumstances, Hotels are subject to change, in such condition substitute hotel of similar category is provided.. Meals include: \nDaily buffet breakfast (Except Day 1)\n06 Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners at Indian restaurant\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner), Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation at the hotels specified above or similar. Internal Airfare for Bali – Jakarta is included for all passengers including Joining Direct / NRI Passengers Cost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 31 July 2026 Medical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges. Meals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary Return Airport transfers from all airports. All transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. Professional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative. If group size is less than 15 customers, the tour will operate on Seat in Coach and FIT basis. For Group Size more than 15 customers there will be English Speaking Guide Assistance and for less than 15 customers there will be Driver cum Guide.. Exclusions: Main Airfare Airport taxes Indonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival) Visa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable) The cost of deviation, if you want to deviate from the group departure dates will be at an additional cost. City Tax or Tourism Tax Cruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays) Cost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 2,50,000. Applicable Government Taxes and other service charges. The cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 31 July 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same Any increase in the rate of exchange leading to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure. The tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure. The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges. Porterage Facility Any other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package. Additional Meals which are not specifically included in the above itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary. Cost of Optional Excursions.. Product Terms and Conditions: N/A. Highlights of the package: Guaranteed Departure – Minimum 2 Pax Required. Insurance 4 Star Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Dinners What’s More Like – One Souvenir per room Bali Experience Bali Swing Visit Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset Enjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject to Weather Conditions) Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance Jakarta Visit Autograph Tower City Tour Visit Merdeka Square Photostop At National Monument Visit National Museum Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to Operation) Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Free time at Kuta Dua - Jakarta’s Old Town.', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZBJ560', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter' package is a 7-day tour covering the vibrant destinations of Kuta and Jakarta. This exciting itinerary features a Bali Swing experience, a sunset visit to the Tanah Lot Floating Temple, thrilling water sports at Tanjung Benoa including banana boat rides, parasailing, and jet skiing, and a visit to the Uluwatu Temple to watch the traditional Kecak Dance. In Jakarta, participants will enjoy a comprehensive city tour with highlights such as the Autograph Tower, Merdeka Square, the National Monument, the National Museum, the Presidential Palace, the Jakarta Aquarium Safari, and free time to explore Kota Tua. With guaranteed departures for a minimum of two guests, the package also includes 4-star hotel accommodations with breakfast, travel insurance, a complimentary souvenir per room, and specially curated Indian dinners catering to Jain, vegetarian, and non-vegetarian preferences.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrival In Bali - Check In\nWelcome To Bali, Indonesia, One Of The Most Famous Destinations In The World For Holidays And Packages. Upon Arrival At Denpasar Airport, You Will Be Met By Our Representative/ Tour Manager Who Will Assist You For Your Transfer To The Hotel.\nOn Arrival In Bali, You Will Be Greeted By Your Friendly Tour Manager / Local Representative Outside The Baggage Hall Area At The Airport. Transfer To The Hotel & Check-In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs). Rest Of The Day Is At Leisure.\n\xa0\nNOTE\xa0\n\nAll our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card\nJoining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nExperience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunse