s. This\xa0 sometimes gives impression that operator is giving preference to the other guest.\xa0\n\xa0\nSeating and Capacity Each helicopter can accommodate 6 passengers with a maximum total weight of 450 kg. Booking 6 seats does not mean all passengers will travel together or that it will be a private charter.\n\xa0\nBody Weight Each passenger’s actual body weight must be provided at the time of booking. The average limit is under 75 kg per person. Passengers exceeding 75 kg should check with Operations Team for available dates and supplement cost.\n\xa0\nWeight Exceeds If the declared weight exceeds by more than 2 kg at the time of travel, the operator reserves the right to de board such guests, and the amount paid will be non refundable.\n\xa0\nHelipads Multiple helipads are available for flights to Kedarnath, including Sersi, Phata, Guptkashi, and Sitapur. Guests may board from any of these locations.\n\xa0\nFacilities:\nPlease note that heaters and blowers are not available in the hotels during Yatra. Guests are advised to carry adequate warm clothing to stay comfortable during their stay.\n\xa0\nVIP Darshan: All VIP Darshan arrangements are entirely at the discretion of the Mandir Samiti and the Uttarakhand Government.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0\nBreakfast', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nN/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nDehradun\nFairfield by Marriot or Similar\n\n\nKedarnath\nPunjab Sindh/Gayatri Bhawan or Similar\n\n\nBadrinath\nSarovar Portico /Similar\n\n\n', '\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nDehradun 1N\nHyatt Regency or Similar\n\n\nKedarnath 1N\nGayatri Bhawan\xa0or Similar\n\n\nBadrinath 1N\nHotel Dikesh Inn or Similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nDehradun\nFairfield by Marriot or Similar\n\n\nKedarnath\nPunjab Sindh/Gayatri Bhawan or Similar\n\n\nBadrinath\nSarovar Portico /Similar\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nDehradun 1N\nHyatt Regency or Similar\n\n\nKedarnath 1N\nGayatri Bhawan\xa0or Similar\n\