ff">\n<p align="center">07:15+1</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 82.3542px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">DPS-SIN</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 73px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">SQ935</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 73px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">10:30</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 71px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">13:10</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr valign="bottom">\n<td style="width: 111px;" bgcolor="#ffffff" height="17">\n<p align="center">SIN-DPS</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 90px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">SQ944</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 75px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">15:50</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 75.6458px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">18:45</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 82.3542px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">SIN-AMD</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 73px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">SQ504</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 73px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">18:40</p>\n</td>\n<td style="width: 71px;" bgcolor="#ffffff">\n<p align="center">21:50</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn Airfare (Singapore Airlines)\xa0\n04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Kuta\n02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Ubud as per the selected city option\nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\xa0\nReturn airport transfers on private basis\nInter Hotel Transfers\nFull Day Water sports (Jet Ski, Banana Boat, Parasailing) followed by Uluwatu temple Tour Transfer on PVT basis.\xa0\xa0\nUbud tour with Swing by My Swing, Coffee Plantation, Celuk Mas Village on PVT Basis.\nBedugul tour (Ulun Danu Temple) + Tanah Lot sunset.\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\xa0\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 2 adults travelling together at all times.\nPre and post tour services & costs.\nHotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales.\nBlackout date surcharges –\xa0\nMidnight surcharge.\nMeals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary.\nTips for guide & driver.\nCity tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable).\nExpenditure of a personal nature (minibar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.)\nCamera fee.\nPorterage facility\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable.\nVisa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable).\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary.\xa0\nCost of optional excursions.\nAnything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list.\nNote: In the Premium category for this Bali Product, Kuta stay will be at a 4-star hotel while Ubud stay will be at a 5-star hotel.\nVisa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\nThe package price is valid.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 2 adults travelling together at all times.\nNote: In the Premium category for this Bali Product, Kuta stay will be at a 4-star hotel while Ubud stay will be at a 5-star hotel.\nHotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nHotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels.\nHotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking.\nIf the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide multiple alternate options of a similar category.\nThe rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade fair periods.\nAny applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly.\nSurcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking.\nGuests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking.\nAll rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking.\nWe reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\xa0\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\nWherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges.\nNo refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services.\nAll sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice.\nRates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends.\nAny promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice.\nOnce bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time.\nOrganization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control.\nA refundable security deposit is required at check-in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at checkout. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as minibar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage':