is Bali Swing. Take your loved ones for a thrilling yet exciting ride on the tandem swing, or if you want to feel the sensation of flying by yourself, try the single swing that goes up to 60 meters above ground. Make your trip even more unforgettable by taking pictures in various unique photo spots available, such as adorable birds nest you can sit in !\nLater enjoy the local Lunch at Bali Swing Pioneer.\nProceed to spoil yourself and soothe your body and mind with our selected Balinese Massage Treatment. Using local herbs and spices along with aromatic oil, we offer a wide range of spa package including specialist treatments, facials body and foot scrub so that you can relax and escape from the stress and pressure of daily life.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Local Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak or\xa0Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso (Premium)\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nRoyal Taman Ayun & Tanah Lot Tour (PVT Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nTaman Ayun Temple or Pura Taman Ayun is a magnificent family temple of Mengwi empire. This one of the most visited temple in Bali, both local & Foreign tourist. Taman Ayun Temple is also one of six royal temples in Bali making it very important both spiritually and historically. This temple’s name Taman Ayun translates to the “ Garden\xa0 Temple in the Water”.\n\xa0\nTanah Lot Temple\xa0 is one of the most popular Bali Places of Interest and its an ancient Hindu Shrine perched on top of an outcrop amidst constantly crashing waves, the temple is simply among Bali not to be missed icons. The onshore site is dotted with smaller shrines alongside visitors leisure facilities that compromise restaurants, Shops and cultural park presenting regular dance performances. The temple is located in the Beraban village of the Tabanan regency, an approximate 20 km northwest of Kuta and is included on most tours to Bali western and central regions.\n\xa0\nReturn to hotel post the tour and spend the overnight in Bali.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak or\xa0Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso (Premium)\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day Water Sports with Uluwatu Temple Tour Followed by Kecak Dance (PVT Basis)\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nEnjoy the Salty Air! Sandy Hair! Feel the tropical breeze and get closer to Indian Ocean with selected water sport activity. 1 x Jet Ski & Banana Boat Ride and Complimentary 1 x Parasailing\xa0\nLater proceed Uluwatu Temple sits on 70 meter high cliff protruding above Indonesian Ocean. The main site of Uluwatu Tours is visiting this temple. There are hundreds of monkeys roaming along the path outside temple. A small forest lies at the front and hundreds of monkey’s dwells here. They are believed to guard the temple from bad influence. The Serpentine pathway to the temple is fortified by concrete walls on the cliff sides.\nWhen sun goes down, we will witness the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’. Kecak dance is that the accompanying music is provided by the human voice, the gamelan suara, a choir of a hundred men or more sitting in concentric circle, swaying, standing up, lying prone as the story develops. Amongst the swaying masses the voices of the storytellers can be heard telling the unfolding tale. The music generated from a combination sounds of members cak which were about 50 – 70 people all of them will make music in acapella.\xa0\nReturn to hotel post the tour and spend the overnight in Bali.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak or\xa0Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso (Premium)\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nBounty Cruise on Private Basis\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel\xa0\n\xa0\nSpend an unforgettable evening cruise on Bounty Dinner Cruise, Bali. Take in a breathtaking view of the sunset over Tanjung Benoa. Enjoy a delicious international buffet dinner with your loved ones. Watch various interactive performances, such as a traditional Balinese dance, comedy number and DJ performance.\xa0\nReturn to hotel post the tour and spend the overnight in Bali.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0The Legian Paradiso\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Swiss Belcourt Seminyak or\xa0Fairfield Seminyak (Value) /\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso (Premium)\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart from Kuta\xa0\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subject to change without prior notice.\xa0\n\xa0\nExtension Nights:\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01\xa0Oct 2026 –\xa024 Mar 2027\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\nHOTELS\n\n\nPACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nSINGLE\n\n\nTWIN /DOUBLE\n\n\nTRIPLE\n\n\nCHILDWITH BED\n\n\nCHILDNO BED\n\n\n\n\nSTANDARD\n\n\nThe Legian Paradiso or similar\n\n\nUSD 35\n\n\nUSD 20\n\n\nUSD 20\n\n\nUSD 10\n\n\nUSD 10\n\n\n\n\nVALUE\n\n\nSwiss Belcourt Seminyak /Fairfield Seminyak Or Similar\n\n\nUSD 60\n\n\nUSD 30\n\n\nUSD 30\n\n\nUSD 20\n\n\nUSD 20\n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM\n\n\nBintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar\n\n\nUSD 105\n\n\nUSD 52\n\n\nUSD 50\n\n\nUSD 30\n\n\nUSD 30\n\n\n\n\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ["\n6 Night's Hotel\xa0Swiss Belcourt\xa0 Seminyak /\xa0Fairfield Seminyak\xa0Or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n", '\nHotel\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar in Kuta, Bali\n', '\nHotel The Legian Paradiso or similar in Kuta, Bali\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': "\n6 Night's Hotel\xa0Swiss Belcourt\xa0 Seminyak /\xa0Fairfield Seminyak\xa0Or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n", '2': '\nHotel\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar in Kuta, Bali\n', '0': '\nHotel The Legian Paradiso or similar in Kuta, Bali\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'ID', 'countryName': 'Indonesia', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 65700.0, 'hotels': ['\nHotel The Legian Paradiso or similar in Kuta, Bali\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 72600.0, 'hotels': ["\n6 Night's Hotel\xa0Swiss Belcourt\xa0 Seminyak /\xa0Fairfield Seminyak\xa0Or Similar in Kuta, Bali\xa0\n"]}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 86500.0, 'hotels': ['\nHotel\xa0Bintang Bali Resort / Kuta Paradiso or Similar in Kuta, Bali\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\nFull Day Kintamani Tour with Hot Spring, Ubud Village On Private Basis.\nFull Day Tour – Kokat Swing with local Lunch followed 02 Hour Spa followed by Bounty cruise on Pvt Basis.\nFull Day Taman Ayu Temple Tour followed by Tanah Lot Temple tour\nHalf Day Water Sports (1xJet Ski & 1xBanana Boat) Followed by Uluwatu Temple Tour with Kecak Dance\nComplimentary 1xParasailing Or 1X Flying Fish during the water sports activities\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\n06 night’s accommodation with breakfast\nReturn Airport Transfers on Private basis\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\nFull Day Kintamani Tour with Hot Spring, Ubud Village On Private Basis.\nFull Day Tour – Kokat Swing with local Lunch followed 02 Hour Spa followed by Bounty cruise on Pvt Basis.\nFull Day Taman Ayu Temple Tour followed by Tanah Lot Temple tour\nHalf Day Water Sports (1xJet Ski & 1xBanana Boat) Followed by Uluwatu Temple Tour with Kecak Dance\nComplimentary 1xParasailing Or 1X Flying Fish during the water sports activities\nReturn airport transfers 