 Village Tour\nTanah Lot Sunset Tour\nHalf Day Water Sports (1 x Jet Ski & 1xBanana Boat) at Tanjung Benoa\nComplimentary 01 Floating Breakfast on the 2nd day of stay at the villa\nComplimentary 1xParasailing during the water sports activities.\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\n06 night’s accommodation with breakfast\nReturn Airport Transfers on Private basis\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\nFull Day Kintamani Hot Spring with Ubud Village Tour\nTanah Lot Sunset Tour\nHalf Day Water Sports (1 x Jet Ski & 1xBanana Boat) at Tanjung Benoa\nComplimentary 01 Floating Breakfast on the 2nd day of stay at the villa\nComplimentary 1xParasailing during the water sports activities.\nComplimentary welcome gift on arrival\nComplimentary 01 bottle of Mineral Water on arrival\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': "\nTCS & GST\nVisa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person.\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights service\xa0\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary.\nAny tips for guide & Driver\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions.\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nBlackout Dates: Christmas & New year - 15th Dec'2026 to 10th Jan'2027 & 01st Mar 2027 – 11 Mar 2027 Nyepi Day\nThe rates are valid for minimum 01 adult travelling.\xa0\nVisa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person.\n", 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 01 adult travelling.\xa0\nDuring Peak Season: Minimum 2 Nights Stay is required\nNo Check Out period on 31 December 2024 and 01 January 2025\nNo Check Out period on 31 December 2025 and 01 January 2026\nNyepi Day (Silent Day) is on 19 March 2026. No outdoor activity is allowed, and Airport will be closed from 05.59 am 19 March 2026 to 06.00 am 20 March 2026\nCompulsory New Year Dinner will be Applicable according to the Resort\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTC is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TC would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 1, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/bali5.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali_Scenic_7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Tanah_Lot_Temple_New_Bali_&53.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/BALI_BananaBoat.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Batur.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012817/itinerary/Bali9.jpg']}, 'score': 8.488001, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014877', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014877', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Magical Vietnam With Ho Chi Minh And Bali (Winter)', 'days': 12, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Bali', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bali', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bali', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bali', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Hanoi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ha Long Bay', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Hanoi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Da Nang', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Da Nang', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ho Chi Minh City', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ho Chi Minh City', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ho Chi Minh City', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ["An Air Inclusive Value Tour with Tour Manager's assistance throughout the tour. Visa Insurance 4 Star Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Lunches & Dinners (Lunches are not included in Bali Portion) Enjoy Water Sports activities like Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski in Bali Experience Bali Swing in Bali Enjoy Cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi Enjoy Basket Boat Ride at Cam Thanh Village in Da Nang Enjoy Boat Ride with Lantern Releasing in Da Nang Water bus ride in Ho Chi Minh City What’s More Like Vietnamese Ice Cream at Hoi An in Da Nang Vietnamese Coffee Tasting Experience One souvenir per room Bali Experience Bali Swing Visit Tanah Lot Floating Temple For Sunset Enjoy Water Sports At Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject To Weather Conditions) Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance Hanoi Guided City Tour Of Hanoi Photo Stop At Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum Photo Stop At One Pillar Pagoda Experience Cyclo Tour Ride Visit Hoan Kiem Lake Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay Overnight Stay On Ha Long Bay / Lan Ha Bay On Cruise Activities Tai Chi Training, Cooking Classes, Kayaking (Subject To Availability, Cruise Type & Weather Conditions) Da Nang Visit Cam Thanh Coconut Village Enjoy Basket Boat Ride At Cam Thanh Village Visit Hoi An Ancient Town Enjoy Boat Ride With Lantern Releasing Day Excursion To Bana Hills By Cable Car Visit Golden Bridge Visit French Gardens Visit French Quarters Visit St. Denis Church Visit Indoor Fantasy Park (Wax Museum Not Included) Photo Stop At Dragon Bridge Ho Chi Minh Guided City Tour Of Ho Chi Minh Photo Stop Saigon Central Post Office Visit War Remnants Museum Photo Stop At Reunification Palace Visit Cu Chi Tunnels Enjoy Water Bus Ride (A Local Transport Ride) Visit Mekong Delta"], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 228192, 'packageSummary': "The 'Magical Vietnam With Ho Chi Minh And Bali (Winter)' package is a 12-day tour covering Da Nang, Bali, Ho Chi Minh City, Hanoi, and Ha Long Bay. This comprehensive, air-inclusive tour with tour manager assistance features 4-star accommodations and a rich itinerary of activities, including thrilling water sports, the Bali Swing, and visits to Tanah Lot and Uluwatu Temple in Bali. In Vietnam, participants will experience a cyclo ride through Hanoi's Old Quarter, an overnight cruise on Ha Long Bay with Tai Chi and kayaking, a basket boat ride at Cam Thanh Village, and a lantern-releasing boat ride in Hoi An. The adventure also includes a cable car ride to Ba Na Hills to see the Golden Bridge, a guided tour of Ho Chi Minh City featuring the Cu Chi Tunnels and a local water bus ride, and a scenic excursion to the Mekong Delta.", 'images': ['Bali_Swing_Ubud_753.jpg', 'Tanah_Lot_Temple_New_Bali_&53.jpg', 'Nusa_Penida_New_753.jpg', 'KeckDanace.jpg', 'HoChiMinh753.jpg', 'HalongBayCruise753.jpg', 'AdobeStock_296902787_One_Pillar_pagoda_in_Hanoi.jpg', 'HoiAn753.jpg', 'GoldenbridgeDanang753.jpg', 'CuChiTunnels753.jpg', 'MekongDelta753.jpg', 'HoChiMinhCity753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 228192, 'thumbnailImage': 'Bali26789.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014877 is named 'Magical Vietnam With Ho Chi Minh And Bali (Winter)' and spans 12 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Bali, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrival in Bali - Check In Welcome to Bali, Indonesia, one of the most famous destinations in the world for holidays and packages. Upon arrival at the Denpasar airport, you will be met by our representative/ Tour Manager who will assist you for your transfer to the hotel. On arrival in Bali, you will be greeted by your friendly Tour Manager / local representative outside the baggage hall area at the airport. Transfer to the hotel & check-in. (Standard Check in time after 1500Hrs). Rest of the day is at leisure. Note: All our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card Joining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Bali, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Experience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunset Tour Post breakfast, proceed for an exciting swing, the most famous Bali Swing. Later arrive at Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset – An ancient Hindu shrine., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Bali, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Day at Leisure Or Optional Tour of Nusa Penida This morning after buffet breakfast, day is at leisure. Spend rest of the day exploring Bali on your own OR you can explore Nusa Penida Island OPTIONAL EXCURSION: Full Day Nusa Penida Tour inclusive of Angel Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Beach with Lunch (Set Menu) at USD 45 per person (Minimum 2 Pax Required) Join Day Tour of Nusa Penida, where you’ll visit iconic spots like the stunning Broken Beach, the awe-inspiring Kelingking Secret Point, the natural pool of Angel's Billabong., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Bali, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Water Sports At Tanjung Benoa – Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance After breakfast, proceed to the Tanjung Benoa near Nusa Dua Bali. Here you will enjoy the water sport activities included in your tour like - Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski. (**Parasailing subjected to weather conditions) Later proceed for Uluwatu Temple Tour; located at 70-meter-high cliff. Later this evening enjoy the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Hanoi, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Fly to Hanoi – Day at Leisure This morning after breakfast proceed to Denpasar airport for the flight to Hanoi. Later we proceed to the hotel and check in. (Standard check in time 1500 hrs). Rest of the day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Ha Long Bay, Meals: Breakfast, Local Lunch and Local Dinner, Description: Hanoi – Ha Long Bay – Overnight on Cruise - Visit Pearl Farm Enroute Ha Long Bay This morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to Ha Long. Enroute visit Pearl Farm. Upon arrival in Ha Long, check in at the overnight cruise. As we sail on the Ha Long bay we visit Surprise Caves & Ti Top Island - enjoy free time at the beach or walk up the hill to enjoy a view of Ha Long Bay. Later enjoy sunset view from sundeck. OR Hanoi – Lan Ha Bay – Overnight on Cruise This morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to Lan Ha Bay. Upon Arrival in Lan Ha Bay, check in at the Overnight Cruise. As we sail on the Lan Ha Bay, we visit Dark & Bright Cave (Hang Sang & Toi) - Enjoy free time at the beach or enjoy a view of Lan Ha Bay., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Hanoi, Meals: Breakfast, Brunch and Dinner, Description: Sail on Ha Long Bay – Drive to Hanoi - Guided City Tour of Hanoi - Enjoy Cyclo Tour This morning after breakfast, we visit Luon Cave by boat - enjoy kayaking or wooden boat ride through the cave. Enjoy brunch on board the Cruise Return to Halong Wharf and transfer back to Hanoi. (Note: The cruise itinerary can be changed according to weather conditions.) Upon arrival, we proceed on the city tour - See Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum from outside. Visit One Pillar Pagoda followed by a cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi. Later enjoy photostop at Hoan Kiem Lake. OR Sail On Lan Ha Bay – Drive to Hanoi - Guided City Tour of Hanoi - Enjoy Cyclo Tour This Morning After Breakfast, Enjoy sunrise photograph and brunch on board the cruise Return to Tuan Chau Harbor and transfer back to Hanoi. (Note: The cruise itinerary can be changed according to the cruise / weather conditions.) Upon arrival, we proceed on the city tour - See Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum from outside. Visit One Pillar Pagoda followed by a cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi. Later enjoy photostop at Hoan Kiem Lake., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Da Nang, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Fly to Da Nang - Visit Cam Thanh Village – Enjoy Basket Boat Ride at Cam Thanh Village - Visit Hoi An Ancient Town - Experience Boat Ride with Lantern Releasing This morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to the airport for our flight to Da Nang. Upon arrival, transfer from the airport to the hotel for check in. (Standard check in time 1500 hrs). Later visit Cam Thanh Village. Enjoy a basket boat ride through the coconut jungle forest. Visit Hoi An ancient town - see the tile-roofed Japanese Bridge, Chinese Assembly halls and ancient houses followed by a boat ride with lantern releasing on the river., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Da Nang, Meals: Breakfast, International Lunch and Dinner, Description: Day Excursion to Ba Na Hills - Visit Golden Bridge - Photo Stop at Dragon Bridge This morning after breakfast, we proceed to Ba Na hills. On arrival take a Cable Car to Ba Na hills station. Visit Golden Bridge followed by visit the Old Villas, French Stable, and Tinh Tam Garden. See the Linh Ung Pagoda. Visit Loc Uyen Garden and Quan Am Pavilion. Our next stop will be the Fantasy Park, an amusement park. Later this evening proceed for a photo stop at Dragon Bridge., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Ho Chi Minh City, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Fly to Ho Chi Minh – Visit Cu Chi Tunnels - Ride on Water Bus This morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to the airport for our flight to Ho Chi Minh City. Later visit Cu Chi tunnels – the network of over 200 km tunnels which became legendary when they played a vital role in the War. Later proceed a local water bus ride., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 11 - Ho Chi Minh City, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Visit Mekong Delta, Free time at Ben Thanh Market This morning after breakfast, we visit My Tho Village - the homeland of coconut and Unicorn Island. On the way we visit Vinh Trang pagoda, one of the biggest pagodas in the region. Enjoy Coconut Water during Boat Ride. Later we visit Ben Thanh Market., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 12 - Ho Chi Minh City, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Guided City Tour of Ho Chi Minh - Visit War Remnants Museum - End of Tour - Fly Back This morning after breakfast, check out and proceed on a guided city tour of Ho Chi Minh - Saigon Central Post Office and Reunification Palace see from outside. Visit War Remnants Museum. Later proceed to the Airport. Return home with wonderful memories of your tour. Note: Joining Direct / NRI Passengers requested to book flights after 5pm as we need to cover sightseeing on this day. In case of early flight, the sightseeing on this day will be missed. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Final Itinerary will be handed over on the day of arrival., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 228192.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n, \n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n. Meals include: \nDaily buffet / packed breakfast (Except Day 1)\n04 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Lunches\n01 International buffet Lunch\n10 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners\xa0\n1 Lunch, 1 Dinner and 1 Brunch onboard Cruise\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch/ IL/D - International Lunch/Dinner / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)\n**Depending on Flight timings Packed Meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) will be provided instead of Sitting Meals at Indian / Local Restaurant.\n\xa0\n**Lunches are not included in Bali Portion, Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Return economy class airfare as per the itinerary. Internal airfare for Bali – Hanoi, Hanoi- Da Nang, Da Nang – Ho Chi Minh is included for Joining Direct & NRI passengers Accommodation at the hotels specified above or similar. Vietnam Visa & Airport taxes (Any further increase in the same must be borne by the guest). Cost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 30 April 2026 Medical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges. Meals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary Airport transfers from all airports. All transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. Professional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative. If groups size is less than 15 customers than the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis. Visa Requirements: Vietnam E-visa included in the package. Indonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival) Cost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers. All foreign nationals and overseas Vietnamese entering with a visa must complete the digital arrival card prior to immigration clearance. Travelers can fill out the form by scanning a QR code upon arrival at international airports or, preferably, by completing it in advance online at https://prearrival.immigration.gov.vn/ to save time.. Exclusions: Compulsory tips for tour guide and driver: USD 5 per person per day Indonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival) The cost of deviation, if you want to deviate from the group departure dates will be at an additional cost. City Tax or Tourism Tax Visa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable) Cruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays) Cost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 2,50,000. Applicable Government Taxes and other service charges. The cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same Any increase in the rate of exchange leading to increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure. The tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure. The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges. Porterage Facility Any other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package. Additional Meals which is not specifically included in the above itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary. Cost of Optional Excursions.. Product Terms and Conditions: General Information: All travelers while returning to India should submit a self-declaration form (mandatory) on the online Air Suvidha portal (www.newdelhiairport.in) before the scheduled travel, including the last 14 days of travel details. Each passenger shall also submit a declaration with respect to the authenticity of the report and will be liable for criminal prosecution if found otherwise.. Highlights of the package: An Air Inclusive Value Tour with Tour Manager's assistance throughout the tour. Visa Insurance 4 Star Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Lunches & Dinners (Lunches are not included in Bali Portion) Enjoy Water Sports activities like Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski in Bali Experience Bali Swing in Bali Enjoy Cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi Enjoy Basket Boat Ride at Cam Thanh Village in Da Nang Enjoy Boat Ride with Lantern Releasing in Da Nang Water bus ride in Ho Chi Minh City What’s More Like Vietnamese Ice Cream at Hoi An in Da Nang Vietnamese Coffee Tasting Experience One souvenir per room Bali Experience Bali Swing Visit Tanah Lot Floating Temple For Sunset Enjoy Water Sports At Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject To Weather Conditions) Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance Hanoi Guided City Tour Of Hanoi Photo Stop At Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum Photo Stop At One Pillar Pagoda Experience Cyclo Tour Ride Visit Hoan Kiem Lake Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay Overnight Stay On Ha Long Bay / Lan Ha Bay On Cruise Activities Tai Chi Training, Cooking Classes, Kayaking (Subject To Availability, Cruise Type & Weather Conditions) Da Nang Visit Cam Thanh Coconut Village Enjoy Basket Boat Ride At Cam Thanh Village Visit Hoi An Ancient Town Enjoy Boat Ride With Lantern Releasing Day Excursion To Bana Hills By Cable Car Visit Golden Bridge Visit French Gardens Visit French Quarters Visit St. Denis Church Visit Indoor Fantasy Park (Wax Museum Not Included) Photo Stop At Dragon Bridge Ho Chi Minh Guided City Tour Of Ho Chi Minh Photo Stop Saigon Central Post Office Visit War Remnants Museum Photo Stop At Reunification Palace Visit Cu Chi Tunnels Enjoy Water Bus Ride (A Local Transport Ride) Visit Mekong Delta.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVHB60', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Magical Vietnam With Ho Chi Minh And Bali (Winter)' package is a 12-day tour covering Da Nang, Bali, Ho Chi Minh City, Hanoi, and Ha Long Bay. This comprehensive, air-inclusive tour with tour manager assistance features 4-star accommodations and a rich itinerary of activities, including thrilling water sports, the Bali Swing, and visits to Tanah Lot and Uluwatu Temple in Bali. In Vietnam, participants will experience a cyclo ride through Hanoi's Old Quarter, an overnight cruise on Ha Long Bay with Tai Chi and kayaking, a basket boat ride at Cam Thanh Village, and a lantern-releasing boat ride in Hoi An. The adventure also includes a cable car ride to Ba Na Hills to see the Golden Bridge, a guided tour of Ho Chi Minh City featuring the Cu Chi Tunnels and a local water bus ride, and a scenic excursion to the Mekong Delta.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrival in Bali - Check In\nWelcome to Bali, Indonesia, one of the most famous destinations in the world for holidays and packages. Upon arrival at the Denpasar airport, you will be met by our representative/ Tour Manager who will assist you for your transfer to the hotel.\nOn arrival in Bali, you will be greeted by your friendly Tour Manager / local representative outside the baggage hall area at the airport. Transfer to the hotel & check-in. (Standard Check in time after 1500Hrs). Rest of the day is at leisure.\n\xa0\nNote:\n\nAll our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card\nJoining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nExperience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunset Tour\nPost breakfast, proceed for an exciting swing, the most famous Bali Swing.\nLater arrive at Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset – An ancient Hindu shrine.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nDay at Leisure Or Optional Tour of Nusa Penida\nThis morning after buffet breakfast, day is at leisure.\xa0\nSpend rest of the day exploring Bali on your own OR you can explore Nusa Penida Island\nOPTIONAL EXCURSION: Full Day Nusa Penida Tour inclusive of Angel Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Beach with Lunch (Set Menu) at USD 45 per person (Minimum 2 Pax Required)\nJoin Day Tour of Nusa Penida, where you’ll visit iconic spots like the stunning Broken Beach, the awe-inspiring Kelingking Secret Point, the natural pool of Angel's Billabong.\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nWater Sports At Tanjung Benoa – Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance\nAfter breakfast, proceed to the Tanjung Benoa near Nusa Dua Bali. Here you will enjoy the water sport activities included in your tour like - Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski.\n(**Parasailing subjected to weather conditions)\nLater proceed for Uluwatu Temple Tour; located at 70-meter-high cliff. Later this evening enjoy the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFly to Hanoi – Day at Leisure\nThis morning after breakfast proceed to Denpasar airport for the flight to Hanoi. Later we proceed to the hotel and check in. (Standard check in time 1500 hrs).\nRest of the day at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\nHotel Sen Grand / Army / Grand View or similar in Hanoi'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0Hanoi – Ha Long Bay – Overnight on Cruise - Visit Pearl Farm Enroute Ha Long Bay\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to Ha Long. Enroute visit Pearl Farm. Upon arrival in Ha Long, check in at the overnight cruise. As we sail on the Ha Long bay we visit Surprise Caves & Ti Top Island - enjoy free time at the beach or walk up the hill to enjoy a view of Ha Long Bay.\nLater enjoy sunset view from sundeck.\nOR\nHanoi – Lan Ha Bay – Overnight on Cruise\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to Lan Ha Bay. Upon Arrival in Lan Ha Bay, check in at the Overnight Cruise.\xa0 As we sail on the Lan Ha Bay, we visit Dark & Bright Cave (Hang Sang & Toi) - Enjoy free time at the beach or enjoy a view of Lan Ha Bay.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Local Lunch and Local Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nSail on Ha Long Bay – Drive to Hanoi - Guided City Tour of Hanoi - Enjoy Cyclo Tour\nThis morning after breakfast, we visit Luon Cave by boat - enjoy kayaking or wooden boat ride through the cave. Enjoy brunch on board the Cruise\nReturn to Halong Wharf and transfer back to Hanoi.\n(Note: The cruise itinerary can be changed according to weather conditions.)\nUpon arrival, we proceed on the city tour - See Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum from outside. Visit One Pillar Pagoda followed by a cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi. Later enjoy photostop at Hoan Kiem Lake.\nOR\nSail On Lan Ha Bay – Drive to Hanoi - Guided City Tour of Hanoi - Enjoy Cyclo Tour\nThis Morning After Breakfast, Enjoy sunrise photograph and brunch on board the cruise\nReturn to Tuan Chau Harbor and transfer back to Hanoi.\n(Note: The cruise itinerary can be changed according to the cruise / weather conditions.)\nUpon arrival, we proceed on the city tour - See Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum from outside. Visit One Pillar Pagoda followed by a cyclo ride around the Old Quarter of Hanoi. Later enjoy photostop at Hoan Kiem Lake.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Brunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Sen Grand / Army / Grand View or similar in Hanoi'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFly to Da Nang - Visit Cam Thanh Village – Enjoy Basket Boat Ride at Cam Thanh Village - Visit Hoi An Ancient Town - Experience Boat Ride with Lantern Releasing\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to the airport for our flight to Da Nang.\nUpon arrival, transfer from the airport to the hotel for check in. (Standard check in time 1500 hrs).\nLater visit Cam Thanh Village. Enjoy a basket boat ride through the coconut jungle forest. Visit Hoi An ancient town - see the tile-roofed Japanese Bridge, Chinese Assembly halls and ancient houses followed by a boat ride with lantern releasing on the river.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay Excursion to Ba Na Hills - Visit Golden Bridge - Photo Stop at Dragon Bridge\nThis morning after breakfast, we proceed to Ba Na hills. On arrival take a Cable Car to Ba Na hills station. Visit Golden Bridge followed by visit the Old Villas, French Stable, and Tinh Tam Garden. See the Linh Ung Pagoda. Visit Loc Uyen Garden and Quan Am Pavilion. Our next stop will be the Fantasy Park, an amusement park.\nLater this evening proceed for a photo stop at Dragon Bridge.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, International Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFly to Ho Chi Minh – Visit Cu Chi Tunnels - Ride on Water Bus\nThis morning after breakfast, we check out and proceed to the airport for our flight to Ho Chi Minh City.\xa0\nLater visit Cu Chi tunnels – the network of over 200 km tunnels which became legendary when they played a vital role in the War. Later proceed a local water bus ride.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City'}, {'day': 11, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Mekong Delta, Free time at Ben Thanh Market\nThis morning after breakfast, we visit My Tho Village - the homeland of coconut and Unicorn Island. On the way we visit Vinh Trang pagoda, one of the biggest pagodas in the region.\nEnjoy Coconut Water during Boat Ride. Later we visit Ben Thanh Market.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City'}, {'day': 12, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nGuided City Tour of Ho Chi Minh - Visit War Remnants Museum - End of Tour - Fly Back\nThis morning after breakfast, check out and proceed on a guided city tour of Ho Chi Minh - Saigon Central Post Office and Reunification Palace see from outside. Visit War Remnants Museum.\nLater proceed to the Airport. Return home with wonderful memories of your tour.\nNote: Joining Direct / NRI Passengers requested to book flights after 5pm as we need to cover sightseeing on this day. In case of early flight, the sightseeing on this day will be missed.\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. Final Itinerary will be handed over on the day of arrival.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n', '\n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': '\n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n', '2': '\n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'VN', 'countryName': 'Vietnam', 'continentName': 'Asia'}, {'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'ID', 'countryName': 'Indonesia', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 228200.0, 'hotels': ['\n04 Night accommodation at Hotel Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island or similar in Kuta, Bali\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n01 Night accommodation at Golden Cruise / La Regina Royal Cruise /Aqua Legend/ Aqua Elegance or similar in Halong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n01 Night accommodation at Sen Grand Hotel / Army Hotel / Grand View or similar in Hanoi\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Yarra Ocean / Mandila Beach Hotel / Bluesun Hotel\xa0 or similar in Da Nang\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Kim Do Royal Hotel / Ramana Saigon / Muong Thanh or similar in Ho Chi Minh City\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily buffet / packed breakfast (Except Day 1)\n04 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Lunches\n01 International buffet Lunch\n10 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners\xa0\n1 Lunch, 1 Dinner and 1 Brunch onboard Cruise\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch/ IL/D - International Lunch/Dinner / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)\n**Depending on Flight timings Packed Meals (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) will be provided instead of Sitting Meals at Indian / Local Restaurant.\n\xa0\n**Lunches are not included in Bali Portion', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary', '\nVietnam E-visa included in the package.\nIndonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival)\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\nAll foreign nationals and overseas Vietnamese entering with a visa must complete the digital arrival card prior to immigration clearance.\nTravelers can fill out the form by scanning a QR code upon arrival at international airports or, preferably, by completing it in advance online at https://prearrival.immigration.gov.vn/ to save time.\n'], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', '\nAll transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Bali\n\nExperience Bali Swing\nVisit Tanah Lot Floating Temple For Sunset\nEnjoy Water Sports At Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject To Weather Conditions)\xa0\nVisit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance\n\nHanoi\n\nGuided City Tour Of Hanoi\xa0\nPhoto Stop At Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum\nPhoto Stop At One Pillar Pagoda\nExperience Cyclo Tour Ride\nVisit Hoan Kiem Lake\n\n\xa0\nHalong Bay / Lan Ha Bay\n\nOvernight Stay On Ha Long Bay / Lan Ha Bay\nOn Cruise Activities Tai Chi Training, Cooking Classes, Kayaking (Subject To Availability, Cruise Type & Weather Conditions)\n\nDa Nang\n\nVisit Cam Thanh Coconut Village\nEnjoy Basket Boat Ride At Cam Thanh Village\nVisit Hoi An Ancient Town\nEnjoy Boat Ride With Lantern Releasing\nDay Excursion To Bana Hills By Cable Car\nVisit Golden Bridge\nVisit French Gardens\nVisit French Quarters\nVisit St. Denis Church\nVisit Indoor Fantasy Park (Wax Museum Not Included)\nPhoto Stop At Dragon Bridge\n\nHo Chi Minh\n\nGuided City Tour Of Ho Chi Minh\xa0\nPhoto Stop Saigon Central Post Office\nVisit War Remnants Museum\nPhoto Stop At Reunification Palace\nVisit Cu Chi Tunnels\nEnjoy Water Bus Ride (A Local Transport Ride)\nVisit Mekong Delta\n', 'Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '<p>Provision of a Tour Manager is subject to the final operating group size. An accompanying Tour Manager will be provided for groups of 15 or more confirmed passengers. For groups with fewer than 15 passengers, the tour will operate on a Seat in Coach (SIC) / Free independent Tour (FIT) basis, and a Virtual Tour Manager or local representative/assistance will be provided to assist remotely with coordination, guidance, daily briefings, reconfirmations, and on tour support. The Virtual Tour Manager does not accompany the group in person. The company reserves the right to operate the tour without a physical Tour Manager should the final group size be less than 15 passengers. Confirmation of Tour Manager arrangement will be communicated 10-15 days prior to the departure.</p>', 'flightDescription': '<ul>\n<li>Return economy class airfare as per the itinerary.</li>\n<li>Internal airfare for Bali &ndash; Hanoi, Hanoi-Da Nang, Da Nang &ndash; Ho Chi Minh is included for Joining Direct &amp; NRI passengers</li>\n</ul>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn economy class airfare as per the itinerary.\nInternal airfare for Bali – Hanoi, Hanoi- Da Nang, Da Nang – Ho Chi Minh is included for Joining Direct & NRI passengers\xa0\nAccommodation at the hotels specified above or similar.\nVietnam Visa & Airport taxes (Any further increase in the same must be borne by the guest).\nCost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 30 April 2026\nMedical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges.\nMeals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary\nAirport transfers from all airports.\nAll transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\nProfessional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative.\xa0\nIf groups size is less than 15 customers than the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis.\n\n\xa0\nVisa Requirements:\n\nVietnam E-visa included in the package.\nIndonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival)\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\nAll foreign nationals and overseas Vietnamese entering with a visa must complete the digital arrival card prior to immigration clearance.\nTravelers can fill out the form by scanning a QR code upon arrival at international airports or, preferably, by completing it in advance online at https://prearrival.immigration.gov.vn/ to save time.\n', 'exclusions': '\nCompulsory tips for tour guide and driver: USD 5 per person per day\nIndonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival)\nThe cost of deviation, if you want to deviate from the group departure dates will be at an additional cost.\nCity Tax or Tourism Tax\nVisa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable)\nCruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays)\nCost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure.\nCost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 2,50,000.\nApplicable Government Taxes and other service charges.\nThe cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 30 April 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same\nAny increase in the rate of exchange leading to increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure.\nThe tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure.\nThe tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.\nPorterage Facility\nAny other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package.\nAdditional Meals which is not specifically included in the above itinerary.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary.\nCost of Optional Excursions.\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'General Information:\nAll travelers while returning to India should submit a self-declaration form (mandatory) on the online Air Suvidha portal\xa0(www.newdelhiairport.in)\xa0before the scheduled travel, including the last 14 days of travel details. Each passenger shall also submit a declaration with respect to the authenticity of the report and will be liable for criminal prosecution if found otherwise.\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/Bali26789.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/Bali_Swing_Ubud_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/Tanah_Lot_Temple_New_Bali_&53.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/Nusa_Penida_New_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/KeckDanace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HoChiMinh753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HalongBayCruise753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/AdobeStock_296902787_One_Pillar_pagoda_in_Hanoi.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HoiAn753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/GoldenbridgeDanang753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/CuChiTunnels753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/MekongDelta753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014877/itinerary/HoChiMinhCity753.jpg']}, 'score': 8.488001, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013788', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013788', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Explore Bali', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Nusa Penida', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Nusa Penida', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG009597_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 33861, 'packageSummary': "The 'Explore Bali' package is a 7-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Ubud, Kuta, and Nusa Penida. Throughout this tropical journey, travelers will enjoy key activities such as exploring the lush Tegallalang Rice Terraces and sacred monkey forests in Ubud, relaxing on the vibrant, sun-kissed beaches of Kuta, and taking a scenic boat ride to Nusa Penida to marvel at the iconic Kelingking Beach. The itinerary also features cultural temple visits, traditional Balinese dance performances, and opportunities to experience local markets and authentic cuisine.", 'images': ['Bali1.jpg', 'BannanaBoat.jpg', 'NusaPenida753.jpg', 'Nusa_Penida_753.jpg', 'Bali12.jpg', 'Bali7531.jpg', 'bali_shutterstock_521467954.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 33861, 'thumbnailImage': 'ExploreBali267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Durga Puja Special', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013788 is named 'Explore Bali' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kuta, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrival at the Ngurah Rai, Bali International Airport, meet & greet by our local guide who lead you to the parking area to board on vehicle for your transfer to your hotel. It takes about 20 minutes’ drive from airport to your hotel or more depending on the traffic. Upon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel An ideal Bali holiday is incomplete without water sports & what better than the famous Tanjung Benoa beach. This beach best known for its aquatic adventure is located in the Benoa peninsula far away from the hustle & bustle. Please check with our representatives for all the water sports information. Many shacks & restaurants lined up along the beach make sure that your tummy is full & you enjoy the most. Note:- Children below 10 years of age are not permitted to participate in water sports, rafting, swing, spa, or ATV activities. For this age group, only entrance tickets are included; participation in activities is not applicable., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Nusa Penida, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfer from Kuta to Nusa Penida. Full Day West Penida Tour with Local Lunch on Private Basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel A Full day tour to Nusa Penida West Island Tour will give you an experience you will never forget. This is a relatively undeveloped island southeast of the mainland of Bali. Nusa means Island and Penida means priests in Balinese. You won’t find the snazzy beach clubs, organic cafes or trendy restaurants here, but Nusa Penida is still worthy of a visit. It houses some of the most photogenic sights in Bali. In Nusa Penida West Island Tour, we visit 04 Points - Klingking bay, Angel billabong, Broken beach and Crystal Bay., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Nusa Penida, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Nusa Penida Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Day Free to explore the island., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfer from Nusa Penida to Ubud, Followed by Full Day Ubud Kintamani Tour & Sunset Tanah Lot Temple on Private Basis. Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Enroute visit to Kintamani Volcano is a rare opportunity to experience one of Bali’s last remaining active volcanos up close. This is one of the most popular and best day trip in Bali. The tour begins with the sights of a vibrant art village. Here you can meet with the people who keep the techniques of the regions handicrafts alive with a stop at Tohpati village, widely known as the centre of handmade Balinese Batik weaving. Next stop is Celuk village famous for producing high-grade gold and silver handicrafts. Continue trip to Mas Village, one of the many artists villages surrounding Ubud, is the best place on the island to find high-quality Balinese woodcarvings, considered some of the best woodcarvings in the world. Evening enjoy Tanah Lot Temple, locally known as Pura Tanah Lot is probably the most popular and photographed temple on the island, located on the coastal side of Beraban countryside, Kediri sub district and Tabanan Regency. Tanah Lot Temple stands for Earth (Tanah) and Sea (Lot), quite appropriate considering its spectacular setting on top of an impressive rock overlooking the Indian Ocean. This cultural icon is among the seven sea temples located in the coast of Bali and has been contained in Balinese mythology for centuries., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ubud Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Day Free to explore the island., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. EXTENSION NIGHT: PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD Travel Validity: 01 September'2026 – 24 September'2026 2026 / 01 Oct – 25 Mar 2027 Hotels SINGLE TWIN / DOUBLE TRIPLE CHILD WITH BED CHILD NO BED Free Upgrade to 4 Star Atanaya Resort Kuta or Similar NA 18 18 14 10 Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa NA 43 43 35 30 Arsa Santhi Nusa Penida or similar NA 26 26 20 10, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 33861.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n2 Nights\xa0Atanaya\xa0 Resort\xa0or Similar in Kuta\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in Nusa Penida\xa0\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa\xa0in Ubud\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, Daily Breakfast except on Day 01. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Kuta 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Nusa Penida 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Ubud Meet & Greet assistance at the Airport Return Airport & Inter Hotel Transfer on Private basis Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private Basis Full Day Kintamani Volcano Tour with Ubud Village on Private Basis Full Day Nusa Penida tour with Local Lunch on Private Basis Sunset Tanah Lot Temple on Private Basis Sunset Uluwatu Temple tour on private Basis Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Meals as mentioned in the itinerary. Travel Insurance (Valid Till the age of 60 yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person. Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Entrance fees Blackout Dates: Christmas & New year - 15th Dec'2026 to 10th Jan'2027 & 01 Mar 2027 – 11 Mar 2027 Nyepi Day Meals not mentioned in the itinerary. Any tips - for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions. Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc.) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer.. Product Terms and Conditions: The prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer. Terms and Conditions: The upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same. Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TC is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TC would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'ho