el or more depending on the traffic.  Upon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Atanaya Resort or Similar in\xa0Kuta'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nHalf Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private basis\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel\n\xa0\nAn ideal Bali holiday is incomplete without water sports & what better than the famous Tanjung Benoa beach. This beach best known for its aquatic adventure is located in the Benoa peninsula far away from the hustle & bustle. Please check with our representatives for all the water sports information. Many shacks & restaurants lined up along the beach make sure that your tummy is full & you enjoy the most.\n\xa0\nNote:- Children below 10 years of age are not permitted to participate in water sports, rafting, swing, spa, or ATV activities. For this age group, only entrance tickets are included; participation in activities is not applicable.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Atanaya Resort\xa0or Similar in\xa0Kuta'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfer from Kuta to Nusa Penida. Full Day West Penida Tour with Local Lunch on Private Basis\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  A Full day tour to Nusa Penida West Island Tour will give you an experience you will never forget. This is a relatively undeveloped island southeast of the mainland of Bali. Nusa means Island and Penida means priests in Balinese. You won’t find the snazzy beach clubs, organic cafes or trendy restaurants here, but Nusa Penida is still worthy of a visit. It houses some of the most photogenic sights in Bali. In Nusa Penida West Island Tour, we visit 04 Points - Klingking bay, Angel billabong, Broken beach and Crystal Bay.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in\xa0Nusa Penida'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nNusa Penida\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  Day Free to explore the island.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in\xa0Nusa Penida'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfer from Nusa Penida to Ubud, Followed by Full Day Ubud Kintamani Tour & Sunset Tanah Lot Temple on Private Basis.\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel\n\xa0\nEnroute visit to Kintamani Volcano is a rare opportunity to experience one of Bali’s last remaining active volcanos up close. This is one of the most popular and best day trip in Bali. The tour begins with the sights of a vibrant art village. Here you can meet with the people who keep the techniques of the regions handicrafts alive with a stop at Tohpati village, widely known as the centre of handmade Balinese Batik weaving. Next stop is Celuk village famous for producing high-grade gold and silver handicrafts. Continue trip to Mas Village, one of the many artists villages surrounding Ubud, is the best place on the island to find high-quality Balinese woodcarvings, considered some of the best woodcarvings in the world.\n\xa0\nEvening enjoy Tanah Lot Temple, locally known as Pura Tanah Lot is probably the most popular and photographed temple on the island, located on the coastal side of Beraban countryside, Kediri sub district and Tabanan Regency. Tanah Lot Temple stands for Earth (Tanah) and Sea (Lot), quite appropriate considering its spectacular setting on top of an impressive rock overlooking the Indian Ocean. This cultural icon is among the seven sea temples located in the coast of Bali and has been contained in Balinese mythology for centuries.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar in\xa0Ubud'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nUbud\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  Day Free to explore the island.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Bali Masari Villa Ubud\xa0or similar in\xa0Ubud'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nDeparture\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight.\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\nEXTENSION NIGHT:\xa0PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD\nTravel Validity: 01 September'2026 – 24 September'2026 2026 / 01 Oct – 25 Mar 2027\n\n\n\nHotels\nSINGLE\nTWIN / DOUBLE\nTRIPLE\nCHILD WITH BED\nCHILD NO BED\n\n\n\nFree Upgrade to 4 Star Atanaya Resort Kuta\xa0or Similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n18\n\n\n18\n\n\n14\n\n\n10\n\n\n\n\nBali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa\n\n\nNA\n\n\n43\n\n\n43\n\n\n35\n\n\n30\n\n\n\n\nArsa Santhi Nusa Penida or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n26\n\n\n26\n\n\n20\n\n\n10\n\n\n\n\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n2 Nights\xa0Atanaya\xa0 Resort\xa0or Similar in Kuta\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in Nusa Penida\xa0\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa\xa0in Ubud\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n2 Nights\xa0Atanaya\xa0 Resort\xa0or Similar in Kuta\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in Nusa Penida\xa0\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa\xa0in Ubud\n', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'ID', 'countryName': 'Indonesia', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 33900.0, 'hotels': ['\n2 Nights\xa0Atanaya\xa0 Resort\xa0or Similar in Kuta\n2 Nights Hotel\xa0Arsa Santhi or Similar in Nusa Penida\xa0\xa0\n2 Nights\xa0Bali Masari Villa Ubud or similar 01 Bedroom Pool Villa\xa0in Ubud\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', 'Daily Breakfast except on Day 01'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary'], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\nHalf Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private Basis\nFull Day Kintamani Volcano Tour with Ubud Village on Private Basis\nFull Day Nusa Penida tour 