s uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc.)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\n\nBlack out Dates:\xa0 \xa0\n\nChristmas & New Year : 15th December 2026 – 10th January 2027\xa0\nNyepi Day - 09th March'2027\n", 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nDuring Peak Season: Minimum 2 Nights Stay is required\nNo Check Out period on 31 December 2025 and 01 January 2026\nNyepi Day (Silent Day) is on 19 March 2026. No outdoor activity is allowed, and Airport will be closed from 05.59 am 19 March 2026 to 06.00 am 20 March 2026\nCompulsory New Year Dinner will be Applicable according to the Resort\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same.\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/Bali_New_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Kuta.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Bananaboat.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Baliswing_new_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Bali75309.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Gatetheaven7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Seminyak753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/NusaPenida753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012462/itinerary/Bali_Scenic_7531.jpg']}, 'score': 4.1276164, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG012461', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG012461', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Wonderful Bali - Honeymoon Special', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seminyak', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seminyak', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seminyak', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Candlelight Romantic Dinner'], 'pdfName': 'PKG012461_0_20260916215218', 'price': 28822, 'packageSummary': "The 'Wonderful Bali - Honeymoon Special' package is a 5-day tour covering the beautiful destinations of Ubud and Seminyak. The itinerary is specially designed for couples, with the key highlight being an intimate candlelight romantic dinner. Participants will have the opportunity to experience the cultural charm of Ubud and the vibrant beachside atmosphere of Seminyak, creating unforgettable memories on this romantic getaway.", 'images': ['Bali75390.jpg', 'Bananaboat.jpg', 'Baliswing_new_753.jpeg', 'NusaPenida753.jpg', 'Bali7531.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 28822, 'thumbnailImage': 'SRP_NusaPenida.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG012461 is named 'Wonderful Bali - Honeymoon Special' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Ubud, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrival at the Ngurah Rai, Bali International Airport, meet & greet by our local guide who lead you to the parking area to board on vehicle for your transfer to your hotel. Upon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Ubud, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day ATV Quad Bike (1 Hr. Tandem Drive) and Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel For a hard core adventurer or a novice, off-roading is the most appealing word & what better than Quad Biking while in Bali. Ride off the beaten track during your Bali vacation on your own All-Terrain Vehicle (ATV). Follow an experienced guide along a challenging track, suitable for all skill levels. One can also enjoy as a co-pilot if you do not want to do it independently. No driving license required & safety is of utmost priority here. Glide past a picturesque landscape of rice fields, bamboo forest, and lush riverside flanked by traditional Balinese villages. It is an ultimate thrill for a couple of hours, you will just want to keep it going. An ideal Bali holiday is incomplete without water sports & what better than the famous Tanjung Benoa beach. This beach best known for its aquatic adventure is located in the Benoa peninsula far away from the hustle & bustle. North of Nusa Dua this beach offers a wide range of water sports from Parasailing to Banana boat ride & so on. Please check with our representatives for all the water sports information. Many shacks & restaurants lined up along the beach make sure that your tummy is full & you enjoy the most., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Seminyak, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Authentic Balinese Massage (60 Min) + Bali Swing with Photo Shoot (1 Hr) on Private Basis Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel A Bali holiday isn’t complete without an authentic spa experience. Balinese spa treatments are well-known the world over for their healing properties as well as the hospitality by the locals. Refresh your mind, body & soul with a perfect blend of traditional therapeutic remedies & modern-day spa rituals. Enjoy this delightful massage & rejuvenate yourself to the core. Swings in Bali are the most trending activities across all social media platforms. And the experiences definitely justify the popularity. Set in Ubud you must try and enjoy this incredible experience. A professional swing guide, will company you to catch the unforgettable memory. Proper set of instructions will guide you through the equipment & safety standards. Soak in the pleasure of being a free bird, reminiscing through your childhood days., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Seminyak, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Full Day Nusa Penida Tour on SIC Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel A Full day tour to Nusa Penida West Island Tour by Fast Boat will give you an experience you will never forget. Fast Boat transfer is on Sharing Basis. This is a relatively undeveloped island southeast of the mainland of Bali. Nusa means Island and Penida means priests in Balinese. You won’t find the snazzy beach clubs, organic cafes or trendy restaurants here, but Nusa Penida is still worthy of a visit. It houses some of the most photogenic sights in Bali. In Nusa Penida West Island Tour, we visit - Kelingking beach, Angela™s billabong, Broken beach and Crystal Bay., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Seminyak, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight. * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice. EXTENSION NIGHT Travel Validity: 01 Oct'2026 – 24 Mar 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD SINGLE TWIN / DOUBLE TRIPLE CHILD WITH BED CHILD NO BED Standard Champulang Sari Ubud or similar NA 25 NA NA NA Grand Mega Resort or similar NA 15 NA NA NA Deluxe Alam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar NA 55 NA NA NA Cross Paasha Atelier or similar NA 25 NA NA NA Premium Furama Villa Ubud or similar NA 80 NA NA NA Kuta Paradiso or similar NA 40 NA NA NA, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 28822.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\xa0\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nAlam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\nCross Paasha Atelier\xa0or similar\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nFurama Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\nSeminyak\nKuta Paradiso or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Ubud 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Seminyak Return Airport Transfers on Private basis Meet & Greet assistance at the airport Half Day ATV Quad Bike (1 Hr. Tandem Drive) On Private Basis. Half Day Authentic Balinese Massage (60 Min) + Bali Swing with photo Shoot (1 Hr) on Pvt Basis. Full Day Nusa Penida Tour with Local Lunch And Snorkeling Equipment’s On Sic Basis Half Day Water Sports (1xJet Ski & 1xBanana Boat) 01 Time Candlelight Romantic Dinner Complimentary 1xParasailing or 1X Flying Fish during the water sports activities Complimentary welcome gift on arrival Complimentary 01 Floating Breakfast on the 2nd day of stay at the villa Meals as mentioned in the itinerary. Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa Charges Departure PCR test, if 