ility of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: Candlelight Romantic Dinner.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Srinagar', 'cityCode': 'SXR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bagdogra', 'cityCode': 'IXB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Allahabad', 'cityCode': 'IXD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Udaipur', 'cityCode': 'UDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Imphal', 'cityCode': 'IMF', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Wonderful Bali - Honeymoon Special' package is a 5-day tour covering the beautiful destinations of Ubud and Seminyak. The itinerary is specially designed for couples, with the key highlight being an intimate candlelight romantic dinner. Participants will have the opportunity to experience the cultural charm of Ubud and the vibrant beachside atmosphere of Seminyak, creating unforgettable memories on this romantic getaway.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrival at the Ngurah Rai, Bali International Airport, meet & greet by our local guide who lead you to the parking area to board on vehicle for your transfer to your hotel.   Upon arrival at the hotel, directly check in and freshen up.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Champulang Sari\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Alam Puisi Villa\xa0(Value) /\xa0Furama Villa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Ubud (Bali)'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day ATV Quad Bike (1 Hr. Tandem Drive) and Half Day Benoa Beach Tour including Banana Boat on private basis\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel\nFor a hard core adventurer or a novice, off-roading is the most appealing word & what better than Quad Biking while in Bali. Ride off the beaten track during your Bali vacation on your own All-Terrain Vehicle (ATV). Follow an experienced guide along a challenging track, suitable for all skill levels. One can also enjoy as a co-pilot if you do not want to do it independently. No driving license required & safety is of utmost priority here. Glide past a picturesque landscape of rice fields, bamboo forest, and lush riverside flanked by traditional Balinese villages. It is an ultimate thrill for a couple of hours, you will just want to keep it going.\nAn ideal Bali holiday is incomplete without water sports & what better than the famous Tanjung Benoa beach. This beach best known for its aquatic adventure is located in the Benoa peninsula far away from the hustle & bustle. North of Nusa Dua this beach offers a wide range of water sports from Parasailing to Banana boat ride & so on. Please check with our representatives for all the water sports information. Many shacks & restaurants lined up along the beach make sure that your tummy is full & you enjoy the most.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Champulang Sari\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Alam Puisi Villa\xa0(Value) /\xa0Furama Villa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Ubud (Bali)'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day Authentic Balinese Massage (60 Min) + Bali Swing with Photo Shoot (1 Hr) on Private Basis\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  A Bali holiday isn’t complete without an authentic spa experience. Balinese spa treatments are well-known the world over for their healing properties as well as the hospitality by the locals. Refresh your mind, body & soul with a perfect blend of traditional therapeutic remedies & modern-day spa rituals. Enjoy this delightful massage & rejuvenate yourself to the core.\n\xa0\nSwings in Bali are the most trending activities across all social media platforms. And the experiences definitely justify the popularity. Set in Ubud you must try and enjoy this incredible experience. A professional swing guide, will company you to catch the unforgettable memory. Proper set of instructions will guide you through the equipment & safety standards. Soak in the pleasure of being a free bird, reminiscing through your childhood days.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Grand Mega Resort (Standard) /\xa0Cross Paasha Atelier\xa0(Value) /\xa0Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Seminyak (Bali)'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Nusa Penida Tour on SIC\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel \nA Full day tour to Nusa Penida West Island Tour by Fast Boat will give you an experience you will never forget. Fast Boat transfer is on Sharing Basis. This is a relatively undeveloped island southeast of the mainland of Bali. Nusa means Island and Penida means priests in Balinese. You won’t find the snazzy beach clubs, organic cafes or trendy restaurants here, but Nusa Penida is still worthy of a visit. It houses some of the most photogenic sights in Bali. In Nusa Penida West Island Tour, we visit - Kelingking beach, Angela™s billabong, Broken beach and Crystal Bay.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel - Grand Mega Resort (Standard) /\xa0Cross Paasha Atelier\xa0(Value) /\xa0Kuta Paradiso\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Seminyak (Bali)'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nDeparture\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel  Pick up from the hotel to transfer to the Airport according to the scheduled Flight.\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\nEXTENSION NIGHT\nTravel Validity: 01 Oct'2026 – 24 Mar 2027\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY \n\n\nHOTELS\n\n\nPACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD\n\n\n\n\nSINGLE\n\n\nTWIN / DOUBLE\n\n\nTRIPLE\n\n\nCHILD WITH BED\n\n\nCHILD NO BED\n\n\n\n\nStandard\n\n\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar \n\n\nNA\n\n\n25\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n15\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nDeluxe\n\n\nAlam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n55\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nCross Paasha Atelier or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n25\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\nPremium\n\xa0\n\n\nFurama Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\n NA\n\n\n80\n\n\n NA\n\n\n NA\n\n\n NA\n\n\n\n\nKuta Paradiso or similar\n\n\nNA\n\n\n40\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\nNA\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\xa0\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nAlam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\nCross Paasha Atelier\xa0or similar\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nFurama Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\nSeminyak\nKuta Paradiso or similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\xa0\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\n', '1': '\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nAlam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\nCross Paasha Atelier\xa0or similar\n\n\n', '2': '\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nFurama Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\nSeminyak\nKuta Paradiso or similar\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'ID', 'countryName': 'Indonesia', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 28800.0, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nChampulang Sari Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\xa0\nGrand Mega Resort or similar\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 31800.0, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nAlam Puisi Villa Ubud or similar\xa0\n\n\nSeminyak\nCross Paasha Atelier\xa0or similar\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 39500.0, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\nDestinations\nHotel\n\n\nUbud\nFurama Villa Ubud or similar\n\n\nSeminyak\nKuta Paradiso or similar\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', '\nReturn airport transfers on private basis\n'], 'sightseeing': ['\nHalf Day ATV Quad Bike (1 Hr. Tandem Drive) On Private Basis.\xa0\nHalf Day Authentic Balinese Massage (60 Min) + Bali Swing with photo Shoot (1 Hr) on Pvt Basis.\xa0\nFull Day Nusa Penida Tour with Local Lunch And Snorkeling Equipment’s On Sic Basis\xa0\nHalf Day Water Sports (1xJet Ski & 1xBanana Boat)\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Included as per itinerary', 'inclusions': '\n02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Ubud\n02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar Seminyak\nReturn Airport Transfers on Private basis\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\xa0\nHalf Day ATV Quad Bike (1 Hr. Tandem Drive) On Private Basis.\xa0\nHalf Day Authentic Balinese Massage (60 Min) + Bali Swing with photo Shoot (1 Hr) on Pvt Basis.\xa0\nFull Day Nusa Penida Tour with Local Lunch And Snorkeling Equipment’s On Sic Basis\xa0\nHalf Day Water Sports (1xJet Ski & 1xBanana Boat)\xa0\xa0\n01 Time Candlelight Romantic Dinner\nComplimentary 1xParasailing or 1X Flying Fish during the water sports activities\nComplimentary welcome gift on arrival\nComplimentary 01 Floating Breakfast on the 2nd day of stay at the villa\nMeals as mentioned in the itinerary.\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': "\nTCS & GST\nVisa Charges\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nEntrance fees\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary.\nAny tips - for guide & Driver\xa0\nBlackout Dates: Christmas & New year - 15th Dec'2026 to 10th Jan'2027 & 01st Mar 2027 – 11 Mar 2027 Nyepi Day\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions.\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc.)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nVisa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person.\n", 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nThe upgrade hotel prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\xa0\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\xa0\nFor the upgrade hotel, In case the hotel chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nDuring Peak Season: Minimum 2 Nights Stay is required\nNo Check Out period on 31 December 2025 and 01 January 2026\nNyepi Day (Silent Day) is on 19 March 2026. No outdoor activity is allowed, and Airport will be closed from 05.59 am 19 March 2026 to 06.00 am 20 March 2026\nCompulsory New Year Dinner will be Applicable according to the Resort\xa0\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same.\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\xa0\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/SRP_NusaPenida.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Bali75390.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Bananaboat.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Baliswing_new_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/NusaPenida753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012461/itinerary/Bali7531.jpg']}, 'score': 4.1276164, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015271', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015271', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Jakarta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Jakarta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Jakarta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Guaranteed Departure – Minimum 2 Pax Required. Insurance 4 Star Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Dinners What’s More Like – One Souvenir per room Bali Experience Bali Swing Visit Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset Enjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject to Weather Conditions) Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance Jakarta Visit Autograph Tower City Tour Visit Merdeka Square Photostop At National Monument Visit National Museum Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to Operation) Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Free time at Kuta Dua - Jakarta’s Old Town'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 92232, 'packageSummary': "The 'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter' package is a 7-day tour covering the vibrant destinations of Kuta and Jakarta. This exciting itinerary features a Bali Swing experience, a sunset visit to the Tanah Lot Floating Temple, thrilling water sports at Tanjung Benoa including banana boat rides, parasailing, and jet skiing, and a visit to the Uluwatu Temple to watch the traditional Kecak Dance. In Jakarta, participants will enjoy a comprehensive city tour with highlights such as the Autograph Tower, Merdeka Square, the National Monument, the National Museum, the Presidential Palace, the Jakarta Aquarium Safari, and free time to explore Kota Tua. With guaranteed departures for a minimum of two guests, the package also includes 4-star hotel accommodations with breakfast, travel insurance, a complimentary souvenir per room, and specially curated Indian dinners catering to Jain, vegetarian, and non-vegetarian preferences.", 'images': ['Bali7531.jpg', 'BaliSwing.jpg', 'NusaPenida753.jpg', 'KeckDanace.jpg', 'Jakarta.jpg', 'Jakarta753.jpg', 'Bali891.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 92232, 'thumbnailImage': 'SRP BALI.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG015271 is named \'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter\' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kuta, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrival In Bali - Check In Welcome To Bali, Indonesia, One Of The Most Famous Destinations In The World For Holidays And Packages. Upon Arrival At Denpasar Airport, You Will Be Met By Our Representative/ Tour Manager Who Will Assist You For Your Transfer To The Hotel. On Arrival In Bali, You Will Be Greeted By Your Friendly Tour Manager / Local Representative Outside The Baggage Hall Area At The Airport. Transfer To The Hotel & Check-In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs). Rest Of The Day Is At Leisure. NOTE All our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card Joining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Experience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunset TourThis morning after breakfast, proceed for an exciting adventure at Bali Swing and to experience incredible views while swinging. Later proceed to Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset – an ancient Hindu shrine perched on top of an outcrop amidst constantly crashing waves, the temple is simply among Bali not to be missed icons. Overnight in Bali, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Visit Nusa Penida Island This morning after breakfast, Visit Nusa Penida Tour where you’ll visit iconic spots like the stunning Broken Beach - stunning cove features a dramatic archway in the rocky cliffs, creating a picturesque "broken" effect that opens up to the sparkling turquoise ocean below, the awe-inspiring Kelingking Secret Point - with its iconic T-rex shaped cliff, the beach offers stunning panoramic views of turquoise waters crashing against dramatic limestone formations., the natural pool of Angel\'s Billabong - is a stunning natural pool located on the western coast of Nusa Penida. This picturesque spot features crystal-clear turquoise waters that are surrounded by dramatic rocky cliffs. Overnight in Bali., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Kuta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Enjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa – Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance This morning after breakfast, proceed to the Tanjung Benoa near Nusa Dua Bali. Here you will enjoy the water sport activities included in your tour like - Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski. (**Sports Activities subjected to weather conditions) Later proceed for Uluwatu Temple Tour explores Bali\'s iconic 11th-century sea temple perched 70 meters on a sheer cliff. Later this evening enjoy the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’ a stunning Balinese cultural performance set against the backdrop of a dramatic sunset by the Indian Ocean. Overnight in Bali, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Jakarta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Proceed to Jakarta - Check In – Evening visit Autograph Tower This morning after breakfast reach Denpasar Airport for Flight to Jakarta, you will be greeted by your friendly Tour Manager / local representative outside the baggage hall area at the Jakarta airport. On arrival in Jakarta, Transfer to the hotel & check-in. (Standard Check in time after 1500Hrs). Later in the evening visit Autograph Tower Jakarta- to enjoy unforgettable 360-degree views of Jakarta from Indonesia’s Tallest Observatory Deck. More than just a view, visit the Sky Garden a multi-level, semi-outdoor experience where visitors can explore immersive spaces and enjoy thrilling sky-high attractions (Glass Floors, UPswing, UPside, UP High) Overnight in Jakarta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Jakarta, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: City Tour of Jakarta - Merdeka Square, National Museum, Presidential Palace – Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari – Free time at Kuta Tua - Jakarta’s Old Town This morning after breakfast we will explore the Merdeka Square (Independence Square), Photostop at National Monument, Visit National Museum, Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to operation). Later we visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Indonesia\'s largest indoor living planet - where the mysteries of the ocean meet the excitement of a safari adventure. Later in the evening enjoy your free time at Kuta Tua - Jakarta’s Old Town the area is filled with historic buildings, museums, and open spaces that still preserve the atmosphere of old Jakarta. Overnight in Jakarta, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Jakarta, Meals: Breakfast, Description: End Of Tour - Fly Back This Morning After Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour. Note : The Given Itinerary is a tentative itinerary. Itinerary and activities can be rescheduled or substituted based on weather, operational requirements, or unforeseen circumstances, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 92232.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay / Eden\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Memoir / Tara Angkor / Soma Devi\n, \n04 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Bali\n02 Nights’ accommodation at Hotel Santika Premiere Hayam Wuruk / Aston Pluit & Residence or similar in Jakarta\n\n\xa0\nNote : Under unavoidable circumstances, Hotels are subject to change, in such condition substitute hotel of similar category is provided.. Meals include: \nDaily buffet breakfast (Except Day 1)\n06 Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners at Indian restaurant\nNote: Packed meals, if applicable, will be Jain/vegetarian\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner), Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation at the hotels specified above or similar. Internal Airfare for Bali – Jakarta is included for all passengers including Joining Direct / NRI Passengers Cost of the ticket taxes for the above itinerary as of 31 July 2026 Medical insurance for the duration of the tour is included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges. Meals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary Return Airport transfers from all airports. All transfers and excursions inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. Professional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative. If group size is less than 15 customers, the tour will operate on Seat in Coach and FIT basis. For Group Size more than 15 customers there will be English Speaking Guide Assistance and for less than 15 customers there will be Driver cum Guide.. Exclusions: Main Airfare Airport taxes Indonesia visa (To be paid by Guest on arrival) Visa charges for NRI passengers. (If applicable) The cost of deviation, if you want to deviate from the group departure dates will be at an additional cost. City Tax or Tourism Tax Cruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays) Cost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date, in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 2,50,000. Applicable Government Taxes and other service charges. The cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure existing as on 31 July 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same Any increase in the rate of exchange leading to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure. The tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure. The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges. Porterage Facility Any other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package. Additional Meals which are not specifically included in the above itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary. Cost of Optional Excursions.. Product Terms and Conditions: N/A. Highlights of the package: Guaranteed Departure – Minimum 2 Pax Required. Insurance 4 Star Hotels on Bed & Breakfast Basis Specially Curated Indian Jain / Veg / Non-Veg Dinners What’s More Like – One Souvenir per room Bali Experience Bali Swing Visit Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset Enjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa - Banana Boat, Parasailing And Jet Ski (Parasailing Subject to Weather Conditions) Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance Jakarta Visit Autograph Tower City Tour Visit Merdeka Square Photostop At National Monument Visit National Museum Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to Operation) Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Free time at Kuta Dua - Jakarta’s Old Town.', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZBJ560', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Magical Bali with Jakarta - Winter' package is a 7-day tour covering the vibrant destinations of Kuta and Jakarta. This exciting itinerary features a Bali Swing experience, a sunset visit to the Tanah Lot Floating Temple, thrilling water sports at Tanjung Benoa including banana boat rides, parasailing, and jet skiing, and a visit to the Uluwatu Temple to watch the traditional Kecak Dance. In Jakarta, participants will enjoy a comprehensive city tour with highlights such as the Autograph Tower, Merdeka Square, the National Monument, the National Museum, the Presidential Palace, the Jakarta Aquarium Safari, and free time to explore Kota Tua. With guaranteed departures for a minimum of two guests, the package also includes 4-star hotel accommodations with breakfast, travel insurance, a complimentary souvenir per room, and specially curated Indian dinners catering to Jain, vegetarian, and non-vegetarian preferences.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrival In Bali - Check In\nWelcome To Bali, Indonesia, One Of The Most Famous Destinations In The World For Holidays And Packages. Upon Arrival At Denpasar Airport, You Will Be Met By Our Representative/ Tour Manager Who Will Assist You For Your Transfer To The Hotel.\nOn Arrival In Bali, You Will Be Greeted By Your Friendly Tour Manager / Local Representative Outside The Baggage Hall Area At The Airport. Transfer To The Hotel & Check-In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs). Rest Of The Day Is At Leisure.\n\xa0\nNOTE\xa0\n\nAll our guests are advised to activate international calling/data & international credit card\nJoining direct passengers / NRI passengers can check-in on your own at the hotel. The standard check-in time is 1500 hrs.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nExperience Bali Swing - Tanah Lot Sunset TourThis morning after breakfast, proceed for an exciting adventure at Bali Swing and to experience incredible views while swinging.\nLater proceed to Tanah Lot Floating Temple for Sunset – an ancient Hindu shrine perched on top of an outcrop amidst constantly crashing waves, the temple is simply among Bali not to be missed icons.\nOvernight in Bali', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Nusa Penida Island\nThis morning after breakfast, Visit Nusa Penida Tour where you’ll visit iconic spots like the stunning Broken Beach - stunning cove features a dramatic archway in the rocky cliffs, creating a picturesque "broken" effect that opens up to the sparkling turquoise ocean below, the awe-inspiring Kelingking Secret Point - with its iconic T-rex shaped cliff, the beach offers stunning panoramic views of turquoise waters crashing against dramatic limestone formations., the natural pool of Angel\'s Billabong - is a stunning natural pool located on the western coast of Nusa Penida. This picturesque spot features crystal-clear turquoise waters that are surrounded by dramatic rocky cliffs.\xa0\nOvernight in Bali.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa – Visit Uluwatu Temple & Kecak Dance\nThis morning after breakfast, proceed to the Tanjung Benoa near Nusa Dua Bali. Here you will enjoy the water sport activities included in your tour like - Banana boat, Parasailing and Jet Ski.\n(**Sports Activities subjected to weather conditions)\nLater proceed for Uluwatu Temple Tour explores Bali's iconic 11th-century sea temple perched 70 meters on a sheer cliff. Later this evening enjoy the Theatrical Fire Dance Show ‘Kecak Fire Dance’ a stunning Balinese cultural performance set against the backdrop of a dramatic sunset by the Indian Ocean.\nOvernight in Bali", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Harper Kuta Bali / Bliss Surfer Hotel / Sun Island\xa0or similar in Kuta, Bali'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nProceed to Jakarta - Check In – Evening visit Autograph Tower\nThis morning after breakfast reach Denpasar Airport for Flight to Jakarta, you will be greeted by your friendly Tour Manager / local representative outside the baggage hall area at the Jakarta airport.\xa0\nOn arrival in Jakarta, Transfer to the hotel & check-in. (Standard Check in time after 1500Hrs).\xa0\nLater in the evening visit Autograph Tower Jakarta- to enjoy unforgettable 360-degree views of Jakarta from Indonesia’s Tallest Observatory Deck. More than just a view, visit the Sky Garden a multi-level, semi-outdoor experience where visitors can explore immersive spaces and enjoy thrilling sky-high attractions (Glass Floors, UPswing, UPside, UP High)\nOvernight in Jakarta', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Santika Premiere Hayam Wuruk / Aston Pluit & Residence or similar in Jakarta'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nCity Tour of Jakarta - Merdeka Square, National Museum, Presidential Palace – Visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari – Free time at Kuta Tua - Jakarta’s Old Town\xa0\nThis morning after breakfast we will explore the Merdeka Square (Independence Square), Photostop at National Monument, Visit National Museum, Visit Presidential Palace (Subject to operation). Later we visit Jakarta Aquarium Safari Indonesia's largest indoor living planet - where the mysteries of the ocean meet the excitement of a safari adventure. Later in the evening enjoy your free time at Kuta Tua - Jakarta’s Old Town the area is filled with historic buildings, museums, and open spaces that still preserve the atmosphere of old Jakarta.\xa0\nOvernight in Jakarta", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Santika Premiere Hayam Wuruk / Aston Pluit & Residence or similar in Jakarta'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nEnd Of Tour - Fly Back\nThis Morning After Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour.\n\xa0\nNote : The Given Itinerary is a tentative itinerary. Itinerary and activities can be rescheduled or substituted based on weather, operational requirements, or unforeseen circumstances', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n2 nights accommodation in Hanoi with breakfast @ La Casa / Flower Garden\n1 night stay at Halong Bay on board the cruise Glory / Garden / Orchid Trendy Cruise\n3 nights accommodation with breakfast @ Harmony / Bay 