ansportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure.\nThe tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure.\nThe tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.\nPorterage Facility\nAny other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package.\nAdditional Meals which are not specifically included in the above itinerary.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary.\nCost of Optional Excursions.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package does not include flights. You can book flights separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/SRP BALI.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/Bali7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/BaliSwing.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/NusaPenida753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/KeckDanace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/Jakarta.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/Jakarta753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015271/itinerary/Bali891.jpg']}, 'score': 3.7792792, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015557', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015557', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Super Deal Bali on Singapore Airlines – Multiple Hubs', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kuta', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ubud', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['SIGHTSEEINGS: Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Boat, Parasailing) Uluwatu temple Tour Ubud Tour ( Coffee Plantation, Celuk Mass Village) Swing by My Swing Bedugul Tour (Ulun Danu Temple) Tanah Lot Sunset'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 87700, 'packageSummary': "The 'Super Deal Bali on Singapore Airlines – Multiple Hubs' package is a 7-day tour covering the popular Balinese destinations of Ubud and Kuta. The itinerary features thrilling water sports like jet skiing, banana boat rides, and parasailing, as well as cultural highlights including the Uluwatu Temple tour and the Bedugul tour to see the Ulun Danu Temple. Travelers will also enjoy an Ubud tour with visits to a local coffee plantation and Celuk Mass Village, experience the famous Swing by My Swing, and witness a spectacular sunset at the iconic Tanah Lot temple.", 'images': ['Balicity.jpg', 'BaliAdventure.jpg', 'Uluwatu_Temple_753.jpg', 'Bali_1.jpg', 'Bali22.jpg', '47777_Ubud_Green_Rice_Bali753.jpg', 'Bali_Sunset_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 87700, 'thumbnailImage': 'BaliSRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015557 is named 'Super Deal Bali on Singapore Airlines – Multiple Hubs' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kuta, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kuta, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Kuta, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Ubud, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Ubud, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Ubud, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Ubud, Meals: ., Description: ., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 87700.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \nKuta – 4 Nights at Grand Zuri / Kuta Central Park / Famous Hotel Kuta or similar\nUbud –2 Nights at Alam Puisi (One Room Pool Villa) or similar\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\n. Inclusions: Return Airfare (Singapore Airlines) 04 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Kuta 02 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Ubud as per the selected city option Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers on private basis Inter Hotel Transfers Full Day Water sports (Jet Ski, Banana Boat, Parasailing) followed by Uluwatu temple Tour Transfer on PVT basis. Ubud tour with Swing by My Swing, Coffee Plantation, Celuk Mas Village on PVT Basis. Bedugul tour (Ulun Danu Temple) + Tanah Lot sunset. Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 2 adults travelling together at all times. Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges – Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guide & driver. City tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of a personal nature (minibar, refrigerator use, laundry, telephone calls, etc.) Camera fee. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list. Note: In the Premium category for this Bali Product, Kuta stay will be at a 4-star hotel while Ubud stay will be at a 5-star hotel. Visa on arrival charges as applicable (as of 01st October 2023) the charges are approximately USD 35-40 per person.. Product Terms and Conditions: The package price is valid. The rates are valid for a minimum of 2 adults travelling together at all times. Note: In the Premium category for this Bali Product, Kuta stay will be at a 4-star hotel while Ubud stay will be at a 5-star hotel. Hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. Hotel upgrade pricing does not guarantee rooms at the preferred / envisaged hotels. Hotel upgrade rooms remain subject to availability at the time of booking. If the selected upgrade hotel is unavailable, we will provide multiple alternate options of a similar category. The rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade fair periods. Any applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly. Surcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking. Guests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking. All rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & Check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Wherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges. No refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services. All sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or U