2026-10-13 03:58:04,997 - voice_bot.livekit - INFO - Search packages by name response: [{'id': 'PKG012520', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG012520', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Trending Dubai', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012520_0_20260921202247.pdf', 'price': 81299, 'packageSummary': "The 'Trending Dubai' package is a 7-day tour focusing exclusively on the spectacular city of Dubai. The itinerary is packed with exciting activities, including a visit to the observation deck of the iconic Burj Khalifa, a thrilling desert safari complete with dune bashing and a traditional BBQ dinner, and a relaxing dhow cruise along the Dubai Marina. Participants will also enjoy guided city tours showcasing modern marvels like the Museum of the Future and the Dubai Frame, alongside ample time for shopping in the city's world-class malls.", 'images': ['Dhow_Cruise.jpg', 'Burj_Khalifa_1_753.jpg', 'Desert_Safari_Dubai_Adobe_753.jpg', 'Dubai_753.jpg', 'Ferraiworld2.jpg', 'Dubai_Cityview_753.jpg', 'Dubai301.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 81299, 'thumbnailImage': 'DubaiTrending267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Trending Now', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG012520 is named 'Trending Dubai' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Dubai, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrival in Dubai | Standard Marina Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner (SIC Basis) Arrive in Dubai, a city famed for iconic landmarks like Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall, and Palm Jumeirah. After airport pickup, transfer to your hotel and check in. Spend the rest of the day at leisure and get ready to explore this vibrant city. (Standard Check in time after 15:00 Hrs.) Standard Marina Dhow Cruise: - In the evening, set sail on a Marina Dhow Cruise and admire Dubai Marina’s spectacular illuminated skyline. Enjoy scenic waterfront views, a lavish international buffet dinner, and live entertainment, including the mesmerizing traditional Tanura Dance. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour Followed by Burj Khalifa 124 Floor Non-Prime Time + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Half Day City with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor Discover Dubai’s iconic attractions on a half-day city tour, including Palm Jumeirah, Burj Al Arab, Dubai Creek, and the stunning Blue Mosque. Later, visit Burj Khalifa’s 124th-floor observation deck and enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of the city skyline. Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo Discover one of the world's largest suspended aquariums at Dubai Mall, home to thousands of aquatic animals including sharks and rays. Walk through the immersive underwater tunnel and explore fascinating wildlife exhibits across the Underwater Zoo for an unforgettable marine adventure. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Dubai Frame and Standard Desert Safari with Dinner (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Dubai Frame Visit the iconic Dubai Frame, a stunning architectural landmark that connects Dubai’s rich past with its vibrant present. Explore immersive displays and panoramic views that reveal the city’s journey from a fishing village to a global metropolis. Desert Safari with Dinner Experience an unforgettable evening on Desert Safari in Dubai. Feel the thrill of dune bashing across golden sand dunes, then unwind at a traditional Bedouin camp with Arabic coffee and dates. Enjoy captivating Tanoura, belly dancing, and fire shows, followed by a delicious BBQ dinner under the stars. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Museum of the Future - Subject to Availability & The View at the Palm – Non-prime Time (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Museum of the Future Explore the Museum of the Future, an iconic landmark showcasing innovative technologies and immersive experiences. Discover inspiring visions of tomorrow through interactive exhibits that blend science, technology, and human imagination. The View at the Palm Experience spectacular 360-degree views from The View at The Palm. Marvel at Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Marina, the Dubai coastline, and the city’s iconic skyline from a stunning elevated vantage point. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Full Day Abu Dhabi City Tour with Ferrari World (SIC Basis) Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Abu Dhabi City Tour Explore Abu Dhabi’s top attractions, from majestic mosques and cultural landmarks to scenic waterfronts and modern architecture. Experience the perfect blend of heritage, luxury, and contemporary city life in the UAE’s capital. Ferrari World Feel the thrill at Ferrari World Abu Dhabi, home to Formula Rossa, the world’s fastest roller coaster. Enjoy exciting rides, family-friendly attractions, and record-breaking experiences at this iconic Yas Island theme park. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Leisure Day Enjoy Breakfast at the hotel. Day At Leisure. Or enjoy any experience from the optional options. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart from Dubai Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight b