i | Admiral Plaza Hotel BurDubai| Gateway Hotel Bur Dubai | Arabian ParkEdge by Rotana or Similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 May’26 – 25 Aug’26\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\nHOTELS IN DUBAI\n\n\n3* Star\nCitymax Hotel Bur Dubai | Admiral Plaza Hotel Bur Dubai|Gateway Hotel Bur Dubai |Fortune Pearl Hotel Deira | Smana Al Raffa |City Avenue Hotel Deria |\xa0 Arabian Park Edge by Rotana or Similar\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 06 nights stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Dubai. Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Dubai Airport – Dubai Hotel – Dubai Airport Transfers (Private Basis) Arrive at Dubai – Marina Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner (SIC basis) Half Day City Tour followed by Burj Khalifa 124th Floor Non-Prime with Dubai Aquarium + Underwater Zoo (SIC Basis) Dubai Frame (SIC Basis) Museum of the Future (SIC Basis) View at the Palm (Non-Prime) (SIC Basis) Abu Dhabi City Tour with Ferrari World (SIC Basis) Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner (SIC Basis) 5% VAT Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST UAE VISA Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights service Meals that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Any tips for guide & Driver Anything not mentioned in the inclusions. Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of a personal nature (Such as uses of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & Etc) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge BLACK OUT DATES: Diwali (05 Nov-13 Nov) | National Day (02 Dec-05 Dec) | Dubai Air Show (06 Dec -11 Dec) | Christmas & New Year (23 Dec -03 Jan) |Arab Health (23 Jan-29 Jan) Eid Al Fitr (06 Mar -12 Mar) | Gulf Food (13 Mar -20 Mar). Product Terms and Conditions: Terms And Conditions: The upgrade of hotel prices is subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms 