he spectacular city of Dubai. The itinerary is packed with exciting activities, including a visit to the observation deck of the iconic Burj Khalifa, a thrilling desert safari complete with dune bashing and a traditional BBQ dinner, and a relaxing dhow cruise along the Dubai Marina. Participants will also enjoy guided city tours showcasing modern marvels like the Museum of the Future and the Dubai Frame, alongside ample time for shopping in the city's world-class malls.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrival in Dubai | Standard Marina Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner (SIC Basis)\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive in Dubai, a city famed for iconic landmarks like Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall, and Palm Jumeirah. After airport pickup, transfer to your hotel and check in. Spend the rest of the day at leisure and get ready to explore this vibrant city. (Standard Check in time after 15:00 Hrs.)\n\xa0\nStandard Marina Dhow Cruise: - In the evening, set sail on a Marina Dhow Cruise and admire Dubai Marina’s spectacular illuminated skyline. Enjoy scenic waterfront views, a lavish international buffet dinner, and live entertainment, including the mesmerizing traditional Tanura Dance.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0Citymax Bur Dubai (Standard ) / Omega Hotel Bur Dubai (Value ) /\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Diera (Premium) or Similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour Followed by Burj Khalifa 124 Floor Non-Prime Time + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo (SIC Basis)\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nHalf Day City with Burj Khalifa 124th Floor\nDiscover Dubai’s iconic attractions on a half-day city tour, including Palm Jumeirah, Burj Al Arab, Dubai Creek, and the stunning Blue Mosque. Later, visit Burj Khalifa’s 124th-floor observation deck and enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of the city skyline.\n\xa0\nDubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo\nDiscover one of the world's largest suspended aquariums at Dubai Mall, home to thousands of aquatic animals including sharks and rays. Walk through the immersive underwater tunnel and explore fascinating wildlife exhibits across the Underwater Zoo for an unforgettable marine adventure.\xa0\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0Citymax Bur Dubai (Standard ) /\xa0\xa0Omega Hotel Bur Dubai (Value ) /\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Diera (Premium) or Similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDubai Frame and Standard Desert Safari with Dinner (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nDubai Frame\xa0\nVisit the iconic Dubai Frame, a stunning architectural landmark that connects Dubai’s rich past with its vibrant present. Explore immersive displays and panoramic views that reveal the city’s journey from a fishing village to a global metropolis.\n\xa0\nDesert Safari with Dinner\xa0\nExperience an unforgettable evening on Desert Safari in Dubai. Feel the thrill of dune bashing across golden sand dunes, then unwind at a traditional Bedouin camp with Arabic coffee and dates. Enjoy captivating Tanoura, belly dancing, and fire shows, followed by a delicious BBQ dinner under the stars.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0Citymax Bur Dubai (Standard ) /\xa0\xa0Omega Hotel Bur Dubai (Value ) /\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Diera (Premium) or Similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nMuseum of the Future - Subject to Availability & The View at the Palm – Non-prime Time (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nMuseum of the Future\nExplore the Museum of the Future, an iconic landmark showcasing innovative technologies and immersive experiences. Discover inspiring visions of tomorrow through interactive exhibits that blend science, technology, and human imagination.\n\xa0\nThe View at the Palm\xa0\nExperience spectacular 360-degree views from The View at The Palm. Marvel at Palm Jumeirah, Dubai Marina, the Dubai coastline, and the city’s iconic skyline from a stunning elevated vantage point.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0Citymax Bur Dubai (Standard ) /\xa0\xa0Omega Hotel Bur Dubai (Value ) /\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Diera (Premium) or Similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFull Day Abu Dhabi City Tour with Ferrari World (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nAbu Dhabi City Tour\nExplore Abu Dhabi’s top attractions, from majestic mosques and cultural landmarks to scenic waterfronts and modern architecture. Experience the perfect blend of heritage, luxury, and contemporary city life in the UAE’s capital.\n\xa0\nFerrari World\xa0\nFeel the thrill at Ferrari World Abu Dhabi, home to Formula Rossa, the world’s fastest roller coaster. Enjoy exciting rides, family-friendly attractions, and record-breaking experiences at this iconic Yas Island theme park.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0Citymax Bur Dubai (Standard ) /\xa0\xa0Omega Hotel Bur Dubai (Value ) /\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Diera (Premium) or Similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nLeisure Day\xa0\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast at the hotel.\n\xa0\nDay At Leisure. Or enjoy any experience from the optional options.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotels -\xa0Citymax Bur Dubai (Standard ) /\xa0\xa0Omega Hotel Bur Dubai (Value ) /\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Diera (Premium) or Similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart from Dubai\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\xa0\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subject to change without prior notice.\n\xa0\xa0\nExtension Night Package Cost: Per Person In USD \nValidity: - 01st Oct – 01st Nov 2026 | 16th – 28th Nov 2026 | 12th – 19th 