 Hindu Mandir, the UAE's first traditional Hindu stone temple, renowned for its stunning architecture and spiritual significance. (Closed on Mondays). Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart from Dubai Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India. CHILD POLICY Infant: 0-1.99 yrs Child No Bed: 2-5.99 yrs Child With Bed: 6-11.99 yrs A person aged 12 years and below is considered a child, while anyone above 12 years is classified as an adult. EXTENSION NIGHTS Validity: - 01st Oct – 01st Nov 2026 | 16th – 28th Nov 2026 | 12th – 19th Dec 2026| 04th – 18th Jan 2027 | 30th Jan – 01st Mar 2027 CATEGORY HOTELS PACKAGE COST: PER PERSON IN USD SGL TWIN/ DBL TPL CWB CNB Standard Citymax Hotel Bur Dubai | Admiral Plaza | Gateway Hotel Bur Dubai | Fortune Pearl Hotel Deira or Similar 105 55 51 44 20 Value Versallies Hotel by Veiras | Omega Hotel Bur Dubai | Sea View Hotel Bur Dubai | Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai |Arabian Courtyard Hotel & Spa Bur Dubai or similar 150 80 73 64 20 Premium Khalidia Palace Dubai Deira | Park Regis Kris Kin | Canvas Hotel by Mcgallery| Avani Deira Dubai |Crowne Plaza Dubai Deira or Similar 200 105 89 64 25, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 51165.0. Hotels envisaged include: Validity: 05 Jan – 30 Apr 2026 & 01 Sep – 24 Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\nHOTELS IN DUBAI\n\n\n5* Star\nKhalidia Palace Dubai Deir | Avani Deira Dubai |Crowne Plaza Dubai Deira or Similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValidity: 01 May’26 – 25 Aug’26\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\nHOTELS IN DUBAI\n\n\n5* Star\nKhalidia Palace Dubai Deir | Avani Deira Dubai |Crowne Plaza Dubai Deira or Similar\n\n\n, Validity: 05 Jan – 30 Apr 2026 & 01 Sep – 24 Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\nHOTELS IN DUBAI\n\n\n4* Star\nOmega Hotel Bur Dubai | Sea View Hotel Bur Dubai |Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai |Arabian CourtyardHotel & Spa Bur Dubai | Royal AscotHotel Bur Dubai or Similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValidity: 01 May’26 –