ode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Astonishing Dubai With Abu Dhabi' package is a 6-day tour covering the vibrant cities of Dubai and Abu Dhabi. The itinerary includes a variety of exciting activities such as a thrilling desert safari with a barbecue dinner, a traditional dhow cruise, and a visit to the observation deck of the iconic Burj Khalifa. Participants will also enjoy comprehensive guided city tours, exploring major landmarks like the magnificent Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque and the high-speed attractions of Ferrari World.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': "\xa0\nArrive at Dubai - Marina Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner (SIC basis)\nWelcome to Dubai – famous for the record-breaking Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall, and the Palm, its vibrant culture, turbulent history, modern infrastructure, huge aquariums, and indoor ski slopes.\nUpon arrival at the airport, pick up from the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in at the hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)\nLater we visit the Marina Dhow Cruise. Marina Dhow Cruise offers dazzling amazing views of the Dubai cityscape. Take in the lavish architecture of residences, resorts, and shopping facilities, as you feast on a scrumptious fare of international cuisines served in a sophisticated, traditional ambiance. As you dine, you'll enjoy mind-blowing entertainment on-board by dazzling lights that reflect off the water as well as Egyptian Tanura Dance performances.", 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Standard Hotels:\xa0Howard Jonhson / City Max Bur Dubai / Admiral / Fortune Pearl or Similar\xa0in Dubai\nValue Hotels:\xa0LaQuinta / Ramada Plaza Deira Or Similar\xa0in Dubai\nPremium Hotels:\xa0Avani Deira or similar\xa0in Dubai'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour of Dubai (SIC basis), Visit to Burj Khalifa (124th Floor – Non prime time) (Slot subject to availability) with Dubai Aquarium and Underwater Zoo (SIC Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nExplore Dubai by going on a half-day tour around the famous cosmopolitan city. See city's most popular attractions such as the Burj Al Arab Hotel, the Palm Islands, and the Dubai Creek. Marvel at what Dubai has to offer, especially the wonderful interiors and massive library collection of the Blue Mosque. Drop off at Dubai Mall.\nWalk to Burj Khalifa. A visit to Burj Khalifa's observation deck on the 124th and 125th floors is a must-do for every visitor in Dubai. Once at the top, enjoy breathtaking views of Dubai's skyline, desert and ocean through the floor-to-ceiling glass walls. Make sure to use the telescopes provided for close-up real time views of the areas below. Venture outside into the open-air terrace and enjoy a more clear perspective of the sweeping views of Dubai.\nLater we visit Dubai Aquarium and Underwater Zoo. See the true marvels of Dubai with a visit to the city's aquarium and underwater zoo. Dubai Mall is home to one of the world's largest suspended aquariums. The 10-million-liter tank is home to over 300 sharks and rays and boasts the largest collection of tiger sharks in the world.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Standard Hotels:\xa0Howard Jonhson / City Max Bur Dubai / Admiral / Fortune Pearl or Similar\xa0in Dubai\nValue Hotels:\xa0LaQuinta / Ramada Plaza Deira Or Similar\xa0in Dubai\nPremium Hotels:\xa0Avani Deira or similar\xa0in Dubai'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nPremium Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner, Belly dance, Tanoora show and many more activities (SIC Basis)\n\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nLater, in the evening desert safari in Dubai is one of the most memorable experiences that you can have in this vibrant city. After getting picked up at your hotel, head to the sand dunes to experience the dune bashing. Enjoy this exhilarating adventure as you speed up and down the golden sands. As it gets dark, proceed to the Bedouin campsite where you can sip some Arabic coffee and munch on sweet dates. Watch spectacular belly dancing and tanoura dancing performances as well as an awesome fire show. Refuel with a huge BBQ dinner.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Standard Hotels:\xa0Howard Jonhson / City Max Bur Dubai / Admiral / Fortune Pearl or Similar\xa0in Dubai\nValue Hotels:\xa0LaQuinta / Ramada Plaza Deira Or Similar\xa0in Dubai\nPremium Hotels:\xa0Avani Deira or similar\xa0in Dubai'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nDubai – Abu Dhabi City Tour & BAPS Visit\nAfter breakfast proceed to Abu Dhabi\n\xa0\nDiscover the UAE’s capital on an Abu Dhabi city tour starting from Dubai. Begin at the beautiful BAPS Hindu Mandir, then enjoy a scenic drive along the Corniche with views of modern skyscrapers and pristine beaches. Marvel at the majestic Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque. Stop for photos at the iconic Emirates Palace and visit Qasr Al Watan for a unique insight into Arab heritage and governance\nCheck in at the hotel (standard time approx. 1400 hrs.)\nNote: BAPS temple is closed on Mondays', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Standard Hotels:\xa0Ramada Corniche / Hawthrone by Whyndham or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\nValue Hotels:\xa0Ramada Corniche / Downtown Ramada / City Seasons Hamra/ Hawthrone Suites by Whyndham Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\nPremium Hotels:\xa0Crawne Plaza\xa0Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in\xa0Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nAbu Dhabi – Any 2 Park Access Ticket (Shuttle)\nBreakfast at hotel\nYou have an option to choose between Ferrari World 