m Hotels:\xa0Crawne Plaza\xa0Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in\xa0Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDepart from Abu Dhabi\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\nNote: The above itinerary is tentative and subject to change without prior notice', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Standard Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in Howard Jonhson / City Max Bur Dubai / Admiral / Fortune Pearl or Similar\xa0in Dubai\n2 Nights stay in Ramada Corniche / Hawthrone by Whyndham or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\n', 'Premium Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in Avani Deira or similar\xa0in Dubai\n2 Nights stay in Crowne Plaza Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\n', 'Value Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in LaQuinta / Ramada Plaza Deira Or Similar\xa0in Dubai\n2 Nights stay in Ramada Corniche / Downtown Ramada / City Seasons Hamra/ Hawthrone Suites by Whyndham Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Standard Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in Howard Jonhson / City Max Bur Dubai / Admiral / Fortune Pearl or Similar\xa0in Dubai\n2 Nights stay in Ramada Corniche / Hawthrone by Whyndham or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\n', '1': 'Value Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in LaQuinta / Ramada Plaza Deira Or Similar\xa0in Dubai\n2 Nights stay in Ramada Corniche / Downtown Ramada / City Seasons Hamra/ Hawthrone Suites by Whyndham Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\n', '2': 'Premium Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in Avani Deira or similar\xa0in Dubai\n2 Nights stay in Crowne Plaza Abu Dhabi or similar\xa0in Abu Dhabi\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'AE', 'countryName': 'United Arab Emirates', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 74700.0, 'hotels': ['Standard Hotels:\xa0\n\n3 Nights stay in Howard Jonhson / City Max Bur Dubai / Admiral / Fortune Pearl or Similar\xa0in D