h sales staff before booking their onwards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have the right to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice, all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as they will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. We will not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/Ras_Al_Khaimah_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/itinerary/Dhow_Cruise_DXB_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/itinerary/BurjKhalifa_753_New_183371461.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/itinerary/Desert_Safari_753.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/itinerary/Ras_Al_Khaimah_City_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/itinerary/Wadi_Shehah_Ras_Al_Khaimah_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015260/itinerary/Ras-Al-Khaimah-1.jpg']}, 'score': 8.067059, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015265', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015265', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Abu Dhabi And Dubai With Ras Al Khaimah 9N/10D Winter', 'days': 10, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ras Al Khaimah', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ras Al Khaimah', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ras Al Khaimah', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ras Al Khaimah', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG015265_0_20260906113312', 'price': 149911, 'packageSummary': "The 'Abu Dhabi And Dubai With Ras Al Khaimah 9N/10D Winter' package is a 10-day tour covering the vibrant cities of Abu Dhabi, Dubai, and Ras Al Khaimah. Throughout this winter getaway, participants will enjoy guided city tours, visits to iconic landmarks such as the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque and the Burj Khalifa, and a thrilling desert safari complete with a traditional BBQ dinner. The itinerary also offers ample time to experience the scenic beaches and rugged mountain landscapes of Ras Al Khaimah, providing a perfect blend of modern luxury, cultural heritage, and outdoor adventure.", 'images': ['AUHcityscape - 753x430.jpg', 'Abu_dhabi - 753x430.jpg', 'AbudhabiCityscape - 753x430.jpg', 'Dhow_Cruise.jpg', 'Stock_4426_Dubai_Burj_Khalifa753.jpg', 'DesertCamp_753_new.jpg', 'RAKalqawasimcorniche 753 JPG.jpg', 'RAK-AlMarjanIsland- 753x430.jpg', 'rak marjan - 753x430.jpg', 'Jebel_Jais_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 149911, 'thumbnailImage': 'ezgif-898b7307b458683b.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015265 is named 'Abu Dhabi And Dubai With Ras Al Khaimah 9N/10D Winter' and spans 10 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrival in Abu Dhabi Welcome to Abu Dhabi. Upon arrival at the airport, you will be picked up and transferred to your hotel for check in, standard check in time is approximately 1400 hrs. Overnight stay in Abu Dhabi, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour with Grand Mosque.( Shared Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed on a guided tour of Abu Dhabi. Visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque Marvel at the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, a dazzling masterpiece of Islamic architecture. Its white marble domes, intricate carvings, and reflective pools create a serene, awe inspiring atmosphere. Visit Abu Dhabi Corniche Enjoy the scenic Abu Dhabi Corniche, a waterfront stretch with pristine beaches, landscaped parks, and cycling paths. It offers panoramic views of the city skyline and the sparkling Arabian Gulf. Photo-stop Emirates Palace Admire the grandeur of Emirates Palace, a luxurious landmark with golden interiors, lush gardens, and cultural displays. It symbolizes Abu Dhabi’s opulence and world class hospitality. Overnight stay in Abu Dhabi, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day at Leisure Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Day at Leisure to explore Abu Dhabi on your own or choose from the exciting optional excursions. Overnight Stay in Abu Dhabi, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Transfer to Dubai - Standard Marina Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner (Shared Basis) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Transfer to Dubai. you will be picked up and transferred to your hotel for check in, standard check in time is approximately 1400 hrs. Later in the evening, enjoy the Marina Dhow Cruise (Shared basis) Enjoy Marina Dhow Cruise Sail along Dubai Marina’s glittering skyline aboard a traditional dhow. Admire modern architecture, waterfront resorts, and shopping complexes while enjoying onboard entertainment and cultural performances. Relish Buffet Dinner Relish a sumptuous international buffet dinner served in an elegant setting. The meal is complemented by dazzling reflections on the water and live shows, making it a memorable culinary and cultural experience. See Tanura Dance Witness the mesmerizing Tanura Dance, a traditional performance featuring vibrant costumes and spinning movements. This cultural highlight adds authenticity and charm to your evening on the dhow cruise. Overnight stay in Dubai, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day City Tour with Burj Khalifa. Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed on a guided tour of Dubai Photo-stop at Burj Al Arab Hotel Admire the world famous Burj Al Arab, Dubai’s sail shaped luxury hotel. Known for its opulent interiors and striking architecture, it stands as a global symbol of modern design and extravagant hospitality. Drives pass Palm Islands Marvel at the Palm Islands, an engineering wonder shaped like a palm tree. These man made islands host luxury resorts, residences, and entertainment venues, showcasing Dubai’s ambition and creativity. Drive pass Dubai Creek Discover Dubai Creek, the historic waterway that divides the city into Deira and Bur Dubai. Once a hub for pearl diving and trade, it now offers a blend of heritage, bustling souks, and modern attractions. Photo-stop at Jumeirah Mosque renowned for its stunning view. Its intricate design and spiritual ambiance make it a cultural gem and a peaceful retreat in the city. Visit Burj Khalifa Observation Deck Ascend to the 124th floor of the Burj Khalifa for breathtaking views of Dubai’s skyline, desert, and coastline. Floor to ceiling glass panels and telescopes offer close up perspectives of the glittering cityscape. Visit Dubai Aquarium Explore one of the world’s largest indoor aquariums, home to thousands of aquatic creatures. Walk through the immersive tunnel and marvel at sharks, rays, and vibrant tropical fish swimming overhead. Visit Underwater Zoo Encounter fascinating marine species at the Underwater Zoo, from penguins and crocodiles to jellyfish. Interactive exhibits bring you face to face with diverse creatures in a captivating environment. Overnight stay in Dubai, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast and Dinner, Description: Visit Outlet Mall - Expereince Desert Safari (SIC BASIS) Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Later this afternoon expereince the Desert Safari. Shop at Dubai Outlet Mall , a premier destination for discounted luxury and high street brands. With over 200 stores offering fashion, accessories, and lifestyle products, it’s a paradise for bargain hunters and style enthusiasts. Expereince the Desert Safari Embark on an exhilarating desert safari adventure across Dubai’s golden dunes. Experience thrilling dune bashing in 4x4 vehicles, offering an adrenaline packed ride through the vast desert landscape. Enjoy Campsite Relax at a traditional Bedouin campsite where you can sip aromatic Arabic coffee and enjoy sweet dates. The setting offers an authentic glimpse into desert hospitality and Emirati culture. Belly Dancing Be captivated by graceful belly dancing performances under the desert sky. The dancers’ fluid movements and vibrant costumes create a mesmerizing cultural spectacle for guests. Tanoura Dance Watch the hypnotic Tanoura Dance, featuring performers spinning in colorful skirts. This traditional art form symbolizes spiritual devotion and adds cultural depth to the evening’s entertainment. Fire Show Enjoy an awe inspiring fire show where skilled performers manipulate flames with precision. The dazzling display of light and heat adds excitement and drama to the desert safari experience. BBQ Dinner Feast on a hearty BBQ dinner with a wide variety of grilled meats, salads, and desserts. The meal, served under the stars, perfectly complements the evening’s entertainment and desert ambiance. Overnights stay in Dubai, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Ras Al Khaimah, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Drive to Ras Al Khaimah Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel., check-out and drive to Ras Al Khaimah. You will be picked up and transferred to your hotel for check in. standard check in time is approximately 1400 hrs. Drive to Ras Al Khaimah, a scenic emirate known for its rugged mountains, pristine beaches, and cultural heritage. It offers a blend of adventure, relaxation, and history, making it a refreshing escape from Dubai’s bustle. Evening at Leisure to explore and enjoy the resort. Overnight Stay in Ras Al Khaimah, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Ras Al Khaimah, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day at Leisure Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy Marjan Island Resort Spend a leisurely day at Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. Surrounded by pristine beaches and turquoise waters, the resort offers relaxation, luxury amenities, and stunning views, making it an ideal retreat for unwinding. Overnight in Ras Al Khaimah, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Ras Al Khaimah, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day at Leisure Enjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Enjoy Marjan Island Resort Spend a leisurely day at Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. Surrounded by pristine beaches and turquoise waters, the resort offers relaxation, luxury amenities, and stunning views, making it an ideal retreat for unwinding. Overnight in Ras Al Khaimah, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Ras Al Khaimah, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 149911.0. Hotels envisaged include: Travel Validity: 05 Jan – 30 Apr 2026 & 01 Sep – 26 Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel\n\n\nDubai\nOmega Hotel Bur Dubai | Sea View Hotel Bur Dubai | Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai |Arabian Courtyard Hotel & Spa Bur Dubai | Royal Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai or Similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 May’26 – 27 May’26\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel\n\n\nDubai\nVersallies Hotel by Veiras | Omega Hotel Bur Dubai | Sea View Hotel Bur Dubai | Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai |Arabian Courtyard Hotel & Spa Bur Dubai | Ascot hotel Bur Dubai | Royal Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai or Similar\n\n\n, Travel Validity: 05 Jan – 30 Apr 2026 & 01 Sep – 26 Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nDubai\nCitymax Hotel Bur Dubai | Admiral Plaza Hotel Bur Dubai| Gateway Hotel Bur Dubai | Arabian Park Edge by Rotana or Similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 May’26 – 27 May’26\n\n\n\nCity\nHotels\n\n\nDubai\nCitymax Hotel 