'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Abu Dhabi And Dubai With Ras Al Khaimah 9N/10D Winter' package is a 10-day tour covering the vibrant cities of Abu Dhabi, Dubai, and Ras Al Khaimah. Throughout this winter getaway, participants will enjoy guided city tours, visits to iconic landmarks such as the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque and the Burj Khalifa, and a thrilling desert safari complete with a traditional BBQ dinner. The itinerary also offers ample time to experience the scenic beaches and rugged mountain landscapes of Ras Al Khaimah, providing a perfect blend of modern luxury, cultural heritage, and outdoor adventure.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrival in Abu Dhabi\nWelcome to Abu Dhabi. Upon arrival at the airport, you will be picked up and transferred to your hotel for check in, standard check in time is approximately 1400 hrs.\nOvernight stay in Abu Dhabi', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'City Season Al Hamra Abu Dhabi| Ramada Wyndham Abu Dhabi | Ramada Downtown or Similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour with Grand Mosque.( Shared Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed on a guided tour of Abu Dhabi.\nVisit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque Marvel at the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, a dazzling masterpiece of Islamic architecture. Its white marble domes, intricate carvings, and reflective pools create a serene, awe inspiring atmosphere.\nVisit Abu Dhabi Corniche Enjoy the scenic Abu Dhabi Corniche, a waterfront stretch with pristine beaches, landscaped parks, and cycling paths. It offers panoramic views of the city skyline and the sparkling Arabian Gulf.\nPhoto-stop Emirates Palace Admire the grandeur of Emirates Palace, a luxurious landmark with golden interiors, lush gardens, and cultural displays. It symbolizes Abu Dhabi’s opulence and world class hospitality.\nOvernight stay in Abu Dhabi', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'City Season Al Hamra Abu Dhabi| Ramada Wyndham Abu Dhabi | Ramada Downtown or Similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nDay at Leisure\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nDay at Leisure to explore Abu Dhabi on your own or choose from the exciting optional excursions.\nOvernight Stay in Abu Dhabi', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'City Season Al Hamra Abu Dhabi| Ramada Wyndham Abu Dhabi | Ramada Downtown or Similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfer to Dubai -\xa0 Standard Marina Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner (Shared Basis)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nTransfer\xa0 to Dubai. you will be picked up and transferred to your hotel for check in,\xa0standard check in time is approximately 1400 hrs.\nLater in the evening, enjoy the Marina Dhow Cruise (Shared basis)\nEnjoy Marina Dhow Cruise Sail along Dubai Marina’s glittering skyline aboard a traditional dhow. Admire modern architecture, waterfront resorts, and shopping complexes while enjoying onboard entertainment and cultural performances.\nRelish Buffet Dinner Relish a sumptuous international buffet dinner served in an elegant setting. The meal is complemented by dazzling reflections on the water and live shows, making it a memorable culinary and cultural experience.\nSee Tanura Dance Witness the mesmerizing Tanura Dance, a traditional performance featuring vibrant costumes and spinning movements. This cultural highlight adds authenticity and charm to your evening on the dhow cruise.\nOvernight stay in Dubai', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Citymax Hotel Bur Dubai - Standard | Omega Hotel Bur Dubai - Value | Khalidia Palace Dubai Deira - Premium or similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nHalf Day City Tour with Burj Khalifa.\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Proceed on a guided tour of Dubai\nPhoto-stop at Burj Al Arab Hotel Admire the world famous Burj Al Arab, Dubai’s sail shaped luxury hotel. Known for its opulent interiors and striking architecture, it stands as a global symbol of modern design and extravagant hospitality.\nDrives pass Palm Islands Marvel at the Palm Islands, an engineering wonder shaped like a palm tree. These man made islands host luxury resorts, residences, and entertainment venues, showcasing Dubai’s ambition and creativity.\nDrive pass Dubai Creek Discover Dubai Creek, the historic waterway that divides the city into Deira and Bur Dubai. Once a hub for pearl diving and trade, it now offers a blend of heritage, bustling souks, and modern attractions.\nPhoto-stop at Jumeirah Mosque renowned for its stunning view. Its intricate design and spiritual ambiance make it a cultural gem and a peaceful retreat in the city.\nVisit Burj Khalifa Observation Deck Ascend to the 124th floor of the Burj Khalifa for breathtaking views of Dubai’s skyline, desert, and coastline. Floor to ceiling glass panels and telescopes offer close up perspectives of the glittering cityscape.\nVisit Dubai Aquarium Explore one of the world’s largest indoor aquariums, home to thousands of aquatic creatures. Walk through the immersive tunnel and marvel at sharks, rays, and vibrant tropical fish swimming overhead.\nVisit Underwater Zoo Encounter fascinating marine species at the Underwater Zoo, from penguins and crocodiles to jellyfish. Interactive exhibits bring you face to face with diverse creatures in a captivating environment.\nOvernight stay in Dubai', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Citymax Hotel Bur Dubai - Standard | Omega Hotel Bur Dubai - Value | Khalidia Palace Dubai Deira - Premium or similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Outlet Mall - Expereince Desert Safari\xa0 (SIC BASIS)\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel. Later this afternoon expereince the Desert Safari.\n\nShop at\xa0 Dubai Outlet Mall , a premier destination for discounted luxury and high street brands. With over 200 stores offering fashion, accessories, and lifestyle products, it’s a paradise for bargain hunters and style enthusiasts.\nExpereince the Desert Safari Embark on an exhilarating desert safari adventure across Dubai’s golden dunes. Experience thrilling dune bashing in 4x4 vehicles, offering an adrenaline packed ride through the vast desert landscape.\nEnjoy Campsite Relax at a traditional Bedouin campsite where you can sip aromatic Arabic coffee and enjoy sweet dates. The setting offers an authentic glimpse into desert hospitality and Emirati culture.\nBelly Dancing Be captivated by graceful belly dancing performances under the desert sky. The dancers’ fluid movements and vibrant costumes create a mesmerizing cultural spectacle for guests.\nTanoura Dance Watch the hypnotic Tanoura Dance, featuring performers spinning in colorful skirts. This traditional art form symbolizes spiritual devotion and adds cultural depth to the evening’s entertainment.\nFire Show Enjoy an awe inspiring fire show where skilled performers manipulate flames with precision. The dazzling display of light and heat adds excitement and drama to the desert safari experience.\nBBQ Dinner Feast on a hearty BBQ dinner with a wide variety of grilled meats, salads, and desserts. The meal, served under the stars, perfectly complements the evening’s entertainment and desert ambiance.\n\nOvernights stay in Dubai', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Citymax Hotel Bur Dubai - Standard |\xa0Omega Hotel Bur Dubai - Value |\xa0Khalidia Palace Dubai Deira - Premium or similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\xa0\nDrive to Ras Al Khaimah\xa0\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel., check-out and drive to Ras Al Khaimah. You will be picked up and transferred to your hotel for check in. standard check in time is approximately 1400 hrs.\nDrive to Ras Al Khaimah, a scenic emirate known for its rugged mountains, pristine beaches, and cultural heritage. It offers a blend of adventure, relaxation, and history, making it a refreshing escape from Dubai’s bustle.\xa0\nEvening at Leisure to explore and enjoy the resort.\nOvernight Stay in Ras Al Khaimah\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hampton By Hilton Marjan Island | Radisson Resort Ras Al Khaimah Marjan Island |Hilton Garden Inn Ras Al Khaimah Or Similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDay at Leisure\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nEnjoy Marjan Island Resort Spend a leisurely day at Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. Surrounded by pristine beaches and turquoise waters, the resort offers relaxation, luxury amenities, and stunning views, making it an ideal retreat for unwinding.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Ras Al Khaimah', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hampton By Hilton Marjan Island | Radisson Resort Ras Al Khaimah Marjan Island |Hilton Garden Inn Ras Al Khaimah Or Similar'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDay at Leisure\nEnjoy Breakfast in Hotel.\nEnjoy Marjan Island Resort Spend a leisurely day at Marjan Island in Ras Al Khaimah. Surrounded by pristine beaches and turquoise waters, the resort offers relaxation, luxury amenities, and stunning views, making it an ideal retreat for unwinding.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Ras Al Khaimah', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hampton By Hilton Marjan Island | Radisson Resort Ras Al Khaimah Marjan Island |Hilton Garden Inn Ras Al Khaimah Or Similar'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Travel Validity: 05 Jan – 30 Apr 2026 & 01 Sep – 26 Sep 2026\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel\n\n\nDubai\nOmega Hotel Bur Dubai | Sea View Hotel Bur Dubai | Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai |Arabian Courtyard Hotel & Spa Bur Dubai | Royal Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai or Similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\nTravel Validity: 01 May’26 – 27 May’26\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel\n\n\nDubai\nVersallies Hotel by Veiras | Omega Hotel Bur Dubai | Sea View Hotel Bur Dubai | Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai |A