'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Crown Plaza or similar\xa0in Dubai'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit Burj Khalifa -\xa0Guided City Tour Of Dubai - Visit Global Village\nThis morning after buffet breakfast, Visit 124th Floor of Burj Khalifa (non-prime hours). Free time at the Dubai Mall later enjoy Fountain Show. Later proceed for a guided city tour of Dubai along with Photo stop at the Dubai Frame, Museum of the Future, Jumeirah Beach, Jumeirah Mosque & Zabeel Palace. Proceed for Global Village a shopping, dining, and entertainment attraction located on Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. There are four main sections in the Village. These sections consist of events and concerts, carnivals, food, and shopping.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Crown Plaza or similar\xa0in Dubai'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit Dubai Dolphinarium\xa0- Visit Gold Souk - Desert Safari With Dune Bashing & BBQ Dinner\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Dubai Dolphinarium. The Dolphin & Seal Show, the #1 in the UAE.\xa0These interactive extravaganzas showcase the amazing animals' astounding skills.\xa0 Visitors watch in wonder as the dolphins and seals dance, sing, juggle, play ball, jump through hoops and even paint.\xa0Free time for shopping at Gold Souk & Spice Souk.\nLater This Afternoon Proceed For Desert Safari To Enjoy The Thrilling Dune Bashing On A Desert Safari Adventure Exploring The Massive Sand Dunes Of The Arabian Deserts. Enjoy Bbq Dinner And The Belly Dancing Performance At The Desert Camp.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Crown Plaza or similar\xa0in Dubai'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nProceed To Abu Dhabi - Visit Team Lab - Guided City Tour Of Abu Dhabi - Photostop At Grand Mosque -\xa0 Entrance To Ferrari World /\xa0 Warner Bros / Sea World (Any 1 Park)\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Abu Dhabi. Visit Team Lab - An Digital Museum That Collaborates\xa0 The Confluence Of Art, Science, Technology, And The Natural World. Later We Proceed On A Guided City Tour Of Abu Dhabi City Tour Along-With A Photo Stop At The Grand Mosque. Later This Afternoon We Proceed To Yas Island - Our Guest Have A Choice To Visit Ferrari World Or Warner Bros Or Sea World (1 Park Entry Included).\n\xa0\nNote:\nPhoto stop means NO Entry inside the attraction.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Dusit Thani or similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Swami Narayan Temple. Entrance to Ferrari World / Warner Bros / Sea World (Any 1 park)\nThis Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit The Baps Hindu Mandir - A Traditional Hindu Mandir Built By The Baps Swaminarayan Sanstha. This Is The First Traditional Hindu Mandir In Abu Dhabi. Later This Afternoon We Proceed To Yas Island - Our Guest Have A Choice To Visit Ferrari World Or Warner Bros Or Sea World (1 Park Entry Included).\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\xa0Hotel Dusit Thani or similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Snow Abu Dhabai – Visit Qasr Al Watan\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Snow Abu Dhabi. Later In Evening We Proceed To Visit Qasr Al Watan - An Imposing Royal Palace In Abu Dhabi, It Is A Unique Testament To The Spirit Of The United Arab Emirates' People And Its Leaders.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Dusit Thani or similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nEnd Of Tour - Fly Back\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nNote: On few days there will be a coach merger with other Dubai product's (if required)\nNote : The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', 'Valid Till March 2026\n\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Crown Plaza or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Dusit Thani /\xa0Le Royal Meridien\xa0or similar or similar in Abu Dhabi\n\n\xa0\nValid From Apr 2026 To Sept 2026\n\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Crown Plaza or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Dusit Thani or similar or similar in Abu Dhabi\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': 'Valid Till March 2026\n\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Crown Plaza or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Dusit Thani /\xa0Le Royal Meridien\xa0or similar or similar in Abu Dhabi\n\n\xa0\nValid From Apr 2026 To Sept 2026\n\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Crown Plaza or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Dusit Thani or similar or similar in Abu Dhabi\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'AE', 'countryName': 'United Arab Emirates', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Premium', 'price': 165600.0, 'hotels': ['Valid Till March 2026\n\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Crown Plaza or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Dusit Thani /\xa0Le Royal Meridien\xa0or similar or similar in Abu Dhabi\n\n\xa0\nValid From Apr 2026 To Sept 2026\n\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Crown Plaza or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Dusit Thani or similar or similar in Abu Dhabi\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily American buffet breakfast. (Except Day 1)\n02 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Lunches\xa0\n02 Lunch Coupon ( At Park visit in Abu Dhabi)\n01 Lunch Coupon ( At Snow Abu Dhabi)\n01 Local BBQ Buffet dinner at Desert Safari\n05 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners\xa0\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': ['\nSingle-entry UAE visa.\n', '\nUAE Visa included (E-visa)\n'], 'transfer': ['\nAs per itinerary\n', '\nAll transfers and excursions are inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach\n'], 'sightseeing': ['As per itinerary', 'Dubai:\n\nGuided City tour of Dubai\xa0\nVisit Gold & Spice Souk\nVisit Burj Khalifa 124th floor (non-prime slot)\nVisit Global Village\xa0(Valid till March 2026)\nEnjoy Fountain Show (Valid from Apr 2026 to Sept 2026)\nVisit Dubai Dolphinarium\nExperience the Desert Safari with Dune bashing & BBQ\xa0\nExperience a Limousine Ride (60 minutes)\n\n\xa0\nAbu Dhabi:\n\nVisit Team Lab\nGuided City tour of Abu Dhabi\nPhoto stop at the Sheikh Zayed Mosque, Grand Mosque\nVisit Swami Narayan Temple\nVisit\xa0Ferrari World or Warner Bros Studio or Sea World\xa0\n(Guests will be offered a 2 Day 2 Park Ticket with access to any of the 2 theme parks )\nVisit Snow Abu Dhabi\nVisit Qasr Al Watan\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '<p>Provision of a Tour Manager is subject to the final operating group size. An accompanying Tour Manager will be provided for groups of 20 or more confirmed passengers. For groups with fewer than 20 passengers, the tour will operate on a Seat in Coach (SIC) / Free independent Tour (FIT) basis, and a Virtual Tour Manager or local representative/assistance will be provided to assist remotely with coordination, guidance, daily briefings, reconfirmations, and on tour support. The Virtual Tour Manager does not accompany the group in person. The company reserves the right to operate the tour without a physical Tour Manager should the final group size be less than 20 passengers. Confirmation of Tour Manager arrangement will be communicated 10-15 days prior to the departure.</p>', 'flightDescription': '<ul>\n<li>Return Economy Class Airfare Included</li>\n</ul>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.\nAccommodation at the hotels specified above or similar.\nAll local taxes including services taxes as of 1st August 2026.\nCost of Visa & Travel Insurance for the duration of the tour.\nSightseeing, accommodation & services as per the above-mentioned itinerary.\nAll transfers and excursions are inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\nProfessional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative. If the group size is less than 15 customers, then the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis.\nTourism Dirham Fees + 5% VAT\n\n\xa0\nVisa Requirements\n\nUAE Visa included (E-visa)\nCost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 1st August 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.\n', 'exclusions': '\nIf you wish to travel in advance i.e. before the published departure date as mentioned in the brochure or like to come back on a later date after the tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable (subject to availability of seats for the given dates & ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff / travel agent. Kindly note, the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days prior to departure date.\nCost of Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 2,50,000.\nAny increase in the airfare charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st August 2026)\nApplicable Government Taxes and other service charges.\nThe tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.\nPorterage Facility\nAny other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package.\nAdditional Meals which is not specifically included in the above itinerary.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary.\nCost of Optional Excursions.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nGeneral Information:\n\nAll travelers while returning to India should submit a self-declaration form (mandatory) on the online Air Suvidha portal\xa0(www.newdelhiairport.in)\xa0before the scheduled travel, including the last 14 days of travel details. Each passenger shall also submit a declaration with respect to the authenticity of the report and will be liable for criminal prosecution if found otherwise.\n\nIf tour is operated on FIT basis (Less than 10 passengers); FIT supplement applicable will as follows:\n\n\n\n\nBelow Slabs\xa0are\xa0Based\xa0on the Number\xa0of\xa0Adults Traveling\xa0Together:(Cost is Per Person In USD)\n\n\n\nSlab\nPer Adult\nPer Child\n\n\n2-3 PAX\n390\n315\n\n\n4 PAX\n150\n120\n\n\n5-9 PAX\n85\n70\n\n\n\n\xa0\nNote:\n\nSurcharges may be applicable on few of the above departure dates. Please contact your local travel agent for information on Surcharge dates and prices.\n\nImportant Note:\nAirline and Airfare:\n\nThe airfare is based on the fare structure existing as on 1st February 2022. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers.\nPassengers missing flights - In such cases the entire ticket/booking gets a no show and stands canceled. A new return ticket needs to be purchased by the passengers.\nFor prices and departure dates from your hub city please contact our local sales offices/travel agents.\nThe cost of Travel to Hub City is not a part of the package\n\nHotels:\n\nThis Package doesn’t offer city center hotels. Hotels will be located in the airport area or on the outskirts.\nAs a 3rd person in a triple room, most hotels offer rollaway beds and room size will be the same as a double room.\nFor Child with bed: At times hotel don’t have enough roll-away beds, in that case they might give a double and a separate single room\nA person 12 years and below is considered child and above 12 years, an adult\nDue to international events and trade fairs you may have to stay in hotels further away from the city.\nAny damages caused to the hotel rooms / Coach during the stay shall be payable by the passengers.\nWe also reserve the right to substitute a hotel of similar class if it is deemed advisable or necessary\nHotels in certain cities are not offering buffet breakfasts due to health regulations. If the same does not change by the time the tours operate, we will organize breakfasts at Indian / local restaurants.\n\nCoaches:\n\nCoaches are an important part of your journeys and we request our guests to keep the coach clean.\nDue to hygiene factors it is not permitted to use toilets in the coach. However the tour manager will make comfort stops during long drives\nEating & drinking is not permitted in the coach.\nDue to limited boot space in the coach we suggest you to carry one check-in bag & one hand bag per person only\nDue to parking regulations and designated drop off & pick up points it is not possible to stop at all the places during the city tour. Tour Manager will try his/her best to stop coach wherever possible for a photo stop.\nCoaches do not have a wheelchair access. There are steps to board / alight from the coach.\nCoaches are forbidden inside most of the historic city centers; to preserve them from damage caused by pollution and getting overcrowded. Most of your sightseeing will be done by local buses and by foot in the historic and heritage centers.\n\nMeals:\n\nAll Meals are pre–set.\nPacked lunches will be provided on certain days.\n\nSightseeings:\n\nDue to logistical reasons certain departures may have amendments or reverse the itinerary. However, all the services / inclusions will remain the same.\nGenerally, you will have to walk at sightseeing places, amusement parks and at the airports sometimes for a long distance; however the same will be timely instructed by the Tour Manager. It is advisable to carry good pair of comfortable sports shoes. The tour manager and the driver will do their best to get you as close to the monuments as possible.\nEvery Site / Monuments has its own set of rules and regulations. We need to respect this and ensure that we follow the same.\nAll our visits are booked in advance to avoid delays,at the same time there may be delays caused due to over crowding ,local regulations ,security check etc.\n\nGeneral:\n\nOn some occasions you may have to join another group in case the group does not have adequate number of members.\nA local representative or a driver may only be there to assist you during the your initial part of you tour.\nSecurity alerts and unforseen closures may affect the itinerary.\nPlease take extra care of your personal belongings while on the tour, every country you travel to is prone to thefts and bag snatching. Thomas Cook I Limited will not be liable for any loss of belongings / baggage.\nDisabled clients shall carry their own wheelchair & be accompanied by a qualified companion who is able to provide assistance to the disabled client per their regular/routine requirements.\nThomas Cook I Limited shall not accept any liability or responsibility for any damages, loss, baggage loss, theft, injury, accident, death, breakdown or irregularity, which may occur in carrying out the tour arrangement, weather conditions, strikes, war, quarantine and any other cause whatsoever and all such loss or expense must be borne by the passengers alone. Insurance policies must be carried along all throughout while on tour.\nNormal insurance charges for the duration of the tour are included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges.\nThe management reserves the right to claim any additional expenses incurred due to delay or changes in schedules of train, airplane, bus, ship or other services.\nThe Tour Manager and the company reserves the right to amend the itinerary, alter, vary or withdraw any particular departure, excursion advertised. For the convenience of our passengers, we may at times amend the itinerary to suit prevalent conditions & at the same time attain optimum utilization of the tour.All the services as per itinerary shall remain the same as it is during such amends.\nThere are no refunds for any services i.e. meals, sightseeing etc. not utilized on your tour\nIn case you decide to change the date of your return reservation once confirmed the exact amount payable to the airline will be advised once the same is confirmed.\nThe images used in this brochure are for representation purpose only.\nTours operated are subject to RBI / GOI regulations. Part of the tour cost will be paid in USD EURO / CHF out of your BTQ at prevailing rate of exchange at the relevant time. • Please refer to the Booking Form for detailed “Terms and Conditions”.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/119979_Abu_Dhabi_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/47954_Dubai_Marina_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/BurjKhalifa_753_New_183371461.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/DubaiDesertSafari753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/28674_Abu_Dhabi_sheikh_zayed_grand_mosque_UAE_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/AbuDhabiwithFerrariWorld753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/AbuDhabi7534.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015294/itinerary/Abu_Dhabi_753.jpg']}, 'score': 4.8906116, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015283', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015283', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Arabian Dhamaka - Winter', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubai', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Abu Dhabi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Ice Cream during City tour or Dolphin Aquarium Dubai Memories - An Exclusive Souvenir Box (1 box per family) DUBAI Experience a Limousine Ride Visit Burj Khalifa 124th floor (non-prime slot) Guided City tour of Dubai Visit Global Village Visit Dolphin Aquarium Experience the Desert Safari with Dune bashing & BBQ ABU DHABI Visit Team Lab Guided City tour of Abu Dhabi Photo stop at the Sheikh Zayed Mosque, Grand Mosque Visit Swami Narayan Temple Visit Ferrai World or Warner Bros Studio or Sea World (Guests will be offered a 2 Day 2 Park Ticket with access to any of the 2 theme parks) Visit Snow Abu Dhabi Visit Qasr Al Watan'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 151776, 'packageSummary': "The 'Arabian Dhamaka - Winter' package is a 7-day tour covering the spectacular cities of Dubai and Abu Dhabi. The itinerary is packed with exciting activities, including a guided city tour of Dubai with ice cream, a luxurious limousine ride, a visit to the 124th floor of the Burj Khalifa, and trips to the Dolphin Aquarium and Global Village, plus an exclusive Dubai Memories souvenir box for each family. Guests will also experience a thrilling desert safari with dune bashing and a barbecue dinner. In Abu Dhabi, the tour features a guided city tour, a visit to Team Lab, a photo stop at the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, and visits to the Swami Narayan Temple and Qasr Al Watan. To top it off, travelers will enjoy Snow Abu Dhabi and a 2-day, 2-park ticket offering access to any two theme parks among Ferrari World, Warner Bros. Studio, and Sea World.", 'images': ['47954_Dubai_Marina_753.jpg', 'BurjKhalifa_753_New_183371461.jpg', 'DubaiDesertSafari753.jpg', '28674_Abu_Dhabi_sheikh_zayed_grand_mosque_UAE_753.jpg', 'AbuDhabiwithFerrariWorld753.jpg', 'AbuDhabi7534.jpg', 'Abu_Dhabi_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 151776, 'thumbnailImage': 'Dubai26798.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015283 is named 'Arabian Dhamaka - Winter' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Dubai, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrival In Dubai - Check In – Enjoy Limousine Ride Welcome To United Arab Emirates. On Arrival In Dubai, You Will Be Greeted By Your Friendly Tour Manager / Local Representative Outside The Baggage Hall Area At The Airport. Transfer To The Hotel & Check-In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs). Later Enjoy One-Hour Limousine Ride, Sit Back In The Most Comfortable And Luxurious Stretch Limousine And Explore The Night City View. Note All Our Guests Are Advised To Activate International Calling/Data & International Credit Card Joining Direct Passengers / Nri Passengers Can Check-In On Your Own At The Hotel. The Standard Check-In Time Is 1500 Hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: VISIT BURJ KHALIFA - GUIDED CITY TOUR OF DUBAI – GLOBAL VILLAGE This morning after buffet breakfast, Visit 124th Floor of Burj Khalifa (non-prime hours). Free time at the Dubai Mall later enjoy Fountain Show. Later proceed for a guided city tour of Dubai along with Photo stop at the Dubai Frame, Museum of the Future, Jumeirah Beach, Jumeirah Mosque & Zabeel Palace. Proceed for Global Village a shopping, dining, and entertainment attraction located on Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. There are four main sections in the Village. These sections consist of events and concerts, carnivals, food, and shopping. Overnight in Dubai., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Dubai, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Visit Dubai Dolphinarium – Visit Gold Souk - Desert Safari With Dune Bashing & BBQ Dinner This morning after buffet breakfast, proceed to visit Dubai Dolphinarium. The Dolphin & Seal Show, the #1 in the UAE. These interactive extravaganzas showcase the amazing animals' astounding skills. Visitors watch in wonder as the dolphins and seals dance, sing, juggle, play ball, jump through hoops and even paint. Free time for shopping at Gold Souk & Spice Souk. Later this afternoon proceed for Desert Safari to enjoy the thrilling dune bashing on a desert safari adventure exploring the massive sand dunes of the Arabian deserts. Enjoy BBQ Dinner and the belly dancing performance at the Desert Camp., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner, Description: Proceed To Abu Dhabi - Visit Team Lab - Guided City Tour Of Abu Dhabi - Photostop At Grand Mosque - Entrance To Ferrari World / Warner Bros / Sea World (Any 1 Park) This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Abu Dhabi. Visit Team Lab - An Digital Museum That Collaborates The Confluence Of Art, Science, Technology, And The Natural World. Later We Proceed On A Guided City Tour Of Abu Dhabi City Tour Along-With A Photo Stop At The Grand Mosque. Later This Afternoon We Proceed To Yas Island - Our Guest Have A Choice To Visit Ferrari World Or Warner Bros Or Sea World (1 Park Entry Included). Note: Photo stop means NO Entry inside the attraction., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner, Description: Visit Swami Narayan Temple. Entrance To Ferrari World / Warner Bros / Sea World (Any 1 Park) This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit The Baps Hindu Mandir - A Traditional Hindu Mandir Built By The Baps Swaminarayan Sanstha. This Is The First Traditional Hindu Mandir In Abu Dhabi. Later This Afternoon We Proceed To Yas Island - Our Guest Have A Choice To Visit Ferrari World Or Warner Bros Or Sea World (1 Park Entry Included)., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner, Description: Visit Snow Abu Dhabi – Visit Qasr Al Watan This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Snow Abu Dhabi. Later In Evening We Proceed To Visit Qasr Al Watan - An Imposing Royal Palace In Abu Dhabi, It Is A Unique Testament To The Spirit Of The United Arab Emirates' People And Its Leaders., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Abu Dhabi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: End Of Tour - Fly Back This Morning After Buffet Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour. Note: On few days there will be a coach merger with other Dubai product's (if required) Note : The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 151776.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n03 nights accommodation at Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi\n, \n03 nights accommodation at Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai Free upgrade to 5* Hotel Crown Plaza\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi\n. Meals include: \nDaily American buffet breakfast. (Except Day 1)\n02 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Lunches\xa0\n02 Lunch Coupon ( At Park visit in Abu Dhabi)\n01 Lunch Coupon ( At Snow Abu Dhabi)\n01 Local BBQ Buffet dinner at Desert Safari\n05 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners\xa0\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner)\n, \nDaily American buffet breakfast. (Except Day 1)\n02 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Lunches\xa0\n02 Lunch Coupon ( At Park visit in Abu Dhabi)\n01 Lunch Coupon ( At Snow Abu Dhabi)\n01 Local BBQ Buffet dinner at Desert Safari\n05 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non - Vegetarian Dinners\xa0\n\n(B–Breakfast / PB-Packed Breakfast / BR – Brunch / L-Lunch / LL–Local Lunch / LC-Lunch coupon / PL–Packed Lunch / D-Dinner / LD-Local Dinner / PD – Packed Dinner). Inclusions: Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary. Accommodation at the hotels specified above or similar. All local taxes including services taxes as of 1st August2026. Cost of Visa & Travel Insurance for the duration of the tour. Sightseeing, accommodation & services as per the above-mentioned itinerary. All transfers and excursions are inclusive of entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. Professional services of a friendly and multilingual Tour Manager (Subject to minimum 20 customers) or a local Representative. If the group size is less than 15 customers then the tour will operate on Seat in Coach basis. Tourism Dirham Fees + 5% VAT Visa Requirements UAE Visa included (E-visa) Cost of visas including documentation and processing fees as of 1st August 2026. Any further increase in the same must be borne by the passengers.. Exclusions: If you wish to travel in advance i.e. before the published departure date as mentioned in the brochure or like to come back on a later date after the tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable (subject to availability of seats for the given dates & ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff / travel agent. Kindly note, the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days prior to departure date. Cost of Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 2,50,000. Any increase in the airfare charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st August 2026) Applicable Government Taxes and other service charges. The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges. Porterage Facility Any other expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, mini-bar, mineral water, telephone charges, foods and beverages that are not included as a part of the package. Additional Meals which is not specifically included in the above itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the above itinerary. Cost of Optional Excursions.. Product Terms and Conditions: General Info Currency Used : UAE : UAE Dirham Time Difference: UAE : 1 hours and 30 minutes behind IST Important Note: AIRLINE AND AIRFARE The airfare is based on the fare structure existing as on 1st August 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers. Passengers missing flights - In such cases the entire ticket/booking gets a no show and stands canceled. A new return ticket needs to be purchased by the passengers. For prices and departure dates from your hub city please contact our local sales offices/travel agents. Cost of Travel to Hub City is not a part of the package. HOTELS This Package doesn’t offer city center hotels. Hotels will be in the airport area or on the outskirts. As a 3rd person in a triple room, most hotels offer roll-away beds and the room size will be the same as double room. 04 guest in one room are not allowed For Child with bed: At times hotel don’t have enough roll-away beds, in that case they might give a double and a separate single room. A person 12 years and below is considered a child and above 12 years, an adult. Due to international events and trade fairs, you may have to stay in hotels further away from the city. Any damages caused to the hotel rooms / Coach during the stay shall be payable by the passengers. We also reserve the right to substitute a hotel of similar class if it is deemed advisable or necessary. Hotels in certain cities are not offering buffet breakfasts due to health regulations. If the same does not change by the time the tours operate, we will organize breakfasts at Indian / local restaurant. COACHES Coaches are an important part of your journeys, and we request our guests to keep the coach clean. Due to hygiene factors, it is not permitted to use toilets in the coach. However, the tour manager will make comfort stops during long drives. Eating & drinking is not permitted in the coach. Due to limited boot space in the coach we suggest you to carry one check-in bag & one hand bag per person only Due to parking regulations and designated drop-off & pick up points it is not possible to stop at all the places during the city tour. Tour Manager will try his/her best to stop coach wherever possible for a photo stop. Coaches do not have wheelchair access. There are steps to board / alight from the coach. Coaches are forbidden inside most of the historic city centers; to preserve them from damage caused by pollution and getting overcrowded. Most of your sightseeing will be done by local buses and by foot in the historic and heritage centers. MEALS All Meals are pre–set. Packed lunches will be provided on certain days. SIGHTSEEING Due to logistical reasons certain departures may have amendments or reverse the itinerary. However, all the services / inclusions will remain the same. Generally, you will have to walk at sightseeing places, amusement parks and at the airports sometimes for a long distance; however, the same will be timely instructed by the Tour Manager. It is advisable to carry a good pair of comfortable sports shoes. The tour manager and the driver will do their best to get you as close to the monuments as possible. Every Site / Monuments has its own set of rules and regulations. We need to respect this and ensure that we follow the same. All our visits are booked in advance to avoid delays, at the same time there may be delays caused due to overcrowding, local regulations, security check etc. GENERAL On some occasions you may have to join another group in case the group does not have adequate number of members. A local representative or a driver may only be there to assist you during the initial part of your tour. Security alerts and unforeseen closures may affect the itinerary. Please take extra care of your personal belongings while on the tour, every country you travel to is prone to thefts and bag snatching. THOMAS COOK will not be liable for any loss of belongings / baggage. Disabled clients shall carry their own wheelchair & be accompanied by a qualified companion who is able to provide assistance to the disabled client per their regular/routine requirements. THOMAS COOK shall not accept any liability or responsibility for any damages, loss, baggage loss, theft, injury, accident, death, breakdown or irregularity, which may occur in carrying out the tour arrangement, weather conditions, strikes, war, quarantine and any other cause whatsoever and all such loss or expense must be borne by the passengers alone. Insurance policies must be carried along all throughout while on tour. Normal insurance charges for the duration of the tour are included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges. The management reserves the right to claim any additional expenses incurred due to delay or changes in schedules of train, airplane, bus, ship or other services. The Tour Manager and the company reserves the right to amend the itinerary, alter, vary or withdraw any particular departure, excursion advertised. For the convenience of our passengers, we may at times amend the itinerary to suit prevalent conditions & at the same time attain optimum utilization of the tour. All the services as per itinerary shall remain the same as it is during such amends. There are no refunds for any services i.e. meals, sightseeing etc. not utilized on your tour In case you decide to change the date of your return reservation once confirmed the exact amount payable to the airline will be advised once the same is confirmed. The images used in this brochure are for representation purpose only. Tours operated are subject to RBI / GOI regulations. Part of the tour cost will be paid in USD EURO / CHF out of your BTQ at prevailing rate of exchange at the relevant time. Please refer to the Booking Form for detailed “Terms and Conditions”.. Highlights of the package: Ice Cream during City tour or Dolphin Aquarium Dubai Memories - An Exclusive Souvenir Box (1 box per family) DUBAI Experience a Limousine Ride Visit Burj Khalifa 124th floor (non-prime slot) Guided City tour of Dubai Visit Global Village Visit Dolphin Aquarium Experience the Desert Safari with Dune bashing & BBQ ABU DHABI Visit Team Lab Guided City tour of Abu Dhabi Photo stop at the Sheikh Zayed Mosque, Grand Mosque Visit Swami Narayan Temple Visit Ferrai World or Warner Bros Studio or Sea World (Guests will be offered a 2 Day 2 Park Ticket with access to any of the 2 theme parks) Visit Snow Abu Dhabi Visit Qasr Al Watan.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZVX752', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Arabian Dhamaka - Winter' package is a 7-day tour covering the spectacular cities of Dubai and Abu Dhabi. The itinerary is packed with exciting activities, including a guided city tour of Dubai with ice cream, a luxurious limousine ride, a visit to the 124th floor of the Burj Khalifa, and trips to the Dolphin Aquarium and Global Village, plus an exclusive Dubai Memories souvenir box for each family. Guests will also experience a thrilling desert safari with dune bashing and a barbecue dinner. In Abu Dhabi, the tour features a guided city tour, a visit to Team Lab, a photo stop at the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, and visits to the Swami Narayan Temple and Qasr Al Watan. To top it off, travelers will enjoy Snow Abu Dhabi and a 2-day, 2-park ticket offering access to any two theme parks among Ferrari World, Warner Bros. Studio, and Sea World.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrival In Dubai\xa0- Check In – Enjoy Limousine Ride\n\xa0\xa0\xa0\nWelcome To United Arab Emirates. On Arrival In Dubai, You Will Be Greeted By Your Friendly Tour Manager / Local Representative Outside The Baggage Hall Area At The Airport. Transfer To The Hotel & Check-In. (Standard Check In Time After 1500hrs).\nLater Enjoy One-Hour Limousine Ride, Sit Back In The Most Comfortable And Luxurious Stretch Limousine And Explore The Night City View.\nNote\n\nAll Our Guests Are Advised To Activate International Calling/Data & International Credit Card\nJoining Direct Passengers / Nri Passengers Can Check-In On Your Own At The Hotel. The Standard Check-In Time Is 1500 Hrs.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVISIT BURJ KHALIFA - GUIDED CITY TOUR OF DUBAI – GLOBAL VILLAGE\nThis morning after buffet breakfast, Visit 124th Floor of Burj Khalifa (non-prime hours). Free time at the Dubai Mall later enjoy Fountain Show. Later proceed for a guided city tour of Dubai along with Photo stop at the Dubai Frame, Museum of the Future, Jumeirah Beach, Jumeirah Mosque & Zabeel Palace. Proceed for Global Village a shopping, dining, and entertainment attraction located on Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. There are four main sections in the Village. These sections consist of events and concerts, carnivals, food, and shopping.\n\xa0\nOvernight in Dubai.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nVisit Dubai Dolphinarium – Visit Gold Souk - Desert Safari With Dune Bashing & BBQ Dinner\xa0\nThis morning after buffet breakfast, proceed to visit Dubai Dolphinarium. The Dolphin & Seal Show, the #1 in the UAE. These interactive extravaganzas showcase the amazing animals' astounding skills.\xa0 Visitors watch in wonder as the dolphins and seals dance, sing, juggle, play ball, jump through hoops and even paint. Free time for shopping at Gold Souk & Spice Souk. Later this afternoon proceed for Desert Safari to enjoy the thrilling dune bashing on a desert safari adventure exploring the massive sand dunes of the Arabian deserts. Enjoy BBQ Dinner and the belly dancing performance at the Desert Camp.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nProceed To Abu Dhabi - Visit Team Lab - Guided City Tour Of Abu Dhabi - Photostop At Grand Mosque -\xa0 Entrance To Ferrari World /\xa0 Warner Bros / Sea World (Any 1 Park)\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Abu Dhabi. Visit Team Lab - An Digital Museum That Collaborates\xa0 The Confluence Of Art, Science, Technology, And The Natural World. Later We Proceed On A Guided City Tour Of Abu Dhabi City Tour Along-With A Photo Stop At The Grand Mosque. Later This Afternoon We Proceed To\xa0 Yas Island - Our Guest Have A Choice To Visit Ferrari World Or Warner Bros Or Sea World (1 Park Entry Included).\n\xa0\nNote:\n\nPhoto stop means NO Entry inside the attraction.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Swami Narayan Temple. Entrance To Ferrari World / Warner Bros / Sea World (Any 1 Park)\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit The Baps Hindu Mandir - A Traditional Hindu Mandir Built By The Baps Swaminarayan Sanstha. This Is The First Traditional Hindu Mandir In Abu Dhabi. Later This Afternoon We Proceed To\xa0 Yas Island - Our Guest Have A Choice To Visit Ferrari World Or Warner Bros Or Sea World (1 Park Entry Included).', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ramada Corniche or\xa0similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit Snow Abu Dhabi – Visit Qasr Al Watan\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Proceed To Visit Snow Abu Dhabi. Later In Evening We Proceed To Visit Qasr Al Watan - An Imposing Royal Palace In Abu Dhabi, It Is A Unique Testament To The Spirit Of The United Arab Emirates' People And Its Leaders.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch Coupon and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ramada Corniche or\xa0similar in Abu Dhabi'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nEnd Of Tour - Fly Back\nThis Morning\xa0 After Buffet Breakfast, Check Out And Proceed To The Airport. Return Home With Wonderful Memories Of Your Tour.\n\xa0\xa0\nNote: On few days there will be a coach merger with other Dubai product's (if required)\n\xa0\nNote : The above itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice.\n", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n03 nights accommodation at Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi\n', '\n03 nights accommodation at Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai Free upgrade to 5* Hotel Crown Plaza\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n03 nights accommodation at Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai Free upgrade to 5* Hotel Crown Plaza\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi\n', '2': '\n03 nights accommodation at Howard Johnson by Wyndham or similar in Dubai\n03 nights accommodation at Hotel Ramada Corniche or similar in Abu Dhabi\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'AE', 'countryName': 