Complimentary yoga and fitness activities, including group yoga, group pilates classes, aqua aerobics, beach boot camp, gym workouts, morning beach run, healthy bar, sunset meditation, kids’ yoga, and Zumba classes for kids and teens. Complimentary access to pool and beach parties, circus acrobats, and live DJ performances. Complimentary kids’ activities, including craft-making classes, pizza-making classes, and storytelling sessions. USD 50 spa credit at Veyo Spa (non-transferable). Not applicable to tailor-made spa packages, salon services, or retail items. Advance booking is required. Honeymoon benefits (Only for Honeymooners): Min. 3N Stay required 1 bottle of sparkling wine & a fruit basket on arrival day Complimentary honeymoon dinner with table decorated in one of our A la carte restaurant for the couple once during their stay Special evening turn-down service with bed decoration on arrival night 1 celebratory honeymoon cakeNote: (To qualify for the Honeymooner, offer a minimum of 3 Nights stay is required (to be specified at the time of booking - a copy of marriage certificate/registration dated less than 12months to be presented at the time of booking). Wedding Anniversary Benefits 1 bottle of sparkling wine & a fruit basket on arrival day Fruit basket on arrival dayNote: To be informed at the time of booking and wedding certificate copy to be submitted and the travel should apply to the anniversary date'], 'pdfName': 'PKG005495_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 144279, 'packageSummary': "The 'Maldives - Siyam World' package is a 4-day tropical getaway covering Male, where guests can indulge in an array of complimentary activities and luxurious perks. The itinerary features exciting excursions such as a sunset cruise, local island tour, or snorkeling safari, alongside unlimited access to the largest floating water park in the Maldives and non-motorized water sports like windsurfing, canoeing, and stand-up paddleboarding. Guests can also enjoy daily replenished minibars, afternoon tea, 24/7 sports bar access, yoga and fitness classes, pool and beach parties with live DJs, and a USD 50 spa credit at Veyo Spa. Additionally, the package offers engaging activities for kids and exclusive romantic benefits for honeymooners and anniversary couples, including sparkling wine, a fruit basket, and a decorated dinner.", 'images': ['Siyam_World_7530.jpg', 'Siyam_World_7533.jpg', 'Siyam_World_7531.jpg', 'Siyam_World_7532.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 144279, 'thumbnailImage': 'Siyam_World_2671.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon', 'Couple Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG013523 is named \'Maldives - Siyam World\' and spans 4 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Male, Meals: Premium WOW! All Inclusive Meal plan, Description: Arrive Male: Upon arrival in Male, you will be transferred to your resort. Check in at the hotel (standard 1400 hrs.) Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Male, Meals: Premium WOW! All Inclusive Meal plan, Description: Male: Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Male, Meals: Premium WOW! All Inclusive Meal plan, Description: Male: Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Male, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure After breakfast, check out from the resort (standard check out time: 1200 hrs) and transfer to the International Airport for your departure flight back to India or onward destination., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 144279.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nMeal Plan as per selection – WOW! All Inclusive\n. Inclusions: 03 nights stay at Siyam World (Water Villa with Pool + Slide) Meals as per selection Premium WOW! All Inclusive basis Return Seaplane Transfers Green tax Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling. All flight services. Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guides and drivers. City Tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of personal nature Camera fees. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list. Product Terms and Conditions: Complimentary Benefits for All Guests on All Inclusive : Meal Benefits: Breakfast: Varied buffet and live cooking station and Cava Lunch: Buffet, dishes prepared live and assorted desserts, Pasta, salads and assorted desserts Dinner: Buffets and dishes prepared live. Vegetarian options available. Dessert buffet. Special evenings: themed buffet twice a week Snacks 24 Hours a Day (24 Hours at Riu Atoll) For Snacks, Free Choice From A Selection Of Bars At Riu Palace Maldivas And Riu Atoll Beverages: Local and imported beverages served 24 hours a day (24 hours at Riu Atoll) Premium branded drinks throughout hotel Regularly restocked minibar and liquor dispenser Room service (from 7:00 a.m. To 11:00 p.m.) In-Room Safe Sports and Activities at Riu Atoll: Gym Group fitness activities in the RiuFit area (daily) Kayaking, pedaloes, stand up paddle surf (SUP), snorkelling equipment and 1 introductory scuba diving lesson The Practice Of Water Sports Included In The “All Inclusive” Is Limited To The Area Marked In Front Of The Water Sports Centre Steam bath Entertainment: DJ sunset (several times a week) Live music (several times a week) At Riu Atoll: Daytime entertainment programme for children ages 4 to 7 and ages 8 to 12 at "RiuLand" (six times a week) Daytime entertainment programme for adults (daily) Live music or DJ and events (daily) All hotel guests are required to wear an "all inclusive" wristband for identification purposes. Note: Information regarding the above complimentary services must be informed at the time of reservation and must be clearly marked on the client’s original voucher. How to Calculate Rates: The prices in the package are worked out for 3 nights with transfers If you need a rate for 4 nights, add the extension night rate per person to arrive at the final selling price If you need a split stay Eg 2 nights in Standard Deluxe + 1 night in Water Bungalow then Take the 3 nights package cost for Standard Deluxe MINUS 1 extension night for Standard Deluxe ADD 1 extension night for Water Bungalow Room Occupancy: Jr Suite 2 Adults Beach Junior Suite 3 Adults or 2 Adults + 2 Child (below 12 years) Overwater Suite 3 Adults or 2 Adults + 2 Child (below 12 years) Overwater Suite with Pool 3 Adults or 2 Adults + 2 Child (below 12 years) *Cost is based on child sharing room with the adults* Cancellation Policy: Cancellation fee will not be charged if booking is cancelled 15 days prior to the date of arrival. Cancellations within 15 to 8 days prior to the date of arrival 75% of the total will be charged. Cancellation within 10 days and below to the date of arrival, No Show bookings and cancellations within the stay will be charged for the total stay on the basis booked. Payment Policy: For All travel Period Excluding 24th Dec’20 to 8th Jan’21: 100% Payment is to be paid 21 days prior to the Check in. For travel Period 24th Dec’20 to 8th Jan’21: 100% Payment is to be paid 60 days prior to the check in. Terms and Conditions: TCIL reserves the right to change departure dates given the airline seat availability changes. The upgrade hotel/villa prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel/villa prices DO NOT GURANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels/Villa. The upgrade hotel/villa rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel/villa, In case the hotel/villa chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel/villa. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Some flights depart from India on a previous date and arrive at the destination the next day of departure and likewise for the return flight to India. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling