es, pizza-making classes, and storytelling sessions. USD 50 spa credit at Veyo Spa (non-transferable). Not applicable to tailor-made spa packages, salon services, or retail items. Advance booking is required. Honeymoon benefits (Only for Honeymooners): Min. 3N Stay required 1 bottle of sparkling wine & a fruit basket on arrival day Complimentary honeymoon dinner with table decorated in one of our A la carte restaurant for the couple once during their stay Special evening turn-down service with bed decoration on arrival night 1 celebratory honeymoon cakeNote: (To qualify for the Honeymooner, offer a minimum of 3 Nights stay is required (to be specified at the time of booking - a copy of marriage certificate/registration dated less than 12months to be presented at the time of booking). Wedding Anniversary Benefits 1 bottle of sparkling wine & a fruit basket on arrival day Fruit basket on arrival dayNote: To be informed at the time of booking and wedding certificate copy to be submitted and the travel should apply to the anniversary date.', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': '