ay': 'Maldives - Siyam World (Water Villa with pool + Slide) or similar in Male'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nMale:\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own.', 'mealDescription': 'Premium WOW! All Inclusive Meal plan', 'overnightStay': 'Maldives - Siyam World (Water Villa with pool + Slide) or similar in Male'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nMale:\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own', 'mealDescription': 'Premium WOW! All Inclusive Meal plan', 'overnightStay': 'Maldives - Siyam World (Water Villa with pool + Slide) or similar in Male'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nDeparture\nAfter breakfast, check out from the resort (standard check out time: 1200 hrs) and transfer to the International Airport for your departure flight back to India or onward destination.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'MV', 'countryName': 'Maldives', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Premium', 'price': 144300.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', '\nMeal Plan as per selection – WOW! All Inclusive\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\n03 nights stay at Siyam World (Water Villa with Pool + Slide)\xa0\xa0\nMeals as per selection Premium WOW! All Inclusive basis\nReturn Seaplane Transfers\nGreen tax\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\xa0\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling.\nAll flight services.\nPre and post tour services & costs.\nHotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales.\nBlackout date surcharges\nMidnight surcharge.\nMeals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary.\nTips for guides and drivers.\nCity Tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable).\nExpenditure of personal nature\nCamera fees.\nPorterage facility\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable.\nVisa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable).\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary.\xa0\nCost of optional excursions.\nAnything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Complimentary Benefits for All Guests on All Inclusive :\nMeal Benefits:\nBreakfast:\n\nVaried buffet and live cooking station\xa0and Cava\n\nLunch:\n\nBuffet, dishes prepared live and assorted desserts, Pasta, salads and assorted desserts\n\nDinner:\n\nBuffets and dishes prepared live. Vegetarian options available. Dessert buffet.\nSpecial evenings: themed buffet twice a week\n\nSnacks 24 Hours a Day\xa0(24 Hours\xa0at Riu\xa0Atoll)\nFor Snacks, Free Choice From A Selection Of Bars At Riu Palace Maldivas And Riu Atoll\nBeverages:\n\nLocal and imported beverages served 24 hours a day (24 hours at Riu Atoll)\nPremium branded drinks throughout hotel\nRegularly restocked minibar and liquor dispenser\n\nRoom service (from 7:00 a.m. To 11:00 p.m.)\nIn-Room Safe\nSports and Activities at Riu Atoll:\n\nGym\nGroup fitness activities in the RiuFit area (daily)\nKayaking, pedaloes, stand up paddle surf (SUP), snorkelling equipment and 1 introductory scuba diving lesson\nThe Practice Of Water Sports Included In The “All Inclusive” Is Limited To The Area Marked In Front Of The Water Sports Centre\n\nSteam bath\nEntertainment:\n\nDJ sunset (several times a week)\nLive music (several times a week)\n\nAt Riu Atoll:\n\nDaytime entertainment programme for children ages 4 to 7 and ages 8 to 12 at "RiuLand" (six times a week)\nDaytime entertainment programme for adults (daily)\nLive music or DJ and events (daily)\n\nAll hotel guests are required to wear an "all inclusive" wristband for identification purposes.\nNote:\n\nInformation regarding the above complimentary services must be informed at the time of reservation and must be clearly marked on the client’s original voucher.\n\nHow to Calculate Rates:\n\nThe prices in the package are worked out for 3 nights with transfers\nIf you need a rate for 4 nights, add the extension night rate per person to arrive at the final selling price\nIf you need a split stay Eg 2 nights in Standard Deluxe + 1 night in Water Bungalow then\nTake the 3 nights package cost for Standard Deluxe MINUS 1 extension night for Standard Deluxe ADD 1 extension night for Water Bungalow\n\nRoom Occupancy:\n\n\n\nJr Suite\n2 Adults\n\n\nBeach Junior Suite\n3 Adults or 2 Adults + 2 Child (below 12 years)\n\n\nOverwater Suite\n3 Adults or 2 Adults + 2 Child (below 12 years)\n\n\nOverwater Suite with Pool\n3 Adults or 2 Adults + 2 Child (below 12 years)\n\n\n\n*Cost is based on child sharing room with the adults*\nCancellation Policy:\n\nCancellation fee will not be charged if booking is cancelled 15 days prior to the date of arrival.\nCancellations within 15 to 8 days prior to the date of arrival 75% of the total will be charged.\nCancellation within 10 days and below to the date of arrival, No Show bookings and cancellations within the stay will be charged for the total stay on the basis booked.\n\nPayment Policy:\n\nFor All travel Period Excluding 24th Dec’20 to 8th Jan’21: 100% Payment is to be paid 21 days prior to the Check in.\nFor travel Period 24th Dec’20 to 8th Jan’21: 100% Payment is to be paid 60 days prior to the check in.\n\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nTCIL reserves the right to change departure dates given the airline seat availability changes.\nThe upgrade hotel/villa prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe upgrade hotel/villa prices DO NOT GURANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels/Villa.\nThe upgrade hotel/villa rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nFor the upgrade hotel/villa, In case the hotel/villa chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel/villa.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\nSome flights depart from India on a previous date and arrive at the destination the next day of departure and likewise for the return flight to India.\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nThomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013523/Siyam_World_2671.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013523/itinerary/Siyam_World_7530.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013523/itinerary/Siyam_World_7533.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013523/itinerary/Siyam_World_7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013523/itinerary/Siyam_World_7532.jpg']}, 'score': 9.197659, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013189', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013189', 'availableMonths': ['june_2027', 'april_2027', 'july_2027', 'august_2027', 'november_2026', 'september_2027', 'may_2027', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Maldives - Adaaran Club Rannalhi', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Package Highlights 30-minute Spa – once during the stay for the couple (02 Pax) adults only *Not applicable for additional Adult and Child. Experience one-time excursions - Sunset cruise *For Water Bungalow Guest – in villa Breakfast include during the stay** 10% discount on the Excursion bill (This will be deducted from the final extra bill pre-tax) – except for the excursions organized by third party (i.e., Water Sports, Diving, Spa, etc.) AI extension till departure for all occupants, excluding accommodation and main meals (only snacks and AI beverages All-Inclusive Inclusions All Inclusive offerings Whisky, brandy, gin, vodka, rum, draft beer House wine – red/white/Rose Soft drinks – Coca Cola, Diet Coke, Fanta, Sprite, Bitter Lemon, Soda Water and Tonic Water Tea and coffee Mineral water Selected cocktails Selected mocktails **For Water Bungalow Guest – in villa Breakfast include during the stay** Discovery Complimentary snorkeling equipment (fins and masks) for the duration of stay Complimentary Sunset photo cruise (One hour, per stay) for stays of 03 (three) nights and above Non-motorized water sports: windsurfing (a windsurfing license is required) |canoe | stand-up peddle board 15 minutes per day, for stays of three nights and above Entertainment Daily entertainment with live band Outdoor DJ night, twice a week Sundown DJ music at the Cocktail Bar Karaoke night Movie night at the Amphitheatre* Beach party with Bonfire * *once a week CHILD OFFER: Up to two children stay free; only green tax and transfers will be charged at actuals (Only applicable for travel till 30 Sep 2026)* HONEYMOON FREEBIES (ONLY FOR HONEYMOONERS): Romantic Bed decoration - once per stay US $ 30 F&B credit – per couple, per stay. One Honeymoon cake Romantic Turn-down service - once per stay (on request) Bottle of wine on arrival ANNIVERSARY INCLUSIONS: Anniversary Cake – once during the stay Anniversary Bed Decoration – once during the stay Bottle of wine on arrival *To be informed at the time of booking and wedding certificate copy to be submitted and the travel should apply to the anniversary date BIRTHDAY INCLUSIONS Birthday Cake – once during the stay Bottle of wine on arrival Birthday Bed Decoration – once during the stay'], 'pdfName': 'PKG004211_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 101887, 'packageSummary': "The 'Maldives - Adaaran Club Rannalhi' package is a 5-day tropical getaway to Male, Maldives, offering a comprehensive all-inclusive island experience. Throughout their stay, guests can enjoy a variety of exciting activities, including a complimentary sunset photo cruise, snorkeling with free equipment, and non-motorized water sports such as windsurfing, canoeing, and stand-up paddleboarding. The package features vibrant daily entertainment, including live bands, DJ nights, karaoke, movie nights, and beach bonfire parties, alongside an extensive all-inclusive beverage selection. Additional highlights include a relaxing 30-minute spa treatment for couples, in-villa breakfast for Water Bungalow guests, a 10% discount on select excursions, and special celebratory perks for honeymooners, birthdays, and anniversaries, such as complimentary wine, cakes, and romantic bed decorations.", 'images': ['Adaaran_Club_Rannalhi_753.jpg', 'Adaaran_11_C.jpg', 'Adaaran_Club_Rannalhi_753_2.jpg', 'Adaaran_Club_Rannalhi_753_6.jpg', 'MaldivesDay71.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 101887, 'thumbnailImage': 'AadaranClubRannhali267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013189 is named 'Maldives - Ad