_JPG.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015315/itinerary/RAAYAATMOS753x430_JPG.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015315/itinerary/RAAYAMALD753x430JPG.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015315/itinerary/RAAYA_JPG_ITINERARY735x430.jpg']}, 'score': 8.749876, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013518', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013518', 'availableMonths': ['april_2027', 'november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Maldives - Centara Mirage Lagoon Resort', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['NOTE: No child is allowed in the mentioned room Special Offer : Meet and greet at Valena International Airport, assistance with the speedboat transfer Complimentary Snorkeling equipment for use throughout the stay period Complimentary non-motorized water sports including kayaking, pedalo, stand up paddleboard (SUP) and windsurf board for experienced guest only Complimentary Kid Club, E-Zone and Fitness Center Complimentary Access to Lazy River and water complex Complimentary wifi access throughout the resort Honeymoon & Anniversary : One bottle of sparkling wine and homemade chocolate to be placed in a villa upon arrival. 1-time honeymoon or anniversary bed decoration during turndown 1-time sunset cocktail at Dolphin Bar. 1-time 30-minute SPA with a minimum 4 nights stay and above Terms: Wedding certificate valid within 6 months to be presented upon check-in.'], 'pdfName': 'PKG004643_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 120720, 'packageSummary': "The 'Maldives - Centara Mirage Lagoon Resort' package is a 5-day tropical getaway covering Male, offering an exclusive experience where children are not permitted in the specified room category. The trip begins with a warm meet and greet at Valena International Airport followed by a speedboat transfer to the resort, where guests can enjoy complimentary Wi-Fi, a fitness center, a Kids Club, an E-Zone, and a water complex featuring a Lazy River. Key activities include complimentary snorkeling and non-motorized water sports such as kayaking, pedalo, stand-up paddleboarding, and windsurfing. Additionally, couples celebrating a honeymoon or anniversary will be treated to special perks, including a bottle of sparkling wine, homemade chocolates, a decorated bed, a sunset cocktail at the Dolphin Bar, and a relaxing 30-minute spa treatment.", 'images': ['Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_753.jpg', 'Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7531.jpg', 'Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7533.jpg', 'Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7532.jpg', 'Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7534.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 120720, 'thumbnailImage': 'Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Honeymoon', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013518 is named 'Maldives - Centara Mirage Lagoon Resort' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Male, Meals: Full Board, Description: Arrive Male Upon arrival in Male, you will be transferred to your resort. Check in at the hotel (standard 1400 hrs.) Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Male, Meals: Full board, Description: Male Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Male, Meals: Full board, Description: Male Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Male, Meals: Full Board, Description: Male Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Male, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Male After breakfast, check out (standard 1200 hrs.) and transfer from the hotel to International Airport for the departure flight back to India or to your onwards destination., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 120720.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nMeal Plan as per selection - Full Board upgrade All Inclusive Meal Plan\xa0\n. Inclusions: 02 Night’s accommodation in Panoramic Room with Open-air Bath 02 Night’s accommodation in Overwater Villa with Jacuzzi Meal Plan as per selection – Full board Free Upgrade to All Inclusive Return Speedboat transfers Green Tax Travel Insurance (up to age of 60 yrs.) for the travel duration. Exclusions: TCS & GST International Airfare & Visa Charges Guaranteed early check in or late check-out. This is completely at the discretion of the hotel, and we can only put in a request for the same. Any expenses of personal nature Tips and porterage Meals other than that what is mentioned in your itinerary. Drinks including Water during meals / sightseeing tours are not included The above prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer RT-PCR Test Any services not mentioned in the inclusions list The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.. Product Terms and Conditions: N/A. Highlights of the package: NOTE: No child is allowed in the mentioned room Special Offer : Meet and greet at Valena International Airport, assistance with the speedboat transfer Complimentary Snorkeling equipment for use throughout the stay period Complimentary non-motorized water sports including kayaking, pedalo, stand up paddleboard (SUP) and windsurf board for experienced guest only Complimentary Kid Club, E-Zone and Fitness Center Complimentary Access to Lazy River and water complex Complimentary wifi access throughout the resort Honeymoon & Anniversary : One bottle of sparkling wine and homemade chocolate to be placed in a villa upon arrival. 1-time honeymoon or anniversary bed decoration during turndown 1-time sunset cocktail at Dolphin Bar. 1-time 30-minute SPA with a minimum 4 nights stay and above Terms: Wedding certificate valid within 6 months to be presented upon check-in..", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId':