y at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'MV', 'countryName': 'Maldives', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTourType': ['Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Premium', 'price': 120700.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', '\nMeal Plan as per selection - Full Board upgrade All Inclusive Meal Plan\xa0\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\n02 Night’s accommodation in Panoramic Room with Open-air Bath\n02 Night’s accommodation in Overwater Villa with Jacuzzi\nMeal Plan as per selection – Full board Free Upgrade to All Inclusive\xa0 \xa0\nReturn Speedboat transfers\nGreen Tax\nTravel Insurance (up to age of 60 yrs.) for the travel duration\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nInternational Airfare & Visa Charges\nGuaranteed early check in or late check-out. This is completely at the discretion of the hotel, and we can only put in a request for the same.\nAny expenses of personal nature\nTips and porterage\nMeals other than that what is mentioned in your itinerary.\nDrinks including Water during meals / sightseeing tours are not included\nThe above prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer\nRT-PCR Test\nAny services not mentioned in the inclusions list\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013518/Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_267.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013518/itinerary/Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013518/itinerary/Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013518/itinerary/Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7533.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013518/itinerary/Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013518/itinerary/Centara_Mirage_Lagoon_7534.jpg']}, 'score': 8.377674, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015328', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015328', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Maldives - Sun Siyam Olhuveli (Couple Only Offer)', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Male', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['One-time Lucky Dolphin Cruise for 2 Adults & 2 Children (02 - 11 yrs) One Thali Lunch during the stay (Min. 3N required) Spa Credit: Enjoy a spa credit of US$ 50 per Adult per stay – non-transferable Honeymoon benefits (Only for Honeymooners): Min. 3N Stay required 1 bottle of sparkling wine & a fruit basket on arrival day Complimentary honeymoon dinner with table decorated in one of our A la carte Restaurants for the couple, once during their stay. Special evening turn-down service with bed decoration on arrival night 1 celebratory cake Note: To be informed at the time of booking and wedding certificate copy to be submitted and the travel should be within 6 months of the date of marriage. Wedding Anniversary Benefits: 1 bottle of sparkling wine 1 celebratory cake Note: To be informed at the time of booking and wedding certificate copy to be submitted and the travel should apply to the anniversary date'], 'pdfName': 'PKG005495_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 164587, 'packageSummary': "The 'Maldives - Sun Siyam Olhuveli (Couple Only Offer)' package is a 5-day romantic getaway covering Male, Maldives, designed to provide an unforgettable tropical escape for couples. During their stay, guests will enjoy key highlights such as a one-time Lucky Dolphin Cruise, a special Thali lunch, and a fifty-dollar spa credit per adult to unwind. Honeymooners are treated to exclusive benefits including a bottle of sparkling wine, a fresh fruit basket, a decorated complimentary dinner at an a la carte restaurant, a special evening turn-down service with bed decoration, and a celebratory cake, while couples celebrating their wedding anniversary will also receive a complimentary bottle of sparkling wine and a celebratory cake to mark their special milestone.", 'images': ['SunSiyamOlhuveli7531.jpg', 'SunSiyamOlhuvel7532.jpg', 'SunSiyamOlhuveli7533.jpg', 'SunSiyamOlhuvel7534.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 164587, 'thumbnailImage': 'SunSiyamOlhuveliSrp.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon', 'Couple Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015328 is named 'Maldives - Sun Siyam Olhuveli (Couple Only Offer)' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Male, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrive Male: Upon arrival in Male, you will be transferred to your resort. Check in at the hotel (standard 1400 hrs). Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Male, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Male: After breakfast, Day at leisure, explore the island on your own or for the various water sports, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Male, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Male: Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Male, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Male: After breakfast, check out (standard 1200 hrs) and transfer from the hotel to International Airport for the departure flight back to India or to your onwards destination., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 164587.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Meals as per selection – Full board basis Complimentary Combined Speedboat transfers Green tax Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling. All flight services Pre and post tour services & costs. Hotel rates not valid during blackout period / surcharge dates / stop sales. Blackout date surcharges Midnight surcharge. Meals and beverages that are not mentioned in the itinerary. Tips for guides and drivers. City Tax & Tourism Tax (if applicable). Expenditure of personal nature Camera fees. Porterage facility Departure PCR test, if applicable. Visa charges for NRI passengers (if applicable). Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides not mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of optional excursions. Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions list. Note: The above prices will not be valid for any black out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer. Product Terms and Conditions: Rooming Occupancy: Deluxe Room 2A+1C Grand Beach Villa 3A OR 2A+2C Grand Beach Villa with Pool 3A OR 2A+2C Romantic Beach Villa with Pool 2A Grand Beach Suite with Pool 4A OR 2A+3C Deluxe Water Villa 3A OR 2A+1C Jacuzzi Water Villa 3A OR 2A+1C Grand Water Villa 3A OR 2A+1C Sunset Jacuzzi Water Villa 3A OR 2A+1C Grand Water Villa with Pool 3A OR 2A+2C Prestige Jacuzzi Water Villa 3A OR 2A+2C Romantic Water Villa with Pool 2A Terms and Conditions: Information regarding the above complimentary services must be informed at the time of reservation and must be clearly marked on the client’s original voucher. Wedding should be no older than 12 months to entitle the Honeymoon benefits. Cancellation Policy: Less than 30 days to departure : 25% charges Less than 14 days to departure : 50% charges Less than 7 days to departure / No Show : 100% charges Payment Policy: For All travel Period Excluding 24th Dec’20 to 8th Jan’21: 100% Payment is to be paid 21 days prior to the Check in. For travel Period 24th Dec’20 to 8th Jan’21: 100% Payment is to be paid 60 days prior to the check in. Terms and Conditions: TCIL reserves the right to change departure dates given the airline seat availability changes. The upgrade hotel/villa prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel/villa prices DO NOT GURANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels/Villa. The upgrade hotel/villa rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel/villa, In case the hotel/villa chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel/villa. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Some flights depart from India on a previous date and arrive at the destination the next day of departure and likewise for the return flight to India. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. Thomas Cook (I) Ltd is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: One-time Lucky Dolphin Cruise for 2 Adults & 2 Children (02 - 11 yrs) One Thali Lunch during the stay (Min. 3N required) Spa Credit: Enjoy a spa credit of US$ 50 per Adult per stay – non-transferable Honeymoon benefits (Only for Honeymooners): Min. 3N Stay 