 stay, guests will enjoy key highlights such as a one-time Lucky Dolphin Cruise, a special Thali lunch, and a fifty-dollar spa credit per adult to unwind. Honeymooners are treated to exclusive benefits including a bottle of sparkling wine, a fresh fruit basket, a decorated complimentary dinner at an a la carte restaurant, a special evening turn-down service with bed decoration, and a celebratory cake, while couples celebrating their wedding anniversary will also receive a complimentary bottle of sparkling wine and a celebratory cake to mark their special milestone.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Male:\nUpon arrival in Male, you will be transferred to your resort. Check in at the hotel (standard 1400 hrs). Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Sun Siyam Olhuveli\xa0(Deluxe Room)\xa0or similar in\xa0Male'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nMale:\nAfter breakfast, Day at leisure, explore the island on your own or for the various water sports', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Sun Siyam Olhuveli\xa0(Deluxe Room)\xa0or similar in\xa0Male'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nMale:\nEnjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Sun Siyam Olhuveli\xa0(Deluxe Room)\xa0or similar in\xa0Male'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Male:\nAfter breakfast, check out (standard 1200 hrs) and transfer from the hotel to International Airport for the departure flight back to India or to your onwards destination.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 1, 'countryCode': 'MV', 'countryName': 'Maldives', 'continentName': 'Asia'}], 'packageTou