ialty coffee (cappuccino, espresso, latte), tea selection and chilled juice all by the glass. Daily replenished minibar service including a selection of snacks, soft drinks and mixers, mineral water, chocolates, and beer. The minibar is stocked once per day. Additional stock will incur a charge Afternoon tea with pastries and sandwiches together with a selection of tea and filter coffee. Sundowners Canapés selection: flavorful tapas and canapés. Spa Cenvaree - enjoy a spa credit of USD 50 per adult per stay (non-transferable and not applicable on in-house promotions, salon, and retail items in the spa -advance booking is required) Special Ad-ons 1-time Thali special meal per stay. (advance booking is required) 2. Guest choose 1 out of the following 2 choices: Option A – Additional Spa Credit An additional spa credit of USD 50 per person will be offered, which can be combined with the Special PAI meal plan package inclusion to enjoy either a 60-minute or 90-minute spa treatment. Option B – Complimentary Romantic In-Villa Breakfast A complimentary romantic in-villa breakfast for 2 persons (valued at USD 50 per couple). Please note that advance reservation is required at least 24 hours in advance, and arrangements remain subject to availability Birthday Celebrations One bottle of sparkling wine to be placed in a villa on the occasion date. Birthday cake is to be placed in a villa or at the restaurant on the occasion date 1-time sunset cocktail at Dolphin Bar. Terms: the resort must be informed about the occasion celebration no later than 7 days before arrival. A valid document to prove the birth date or wedding date is during the stay Honeymoon & Anniversary 1-time honeymoon or anniversary bed decoration during turndown. 1-time sunset cocktail at Sunset Social. 1-time 30-minute SPA with a minimum of 3 nights stay and above. Terms: Wedding certificate valid within 6 months to be presented upon check-in.'], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 99972, 'packageSummary': "The 'Maldives - Centara Ras Fushi Resort And Spa (Adult Only)' package is a luxurious 5-day tropical getaway to Male, Maldives, designed exclusively for adults. Throughout their stay, guests will enjoy a premium all-inclusive experience featuring daily international buffet meals at the Oceans Restaurant, a premium beverage selection, a daily replenished minibar, afternoon tea, and evening sundowner canapés. Key activities and highlights include relaxing at Spa Cenvaree with a USD 50 spa credit, savoring a special one-time Thali meal, and choosing between an additional spa credit or a romantic in-villa breakfast. Furthermore, the package offers delightful celebratory perks for birthdays, honeymoons, and anniversaries, such as sunset cocktails, sparkling wine, cake, and romantic bed decorations, making it the perfect island escape.", 'images': ['CentaraRashiFushi7532.jpg', 'Cantara_Ras_Fushi_753_1.jpg', 'CentaraRashiFushi7533.jpg', 'CentaraRashiFushi7534.jpg', 'CentaraRashiFushi7536.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 99972, 'thumbnailImage': 'CentaraRashiFushi267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014163 is named 'Maldives - Centara Ras Fushi Resort And Spa (Adult Only)' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Male, Meals: Premium All-Inclusive Plan, Description: Arrive MaleUpon arrival in Male, you will be transferred to your resort. Check in at the hotel (standard 1400 hrs.) Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Male, Meals: Premium All-Inclusive Plan, Description: Male Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Male, Meals: Premium All-Inclusive Plan, Description: Male Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Male, Meals: Premium All-Inclusive Plan, Description: Male Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later enjoy your day at leisure, explore the island on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Male, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Male After breakfast, check out (standard 1200 hrs.) and transfer from the hotel to International Airport for the departure flight back to India or to your onwards destination. MANDATORY SURCHARGE Christmas Eve Dinner (Optional) - USD 244 New Year Eve Dinner (Mandatory) - USD 333, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 99972.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: \nMeal Plan as per selection – Premium All Inclusive\n. Inclusions: 02 Night’s accommodation in Beach Villa 02 Night’s accommodation in Overwater Villa Meal Plan as per selection – Premium All Inclusive Return Speedboat transfers Green Tax Travel Insurance (up to age of 60 yrs.) for the travel duration. Exclusions: TCS & GST International Airfare & Visa Charges Guaranteed early check in or late check-out. This is completely at the discretion of the hotel, and we can only put in a request for the same. Any expenses of personal nature Tips and porterage Meals other than that what is mentioned in your itinerary. Drinks including Water during meals / sightseeing tours are not included The above prices will not be valid for any block out date/ period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer RT-PCR Test Any services not mentioned in the inclusions list The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.. Product Terms and Conditions: Terms and Conditions: The package price is valid as mentioned for booking done until 31st July 2026. The upgrade hotel/villa prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The upgrade hotel/villa prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels/Villa. The upgrade hotel/villa rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel/villa, in case the hotel/villa chosen is unavailable we will provide with multiple options of similar category hotel/villa. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Some flights depart from India on a previous date and arrive at the destination the next day of departure and likewise for the return flight to India. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TC is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as they will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TC would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: NOTE: Child Above 18 years will be considered in this property. Special Premium All Inclusive International breakfast, Lunch and Dinner buffet at the Oceans Restaurant. Beverages available from the premium beverage menu which consist of international and premium pouring brands, wines (Red, White, Sparkling, and Rosé), beer, alcoholic beverages and a selection of cocktails, as well as still water, soft drinks, specialty coffee (cappuccino, espresso, latte), tea selection and chilled juice all by the glass. Daily replenished minibar service including a selection of snacks, soft drinks and mixers, mineral water, chocolates, and beer. The minibar is stocked once per day. Additional stock will incur a charge Afternoon tea with pastries and sandwiches together with a selection of tea and filter coffee. Sundowners Canapés selection: flavorful tapas and canapés. Spa Cenvaree - enjoy a spa credit of USD 50 per adult per stay (non-transferable and not applicable on in-house promotions, salon, and retail items in the spa -advance booking is required) Special Ad-ons 1-time Thali special meal per stay. (advance booking is required) 2. Guest choose 1 out of the following 2 choices: Option A – Additional Spa Credit An additional spa credit of USD 50 per person will be offered, which can be combined with the Special PAI meal plan package inclusion to enjoy either a 60-minute or 90-minute spa treatment. Option B – Complimentary Romantic In-Villa Breakfast A complimentary romantic in-villa breakfast for 2 persons (valued at USD 50 per couple). Please note that advance reservation is required at least 24 hours in advance, and arrangements remain subject to availability Birthday Celebrations One bottle of sparkling wine to be placed in a villa on the occasion date. Birthday cake is to be placed in a villa or at the restaurant on the occasion date 1-time sunset cocktail at Dolphin Bar. Terms: the resort must be informed about the occasion celebration no later than 7 days before arrival. A valid document to prove the birth date or wedding date is during the stay Honeymoon & Anniversary 1-time honeymoon or anniversary bed decoration during turndown. 1-time sunset cocktail at Sunset Social. 1-time 30-minute SPA with a minimum of 3 nights stay and above. Terms: Wedding certificate valid within 6 months to be presented upon check-in..", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayL